,{"icon":"❓","label":"Quiz Anatomi","sub":"5 soal","target":"quiz","targetIndex":0}],"cards":[{"id":"slide-1-card-1","title":"Anatomi Telinga","badge":"HIGH-YIELD","body":"Telinga dibagi 3 bagian: **Telinga Luar** (pinna auricula, meatus akustikus eksternus/MAE, membran timpani) — MAE berbentuk huruf S dengan 1/3 luar pars kartilagenosa dan 2/3 dalam pars tulang. **Telinga Tengah** (kavum timpani: epitimpanum, mesotimpanum, hipotimpanum; tulang pendengaran: malleus, incus, stapes). **Telinga Dalam** (koklea 2½ lingkaran, vestibulum dengan 3 kanalis semisirkularis). Ujung koklea = helikotrema. Skala vestibuli & timpani berisi perilimfa; skala media berisi endolimfa.","variant":"default","items":["Vaskularisasi telinga dalam: a. labirintin (cabang a. serebelaris anterior-inferior)","Persarafan: N. aurikulotemporalis (V3), N. vagus (X) — membran timpani","Fisiologi pendengaran: bunyi → membran timpani → tulang pendengaran → fenestra ovale → perilimfa → endolimfa → defleksi stereosilia sel rambut → potensial aksi saraf auditorius"],"number":1,"content":"<p>Telinga dibagi 3 bagian: <strong>Telinga Luar</strong> (pinna auricula, meatus akustikus eksternus/MAE, membran timpani) — MAE berbentuk huruf S dengan 1/3 luar pars kartilagenosa dan 2/3 dalam pars tulang. <strong>Telinga Tengah</strong> (kavum timpani: epitimpanum, mesotimpanum, hipotimpanum; tulang pendengaran: malleus, incus, stapes). <strong>Telinga Dalam</strong> (koklea 2½ lingkaran, vestibulum dengan 3 kanalis semisirkularis). Ujung koklea = helikotrema. Skala vestibuli &amp; timpani berisi perilimfa; skala media berisi endolimfa.</p><ul><li>Vaskularisasi telinga dalam: a. labirintin (cabang a. serebelaris anterior-inferior)</li><li>Persarafan: N. aurikulotemporalis (V3), N. vagus (X) — membran timpani</li><li>Fisiologi pendengaran: bunyi → membran timpani → tulang pendengaran → fenestra ovale → perilimfa → endolimfa → defleksi stereosilia sel rambut → potensial aksi saraf auditorius</li></ul><figure class=\"codex-media-card\"><img src=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Anatomy_of_the_Human_Ear_1_Intl.svg\" alt=\"Diagram terlabeli yang menunjukkan anatomi lengkap telinga manusia: telinga luar (pinna, liang telinga, gendang telinga), telinga tengah (tulang pendengaran malleus/incus/stapes, rongga timpani), dan telinga dalam (koklea, labirin, kanalis semisirkularis, saraf vestibulokoklear)\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" onerror=\"this.closest('figure').classList.add('image-load-failed')\"/><figcaption>Diagram anatomi telinga (luar, tengah, dalam)<br><span>Jmarchn (Wikimedia Commons) · CC BY-SA 3.0</span></figcaption></figure>","terms":[{"term":"Koklea","arti":"Struktur telinga dalam berbentuk 2½ lingkaran yang mengubah getaran mekanik menjadi sinyal elektrik.","penjelasan":"Snail shell-like structure untuk transduksi suara"},{"term":"Organ Corti","arti":"Organ sensorik pendengaran yang terletak di skala media koklea, mengandung sel-sel rambut.","penjelasan":"Hearing organ with hair cells"},{"term":"Tuba Eustachius","arti":"Saluran yang menghubungkan telinga tengah dengan nasofaring, berfungsi menyeimbangkan tekanan.","penjelasan":"Tube connecting middle ear to throat"},{"term":"Septum Nasi","arti":"Dinding yang memisahkan rongga hidung kiri dan kanan, terdiri dari tulang, kartilago, dan mukosa.","penjelasan":"Nasal wall divider"}]},{"id":"slide-1-card-2","title":"Anatomi Hidung & Sinus","badge":"CORE","body":"Hidung terdiri dari **Hidung Luar** (pangkal/bridge, dorsum nasi, tip, ala nasi, kolumela, nares anterior) dan **Hidung Dalam** (rongga hidung/cavum nasi, septum nasi). **Sinus Paranasales**: frontalis, maksilaris, ethmoidalis, sfenoidalis. Fisiologi hidung meliputi: respirasi, pengaturan suhu udara, filtrasi (vibrissae, silia, lendir/mucous blanket pH 6.5-7), resonansi vokal, dan fungsi refleks (bersin, reflek saluran cerna-kardiovaskuler).","variant":"default","items":["Filtrasi: ~2/3 benda asing tersaring oleh vibrissae, silia bergerak cepat ke belakang lambat ke depan","Vocal resonance: konsonan nasal M, N, NG; rinolalia bila resonansi terganggu","Fungsi pengidu: mukosa olfaktorius di regio superior cavum nasi"],"number":2,"content":"<p>Hidung terdiri dari <strong>Hidung Luar</strong> (pangkal/bridge, dorsum nasi, tip, ala nasi, kolumela, nares anterior) dan <strong>Hidung Dalam</strong> (rongga hidung/cavum nasi, septum nasi). <strong>Sinus Paranasales</strong>: frontalis, maksilaris, ethmoidalis, sfenoidalis. Fisiologi hidung meliputi: respirasi, pengaturan suhu udara, filtrasi (vibrissae, silia, lendir/mucous blanket pH 6.5-7), resonansi vokal, dan fungsi refleks (bersin, reflek saluran cerna-kardiovaskuler).</p><ul><li>Filtrasi: ~2/3 benda asing tersaring oleh vibrissae, silia bergerak cepat ke belakang lambat ke depan</li><li>Vocal resonance: konsonan nasal M, N, NG; rinolalia bila resonansi terganggu</li><li>Fungsi pengidu: mukosa olfaktorius di regio superior cavum nasi</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Koklea","arti":"Struktur telinga dalam berbentuk 2½ lingkaran yang mengubah getaran mekanik menjadi sinyal elektrik.","penjelasan":"Snail shell-like structure untuk transduksi suara"},{"term":"Organ Corti","arti":"Organ sensorik pendengaran yang terletak di skala media koklea, mengandung sel-sel rambut.","penjelasan":"Hearing organ with hair cells"},{"term":"Tuba Eustachius","arti":"Saluran yang menghubungkan telinga tengah dengan nasofaring, berfungsi menyeimbangkan tekanan.","penjelasan":"Tube connecting middle ear to throat"},{"term":"Septum Nasi","arti":"Dinding yang memisahkan rongga hidung kiri dan kanan, terdiri dari tulang, kartilago, dan mukosa.","penjelasan":"Nasal wall divider"}]},{"id":"slide-1-card-3","title":"Anatomi Faring & Tonsil","badge":"CORE","body":"Faring adalah saluran aerodigestivus tubular ireguler dari dasar tengkorak sampai batas inferior setinggi kartilago krikoid (anterior) dan vertebra servikal ke-6 (posterior). Panjang 12-14 cm, lebar maksimal ±5 cm di daerah hyoid, tersempit ±1.5 cm di inferior. **3 Bagian**: Nasofaring (epifaring, posterior kavum nasi), Orofaring (mesofaring, posterior mulut), Laringofaring (hipofaring, posterior laring). **Cincin Waldeyer**: tonsila faringeal/adenoid, tonsila palatina, tonsila lingualis. Tonsil palatina memiliki 10-30 kripta, hanya memiliki limfatik eferen menuju deep jugular node superior.","variant":"default","items":["Batas: Superior=oksipital & sinus sphenoid, Inferior=esofagus, Anterior=kavum nasi/oris/laring, Posterior=vertebra servikal","Arteri faring: cabang mayor a. carotis eksterna (a. faringeal ascending, tonsilar, palatina)","Fisiologi faring: pernapasan, penelanan, resonansi suara, artikulasi"],"number":3,"content":"<p>Faring adalah saluran aerodigestivus tubular ireguler dari dasar tengkorak sampai batas inferior setinggi kartilago krikoid (anterior) dan vertebra servikal ke-6 (posterior). Panjang 12-14 cm, lebar maksimal ±5 cm di daerah hyoid, tersempit ±1.5 cm di inferior. <strong>3 Bagian</strong>: Nasofaring (epifaring, posterior kavum nasi), Orofaring (mesofaring, posterior mulut), Laringofaring (hipofaring, posterior laring). <strong>Cincin Waldeyer</strong>: tonsila faringeal/adenoid, tonsila palatina, tonsila lingualis. Tonsil palatina memiliki 10-30 kripta, hanya memiliki limfatik eferen menuju deep jugular node superior.</p><ul><li>Batas: Superior=oksipital &amp; sinus sphenoid, Inferior=esofagus, Anterior=kavum nasi/oris/laring, Posterior=vertebra servikal</li><li>Arteri faring: cabang mayor a. carotis eksterna (a. faringeal ascending, tonsilar, palatina)</li><li>Fisiologi faring: pernapasan, penelanan, resonansi suara, artikulasi</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Koklea","arti":"Struktur telinga dalam berbentuk 2½ lingkaran yang mengubah getaran mekanik menjadi sinyal elektrik.","penjelasan":"Snail shell-like structure untuk transduksi suara"},{"term":"Organ Corti","arti":"Organ sensorik pendengaran yang terletak di skala media koklea, mengandung sel-sel rambut.","penjelasan":"Hearing organ with hair cells"},{"term":"Tuba Eustachius","arti":"Saluran yang menghubungkan telinga tengah dengan nasofaring, berfungsi menyeimbangkan tekanan.","penjelasan":"Tube connecting middle ear to throat"},{"term":"Septum Nasi","arti":"Dinding yang memisahkan rongga hidung kiri dan kanan, terdiri dari tulang, kartilago, dan mukosa.","penjelasan":"Nasal wall divider"}]},{"id":"slide-1-card-4","title":"Anatomi Laring","badge":"CORE","body":"Laring dibagi 3 bagian dengan acuan glottis: **Supraglottis** (di atas glottis, sinus Morgagni), **Glottis** (pita suara ±1 cm), **Subglottis** (di bawah glottis sampai batas kartilago krikoid). Otot intrinsik: adduktor (m. interaritenoideus, m. krikotiroideus), abduktor (m. krikoaritenoideus posterior), tensor (m. tiroaritenoideus, m. vokalis). **Persarafan**: N. laringeus superior (sensorik: vallecula, epiglotis, pita suara; motorik: m. kriotiroid), N. laringeus inferior/rekuren (sensorik: subglotis; motorik: semua otot laring kecuali m. krikotiroideus).","variant":"default","items":["Vaskularisasi: a. tiroid superior (dari a. karotis eksterna), a. tiroid inferior (dari a. subklavia)","Drainase limfe: lateral → KGB leher dalam & paratrakeal; medial → prelaringeal & pretrakeal","Otot ekstrinsik: elevator (m. stilohioideus, geniohioideus) & depresor (m. omohioideus, tiroideus)"],"number":4,"content":"<p>Laring dibagi 3 bagian dengan acuan glottis: <strong>Supraglottis</strong> (di atas glottis, sinus Morgagni), <strong>Glottis</strong> (pita suara ±1 cm), <strong>Subglottis</strong> (di bawah glottis sampai batas kartilago krikoid). Otot intrinsik: adduktor (m. interaritenoideus, m. krikotiroideus), abduktor (m. krikoaritenoideus posterior), tensor (m. tiroaritenoideus, m. vokalis). <strong>Persarafan</strong>: N. laringeus superior (sensorik: vallecula, epiglotis, pita suara; motorik: m. kriotiroid), N. laringeus inferior/rekuren (sensorik: subglotis; motorik: semua otot laring kecuali m. krikotiroideus).</p><ul><li>Vaskularisasi: a. tiroid superior (dari a. karotis eksterna), a. tiroid inferior (dari a. subklavia)</li><li>Drainase limfe: lateral → KGB leher dalam &amp; paratrakeal; medial → prelaringeal &amp; pretrakeal</li><li>Otot ekstrinsik: elevator (m. stilohioideus, geniohioideus) &amp; depresor (m. omohioideus, tiroideus)</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Koklea","arti":"Struktur telinga dalam berbentuk 2½ lingkaran yang mengubah getaran mekanik menjadi sinyal elektrik.","penjelasan":"Snail shell-like structure untuk transduksi suara"},{"term":"Organ Corti","arti":"Organ sensorik pendengaran yang terletak di skala media koklea, mengandung sel-sel rambut.","penjelasan":"Hearing organ with hair cells"},{"term":"Tuba Eustachius","arti":"Saluran yang menghubungkan telinga tengah dengan nasofaring, berfungsi menyeimbangkan tekanan.","penjelasan":"Tube connecting middle ear to throat"},{"term":"Septum Nasi","arti":"Dinding yang memisahkan rongga hidung kiri dan kanan, terdiri dari tulang, kartilago, dan mukosa.","penjelasan":"Nasal wall divider"}]}],"tables":[{"id":"slide-1-table-1","title":"Perbandingan Tiga Bagian Telinga","headers":["Komponen","Telinga Luar","Telinga Tengah","Telinga Dalam"],"rows":[["Struktur utama","Pinna, MAE, MT","Kavum timpani, tulang pendengaran","Koklea, vestibulum, kanalis semisirkularis"],["Cairan","Serumen","Udara","Perilimfa & endolimfa"],["Fungsi","Koleksi & konduksi bunyi","Konduksi & amplifikasi bunyi","Transduksi mekanik-elektrik"],["Gangguan pendengaran","Konduktif","Konduktif","Sensorineural"]]}],"quizzes":[{"id":"slide-1-quiz-1","question":"Berapa panjang faring pada orang dewasa?","options":["5-7 cm","8-10 cm","12-14 cm","15-18 cm"],"correct":2,"explanation":"Panjang faring berkisar antara 12-14 cm, dengan lebar maksimal ±5 cm di daerah hyoid dan tersempit ±1.5 cm di batas inferiornya."},{"id":"slide-1-quiz-2","question":"Tulang pendengaran telinga tengah terdiri dari?","options":["Malleus, Stapes, Incus","Malleus, Stapes, Cochlea","Incus, Cochlea, Vestibulum","Maleus, Timpanum, Ovalis"],"correct":0,"explanation":"Tulang pendengaran telinga tengah terdiri dari 3 tulang: Malleus (palu), Incus (landasan), dan Stapes (sangkurai) yang menghantarkan getaran dari membran timpani ke fenestra ovale."},{"id":"slide-1-quiz-3","question":"Cairan yang terdapat di skala media koklea adalah?","options":["Perilimfa","Endolimfa","Serebrospinal","Lendir"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Skala media (scala media/ductus cochlearis) berisi endolimfa yang memiliki muatan positif (+80 mV), sedangkan skala vestibuli dan skala timpani berisi perilimfa."},{"id":"slide-1-quiz-4","question":"Otot laring yang berfungsi sebagai abduktor (membuka pita suara) adalah?","options":["M. krikotiroideus","M. interaritenoideus","M. krikoaritenoideus posterior","M. tiroaritenoideus"],"correct":2,"explanation":"M. krikoaritenoideus posterior adalah satu-satunya otot abduktor laring yang membuka pita suara. Otot lainnya berfungsi sebagai adduktor (menutup) atau tensor (menegangkan)."},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-17","question":"Kelenjar yang menghasilkan serumen adalah...","options":["Kelenjar sebacea","Kelenjar seruminosa (apokrin)","Kelenjar minyak","Kelenjar ekrin/merokrin"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Serumen (earwax) dihasilkan oleh kelenjar seruminosa (apokrin glands) dan kelenjar sebacea yang terdapat di daerah kartilago meatus akustikus eksternus (outer 1/3). Kelenjar seruminosa adalah modifikasi kelenjar apokrin yang terletak di submukosa. Serumen bersifat protektif: antimikroba, pelumas, dan barrier."}],"flashcards":[{"term":"Meatus Akustikus Eksternus (MAE)","arti":"Liang telinga berbentuk huruf S yang menghubungkan pinna dengan membran timpani.","penjelasan":"1/3 luar = pars kartilagenosa, 2/3 dalam = pars tulang. Berfungsi menyalurkan bunyi ke membran timpani."},{"term":"Helikotrema","arti":"Ujung atau puncak koklea yang menghubungkan skala vestibuli dengan skala timpani.","penjelasan":"Di helikotrema, perilimfa dari skala vestibuli dapat mengalir ke skala timpani, membentuk satu sistem cairan kontinu."},{"term":"Cincin Waldeyer","arti":"Komposisi jaringan limfoid menyerupai cincin tidak sempurna pada jalan masuk traktus aerodigestivus atas.","penjelasan":"Terdiri dari tonsila faringeal (adenoid), tonsila palatina, tonsila lingualis, dan plika tubaria. Fungsi imunitas lokal."},{"term":"Glottis","arti":"Bagian laring yang terdiri dari pita suara sejati dan celah di antaranya, berfungsi sebagai suara dan proteksi jalan napas.","penjelasan":"Lebar ±1 cm. Dibatasi oleh kartilago aritenoideus posteriorly. Membentuk batas antara supraglottis dan subglottis."},{"term":"Fissula ante fenestram","arti":"Area di depan jendela oval tempat otosklerosis stapedial dimulai.","penjelasan":"Lesi otosklerosis dimulai dari depan oval window di area ini, menyebabkan fiksasi stapes dan tuli konduktif."},{"term":"Mukosa Olfaktorius","arti":"Mukosa khusus pada regio superior cavum nasi yang mengandung reseptor bau.","penjelasan":"Mengandung sel olfaktorius dengan bulbus olfaktorius yang mengirimkan sinyal melalui n. olfaktorius (I) ke korteks piriformis."}],"terms":[{"term":"Koklea","arti":"Struktur telinga dalam berbentuk 2½ lingkaran yang mengubah getaran mekanik menjadi sinyal elektrik.","penjelasan":"Snail shell-like structure untuk transduksi suara"},{"term":"Organ Corti","arti":"Organ sensorik pendengaran yang terletak di skala media koklea, mengandung sel-sel rambut.","penjelasan":"Hearing organ with hair cells"},{"term":"Tuba Eustachius","arti":"Saluran yang menghubungkan telinga tengah dengan nasofaring, berfungsi menyeimbangkan tekanan.","penjelasan":"Tube connecting middle ear to throat"},{"term":"Septum Nasi","arti":"Dinding yang memisahkan rongga hidung kiri dan kanan, terdiri dari tulang, kartilago, dan mukosa.","penjelasan":"Nasal wall divider"},{"term":"Sinus Paranasales","arti":"Rongga udara yang berhubungan dengan rongga hidung: frontalis, maksilaris, ethmoidalis, sfenoidalis.","penjelasan":"Air cavities around the nose"},{"term":"Waldeyer Ring","arti":"Cincin jaringan limfoid pada faring yang terdiri dari tonsil palatina, adenoid, tonsil lingualis.","penjelasan":"Lymphoid ring in pharynx"},{"term":"Vibrissae","arti":"Bulu-bulu hidung yang berfungsi menyaring partikel besar dari udara yang dihirup.","penjelasan":"Nose hairs for filtration"},{"term":"Rinolalia","arti":"Suara nasal abnormal akibat gangguan resonansi di hidung dan sinus.","penjelasan":"Abnormal nasal voice"},{"term":"Pita Suara","arti":"Lipatan mukosa di laring yang bergetar menghasilkan suara, terletak di glottis.","penjelasan":"Vocal folds for sound production"},{"term":"N. Laringeus Rekuren","arti":"Cabang n. vagus yang menginervasi semua otot intrinsik laring kecuali m. krikotiroideus.","penjelasan":"Recurrent laryngeal nerve"},{"term":"Adenoid","arti":"Tonsila faringeal yang terletak pada dinding posterior nasofaring, sering hipertrofi pada anak.","penjelasan":"Pharyngeal tonsil"},{"term":"Nares Anterior","arti":"Lubang hidung bagian depan yang merupakan pintu masuk udara ke rongga hidung.","penjelasan":"Front nostril openings"}],"media":[{"mediaId":"media-slide-1-1","caption":"Diagram anatomi telinga (luar, tengah, dalam)","placement":"card-anatomi-telinga"},{"mediaId":"media-slide-1-2","caption":"Anatomi sinus paranasales","placement":"card-anatomi-hidung"},{"mediaId":"media-slide-1-3","caption":"Cincin Waldeyer dan struktur faring","placement":"card-faring-tonsil"}],"crosslinks":[{"label":"Penyakit Telinga Luar","targetSlideId":"slide-2","reason":"Lanjutan klinis dari anatomi telinga"},{"label":"Penyakit Telinga Tengah & Dalam","targetSlideId":"slide-3","reason":"Lanjutan klinis anatomi telinga tengah-dalam"},{"label":"Tonsilitis & Faringitis","targetSlideId":"slide-7","reason":"Aplikasi klinis anatomi faring dan tonsil"}]},{"id":"slide-2","number":2,"title":"Penyakit Telinga Luar","subtitle":"Trauma, otitis eksterna, corpus alienum, fistula preaurikular, dan serumen prop","emoji":"👂","stats":[{"val":5,"lbl":"Topik utama","emoji":"📋"},{"val":"P.aeruginosa","lbl":"OE Maligna","emoji":"🦠"},{"val":"<48jam","lbl":"Drainase hematoma","emoji":"⏰"}],"actions":[{"icon":"🎯","label":"High-Yield","sub":"Red flags telinga luar","target":"slide","targetIndex":1},{"icon":"❓","label":"Quiz","sub":"Kasus klinis","target":"quiz","targetIndex":1}],"cards":[{"id":"slide-2-card-1","title":"Trauma Aurikular & Hematoma","badge":"URGENT","body":"**Hematoma aurikularis**: kumpulan darah di antara kartilago dan perikondrium daun telinga akibat trauma tumpul. Etiologi: olahraga kontak (gulat, tinju), kecelakaan, penempatan anting. Patofisiologi: trauma → perikondrium & pembuluh darah rusak → pemisahan dari kartilago → ruang potensial terisi darah → gangguan vaskular → cauliflower ear. **Manifestasi**: benjolan, fluktuasi, nyeri, kontur aurikula menghilang. **Terapi**: drainase aspirasi/insisi + bebat tekan (head dressing, silicone ear splint, bolster, quilting/mattress sutures) — optimal <48 jam.","variant":"danger","items":["Sering terjadi pada tepi heliks, konka, atau keduanya","Diagnosis: anamnesis trauma, pemeriksaan fisik (fluktuasi), USG/CT bila perlu","Kompilkasi: cauliflower ear (deformitas permanen) bila tidak ditangani"],"number":1,"content":"<p><strong>Hematoma aurikularis</strong>: kumpulan darah di antara kartilago dan perikondrium daun telinga akibat trauma tumpul. Etiologi: olahraga kontak (gulat, tinju), kecelakaan, penempatan anting. Patofisiologi: trauma → perikondrium &amp; pembuluh darah rusak → pemisahan dari kartilago → ruang potensial terisi darah → gangguan vaskular → cauliflower ear. <strong>Manifestasi</strong>: benjolan, fluktuasi, nyeri, kontur aurikula menghilang. <strong>Terapi</strong>: drainase aspirasi/insisi + bebat tekan (head dressing, silicone ear splint, bolster, quilting/mattress sutures) — optimal &lt;48 jam.</p><ul><li>Sering terjadi pada tepi heliks, konka, atau keduanya</li><li>Diagnosis: anamnesis trauma, pemeriksaan fisik (fluktuasi), USG/CT bila perlu</li><li>Kompilkasi: cauliflower ear (deformitas permanen) bila tidak ditangani</li></ul><figure class=\"codex-media-card\"><img src=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Cauliflower_Ear_Secondary_to_a_Chronic_Auricular_Hematoma_-_JETem.png\" alt=\"Fotografi klinis cauliflower ear yang menunjukkan deformitas permanen daun telinga akibat hematoma aurikularis kronis tidak tertangani dengan pembengkakan dan fibrosis kartilago\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" onerror=\"this.closest('figure').classList.add('image-load-failed')\"/><figcaption>Hematoma aurikularis dan cauliflower ear<br><span>JETem (Journal of Emergencies, Trauma, and Shock) · CC BY-SA 3.0</span></figcaption></figure>","terms":[{"term":"Cauliflower Ear","arti":"Deformitas daun telinga permanen akibat hematoma aurikularis yang tidak tertangani.","penjelasan":"Permanent ear deformity from untreated hematoma"},{"term":"Hillock of His","arti":"Enam tonjolan embriologis pada arkus brankial 1 dan 2 yang membentuk struktur daun telinga.","penjelasan":"Embryonic ear bumps"},{"term":"Ear Toilet","arti":"Pembersihan liang telinga dari sekret, debris, atau benda asing.","penjelasan":"Ear cleaning procedure"},{"term":"Irigasi Telinga","arti":"Pencucian liang telinga dengan air hangat menggunakan spuit 20-50cc untuk mengeluarkan serumen.","penjelasan":"Ear irrigation procedure"}]},{"id":"slide-2-card-2","title":"Otitis Eksterna (OE)","badge":"HIGH-YIELD","body":"Radang liang telinga akut/kronis akibat infeksi bakteri, virus, atau jamur. **OE Sirkumskripta (Furunkulosis)**: infeksi polisebaseus 1/3 luar CAE, pathogen S. aureus/S. albus, gejala nyeri telinga + gangguan dengar (jika furunkel besar), terapi analgetik + antibiotik topikal, aspirasi bila abses. **OE Difusa**: liang telinga 2/3 dalam, pathogen Pseudomonas, S. albus, E. coli, gejala nyeri + sekret + penurunan dengar, terapi ear toilet + tampon antibiotik 48-72 jam. **OE Maligna/Nekrotikan**: infeksi difus pada DM tua, pathogen P. aeruginosa, gejala gatal → nyeri hebat + granulasi, terapi antibiotik + debridemen radikal.","variant":"default","items":["OE maligna = otitis eksterna nekrotikan, merupakan emergency","Faktor risiko: berenang, trauma cotton bud, DM, kelembaban","Red flag: nyeri hebat, diabetes, paralisis saraf → OE maligna"],"number":2,"content":"<p>Radang liang telinga akut/kronis akibat infeksi bakteri, virus, atau jamur. <strong>OE Sirkumskripta (Furunkulosis)</strong>: infeksi polisebaseus 1/3 luar CAE, pathogen S. aureus/S. albus, gejala nyeri telinga + gangguan dengar (jika furunkel besar), terapi analgetik + antibiotik topikal, aspirasi bila abses. <strong>OE Difusa</strong>: liang telinga 2/3 dalam, pathogen Pseudomonas, S. albus, E. coli, gejala nyeri + sekret + penurunan dengar, terapi ear toilet + tampon antibiotik 48-72 jam. <strong>OE Maligna/Nekrotikan</strong>: infeksi difus pada DM tua, pathogen P. aeruginosa, gejala gatal → nyeri hebat + granulasi, terapi antibiotik + debridemen radikal.</p><ul><li>OE maligna = otitis eksterna nekrotikan, merupakan emergency</li><li>Faktor risiko: berenang, trauma cotton bud, DM, kelembaban</li><li>Red flag: nyeri hebat, diabetes, paralisis saraf → OE maligna</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Cauliflower Ear","arti":"Deformitas daun telinga permanen akibat hematoma aurikularis yang tidak tertangani.","penjelasan":"Permanent ear deformity from untreated hematoma"},{"term":"Hillock of His","arti":"Enam tonjolan embriologis pada arkus brankial 1 dan 2 yang membentuk struktur daun telinga.","penjelasan":"Embryonic ear bumps"},{"term":"Ear Toilet","arti":"Pembersihan liang telinga dari sekret, debris, atau benda asing.","penjelasan":"Ear cleaning procedure"},{"term":"Irigasi Telinga","arti":"Pencucian liang telinga dengan air hangat menggunakan spuit 20-50cc untuk mengeluarkan serumen.","penjelasan":"Ear irrigation procedure"}]},{"id":"slide-2-card-3","title":"Corpus Alienum (Benda Asing) Telinga","badge":"CLINICAL","body":"Benda asing di liang telinga bervariasi: **Anak**: kacang hijau, biji jagung, karet penghapus, manik-manik, mainan. **Dewasa**: kapas cotton bud tertinggal, serangga (semut, nyamuk, kecoa). **Gejala**: otalgia, suara gaduh, gangguan dengar. **Prinsip pengeluaran**: Benda hidup → matikan dulu (tampon basah + rivanol/anestesi lokal 10 menit), lalu irigasi/ambil pingset. Benda mati besar bulat → tarik dengan hook. Benda kecil → cunam/pengait. **Peringatan**: baterai jangan dibasahi!","variant":"default","items":["Jangan membasahi benda asing yang aktif/mengandung baterai","Serangga: matikan dulu sebelum diekstrak untuk mencegah trauma","Komplikasi: perforasi MT, otitis media sekunder"],"number":3,"content":"<p>Benda asing di liang telinga bervariasi: <strong>Anak</strong>: kacang hijau, biji jagung, karet penghapus, manik-manik, mainan. <strong>Dewasa</strong>: kapas cotton bud tertinggal, serangga (semut, nyamuk, kecoa). <strong>Gejala</strong>: otalgia, suara gaduh, gangguan dengar. <strong>Prinsip pengeluaran</strong>: Benda hidup → matikan dulu (tampon basah + rivanol/anestesi lokal 10 menit), lalu irigasi/ambil pingset. Benda mati besar bulat → tarik dengan hook. Benda kecil → cunam/pengait. <strong>Peringatan</strong>: baterai jangan dibasahi!</p><ul><li>Jangan membasahi benda asing yang aktif/mengandung baterai</li><li>Serangga: matikan dulu sebelum diekstrak untuk mencegah trauma</li><li>Komplikasi: perforasi MT, otitis media sekunder</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Cauliflower Ear","arti":"Deformitas daun telinga permanen akibat hematoma aurikularis yang tidak tertangani.","penjelasan":"Permanent ear deformity from untreated hematoma"},{"term":"Hillock of His","arti":"Enam tonjolan embriologis pada arkus brankial 1 dan 2 yang membentuk struktur daun telinga.","penjelasan":"Embryonic ear bumps"},{"term":"Ear Toilet","arti":"Pembersihan liang telinga dari sekret, debris, atau benda asing.","penjelasan":"Ear cleaning procedure"},{"term":"Irigasi Telinga","arti":"Pencucian liang telinga dengan air hangat menggunakan spuit 20-50cc untuk mengeluarkan serumen.","penjelasan":"Ear irrigation procedure"}]},{"id":"slide-2-card-4","title":"Fistula Preaurikular & Serumen Prop","badge":"CORE","body":"**Fistula Preaurikular**: kelainan herediter dominan, lubang bulat/lonjong di depan tragus akibat kegagalan penggabungan 2 dari 6 hillocks arkus brankial 1 dan 2. Gejala: infeksi, pyoderma, sekret. Terapi: antibiotik + eksisi komplit. **Serumen Prop**: akumulasi serumen (sekret kelenjar sebasea + seruminosa + epitel) yang mengeras dan menyumbat CAE. Gejala: penuh di telinga, penurunan dengar, otalgia, gatal, tinitus (jika menempel MT). Terapi: karbogliserin 5-10% 2-3 hari untuk melunakkan → ekstraksi/irigasi telinga.","variant":"default","items":["Hillocks of His: tonjolan 1-3 dari arkus 1, tonjolan 4-6 dari arkus 2","Serumen prop jangan dikorek dengan cotton bud (mendorong semakin dalam)","Irigasi: air hangat dengan spuit 20-50cc, kontraindikasi perforasi MT"],"number":4,"content":"<p><strong>Fistula Preaurikular</strong>: kelainan herediter dominan, lubang bulat/lonjong di depan tragus akibat kegagalan penggabungan 2 dari 6 hillocks arkus brankial 1 dan 2. Gejala: infeksi, pyoderma, sekret. Terapi: antibiotik + eksisi komplit. <strong>Serumen Prop</strong>: akumulasi serumen (sekret kelenjar sebasea + seruminosa + epitel) yang mengeras dan menyumbat CAE. Gejala: penuh di telinga, penurunan dengar, otalgia, gatal, tinitus (jika menempel MT). Terapi: karbogliserin 5-10% 2-3 hari untuk melunakkan → ekstraksi/irigasi telinga.</p><ul><li>Hillocks of His: tonjolan 1-3 dari arkus 1, tonjolan 4-6 dari arkus 2</li><li>Serumen prop jangan dikorek dengan cotton bud (mendorong semakin dalam)</li><li>Irigasi: air hangat dengan spuit 20-50cc, kontraindikasi perforasi MT</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Cauliflower Ear","arti":"Deformitas daun telinga permanen akibat hematoma aurikularis yang tidak tertangani.","penjelasan":"Permanent ear deformity from untreated hematoma"},{"term":"Hillock of His","arti":"Enam tonjolan embriologis pada arkus brankial 1 dan 2 yang membentuk struktur daun telinga.","penjelasan":"Embryonic ear bumps"},{"term":"Ear Toilet","arti":"Pembersihan liang telinga dari sekret, debris, atau benda asing.","penjelasan":"Ear cleaning procedure"},{"term":"Irigasi Telinga","arti":"Pencucian liang telinga dengan air hangat menggunakan spuit 20-50cc untuk mengeluarkan serumen.","penjelasan":"Ear irrigation procedure"}]}],"tables":[{"id":"slide-2-table-1","title":"Perbandingan Tipe Otitis Eksterna","headers":["Ciri","OE Sirkumskripta","OE Difusa","OE Maligna"],"rows":[["Lokasi","1/3 luar CAE","2/3 dalam CAE","Difus + struktur sekitar"],["Pathogen","S. aureus","Pseudomonas, E. coli","P. aeruginosa"],["Pasien","Umum","Umum","Diabetes lansia"],["Gejala utama","Nyeri + benjolan","Nyeri + sekret","Gatal → nyeri hebat"],["Tanda khas","Furunkel","Edema + sekret","Granulasi + nekrosis"],["Terapi","Analgetik + AB topikal","Ear toilet + tampon AB","AB sistemik + debridemen"]]}],"quizzes":[{"id":"slide-2-quiz-1","question":"Patogen paling sering pada otitis eksterna maligna adalah?","options":["Staphylococcus aureus","Pseudomonas aeruginosa","Streptococcus pneumoniae","Haemophilus influenzae"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Pseudomonas aeruginosa adalah patogen tersering pada OE maligna/nekrotikan, terutama pada pasien diabetes melitus lanjut usia. Memerlukan antibiotik sistemik dan debridemen radikal."},{"id":"slide-2-quiz-2","question":"Waktu optimal untuk drainase hematoma aurikular adalah?","options":["< 6 jam","< 48 jam","< 1 minggu","Tanpa batas waktu"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Drainase hematoma aurikular paling efektif dilakukan <48 jam. Setelah itu terjadi organisasi clot dan neokartilago yang menyebabkan cauliflower ear permanen."},{"id":"slide-2-quiz-3","question":"Tindakan pertama pada benda asing hidup (serangga) di telinga adalah?","options":["Irigasi dengan air hangat","Matiakan dengan tampon basai/anestesi lokal","Ambil dengan cunam langsung","Teteskan H2O2 3%"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Serangga hidup harus dimatikan terlebih dahulu dengan tampon basah atau obat anestesi lokal selama ~10 menit sebelum diekstraksi. Ini mencegah serangga bergerak dan menyebabkan trauma pada CAE atau MT."},{"id":"slide-2-quiz-4","question":"Fistula preaurikular disebabkan oleh kegagalan penggabungan berapa hillocks?","options":["2 dari 4 hillocks","2 dari 6 hillocks","3 dari 6 hillocks","1 dari 3 hillocks"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Fistula preaurikular disebabkan oleh kegagalan penggabungan 2 dari 6 hillocks yang muncul dari arkus brankial 1 dan 2 (Hillock of His). Sifatnya herediter dominan."}],"flashcards":[{"term":"Hematoma Aurikularis","arti":"Kumpulan darah antara kartilago dan perikondrium daun telinga akibat trauma tumpul.","penjelasan":"Jika tidak segera didrainase <48 jam akan menyebabkan cauliflower ear permanen akibat neokartilago."},{"term":"Otitis Eksterna Maligna","arti":"Infeksi difus liang telinga yang meluas ke struktur sekitar, terutama pada diabetes lanjut usia.","penjelasan":"Pathogen: P. aeruginosa. Gejala: nyeri hebat, granulasi, sekret. Terapi: antibiotik sistemik + debridemen radikal. Emergency."},{"term":"Furunkelosis","arti":"Infeksi polisebaseus 1/3 luar liang telinga, biasanya oleh S. aureus.","penjelasan":"Gejala: nyeri telinga, gangguan dengar jika furunkel besar. Terapi: analgetik + antibiotik topikal, aspirasi bila abses."},{"term":"Serumen Prop","arti":"Akumulasi serumen yang mengeras dan menyumbat liang telinga.","penjelasan":"Gejala: telinga penuh, penurunan dengar, otalgia, gatal. Terapi: karbogliserin 5-10% 2-3 hari lalu ekstraksi/irigasi."}],"terms":[{"term":"Cauliflower Ear","arti":"Deformitas daun telinga permanen akibat hematoma aurikularis yang tidak tertangani.","penjelasan":"Permanent ear deformity from untreated hematoma"},{"term":"Hillock of His","arti":"Enam tonjolan embriologis pada arkus brankial 1 dan 2 yang membentuk struktur daun telinga.","penjelasan":"Embryonic ear bumps"},{"term":"Ear Toilet","arti":"Pembersihan liang telinga dari sekret, debris, atau benda asing.","penjelasan":"Ear cleaning procedure"},{"term":"Irigasi Telinga","arti":"Pencucian liang telinga dengan air hangat menggunakan spuit 20-50cc untuk mengeluarkan serumen.","penjelasan":"Ear irrigation procedure"},{"term":"Debridemen","arti":"Pembersihan jaringan nekrotik atau terinfeksi secara radikal.","penjelasan":"Surgical removal of dead tissue"},{"term":"Granulasi","arti":"Jaringan baru berkapiler merah muda yang terbentuk pada proses penyembuhan luka.","penjelasan":"New capillary tissue in wound healing"}],"media":[{"mediaId":"media-slide-2-1","caption":"Hematoma aurikularis dan cauliflower ear","placement":"card-trauma"},{"mediaId":"media-slide-2-2","caption":"Otitis eksterna difusa dan maligna","placement":"card-oe"},{"mediaId":"media-slide-2-3","caption":"Fistula preaurikular","placement":"card-fistula"}],"crosslinks":[{"label":"Anatomi THT","targetSlideId":"slide-1","reason":"Kembali ke dasar anatomi telinga"},{"label":"Penyakit Telinga Tengah & Dalam","targetSlideId":"slide-3","reason":"Lanjutan penyakit telinga"}]},{"id":"slide-3","number":3,"title":"Penyakit Telinga Tengah & Dalam","subtitle":"Mastoiditis, kolesteatoma, otitis media akut/kronis, otosklerosis, dan labirinitis","emoji":"🔊","stats":[{"val":"S.pneumoniae","lbl":"OMA paling sering","emoji":"🦠"},{"val":"70%","lbl":"Anak usia 2 tahun","emoji":"👶"},{"val":"Carhart","lbl":"Notch otosklerosis","emoji":"📊"}],"actions":[{"icon":"🎯","label":"High-Yield","sub":"Bedah telinga","target":"slide","targetIndex":2},{"icon":"❓","label":"Quiz","sub":"Bedah + farmakologi","target":"quiz","targetIndex":2}],"cards":[{"id":"slide-3-card-1","title":"Otitis Media Akut (OMA)","badge":"HIGH-YIELD","body":"Infeksi telinga tengah akut. **Epidemiologi**: puncak insidensi 3-18 bulan, 70% anak usia 2 tahun pernah mengalami OMA minimal 1 kali. **Etiologi**: Streptococcus pneumoniae, Haemophilus influenzae, Moraxella catarrhalis. **Jalur infeksi**: melalui tuba eustachius (paling sering), bayi & anak: tuba pendek, lebar, horizontal. **5 Stadium**: (1) Oklusi tuba → tekanan negatif, (2) Hyperemis/pre-supurasi → MT hiperemis + eksudat serosa, (3) Supurasi → MT bulging, (4) Perforasi → sekret keluar, suhu turun, (5) Resolusi.","variant":"warning","items":["Gejala anak: demam tinggi 39.5°C, gelisah, menjerit tiba-tiba saat tidur","Gejala dewasa: otalgia, sensasi penuh, gangguan dengar, tinitus pulsatil","Terapi: antibiotik (penisilin/ampisilin/amoksisilin 10-14 hari), analgetik, miringotomi bila MT bulging"],"number":1,"content":"<p>Infeksi telinga tengah akut. <strong>Epidemiologi</strong>: puncak insidensi 3-18 bulan, 70% anak usia 2 tahun pernah mengalami OMA minimal 1 kali. <strong>Etiologi</strong>: Streptococcus pneumoniae, Haemophilus influenzae, Moraxella catarrhalis. <strong>Jalur infeksi</strong>: melalui tuba eustachius (paling sering), bayi &amp; anak: tuba pendek, lebar, horizontal. <strong>5 Stadium</strong>: (1) Oklusi tuba → tekanan negatif, (2) Hyperemis/pre-supurasi → MT hiperemis + eksudat serosa, (3) Supurasi → MT bulging, (4) Perforasi → sekret keluar, suhu turun, (5) Resolusi.</p><ul><li>Gejala anak: demam tinggi 39.5°C, gelisah, menjerit tiba-tiba saat tidur</li><li>Gejala dewasa: otalgia, sensasi penuh, gangguan dengar, tinitus pulsatil</li><li>Terapi: antibiotik (penisilin/ampisilin/amoksisilin 10-14 hari), analgetik, miringotomi bila MT bulging</li></ul><figure class=\"codex-media-card codex-media-source-card\"><div class=\"codex-source-preview\"><strong>Media sumber internet</strong><span>URL ini adalah halaman sumber, bukan file gambar langsung.</span></div><figcaption>Klasifikasi OMSK benigna vs maligna<br><span>Radiopaedia.org (Dr Frank Gaillard et al.) · CC BY-NC-SA 3.0</span><br><a href=\"https://radiopaedia.org/articles/chronic-otitis-media-with-cholesteatoma\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Buka sumber gambar</a></figcaption></figure>","terms":[{"term":"Otorrhea","arti":"Keluar cairan dari telinga.","penjelasan":"Ear discharge"},{"term":"Tympanosclerosis","arti":"Deposisi kalsium pada membran timpani dan telinga tengah pasca-otitis media.","penjelasan":"Calcification of tympanic membrane"},{"term":"Mastoidektomi","arti":"Pembedahan pengangkatan sel-sel mastoid untuk mengobati mastoiditis/kolesteatoma.","penjelasan":"Surgical removal of mastoid cells"},{"term":"Stapedektomi","arti":"Pembedahan penggantian stapes dengan prostesis untuk otosklerosis.","penjelasan":"Stapes replacement surgery"}]},{"id":"slide-3-card-2","title":"Otitis Media Supuratif Kronis (OMSK)","badge":"HIGH-YIELD","body":"Infeksi kronis telinga tengah dengan perforasi MT dan otorrea >2 bulan. **Tipe Benigna/Aman**: perforasi sentral di pars tensa, sekret mukoid, tanpa kolesteatoma, komplikasi jarang, tuli konduktif ringan-sedang. **Tipe Maligna/Bahaya**: perforasi marginal/atik di pars flaksida, kolesteatoma (+), sekret purulen berbau, granulasi, komplikasi sering, tuli konduktif/campuran. **Terapi**: tipe aman → ear toilet + AB topikal, timpanoplasti bila perforasi menetap >2 bulan; tipe bahaya → mastoidektomi ± timpanoplasti.","variant":"danger","items":["Kolesteatoma = kista epitel berisi deskuamasi epitel, bersifat destruktif pada tulang","Komplikasi tipe bahaya: abses subperiosteal, Bezold, facial nerve paralysis, labirinitis, meningitis","Tanda bedah: mastoidektomi sederhana, radikal, radikal modifikasi (Bondy), miringoplasti, timpanoplasti"],"number":2,"content":"<p>Infeksi kronis telinga tengah dengan perforasi MT dan otorrea &gt;2 bulan. <strong>Tipe Benigna/Aman</strong>: perforasi sentral di pars tensa, sekret mukoid, tanpa kolesteatoma, komplikasi jarang, tuli konduktif ringan-sedang. <strong>Tipe Maligna/Bahaya</strong>: perforasi marginal/atik di pars flaksida, kolesteatoma (+), sekret purulen berbau, granulasi, komplikasi sering, tuli konduktif/campuran. <strong>Terapi</strong>: tipe aman → ear toilet + AB topikal, timpanoplasti bila perforasi menetap &gt;2 bulan; tipe bahaya → mastoidektomi ± timpanoplasti.</p><ul><li>Kolesteatoma = kista epitel berisi deskuamasi epitel, bersifat destruktif pada tulang</li><li>Komplikasi tipe bahaya: abses subperiosteal, Bezold, facial nerve paralysis, labirinitis, meningitis</li><li>Tanda bedah: mastoidektomi sederhana, radikal, radikal modifikasi (Bondy), miringoplasti, timpanoplasti</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Otorrhea","arti":"Keluar cairan dari telinga.","penjelasan":"Ear discharge"},{"term":"Tympanosclerosis","arti":"Deposisi kalsium pada membran timpani dan telinga tengah pasca-otitis media.","penjelasan":"Calcification of tympanic membrane"},{"term":"Mastoidektomi","arti":"Pembedahan pengangkatan sel-sel mastoid untuk mengobati mastoiditis/kolesteatoma.","penjelasan":"Surgical removal of mastoid cells"},{"term":"Stapedektomi","arti":"Pembedahan penggantian stapes dengan prostesis untuk otosklerosis.","penjelasan":"Stapes replacement surgery"}]},{"id":"slide-3-card-3","title":"Mastoiditis & Kolesteatoma","badge":"URGENT","body":"**Mastoiditis**: infeksi rongga mastoid, umum <4 tahun. Pathogen: S. pneumoniae, S. pyogenes, P. aeruginosa, H. influenzae, S. aureus. Gejala: otalgia, otorea, demam tinggi, nyeri kepala, edema retrourikular, proptosis aurikula. Diagnosis: foto polos mastoid (perselubungan + destruksi tulang), leukositosis, CRP↑. **Kolesteatoma**: kista epitelial berisi deskuamasi epitel. Patogenesis: teori invaginasi, migrasi, metaplasi, implantasi. Klasifikasi: kongenital (MT intak), akuisital primer (retraksi MT), akuisital sekunder (perforasi MT). Komplikasi: parese N. fasialis, fistula labirin, SNHL, intrakranial.","variant":"danger","items":["Mastoiditis terkait OMA akut → erosi tulang mastoid (koalesen)","CT scan: standar emas untuk mastoiditis (kekeruhan sel + erosi trabekula)","Terapi kolesteatoma: medis (ear toilet + AB) + bedah (timpanomastoidectomy)"],"number":3,"content":"<p><strong>Mastoiditis</strong>: infeksi rongga mastoid, umum &lt;4 tahun. Pathogen: S. pneumoniae, S. pyogenes, P. aeruginosa, H. influenzae, S. aureus. Gejala: otalgia, otorea, demam tinggi, nyeri kepala, edema retrourikular, proptosis aurikula. Diagnosis: foto polos mastoid (perselubungan + destruksi tulang), leukositosis, CRP↑. <strong>Kolesteatoma</strong>: kista epitelial berisi deskuamasi epitel. Patogenesis: teori invaginasi, migrasi, metaplasi, implantasi. Klasifikasi: kongenital (MT intak), akuisital primer (retraksi MT), akuisital sekunder (perforasi MT). Komplikasi: parese N. fasialis, fistula labirin, SNHL, intrakranial.</p><ul><li>Mastoiditis terkait OMA akut → erosi tulang mastoid (koalesen)</li><li>CT scan: standar emas untuk mastoiditis (kekeruhan sel + erosi trabekula)</li><li>Terapi kolesteatoma: medis (ear toilet + AB) + bedah (timpanomastoidectomy)</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Otorrhea","arti":"Keluar cairan dari telinga.","penjelasan":"Ear discharge"},{"term":"Tympanosclerosis","arti":"Deposisi kalsium pada membran timpani dan telinga tengah pasca-otitis media.","penjelasan":"Calcification of tympanic membrane"},{"term":"Mastoidektomi","arti":"Pembedahan pengangkatan sel-sel mastoid untuk mengobati mastoiditis/kolesteatoma.","penjelasan":"Surgical removal of mastoid cells"},{"term":"Stapedektomi","arti":"Pembedahan penggantian stapes dengan prostesis untuk otosklerosis.","penjelasan":"Stapes replacement surgery"}]},{"id":"slide-3-card-4","title":"Otosklerosis & Labirinitis","badge":"CORE","body":"**Otosklerosis**: pembentukan tulang spongiosus baru di fissula ante fenestram → fiksasi stapes → tuli konduktif. Prevalensi: 0.3-0.4% (kaukasia), bilateral 70-80%, F:M = 2:1. Diagnosis: Rinne negatif, Weber ke sisi sakit, **Carhart notch** (air-bone gap >20dB di 2000Hz). **Terapi**: natrium fluorida 30-60mg/hari 2 tahun (medikamentosa), stapedektomi/stapedotomi (operatif). **Labirinitis**: peradangan labirin akibat otitis. Serous: translokasi toksin, vertigo tiba-tibia, dengar sedikit terpengaruh. Supuratif: invasi bakteri langsung, SNHL berat, potensi meningitis.","variant":"default","items":["Paracusis Willisii = dengar lebih baik di tempat bising (khas otosklerosis)","Tanda Schwartze: promontorium merah jambu pada otoskopi (tanda otosklerosis aktif)","Labirinitis supuratif → mastoidektomi + AB intravena, prognosis pendengaran buruk"],"number":4,"content":"<p><strong>Otosklerosis</strong>: pembentukan tulang spongiosus baru di fissula ante fenestram → fiksasi stapes → tuli konduktif. Prevalensi: 0.3-0.4% (kaukasia), bilateral 70-80%, F:M = 2:1. Diagnosis: Rinne negatif, Weber ke sisi sakit, <strong>Carhart notch</strong> (air-bone gap &gt;20dB di 2000Hz). <strong>Terapi</strong>: natrium fluorida 30-60mg/hari 2 tahun (medikamentosa), stapedektomi/stapedotomi (operatif). <strong>Labirinitis</strong>: peradangan labirin akibat otitis. Serous: translokasi toksin, vertigo tiba-tibia, dengar sedikit terpengaruh. Supuratif: invasi bakteri langsung, SNHL berat, potensi meningitis.</p><ul><li>Paracusis Willisii = dengar lebih baik di tempat bising (khas otosklerosis)</li><li>Tanda Schwartze: promontorium merah jambu pada otoskopi (tanda otosklerosis aktif)</li><li>Labirinitis supuratif → mastoidektomi + AB intravena, prognosis pendengaran buruk</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Otorrhea","arti":"Keluar cairan dari telinga.","penjelasan":"Ear discharge"},{"term":"Tympanosclerosis","arti":"Deposisi kalsium pada membran timpani dan telinga tengah pasca-otitis media.","penjelasan":"Calcification of tympanic membrane"},{"term":"Mastoidektomi","arti":"Pembedahan pengangkatan sel-sel mastoid untuk mengobati mastoiditis/kolesteatoma.","penjelasan":"Surgical removal of mastoid cells"},{"term":"Stapedektomi","arti":"Pembedahan penggantian stapes dengan prostesis untuk otosklerosis.","penjelasan":"Stapes replacement surgery"}]}],"tables":[{"id":"slide-3-table-1","title":"OMSK Benigna vs Maligna","headers":["Ciri","OMSK Benigna (Aman)","OMSK Maligna (Bahaya)"],"rows":[["Perforasi","Sentral (pars tensa)","Marginal/atik (pars flaksida)"],["Sekret","Mukoid, tidak berbau","Purulen, berbau"],["Kolesteatoma","Tidak ada","Ada"],["Granulasi","Jarang","Sering"],["Komplikasi","Jarang","Sering"],["Tuli","Konduktif ringan-sedang","Konduktif/campuran"],["Terapi","Toilet + AB, timpanoplasti","Mastoidektomi"]]},{"id":"slide-3-table-2","title":"Stadium OMA","headers":["Stadium","Ciri Klinis","Terapi"],"rows":[["Oklusi tuba","Tekanan negatif, MT normal/keruh","Dekongestan nasal"],["Pre-supurasi","MT hiperemis, eksudat serosa, demam","Antibiotik + analgetik"],["Supurasi","MT bulging, nyeri hebat","Miringotomi"],["Perforasi","Sekret keluar, suhu turun","Toilet + antibiotik 7 hari"],["Resolusi","Sekret hilang, perforasi menutup","Observasi"]]}],"quizzes":[{"id":"slide-3-quiz-1","question":"Patogen paling sering causing OMA pada anak adalah?","options":["Pseudomonas aeruginosa","Streptococcus pneumoniae","Staphylococcus aureus","Moraxella catarrhalis"],"correct":1,"explanation":"S. pneumoniae adalah patogen paling sering pada OMA, diikuti H. influenzae dan M. catarrhalis. P. aeruginosa lebih sering pada OE maligna dan mastoiditis kronis."},{"id":"slide-3-quiz-2","question":"Ciri khas perforasi pada OMSK tipe maligna adalah?","options":["Sentral di pars tensa","Marginal/atik di pars flaksida","Sentral di pars flaksida","Atik di pars tensa"],"correct":1,"explanation":"OMSK maligna memiliki perforasi marginal atau atik pada pars flaksida, sering disertai kolesteatoma. OMSK benigna memiliki perforasi sentral pada pars tensa."},{"id":"slide-3-quiz-3","question":"Tanda khas otosklerosis pada audiometri adalah?","options":["Cookie-bite notch","Carhart notch","Steeple sign","Thumbprint sign"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Carhart notch adalah air-bone gap >20dB pada frekuensi 2000Hz yang merupakan ciri khas otosklerosis. Steeple sign dan thumbprint sign adalah tanda radiologi pada laring."},{"id":"slide-3-quiz-4","question":"Komplikasi intrakranial dari kolesteatoma meliputi, KECUALI?","options":["Meningitis","Abses serebri","Sinus trombosis","Otosklerosis"],"correct":3,"explanation":"Otosklerosis adalah penyakit tulang telinga tengah yang tidak berhubungan dengan kolesteatoma. Komplikasi intrakranial kolesteatoma: meningitis, epidural/subdural empyema, abses serebri, sinus trombosis."},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-28","question":"Pembengkakan dari post auricular sampai m. sternocleidomastoideus setelah otitis media akut. Diagnosis?","options":["Abses Bezold","Mastoiditis akut","Abses subperiosteal","Lateral sinus thrombosis"],"correct":0,"explanation":"Abses Bezold adalah komplikasi otitis media akut/mastoiditis dimana infeksi menyebar melalui mastoid tip (processus mastoideus) yang pneumatized, masuk ke ruang di bawah m. sternocleidomastoideus. Tanda: pembengkakan post-auricular yang meluas ke leher (sulcus retro-mastoideus → SCM)."},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-2","question":"Tn F usia 23 tahun, pendengaran berkurang telinga kanan 3 hari, nyeri, keluar cairan nanah, demam (sudah tidak demam). Pemeriksaan otoskopi: perforasi membran timpani. Tatalaksana?","options":["NaCl 3% dan antibiotik","Irigasi telinga dengan NaCl 0,9% dan antibiotik","Dekongestan nasal","Analgesik saja"],"correct":1,"explanation":"OMA (Otitis Media Akut) stadium perforasi ditatalaksani dengan irigasi telinga menggunakan NaCl 0,9% untuk membersihkan sekret/nanah dan pemberian antibiotik sistemik. NaCl 3% digunakan untuk serumen prop, bukan OMA. Dekongestan tidak mengatasi infeksi."}],"flashcards":[{"term":"Kolesteatoma","arti":"Kista epitelial berisi deskuamasi epitel pada telinga tengah yang bersifat destruktif.","penjelasan":"4 teori patogenesis: invaginasi, migrasi, metaplasi, implantasi. Komplikasi: parese fasialis, fistula labirin, SNHL, intrakranial."},{"term":"Carhart Notch","arti":"Air-bone gap >20dB pada frekuensi 2000Hz pada audiometri, ciri khas otosklerosis.","penjelasan":"Disebabkan oleh fiksasi stapes di fissula ante fenestram yang mengganggu konduksi getaran ke koklea."},{"term":"Miringotomi","arti":"Insisi membran timpani untuk mengeluarkan pus dan mencegah perforasi spontan.","penjelasan":"Indikasi: MT bulging pada stadium supurasi OMA. Membantu drainase, mencegah komplikasi mastoiditis."},{"term":"Paracusis Willisii","arti":"Fenomena dengar lebih baik di tempat bising yang merupakan gejala khas otosklerosis.","penjelasan":"Pasien dengan otosklerosis merasa pendengarannya lebih baik di lingkungan bising karena orang lain berbicara lebih keras."},{"term":"Mastoiditis Koalesen","arti":"Mastoiditis dengan destruksi dan erosi tulang mastoid akibat infeksi.","penjelasan":"Tanda radiologi: perselubungan mastoid dengan destruksi trabekula tulang. Memerlukan mastoidektomi."},{"term":"Fissula Ante Fenestram","arti":"Area di depan jendela oval tempat otosklerosis stapedial dimulai.","penjelasan":"Lesi otosklerosis dimulai dari fissura ante fenestram dan meluas ke stapes menyebabkan fiksasi dan tuli konduktif."}],"terms":[{"term":"Otorrhea","arti":"Keluar cairan dari telinga.","penjelasan":"Ear discharge"},{"term":"Tympanosclerosis","arti":"Deposisi kalsium pada membran timpani dan telinga tengah pasca-otitis media.","penjelasan":"Calcification of tympanic membrane"},{"term":"Mastoidektomi","arti":"Pembedahan pengangkatan sel-sel mastoid untuk mengobati mastoiditis/kolesteatoma.","penjelasan":"Surgical removal of mastoid cells"},{"term":"Stapedektomi","arti":"Pembedahan penggantian stapes dengan prostesis untuk otosklerosis.","penjelasan":"Stapes replacement surgery"},{"term":"Timpanoplasti","arti":"Pembedahan rekonstruksi membran timpani dan/atau tulang pendengaran.","penjelasan":"Eardrum reconstruction surgery"},{"term":"Labirinitis","arti":"Peradangan labirin telinga dalam akibat penyebaran infeksi dari telinga tengah.","penjelasan":"Inner ear labyrinth inflammation"},{"term":"Otosklerosis Stapedial","arti":"Tipe otosklerosis yang mengenai stapes di jendela oval menyebabkan tuli konduktif.","penjelasan":"Stapes otosclerosis"},{"term":"Bullous Myringitis","arti":"Inflamasi membran timpani dengan terbentuknya bula disertai penurunan tajam pendengaran.","penjelasan":"Blistered eardrum"},{"term":"Cholesteatoma Kongenital","arti":"Kolesteatoma dengan membran timpani normal tanpa riwayat infeksi/operasi.","penjelasan":"Congenital cholesteatoma"},{"term":"Stadium Oklusi Tuba","arti":"Stadium awal OMA dengan sumbatan tuba eustachius dan tekanan negatif di telinga tengah.","penjelasan":"First stage of AOM"}],"media":[{"mediaId":"media-slide-3-1","caption":"Klasifikasi OMSK benigna vs maligna","placement":"card-omsk"},{"mediaId":"media-slide-3-2","caption":"Kolesteatoma dan mastoiditis","placement":"card-mastoid"},{"mediaId":"media-slide-3-3","caption":"Audiogram Carhart notch otosklerosis","placement":"card-otosklerosis"}],"crosslinks":[{"label":"Anatomi Telinga","targetSlideId":"slide-1","reason":"Review dasar anatomi telinga"},{"label":"Penyakit Telinga Luar","targetSlideId":"slide-2","reason":"Lanjutan penyakit telinga"},{"label":"Farmakologi THT","targetSlideId":"slide-5","reason":"Terapi farmakologi OMA/OE"}]},{"id":"slide-4","number":4,"title":"Gangguan Pendengaran & Keseimbangan","subtitle":"Congenital deafness, BPPV, Meniere, motion sickness, dan trauma akustik","emoji":"🌀","stats":[{"val":"85dB","lbl":"Ambang NIHL","emoji":"🔊"},{"val":"TTS→PTS","lbl":"Progresi trauma","emoji":"📉"},{"key":"Cochlear Implant","lbl":"Terapi congenital","emoji":"🔋"}],"actions":[{"icon":"🎯","label":"High-Yield","sub":"BPPV & Meniere","target":"slide","targetIndex":3},{"icon":"❓","label":"Quiz","sub":"Vertigo & dengar","target":"quiz","targetIndex":3}],"cards":[{"id":"slide-4-card-1","title":"Congenital Deafness","badge":"CORE","body":"Ketulian sejak lahir dapat bersifat konduktif, sensorineural, atau campuran. Penyebab: faktor genetik (sindromal/non-sindromal), infeksi intrauterin (TORCH), ototoksik, prematuritas, asfiksia perinatal. **Penatalaksanaan**: deteksi dini ( newborn hearing screening), hearing aid untuk tuli konduktif/moderat, **cochlear implant** untuk SNHL berat bilateral (optimal <3-5 tahun untuk perkembangan bahasa).","variant":"default","items":["Indikasi cochlear implant: SNHL berat bilateral, gagal hearing aid, usia <5 tahun optimal","Early intervention penting untuk perkembangan bahasa dan bicara","Tidak ada terapi farmakologis yang efektif untuk SNHL congenital"],"number":1,"content":"<p>Ketulian sejak lahir dapat bersifat konduktif, sensorineural, atau campuran. Penyebab: faktor genetik (sindromal/non-sindromal), infeksi intrauterin (TORCH), ototoksik, prematuritas, asfiksia perinatal. <strong>Penatalaksanaan</strong>: deteksi dini ( newborn hearing screening), hearing aid untuk tuli konduktif/moderat, <strong>cochlear implant</strong> untuk SNHL berat bilateral (optimal &lt;3-5 tahun untuk perkembangan bahasa).</p><ul><li>Indikasi cochlear implant: SNHL berat bilateral, gagal hearing aid, usia &lt;5 tahun optimal</li><li>Early intervention penting untuk perkembangan bahasa dan bicara</li><li>Tidak ada terapi farmakologis yang efektif untuk SNHL congenital</li></ul><figure class=\"codex-media-card codex-media-source-card\"><div class=\"codex-source-preview\"><strong>Media sumber internet</strong><span>URL ini adalah halaman sumber, bukan file gambar langsung.</span></div><figcaption>Epley maneuver untuk BPPV<br><span>Cleveland Clinic · Cleveland Clinic Educational License</span><br><a href=\"https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/treatments/17930-canalith-repositioning-procedure-crp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Buka sumber gambar</a></figcaption></figure>","terms":[{"term":"NIHL","arti":"Noise-Induced Hearing Loss: gangguan pendengaran akibat paparan bising berlebihan.","penjelasan":"Hearing loss from noise"},{"term":"Otokonia","arti":"Kristal kalsium karbonat di utrikulus dan sakulus yang berfungsi sebagai sensor gravitasi.","penjelasan":"Calcium crystals in inner ear"},{"term":"Hydropik Endolimfatik","arti":"Penumpukan endolimfa berlebihan di telinga dalam yang menjadi penyebab Meniere.","penjelasan":"Excess inner ear fluid"},{"term":"Dix-Hallpike Test","arti":"Tes diagnostik BPPV dengan menggantungkan kepala 45° ke sisi yang dicurigai.","penjelasan":"Diagnostic test for BPPV"}]},{"id":"slide-4-card-2","title":"Benign Paroxysmal Positional Vertigo (BPPV)","badge":"HIGH-YIELD","body":"Vertigo posisional singkat (<1 menit) akibat dislokasi otokonia (kalsium karbonat) ke semisirkular kanalis posterior. **Gejala**: vertigo paroksismal dipicu perubahan posisi kepala (berbaring, bangkit, mengguling), nistagmus rotasi-torsi dengan komponen geotropik. **Diagnosis**: Dix-Hallpike test positif. **Terapi**: Epley maneuver (repositioning kanalis posterior), Semont maneuver, Brandt-Daroff exercises. **Prognosis**: baik, sering rekuren.","variant":"default","items":["Kanalis posterior tersering terkena (90%) karena posisi anatomis paling inferior","Epley maneuver: seri gerakan kepala untuk memindahkan otokonia kembali ke utrikulus","Red flag: vertigo >1 menit, neurologi defisit, diplopia → rujuk (bukan BPPV)"],"number":2,"content":"<p>Vertigo posisional singkat (&lt;1 menit) akibat dislokasi otokonia (kalsium karbonat) ke semisirkular kanalis posterior. <strong>Gejala</strong>: vertigo paroksismal dipicu perubahan posisi kepala (berbaring, bangkit, mengguling), nistagmus rotasi-torsi dengan komponen geotropik. <strong>Diagnosis</strong>: Dix-Hallpike test positif. <strong>Terapi</strong>: Epley maneuver (repositioning kanalis posterior), Semont maneuver, Brandt-Daroff exercises. <strong>Prognosis</strong>: baik, sering rekuren.</p><ul><li>Kanalis posterior tersering terkena (90%) karena posisi anatomis paling inferior</li><li>Epley maneuver: seri gerakan kepala untuk memindahkan otokonia kembali ke utrikulus</li><li>Red flag: vertigo &gt;1 menit, neurologi defisit, diplopia → rujuk (bukan BPPV)</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"NIHL","arti":"Noise-Induced Hearing Loss: gangguan pendengaran akibat paparan bising berlebihan.","penjelasan":"Hearing loss from noise"},{"term":"Otokonia","arti":"Kristal kalsium karbonat di utrikulus dan sakulus yang berfungsi sebagai sensor gravitasi.","penjelasan":"Calcium crystals in inner ear"},{"term":"Hydropik Endolimfatik","arti":"Penumpukan endolimfa berlebihan di telinga dalam yang menjadi penyebab Meniere.","penjelasan":"Excess inner ear fluid"},{"term":"Dix-Hallpike Test","arti":"Tes diagnostik BPPV dengan menggantungkan kepala 45° ke sisi yang dicurigai.","penjelasan":"Diagnostic test for BPPV"}]},{"id":"slide-4-card-3","title":"Meniere Disease & Motion Sickness","badge":"CLINICAL","body":"**Meniere Disease**: gangguan telinga dalam akibat hidropik endolimfatik. Tritas klasik: vertigo (20 menit-12 jam), SNHL fluktuatif, tinitus, sensasi penuh (aural fullness). Diagnosis: kriteria AAO-HNS (vertigo + SNHL + tinitus/fullness). Terapi: diet rendah garam, diuretik, betahistin, intratympanic gentamicin/steroi untuk refrakter. **Motion Sickness**: mual-muntah akibat diskoordinasi informasi visual-vestibular-proprioseptif. Terapi: skopolamin patch, antihistamin (dimenhydrinate, meclizine), behavioral modification.","variant":"default","items":["Meniere: serangan vertigo berulang 20 menit-12 jam, SNHL progresif dari rendah ke frekuensi tinggi","Gentamisin transtimpani: ablation kimiawi untuk Meniere refrakter (destruksi vestibulum)","Motion sickness: pencegahan lebih efektif (duduk depan, lihat ke depan, hindari membaca)"],"number":3,"content":"<p><strong>Meniere Disease</strong>: gangguan telinga dalam akibat hidropik endolimfatik. Tritas klasik: vertigo (20 menit-12 jam), SNHL fluktuatif, tinitus, sensasi penuh (aural fullness). Diagnosis: kriteria AAO-HNS (vertigo + SNHL + tinitus/fullness). Terapi: diet rendah garam, diuretik, betahistin, intratympanic gentamicin/steroi untuk refrakter. <strong>Motion Sickness</strong>: mual-muntah akibat diskoordinasi informasi visual-vestibular-proprioseptif. Terapi: skopolamin patch, antihistamin (dimenhydrinate, meclizine), behavioral modification.</p><ul><li>Meniere: serangan vertigo berulang 20 menit-12 jam, SNHL progresif dari rendah ke frekuensi tinggi</li><li>Gentamisin transtimpani: ablation kimiawi untuk Meniere refrakter (destruksi vestibulum)</li><li>Motion sickness: pencegahan lebih efektif (duduk depan, lihat ke depan, hindari membaca)</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"NIHL","arti":"Noise-Induced Hearing Loss: gangguan pendengaran akibat paparan bising berlebihan.","penjelasan":"Hearing loss from noise"},{"term":"Otokonia","arti":"Kristal kalsium karbonat di utrikulus dan sakulus yang berfungsi sebagai sensor gravitasi.","penjelasan":"Calcium crystals in inner ear"},{"term":"Hydropik Endolimfatik","arti":"Penumpukan endolimfa berlebihan di telinga dalam yang menjadi penyebab Meniere.","penjelasan":"Excess inner ear fluid"},{"term":"Dix-Hallpike Test","arti":"Tes diagnostik BPPV dengan menggantungkan kepala 45° ke sisi yang dicurigai.","penjelasan":"Diagnostic test for BPPV"}]},{"id":"slide-4-card-4","title":"Acoustic Trauma & NIHL","badge":"URGENT","body":"**NIHL akut**: eksposur tunggal >130-140 dB → kerusakan mekanik organ Corti, takik pada 4000 Hz (notch patognomonik). **NIHL kronis**: eksposur >85 dB jangka panjang. Pathofisiologi: kerusakan metabolik + mekanik sel rambut koklea, mulai frekuensi 3000-6000 Hz. Diagnosis: anamnesis eksposur bising + audiometri (takik 4000 Hz). Terapi: tirah baring + vasodilator + vitamin + steroid (sistemik/intratimpani), hyperbaric oxygen. **Prognosis**: TTS (temporary threshold shift) reversibel, PTS (permanent threshold shift) ireversibel.","variant":"danger","items":["Eksposur >85 dB dapat menyebabkan gangguan pendengaran","Takik 4000 Hz = tanda patognomonik NIHL","TTS reversibel dalam 24-48 jam; PTS permanen tanpa terapi yang efektif"],"number":4,"content":"<p><strong>NIHL akut</strong>: eksposur tunggal &gt;130-140 dB → kerusakan mekanik organ Corti, takik pada 4000 Hz (notch patognomonik). <strong>NIHL kronis</strong>: eksposur &gt;85 dB jangka panjang. Pathofisiologi: kerusakan metabolik + mekanik sel rambut koklea, mulai frekuensi 3000-6000 Hz. Diagnosis: anamnesis eksposur bising + audiometri (takik 4000 Hz). Terapi: tirah baring + vasodilator + vitamin + steroid (sistemik/intratimpani), hyperbaric oxygen. <strong>Prognosis</strong>: TTS (temporary threshold shift) reversibel, PTS (permanent threshold shift) ireversibel.</p><ul><li>Eksposur &gt;85 dB dapat menyebabkan gangguan pendengaran</li><li>Takik 4000 Hz = tanda patognomonik NIHL</li><li>TTS reversibel dalam 24-48 jam; PTS permanen tanpa terapi yang efektif</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"NIHL","arti":"Noise-Induced Hearing Loss: gangguan pendengaran akibat paparan bising berlebihan.","penjelasan":"Hearing loss from noise"},{"term":"Otokonia","arti":"Kristal kalsium karbonat di utrikulus dan sakulus yang berfungsi sebagai sensor gravitasi.","penjelasan":"Calcium crystals in inner ear"},{"term":"Hydropik Endolimfatik","arti":"Penumpukan endolimfa berlebihan di telinga dalam yang menjadi penyebab Meniere.","penjelasan":"Excess inner ear fluid"},{"term":"Dix-Hallpike Test","arti":"Tes diagnostik BPPV dengan menggantungkan kepala 45° ke sisi yang dicurigai.","penjelasan":"Diagnostic test for BPPV"}]}],"tables":[{"id":"slide-4-table-1","title":"Perbandingan Vertigo","headers":["Ciri","BPPV","Meniere","Vestibular Neuritis"],"rows":[["Durasi","<1 menit","20 menit-12 jam","Hari-hari"],["Pemicu","Posisi kepala","Spontan","Spontan"],["Hearing loss","Tidak","SNHL fluktuatif","Tidak"],["Tinitus","Tidak","Ya","Tidak"],["Nistagmus","Rotasi-torsi","Horisontal","Horisontal"],["Terapi","Epley maneuver","Diet garam + diuretik","Steroid + vestibular rehab"]]}],"quizzes":[{"id":"slide-4-quiz-1","question":"Tanda audiometri paling khas pada trauma akustik/NIHL adalah?","options":["Cookie-bite notch","Takik pada frekuensi 4000 Hz","Air-bone gap 2000 Hz","Konduktif di semua frekuensi"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Takik (notch) pada frekuensi 4000 Hz merupakan tanda patognomonik NIHL karena daerah basal koklea (mendeteksi frekuensi tinggi) paling rentan terhadap kerusakan akibat bising."},{"id":"slide-4-quiz-2","question":"Terapi pilihan pertama BPPV adalah?","options":["Betahistin","Epley maneuver","Gentamisin intratimpani","Diuretik"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Epley maneuver (canalith repositioning procedure) adalah terapi pilihan pertama BPPV untuk memindahkan otokonia yang dislokasi kembali ke utrikulus. Betahistin untuk Meniere, gentamisin untuk ablasi vestibuler."},{"id":"slide-4-quiz-3","question":"Tritas klasik Meniere disease terdiri dari?","options":["Vertigo, SNHL, tinitus, aural fullness","Vertigo, CHL, otalgia, otorrhea","Tuli, tinitus, otalgia, demam","Vertigo, diplopia, disartria, disfagia"],"correct":0,"explanation":"Tritas Meniere: (1) Vertigo episodik 20 menit-12 jam, (2) SNHL fluktuatif sensorineural, (3) Tinitus + aural fullness. Disebabkan oleh hidropik endolimfatik."},{"id":"slide-4-quiz-4","question":"Ambang batas kebisingan yang dapat menyebabkan NIHL kronis adalah?","options":["65 dB","85 dB","100 dB","120 dB"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Paparan >85 dB secara jangka panjang dapat menyebabkan NIHL kronis. Paparan tunggal >130-140 dB dapat menyebabkan NIHL akut."},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-24","question":"Laki-laki 62 tahun, vesikel multiple aurikularis sinistra, nyeri, pendengaran berkurang, pusing. Saraf terlibat?","options":["N. VII dan N. VIII","N. I dan N. II","N. III dan N. IV","N. V dan N. VI"],"correct":0,"explanation":"Ramsay Hunt Syndrome (herpes zoster oticus) adalah reaktivasi VZV di ganglion geniculate (N. VII facial). Trias: (1) vesikel aurikular/external ear, (2) facial paralysis (Bell palsy-like), (3) auditory/vestibular symptoms (tinnitus, HL, vertigo) akibat N. VIII involvement. Tatalaksana: asiklovir + prednison dalam 72 jam."},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-25","question":"Buruh 36 tahun, penurunan pendengaran bilateral, terbiasa suara mesin. Hasil audiometri?","options":["Noise notch 4000 Hz bilateral","Penurunan air conduction saja","Penurunan bone conduction saja","Cookie-bite pattern"],"correct":0,"explanation":"Noise-induced hearing loss (NIHL) adalah sensorineural hearing loss akibat paparan noise kronis (>85 dB). Tanda audiometri khas: bilateral symmetrical sensorineural hearing loss dengan noise notch di 3000-6000 Hz (peak 4000 Hz). Mekanisme: stereocilia damage di basal turn cochlea (high frequency region)."}],"flashcards":[{"term":"BPPV","arti":"Vertigo posisional singkat akibat otokonia dislokasi ke kanalis semisirkularis posterior.","penjelasan":"Gejala: vertigo <1 menit dipicu posisi kepala, nistagmus rotasi. Terapi: Epley maneuver. Diagnosis: Dix-Hallpike test."},{"term":"Meniere Disease","arti":"Gangguan telinga dalam akibat hidropik endolimfatik dengan tritas vertigo-SNHL-tinitus.","penjelasan":"Vertigo 20 menit-12 jam, SNHL fluktuatif, tinitus, aural fullness. Terapi: diet rendah garam, diuretik, betahistin."},{"term":"Temporary Threshold Shift (TTS)","arti":"Penurunan ambang pendengaran sementara akibat paparan bising yang reversibel.","penjelasan":"TTS membaik dalam 24-48 jam. Berbeda dengan PTS (permanent) yang tidak bisa dipulihkan."},{"term":"Epley Maneuver","arti":"Seri gerakan repositioning untuk mengembalikan otokonia ke utrikulus pada BPPV.","penjelasan":"Prosedur: duduk→baring dengan kepala tergantung 45° ke sisi yang sakit→putar 90° ke sisi lain→guling miring 135°→duduk tegak."},{"term":"Cochlear Implant","arti":"Alat elektrik yang menggantikan fungsi koklea untuk SNHL berat bilateral.","penjelasan":"Optimal <3-5 tahun untuk perkembangan bahasa. Kontraindikasi: saluran koklea tidak berkembang, SNHL non-organik."},{"term":"Motion Sickness","arti":"Mual-muntah akibat diskoordinasi input vestibular, visual, dan proprioseptif.","penjelasan":"Terapi: skopolamin, dimenhydrinate, meclizine. Pencegahan: duduk depan, tatap horizon, hindari membaca."}],"terms":[{"term":"NIHL","arti":"Noise-Induced Hearing Loss: gangguan pendengaran akibat paparan bising berlebihan.","penjelasan":"Hearing loss from noise"},{"term":"Otokonia","arti":"Kristal kalsium karbonat di utrikulus dan sakulus yang berfungsi sebagai sensor gravitasi.","penjelasan":"Calcium crystals in inner ear"},{"term":"Hydropik Endolimfatik","arti":"Penumpukan endolimfa berlebihan di telinga dalam yang menjadi penyebab Meniere.","penjelasan":"Excess inner ear fluid"},{"term":"Dix-Hallpike Test","arti":"Tes diagnostik BPPV dengan menggantungkan kepala 45° ke sisi yang dicurigai.","penjelasan":"Diagnostic test for BPPV"},{"term":"Takik 4000 Hz","arti":"Notch pada frekuensi 4000 Hz di audiogram yang khas untuk NIHL.","penjelasan":"4kHz notch in NIHL"},{"term":"Vestibular Rehab","arti":"Program latihan fisioterapi untuk mengkompensasi gangguan vestibular.","penjelasan":"Balance rehabilitation therapy"}],"media":[{"mediaId":"media-slide-4-1","caption":"Epley maneuver untuk BPPV","placement":"card-bppv"},{"mediaId":"media-slide-4-2","caption":"Audiogram takik 4000 Hz NIHL","placement":"card-nihl"}],"crosslinks":[{"label":"Trauma Akustik Detail","targetSlideId":"slide-5","reason":"Detail etiologi dan terapi trauma akustik"},{"label":"Farmakologi","targetSlideId":"slide-5","reason":"Obat-obatan untuk vertigo dan infeksi"}]},{"id":"slide-5","number":5,"title":"Trauma Akustik & Farmakologi THT","subtitle":"Etiologi bising, terapi, dan farmakologi telinga-hidung-tenggorok","emoji":"💊","stats":[{"val":"85dB","lbl":"Ambang NIHL","emoji":"🎧"},{"val":"AB + Steroid","lbl":"OMA terapi","emoji":"💉"},{"val":"Alpha-1","lbl":"Dekongestan","emoji":"🔬"}],"actions":[{"icon":"📋","label":"Quick Reference","sub":"Dosis obat THT","target":"quick-reference","targetIndex":0},{"icon":"❓","label":"Quiz","sub":"Farmakologi","target":"quiz","targetIndex":4}],"cards":[{"id":"slide-5-card-1","title":"Trauma Akustik Akut: Etiologi & Patofisiologi","badge":"HIGH-YIELD","body":"**Definisi**: gangguan pendengaran sensorineural akibat paparan suara keras yang merusak sel-sel rambut organ Corti. **Etiologi**: ledakan bom, petasan, tembakan, earphone bising. **Tipe bising**: Continuous (>85 dB kronis), Impact (tinggi intensitas pendek), Impulse (>130-140 dB eksposur tunggal). **Patofisiologi**: metabolik (stress oksidatif, gangguan homeostasis koklea) + mekanik (shear force pada stereosilia). Kerusakan dimulai frekuensi 3000-6000 Hz, puncak 4000 Hz. **TTS** (Temporary Threshold Shift) reversibel <48 jam; **PTS** (Permanent Threshold Shift) ireversibel.","variant":"danger","items":["Paparan >130-140 dB tunggal → NIHL akut; >85 dB kronis → NIHL kronis","Sel rambut bagian dalam (IHC) → neurotransmisi; sel rambut luar (OHC) → amplifikasi 40 dB","Gangguan metabolisme koklea: reactive oxygen species, gangguan kalsium homeostasis"],"number":1,"content":"<p><strong>Definisi</strong>: gangguan pendengaran sensorineural akibat paparan suara keras yang merusak sel-sel rambut organ Corti. <strong>Etiologi</strong>: ledakan bom, petasan, tembakan, earphone bising. <strong>Tipe bising</strong>: Continuous (&gt;85 dB kronis), Impact (tinggi intensitas pendek), Impulse (&gt;130-140 dB eksposur tunggal). <strong>Patofisiologi</strong>: metabolik (stress oksidatif, gangguan homeostasis koklea) + mekanik (shear force pada stereosilia). Kerusakan dimulai frekuensi 3000-6000 Hz, puncak 4000 Hz. <strong>TTS</strong> (Temporary Threshold Shift) reversibel &lt;48 jam; <strong>PTS</strong> (Permanent Threshold Shift) ireversibel.</p><ul><li>Paparan &gt;130-140 dB tunggal → NIHL akut; &gt;85 dB kronis → NIHL kronis</li><li>Sel rambut bagian dalam (IHC) → neurotransmisi; sel rambut luar (OHC) → amplifikasi 40 dB</li><li>Gangguan metabolisme koklea: reactive oxygen species, gangguan kalsium homeostasis</li></ul><figure class=\"codex-media-card codex-media-source-card\"><div class=\"codex-source-preview\"><strong>Media sumber internet</strong><span>URL ini adalah halaman sumber, bukan file gambar langsung.</span></div><figcaption>Tabel obat ototoksik<br><span>National Center for Biotechnology Information (NCBI/NIH) · Public Domain (US Government work)</span><br><a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK507860/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Buka sumber gambar</a></figcaption></figure>","terms":[{"term":"Hyperbaric Oxygen","arti":"Terapi oksigen dalam tekanan tinggi untuk meningkatkan oksigenasi jaringan.","penjelasan":"High-pressure oxygen therapy"},{"term":"Vasodilator","arti":"Obat yang melebarkan pembuluh darah untuk meningkatkan perfusi.","penjelasan":"Blood vessel dilator"},{"term":"Rinitis Medikamentosa","arti":"Kongesti hidung kronis akibat penggunaan dekongestan nasal berlebihan >3-5 hari.","penjelasan":"Medication-induced rhinitis"},{"term":"Alpha-Agonis","arti":"Obat yang meregangkan reseptor alfa-adrenergik menyebabkan vasokonstriksi.","penjelasan":"Alpha receptor agonist"}]},{"id":"slide-5-card-2","title":"Tatalaksana Trauma Akustik","badge":"URGENT","body":"**Diagnosis**: anamnesis paparan bising + pemeriksaan fisik (MT normal) + audiometri (takik 3000-6000 Hz, puncak 4000 Hz). **Tatalaksana**: (1) Tirah baring sempurna tanpa bantal di ruang kedap suara (<40 dB), (2) Vasodilator + vitamin, (3) Steroid (sistemik/intratimpani: deksametason/metilprednisolon), (4) Antikoagulan/heparin, (5) Diuretik + diet rendah garam + rendah kolesterol, (6) Hyperbaric Oxygen Therapy (HBOT). **Prognosis**: TTS reversibel, PTS permanen tidak ada terapi. Pencegahan: ear protection (earmuff, earplug) saat paparan >85 dB.","variant":"danger","items":["Terapi steroid intratimpani: dexamethasone/methylprednisolone → kadar lebih tinggi di perilimfa","HBOT: meningkatkan oksigenasi koklea, efektif bila dini","Tidak ada metode pengobatan yang efektif untuk PTS yang sudah terjadi"],"number":2,"content":"<p><strong>Diagnosis</strong>: anamnesis paparan bising + pemeriksaan fisik (MT normal) + audiometri (takik 3000-6000 Hz, puncak 4000 Hz). <strong>Tatalaksana</strong>: (1) Tirah baring sempurna tanpa bantal di ruang kedap suara (&lt;40 dB), (2) Vasodilator + vitamin, (3) Steroid (sistemik/intratimpani: deksametason/metilprednisolon), (4) Antikoagulan/heparin, (5) Diuretik + diet rendah garam + rendah kolesterol, (6) Hyperbaric Oxygen Therapy (HBOT). <strong>Prognosis</strong>: TTS reversibel, PTS permanen tidak ada terapi. Pencegahan: ear protection (earmuff, earplug) saat paparan &gt;85 dB.</p><ul><li>Terapi steroid intratimpani: dexamethasone/methylprednisolone → kadar lebih tinggi di perilimfa</li><li>HBOT: meningkatkan oksigenasi koklea, efektif bila dini</li><li>Tidak ada metode pengobatan yang efektif untuk PTS yang sudah terjadi</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Hyperbaric Oxygen","arti":"Terapi oksigen dalam tekanan tinggi untuk meningkatkan oksigenasi jaringan.","penjelasan":"High-pressure oxygen therapy"},{"term":"Vasodilator","arti":"Obat yang melebarkan pembuluh darah untuk meningkatkan perfusi.","penjelasan":"Blood vessel dilator"},{"term":"Rinitis Medikamentosa","arti":"Kongesti hidung kronis akibat penggunaan dekongestan nasal berlebihan >3-5 hari.","penjelasan":"Medication-induced rhinitis"},{"term":"Alpha-Agonis","arti":"Obat yang meregangkan reseptor alfa-adrenergik menyebabkan vasokonstriksi.","penjelasan":"Alpha receptor agonist"}]},{"id":"slide-5-card-3","title":"Farmakologi Telinga","badge":"CORE","body":"**Antibiotik topikal**: gentamicin (ototoksik, hati-hati perforasi), ciprofloxacin (lebih aman bila MT perforasi), ofloxacin, polymyxin B. **Kortikosteroid intratimpani**: deksametason, methylprednisolone, hidrokortison untuk tuli SN mendadak, Meniere refrakter, tinnitus. **Aminoglikosida intratimpani**: gentamisin untuk ablasi labirin pada Meniere (hati-hati ototoksik). **Cerumenolitik**: H2O2, carbamide peroxide, glycerin, olive oil, sodium bicarbonate. **Obat ototoksik**: aminoglikosida, diuretik loop, cisplatin, salisilat dosis tinggi, antimalaria.","variant":"default","items":["Rute transtimpani: obat melewati membran jendela bulat → perilimfa → koklea","Blood-labyrinthine barrier mirip BBB → obat sistemik sulit mencapai telinga dalam","Kontraindikasi cerumenolitik: perforasi MT, infeksi telinga tengah, riwayat operasi telinga"],"number":3,"content":"<p><strong>Antibiotik topikal</strong>: gentamicin (ototoksik, hati-hati perforasi), ciprofloxacin (lebih aman bila MT perforasi), ofloxacin, polymyxin B. <strong>Kortikosteroid intratimpani</strong>: deksametason, methylprednisolone, hidrokortison untuk tuli SN mendadak, Meniere refrakter, tinnitus. <strong>Aminoglikosida intratimpani</strong>: gentamisin untuk ablasi labirin pada Meniere (hati-hati ototoksik). <strong>Cerumenolitik</strong>: H2O2, carbamide peroxide, glycerin, olive oil, sodium bicarbonate. <strong>Obat ototoksik</strong>: aminoglikosida, diuretik loop, cisplatin, salisilat dosis tinggi, antimalaria.</p><ul><li>Rute transtimpani: obat melewati membran jendela bulat → perilimfa → koklea</li><li>Blood-labyrinthine barrier mirip BBB → obat sistemik sulit mencapai telinga dalam</li><li>Kontraindikasi cerumenolitik: perforasi MT, infeksi telinga tengah, riwayat operasi telinga</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Hyperbaric Oxygen","arti":"Terapi oksigen dalam tekanan tinggi untuk meningkatkan oksigenasi jaringan.","penjelasan":"High-pressure oxygen therapy"},{"term":"Vasodilator","arti":"Obat yang melebarkan pembuluh darah untuk meningkatkan perfusi.","penjelasan":"Blood vessel dilator"},{"term":"Rinitis Medikamentosa","arti":"Kongesti hidung kronis akibat penggunaan dekongestan nasal berlebihan >3-5 hari.","penjelasan":"Medication-induced rhinitis"},{"term":"Alpha-Agonis","arti":"Obat yang meregangkan reseptor alfa-adrenergik menyebabkan vasokonstriksi.","penjelasan":"Alpha receptor agonist"}]},{"id":"slide-5-card-4","title":"Farmakologi Hidung & Tenggorok","badge":"CORE","body":"**Antihistamin H1**: generasi 1 (sedasi: difenhidramin, klorfeniramin), generasi 2 (non-sedasi: loratadine, cetirizine, fexofenadine). **Kortikosteroid nasal**: beclomethasone, budesonide, fluticasone, mometasone (1x sehari). **Dekongestan**: oxymetazoline, xylometazoline, phenylephrine (intranasal); pseudoephedrine (oral). ⚠️ Rebound congestion >3-5 hari → rinitis medikamentosa. **Antibiotik**: amoksisilin (OMA), ciprofloxacin (OE dengan perforasi). **Topikal**: lidocaine/benzocaine (anestesi telinga), nystatin (kandidiasis mulut/faring).","variant":"default","items":["Dekongestan nasal >3-5 hari → rinitis medikamentosa (rebound congestion)","Fluticasone/mometasone: sediaan 1x sehari, efektif untuk rinitis alergi dan vasomotor","Kortikosteroid oral jangka panjang: tapering off secara bertahap untuk mencegah krisis adrenal"],"number":4,"content":"<p><strong>Antihistamin H1</strong>: generasi 1 (sedasi: difenhidramin, klorfeniramin), generasi 2 (non-sedasi: loratadine, cetirizine, fexofenadine). <strong>Kortikosteroid nasal</strong>: beclomethasone, budesonide, fluticasone, mometasone (1x sehari). <strong>Dekongestan</strong>: oxymetazoline, xylometazoline, phenylephrine (intranasal); pseudoephedrine (oral). ⚠️ Rebound congestion &gt;3-5 hari → rinitis medikamentosa. <strong>Antibiotik</strong>: amoksisilin (OMA), ciprofloxacin (OE dengan perforasi). <strong>Topikal</strong>: lidocaine/benzocaine (anestesi telinga), nystatin (kandidiasis mulut/faring).</p><ul><li>Dekongestan nasal &gt;3-5 hari → rinitis medikamentosa (rebound congestion)</li><li>Fluticasone/mometasone: sediaan 1x sehari, efektif untuk rinitis alergi dan vasomotor</li><li>Kortikosteroid oral jangka panjang: tapering off secara bertahap untuk mencegah krisis adrenal</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Hyperbaric Oxygen","arti":"Terapi oksigen dalam tekanan tinggi untuk meningkatkan oksigenasi jaringan.","penjelasan":"High-pressure oxygen therapy"},{"term":"Vasodilator","arti":"Obat yang melebarkan pembuluh darah untuk meningkatkan perfusi.","penjelasan":"Blood vessel dilator"},{"term":"Rinitis Medikamentosa","arti":"Kongesti hidung kronis akibat penggunaan dekongestan nasal berlebihan >3-5 hari.","penjelasan":"Medication-induced rhinitis"},{"term":"Alpha-Agonis","arti":"Obat yang meregangkan reseptor alfa-adrenergik menyebabkan vasokonstriksi.","penjelasan":"Alpha receptor agonist"}]}],"tables":[{"id":"slide-5-table-1","title":"Antibiotik Topikal Telinga","headers":["Obat","Golongan","Indikasi","Catatan"],"rows":[["Gentamicin","Aminoglikosida","Otitis externa","Ototoksik bila MT perforasi"],["Ciprofloxacin","Fluorokuinolon","OE, OMA dengan perforasi","Aman pada perforasi MT"],["Ofloxacin","Fluorokuinolon","OE, OMA","Risiko ototoksik rendah"],["Neomycin","Aminoglikosida","OE","Sering dikombinasi dengan steroid"],["Polymyxin B","Polipeptida","Infeksi bakteri telinga","Kombinasi dengan neomycin"]]},{"id":"slide-5-table-2","title":"Obat Ototoksik","headers":["Golongan","Contoh","Efek"],"rows":[["Aminoglikosida","Gentamicin, Streptomycin","Kerusakan sel rambut koklea & vestibulum"],["Diuretik loop","Furosemide, Bumetanide","Gangguan fungsi koklea"],["Platinum","Cisplatin, Carboplatin","SNHL permanen"],["Salisilat tinggi","Aspirin","Tinnitus sementara"],["Antimalaria","Klorokuin, Kinin","Tinnitus & gangguan dengar"],["Makrolid tinggi","Eritromisin","Gangguan dengar sementara"]]}],"quizzes":[{"id":"slide-5-quiz-1","question":"Antibiotik topikal telinga yang PALING AMAN pada perforasi membran timpani adalah?","options":["Gentamicin","Ciprofloxacin","Neomycin","Polymyxin B"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Ciprofloxacin (fluorokuinolon) adalah antibiotik topikal telinga yang paling aman pada perforasi MT. Aminoglikosida (gentamicin, neomycin) berisiko ototoksik bila sampai ke telinga dalam."},{"id":"slide-5-quiz-2","question":"Terapi pilihan pertama untuk Temporary Threshold Shift (TTS) akut adalah?","options":["Tirah baring di ruang kedap + steroid","Operasi segera","Vitamin saja","Tidak memerlukan terapi"],"correct":0,"explanation":"TTS akut diterapi dengan tirah baring di ruang kedap suara (<40 dB), steroid (sistemik/intratimpani), vasodilator, dan HBOT. Early intervention penting untuk mencegah progresi ke PTS."},{"id":"slide-5-quiz-3","question":"Dekongestan nasal yang menyebabkan rinitis medikamentosa jika digunakan >3-5 hari adalah?","options":["Loratadine","Oxymetazoline","Fluticasone","Ipratropium"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Oxymetazoline dan dekongestan nasal vasokonstriktor lain dapat menyebabkan rinitis medikamentosa (rebound congestion) jika digunakan >3-5 hari karena down-regulasi reseptor alpha-adrenergik."},{"id":"slide-5-quiz-4","question":"Obat ototoksik yang menyebabkan SNHL permanen adalah?","options":["Aspirin","Cisplatin","Furosemide","Eritromisin"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Cisplatin (kemoterapi platinum) menyebabkan SNHL permanen. Aspirin dan eritromisin menyebabkan tinnitus/gangguan dengar sementara. Furosemide dapat menyebabkan gangguan fungsi koklea."},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-10","question":"Jenis erupsi obat yang paling sering terjadi adalah...","options":["Stevens-Johnson syndrome","Erupsi obat tipe bulosa","Erupsi obat morbiliformis","Toxic epidermal necrolysis"],"correct":2,"explanation":"Erupsi obat morbiliformis (exanthematous/morbiliform drug eruption) adalah reaksi obat kulit tersering, menyebabkan ~90% semua reaksi obat cutaneous. Berupa makulopapul eritematosa yang simetris di trunkus dan proksimal ekstremitas, muncul 7-14 hari pasca obat. Self-limiting setelah obat dihentikan."},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-21","question":"Side effect beta blocker yang berhubungan dengan asma adalah...","options":["Bronkospasme","Takikardia","Hipertensi","Hipoglikemia"],"correct":0,"explanation":"Beta blocker non-selektif (propranolol) menghambat reseptor beta-2 di bronkus → bronkospasme. Kontraindikasi pada asma. Beta blocker kardioselektif (metoprolol, bisoprolol) lebih aman tapi tetap hati-hati. Beta-2 agonist (salbutamol) merupakan terapi utama asma."}],"flashcards":[{"term":"PTS (Permanent Threshold Shift)","arti":"Penurunan ambang pendengaran permanen akibat trauma akustik yang tidak dapat dipulihkan.","penjelasan":"Berbeda dari TTS yang reversibel. Terjadi kerusakan permanen pada sel rambut organ Corti, terutama frekuensi 3000-6000 Hz."},{"term":"Rebound Congestion","arti":"Kongesti hidung kambuh setelah penghentian dekongestan vasokonstriktor >3-5 hari.","penjelasan":"Rinitis medikamentosa: down-regulasi reseptor alpha-adrenergik mukosa hidung menyebabkan vasodilatasi rebound."},{"term":"Blood-Labyrinthine Barrier","arti":"Sawar darah di telinga dalam yang mirip BBB, membatasi penetrasi obat sistemik.","penjelasan":"Tight junction antar sel endotel pembuluh darah koklea → obat sistemik sulit mencapai telinga dalam → rute transtimpani lebih efektif."},{"term":"Cerumenolitik","arti":"Obat yang melunakkan serumen untuk memudahkan ekstraksi.","penjelasan":"Contoh: H2O2, carbamide peroxide, glycerin, olive oil, sodium bicarbonate. Kontraindikasi: perforasi MT."},{"term":"Kortikosteroid Intratimpani","arti":"Pemberian steroid langsung ke telinga tengah melalui membran timpani.","penjelasan":"Indikasi: tuli SN mendadak, Meniere refrakter, tinnitus. Agen: dexamethasone, methylprednisolone. Keuntungan: kadar tinggi di perilimfa, efek sistemik minimal."},{"term":"Ablasi Labirin Kimiawi","arti":"Penghancuran fungsi labirin menggunakan gentamisin intratimpani untuk Meniere refrakter.","penjelasan":"Gentamisin ototoksik → kerusakan sel rambut vestibulum → kontrol vertigo. Risiko: penurunan pendengaran SNHL."}],"terms":[{"term":"Hyperbaric Oxygen","arti":"Terapi oksigen dalam tekanan tinggi untuk meningkatkan oksigenasi jaringan.","penjelasan":"High-pressure oxygen therapy"},{"term":"Vasodilator","arti":"Obat yang melebarkan pembuluh darah untuk meningkatkan perfusi.","penjelasan":"Blood vessel dilator"},{"term":"Rinitis Medikamentosa","arti":"Kongesti hidung kronis akibat penggunaan dekongestan nasal berlebihan >3-5 hari.","penjelasan":"Medication-induced rhinitis"},{"term":"Alpha-Agonis","arti":"Obat yang meregangkan reseptor alfa-adrenergik menyebabkan vasokonstriksi.","penjelasan":"Alpha receptor agonist"},{"term":"Aminoglikosida","arti":"Golongan antibiotik yang berisiko ototoksik (kerusakan telinga dalam dan ginjal).","penjelasan":"Antibiotic with ear/kidney toxicity"},{"term":"HBOT","arti":"Hyperbaric Oxygen Therapy: terapi oksigen 100% dalam tekanan >1 atmosfer.","penjelasan":"Hyperbaric oxygen therapy"}],"media":[{"mediaId":"media-slide-5-1","caption":"Tabel obat ototoksik","placement":"card-ototoksik"},{"mediaId":"media-slide-5-2","caption":"Rute pemberian transtimpani","placement":"card-farmakologi"}],"crosslinks":[{"label":"Penyakit Telinga Tengah","targetSlideId":"slide-3","reason":"Aplikasi farmakologi OMA/OE"},{"label":"Gangguan Pendengaran","targetSlideId":"slide-4","reason":"Detail patofisiologi NIHL"}]},{"id":"slide-6","number":6,"title":"Kepala Leher: Kelainan Kongenital & Tumor","subtitle":"Fistula brankial, higroma kistik, tortikolis, dan tumor THT","emoji":"👶","stats":[{"val":"2nd arch","lbl":"Fistula paling sering","emoji":"🔗"},{"val":"75-90%","lbl":"Higroma di serviks","emoji":"📍"},{"val":"Schwannoma","lbl":"Tumor telinga dalam","emoji":"🧬"}],"actions":[{"icon":"🎯","label":"Bedah","sub":"Teknik tonsilektomi","target":"slide","targetIndex":5},{"icon":"❓","label":"Quiz","sub":"Kongenital + tumor","target":"quiz","targetIndex":5}],"cards":[{"id":"slide-6-card-1","title":"Fistula & Kista Brankial","badge":"HIGH-YIELD","body":"Kelainan kongenital akibat kurang sempurnanya penutupan arkus brankialis. **Kista**: kantung tanpa saluran keluar. **Sinus**: kantung dengan saluran ke kulit. **Fistula**: saluran kulik-faring. **Klasifikasi**: 1st arch (5-25%, duplikasi CAE), 2nd arch (40-95%, paling sering, anterior SCM → antara ICA-ECA → tonsila), 3rd arch (jarang, thyroiditis supuratif), 4th arch (jarang, neonatal neck mass). **Diagnosis**: usia muda, massa lateral leher, fluktuasi, mobilitas dengan menelan. **Terapi**: eksisi bedah komplit + penanda traktus dengan methylene blue.","variant":"default","items":["Kista brankial ke-2 paling sering (95%), letak anterior m. sternokleidomastoideus","Diagnosis penunjang: USG, CT, MRI, fistulografi","Prognosis baik bila eksisi komplit; residif jika traktus tidak terangkat seluruhnya"],"number":1,"content":"<p>Kelainan kongenital akibat kurang sempurnanya penutupan arkus brankialis. <strong>Kista</strong>: kantung tanpa saluran keluar. <strong>Sinus</strong>: kantung dengan saluran ke kulit. <strong>Fistula</strong>: saluran kulik-faring. <strong>Klasifikasi</strong>: 1st arch (5-25%, duplikasi CAE), 2nd arch (40-95%, paling sering, anterior SCM → antara ICA-ECA → tonsila), 3rd arch (jarang, thyroiditis supuratif), 4th arch (jarang, neonatal neck mass). <strong>Diagnosis</strong>: usia muda, massa lateral leher, fluktuasi, mobilitas dengan menelan. <strong>Terapi</strong>: eksisi bedah komplit + penanda traktus dengan methylene blue.</p><ul><li>Kista brankial ke-2 paling sering (95%), letak anterior m. sternokleidomastoideus</li><li>Diagnosis penunjang: USG, CT, MRI, fistulografi</li><li>Prognosis baik bila eksisi komplit; residif jika traktus tidak terangkat seluruhnya</li></ul><figure class=\"codex-media-card\"><img src=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Branchial_Cleft_Cyst,_External_Surface,_Gross_(6077646338).jpg\" alt=\"Fotografi patologi gross kista brankial menunjukkan lesi kistik di leher lateral dengan surface eksternal yang halus dan karakteristik lokasi di tepi anterior m. sternocleidomastoideus\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" onerror=\"this.closest('figure').classList.add('image-load-failed')\"/><figcaption>Kista brankial dan jalur traktus<br><span>Ed Uthman, Houston, TX (Wikimedia Commons via Flickr) · CC BY 2.0</span></figcaption></figure>","terms":[{"term":"Branchial Cleft Cyst","arti":"Kista kongenital akibat persistensi celah brankial embriologi.","penjelasan":"Congenital neck cyst"},{"term":"Cystic Hygroma","arti":"Higroma kistik: malformasi limfatik dengan kista berisi cairan bening.","penjelasan":"Lymphatic malformation cyst"},{"term":"Sternocleidomastoideus","arti":"Otot leher yang bila memendek menyebabkan tortikolis.","penjelasan":"Neck muscle involved in torticollis"},{"term":"Plagiocephaly","arti":"Kepala datar pada satu sisi akibat posisi berbaring terus-menerus.","penjelasan":"Flat head syndrome"}]},{"id":"slide-6-card-2","title":"Higroma Kistik (Cystic Hygroma)","badge":"CORE","body":"Malformasi kongenital benigna sistem limfatik akibat kegagalan drainase limfa ke vena → dilatasi saluran limfa. **Epidemiologi**: 6% lesi jinak bayi, 50% sejak lahir, 90% <2 tahun. **Lokasi**: 75-90% serviks (trigonum posterior colli), 20% aksila. **Gejala**: benjolan lunak, kistik, transiluminasi positif, tanpa nyeri. **Komplikasi**: infeksi, respiratory distress, disfagia, perdarahan, ekspansi ke wajah/lidah/laring/mediastinum. **Diagnosis**: USG, CT/MRI. **Terapi**: ekstirpasi bedah (pilihan utama), skleroterapi (OK-432, bleomycin), aspirasi untuk sementara.","variant":"default","items":["Transiluminasi positif = tembus cahaya (khas)","Terdeteksi USG sejak usia kehamilan 10 minggu","Asosiasi: Sindrom Turner, Sindrom Down"],"number":2,"content":"<p>Malformasi kongenital benigna sistem limfatik akibat kegagalan drainase limfa ke vena → dilatasi saluran limfa. <strong>Epidemiologi</strong>: 6% lesi jinak bayi, 50% sejak lahir, 90% &lt;2 tahun. <strong>Lokasi</strong>: 75-90% serviks (trigonum posterior colli), 20% aksila. <strong>Gejala</strong>: benjolan lunak, kistik, transiluminasi positif, tanpa nyeri. <strong>Komplikasi</strong>: infeksi, respiratory distress, disfagia, perdarahan, ekspansi ke wajah/lidah/laring/mediastinum. <strong>Diagnosis</strong>: USG, CT/MRI. <strong>Terapi</strong>: ekstirpasi bedah (pilihan utama), skleroterapi (OK-432, bleomycin), aspirasi untuk sementara.</p><ul><li>Transiluminasi positif = tembus cahaya (khas)</li><li>Terdeteksi USG sejak usia kehamilan 10 minggu</li><li>Asosiasi: Sindrom Turner, Sindrom Down</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Branchial Cleft Cyst","arti":"Kista kongenital akibat persistensi celah brankial embriologi.","penjelasan":"Congenital neck cyst"},{"term":"Cystic Hygroma","arti":"Higroma kistik: malformasi limfatik dengan kista berisi cairan bening.","penjelasan":"Lymphatic malformation cyst"},{"term":"Sternocleidomastoideus","arti":"Otot leher yang bila memendek menyebabkan tortikolis.","penjelasan":"Neck muscle involved in torticollis"},{"term":"Plagiocephaly","arti":"Kepala datar pada satu sisi akibat posisi berbaring terus-menerus.","penjelasan":"Flat head syndrome"}]},{"id":"slide-6-card-3","title":"Tortikolis","badge":"CLINICAL","body":"Keterbatasan gerakan leher akibat pemendekan m. sternokleidomastoideus (SCM). **Kongenital**: trauma leher saat persalinan → hematoma → fibrosis → kontraktur otot SCM. **Akuisita**: distonia fokal, kelainan sentral, tumor fossa posterior, infeksi faring. **Gejala**: kepala miring, dagu ke sisi sehat, rotasi terbatas, plagiocephaly (kepala datar satu sisi). **Terapi**: fisioterapi (stretching, pemanas, massage) dimulai usia 2 bulan; bedah bila >6 bulan stretching gagal atau deviasi >15°.","variant":"default","items":["Intervensi dini (2 bulan) mempengaruhi perkembangan motorik","Peregangan manual: 3x/minggu, 15 kali, masing-masing ±1 detik, jeda 10 detik","Surgical release: sternocleidomastoid tenotomy/tenectomy"],"number":3,"content":"<p>Keterbatasan gerakan leher akibat pemendekan m. sternokleidomastoideus (SCM). <strong>Kongenital</strong>: trauma leher saat persalinan → hematoma → fibrosis → kontraktur otot SCM. <strong>Akuisita</strong>: distonia fokal, kelainan sentral, tumor fossa posterior, infeksi faring. <strong>Gejala</strong>: kepala miring, dagu ke sisi sehat, rotasi terbatas, plagiocephaly (kepala datar satu sisi). <strong>Terapi</strong>: fisioterapi (stretching, pemanas, massage) dimulai usia 2 bulan; bedah bila &gt;6 bulan stretching gagal atau deviasi &gt;15°.</p><ul><li>Intervensi dini (2 bulan) mempengaruhi perkembangan motorik</li><li>Peregangan manual: 3x/minggu, 15 kali, masing-masing ±1 detik, jeda 10 detik</li><li>Surgical release: sternocleidomastoid tenotomy/tenectomy</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Branchial Cleft Cyst","arti":"Kista kongenital akibat persistensi celah brankial embriologi.","penjelasan":"Congenital neck cyst"},{"term":"Cystic Hygroma","arti":"Higroma kistik: malformasi limfatik dengan kista berisi cairan bening.","penjelasan":"Lymphatic malformation cyst"},{"term":"Sternocleidomastoideus","arti":"Otot leher yang bila memendek menyebabkan tortikolis.","penjelasan":"Neck muscle involved in torticollis"},{"term":"Plagiocephaly","arti":"Kepala datar pada satu sisi akibat posisi berbaring terus-menerus.","penjelasan":"Flat head syndrome"}]},{"id":"slide-6-card-4","title":"Tumor THT: Telinga & Hidung","badge":"HIGH-YIELD","body":"**Telinga Luar**: Papilloma skuamosa (HPV 6,11), seboroik keratosis, aktinik keratosis (pre-karsinoma), keratoacanthoma, KSS, KSB, melanoma malignum. **Kelenjar seruminosa**: ceruminoma (jinak), adenoid cystic carcinoma, mucoepidermoid carcinoma. **Telinga Tengah-Dalam**: schwannoma (vestibular, acoustic neuroma → trias: dengar↓, tinitus, vertigo), lipoma. **Hidung**: Polip nasal (inflamasi, jinak), Papilloma sinonasal (inverted, exophytic, oncocytic), KSS nasal (sinus maksilaris 60%). **Terapi**: eksisi untuk jinak; reseksi + radiasi/kemoterapi untuk ganas.","variant":"warning","items":["Acoustic neuroma/schwannoma vestibular: gejala tritas → dengar↓, tinitus, vertigo","Inverted papilloma: potensi malignansi 10-15%, memerlukan wide excision","Adenoid cystic carcinoma: infiltratif, rekuren, perineural invasion"],"number":4,"content":"<p><strong>Telinga Luar</strong>: Papilloma skuamosa (HPV 6,11), seboroik keratosis, aktinik keratosis (pre-karsinoma), keratoacanthoma, KSS, KSB, melanoma malignum. <strong>Kelenjar seruminosa</strong>: ceruminoma (jinak), adenoid cystic carcinoma, mucoepidermoid carcinoma. <strong>Telinga Tengah-Dalam</strong>: schwannoma (vestibular, acoustic neuroma → trias: dengar↓, tinitus, vertigo), lipoma. <strong>Hidung</strong>: Polip nasal (inflamasi, jinak), Papilloma sinonasal (inverted, exophytic, oncocytic), KSS nasal (sinus maksilaris 60%). <strong>Terapi</strong>: eksisi untuk jinak; reseksi + radiasi/kemoterapi untuk ganas.</p><ul><li>Acoustic neuroma/schwannoma vestibular: gejala tritas → dengar↓, tinitus, vertigo</li><li>Inverted papilloma: potensi malignansi 10-15%, memerlukan wide excision</li><li>Adenoid cystic carcinoma: infiltratif, rekuren, perineural invasion</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Branchial Cleft Cyst","arti":"Kista kongenital akibat persistensi celah brankial embriologi.","penjelasan":"Congenital neck cyst"},{"term":"Cystic Hygroma","arti":"Higroma kistik: malformasi limfatik dengan kista berisi cairan bening.","penjelasan":"Lymphatic malformation cyst"},{"term":"Sternocleidomastoideus","arti":"Otot leher yang bila memendek menyebabkan tortikolis.","penjelasan":"Neck muscle involved in torticollis"},{"term":"Plagiocephaly","arti":"Kepala datar pada satu sisi akibat posisi berbaring terus-menerus.","penjelasan":"Flat head syndrome"}]}],"tables":[{"id":"slide-6-table-1","title":"Klasifikasi Kista Brankial","headers":["Arkus","Prevalensi","Lokasi","Manifestasi"],"rows":[["Pertama","5-25%","Sejajar CAE, parotis","Duplikasi saluran telinga"],["Kedua","40-95%","Anterior SCM → tonsila","Paling sering, painless neck mass"],["Ketiga","Jarang","Faring → thyroid","Thyroiditis supuratif rekuren"],["Keempat","Jarang","Faring inferior → tiroid","Neonatal neck mass, deep abses"]]}],"quizzes":[{"id":"slide-6-quiz-1","question":"Kista brankial yang paling sering adalah arkus ke?","options":["Pertama","Kedua","Ketiga","Keempat"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Kista brankial ke-2 (second branchial cleft cyst) adalah yang paling sering (40-95%), terletak anterior m. sternokleidomastoideus, traktus melewati antara a. karotis interna dan eksterna menuju tonsila."},{"id":"slide-6-quiz-2","question":"Tanda khas higroma kistik pada pemeriksaan fisik adalah?","options":["Nyeri tekan","Transiluminasi positif","Bruit","Fixasi"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Transiluminasi positif (tembus cahaya) adalah tanda khas higroma kistik karena lesi berisi cairan limfe bening. Lesi lunak, kistik, tanpa nyeri."},{"id":"slide-6-quiz-3","question":"Tumor jinak telinga dalam yang paling sering adalah?","options":["Karsinoma sel skuamosa","Schwannoma vestibular","Lipoma","Adenoid cystic carcinoma"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Schwannoma vestibular (acoustic neuroma) adalah tumor jinak telinga dalam yang paling sering, berasal dari sel schwann nervus vestibularis. Trias klinis: penurunan pendengaran, tinitus, vertigo."},{"id":"slide-6-quiz-4","question":"Waktu optimal memulai fisioterapi pada tortikolis kongenital adalah?","options":["Segera setelah lahir","Bulan ke-2 kehidupan","Bulan ke-6 kehidupan","Tahun ke-2 kehidupan"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Intervensi fisioterapi tortikolis kongenital harus dimulai pada bulan ke-2 kehidupan untuk mempengaruhi perkembangan motorik normal. Peregangan manual minimal 3x seminggu."},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-18","question":"Sel melanosit berada pada lapisan epidermis...","options":["Stratum korneum","Diantara stratum basal dan stratum spinosum","Stratum granulosum","Stratum spinosum"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Melanosit terletak di stratum basal epidermis (basal layer), bersisian dengan keratinosit. Setiap melanosit melayani sekitar 36 keratinosit (epidermal melanin unit). Melanosit memiliki dendrit yang memanjang ke stratum spinosum untuk transfer melanin (pigment) ke keratinosit."},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-34","question":"Faktor risiko paling tinggi untuk melanoma kulit adalah...","options":["Fitzpatrick Skin Phototype I","Fitzpatrick Skin Phototype II","Fitzpatrick Skin Phototype III","Fitzpatrick Skin Phototype IV"],"correct":0,"explanation":"Fitzpatrick Skin Type I (very fair, always burns, never tans) memiliki risiko melanoma tertinggi. Type II juga berisiko tinggi. Risk ratio: Type I-II 2-3x higher than Type III-IV. Melanoma: #5 cancer terbanyak, #1 cause of skin cancer death. UV exposure = primary risk factor."}],"flashcards":[{"term":"Kista Brankial","arti":"Kelainan kongenital akibat kurang sempurnanya penutupan arkus brankialis.","penjelasan":"Kista brankial ke-2 paling sering (40-95%), anterior SCM. Terapi: eksisi bedah komplit."},{"term":"Higroma Kistik","arti":"Malformasi limfatik dengan dilatasi saluran limfa, transiluminasi positif.","penjelasan":"75-90% di serviks, terdeteksi USG usia 10 minggu. Terapi: ekstirpasi bedah. Asosiasi: Sindrom Turner."},{"term":"Tortikolis Kongenital","arti":"Pemendekan m. SCM akibat fibrosis pasca-trauma persalinan.","penjelasan":"Fisioterapi mulai bulan ke-2. Bedah jika >6 bulan gagal atau deviasi >15°."},{"term":"Schwannoma Vestibular","arti":"Tumor jinak sel schwann nervus vestibularis.","penjelasan":"Trias: dengar↓, tinitus, vertigo. Terapi: observasi (tumor kecil), eksisi (tumor besar/symptomatic)."},{"term":"Inverted Papilloma","arti":"Papilloma sinonasal dengan potensi malignansi 10-15%.","penjelasan":"Tipe: inverted (paling sering), exophytic, oncocytic. Terapi: wide excision karena potensi keganasan."},{"term":"Ceruminoma","arti":"Adenoma kelenjar seruminosa (kelenjar apokrin modifikasi di CAE).","penjelasan":"Tumor jinak, massa di CAE, bilateral layered myoepithelial cells. Eksisi bedah."}],"terms":[{"term":"Branchial Cleft Cyst","arti":"Kista kongenital akibat persistensi celah brankial embriologi.","penjelasan":"Congenital neck cyst"},{"term":"Cystic Hygroma","arti":"Higroma kistik: malformasi limfatik dengan kista berisi cairan bening.","penjelasan":"Lymphatic malformation cyst"},{"term":"Sternocleidomastoideus","arti":"Otot leher yang bila memendek menyebabkan tortikolis.","penjelasan":"Neck muscle involved in torticollis"},{"term":"Plagiocephaly","arti":"Kepala datar pada satu sisi akibat posisi berbaring terus-menerus.","penjelasan":"Flat head syndrome"},{"term":"Acoustic Neuroma","arti":"Schwannoma nervus vestibulokoklearis (VIII), tumor jinak telinga dalam.","penjelasan":"Vestibular schwannoma"},{"term":"Transiluminasi","arti":"Pemeriksaan cahaya menembus lesi untuk menunjukkan isi cairan.","penjelasan":"Light transmission test"}],"media":[{"mediaId":"media-slide-6-1","caption":"Kista brankial dan jalur traktus","placement":"card-brankial"},{"mediaId":"media-slide-6-2","caption":"Higroma kistik leher","placement":"card-higroma"},{"mediaId":"media-slide-6-3","caption":"Schwannoma vestibular MRI","placement":"card-schwannoma"}],"crosslinks":[{"label":"Tonsilitis","targetSlideId":"slide-7","reason":"KGB leher dan infeksi"},{"label":"Anatomi","targetSlideId":"slide-1","reason":"Dasar embriologi arkus brankial"}]},{"id":"slide-7","number":7,"title":"Faring, Tonsil & Laring","subtitle":"Faringitis, tonsilitis, laringitis akut/kronis, dan tumor laring","emoji":"🗣️","stats":[{"val":"70%","lbl":"Faringitis viral","emoji":"🦠"},{"val":"GABHS","lbl":"Tonsilitis bakteri","emoji":"🧫"},{"val":"Stridor","lbl":"Red flag laringitis","emoji":"⚠️"}],"actions":[{"icon":"🚨","label":"Red Flags","sub":"Emergency airway","target":"slide","targetIndex":6},{"icon":"❓","label":"Quiz","sub":"Faring + tonsil + laring","target":"quiz","targetIndex":6}],"cards":[{"id":"slide-7-card-1","title":"Faringitis Akut & Kronis","badge":"HIGH-YIELD","body":"**Faringitis akut**: peradangan mukosa faring, paling sering akibat infeksi. **Viral (70%)**: rhinovirus, coronavirus, adenovirus, influenza, EBV, CMV, HSV. Gejala: malaise, demam, batuk, rinore. Terapi: simptomatik. **Bakteri**: GABHS (Streptococcus pyogenes), Staphylococcus, Corynebacterium diphteriae, Bordetella pertussis, Neisseria gonorrhoeae. **GABHS**: umur 5-15 th, demam, eksudat faring, KGB servikal, tanpa batuk/rhinore. Terapi: penisilin/amoksisilin 10 hari, eritromisin bila alergi. **Difteri**: pseudomembran abu-abu tebal yang menempel kuat, toksin → miokarditis, neuropati. Terapi: antitoksin + penisilin. **Jamur**: Candida (HIV, imunosupresi), nystatin/fluconazole.","variant":"warning","items":["Centor criteria: demam, tonsilar eksudat, KGB tender anterior, tanpa batuk → skoring GABHS","Komplikasi GABHS: demam rematik, glomerulonefritis, abses peritonsil","Difteri: emergency, membran abu-abu tebal, antitoksin harus segera diberikan"],"number":1,"content":"<p><strong>Faringitis akut</strong>: peradangan mukosa faring, paling sering akibat infeksi. <strong>Viral (70%)</strong>: rhinovirus, coronavirus, adenovirus, influenza, EBV, CMV, HSV. Gejala: malaise, demam, batuk, rinore. Terapi: simptomatik. <strong>Bakteri</strong>: GABHS (Streptococcus pyogenes), Staphylococcus, Corynebacterium diphteriae, Bordetella pertussis, Neisseria gonorrhoeae. <strong>GABHS</strong>: umur 5-15 th, demam, eksudat faring, KGB servikal, tanpa batuk/rhinore. Terapi: penisilin/amoksisilin 10 hari, eritromisin bila alergi. <strong>Difteri</strong>: pseudomembran abu-abu tebal yang menempel kuat, toksin → miokarditis, neuropati. Terapi: antitoksin + penisilin. <strong>Jamur</strong>: Candida (HIV, imunosupresi), nystatin/fluconazole.</p><ul><li>Centor criteria: demam, tonsilar eksudat, KGB tender anterior, tanpa batuk → skoring GABHS</li><li>Komplikasi GABHS: demam rematik, glomerulonefritis, abses peritonsil</li><li>Difteri: emergency, membran abu-abu tebal, antitoksin harus segera diberikan</li></ul><figure class=\"codex-media-card\"><img src=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Croup_steeple_sign.jpg\" alt=\"Radiografi AP leher anak yang menunjukkan steeple sign - penyempitan subglottis berbentuk menara gereja yang khas pada laringotrakeobronkitis (croup)\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" onerror=\"this.closest('figure').classList.add('image-load-failed')\"/><figcaption>Steeple sign pada croup vs Thumb sign epiglotitis<br><span>Frank Gaillard / Doc James (Wikimedia Commons) · CC BY-SA 3.0</span></figcaption></figure>","terms":[{"term":"Hoarseness","arti":"Suara serak akibat gangguan getaran pita suara.","penjelasan":"Voice roughness"},{"term":"Stridor","arti":"Suara napas keras akibat obstruksi jalan napas bagian atas.","penjelasan":"Noisy breathing"},{"term":"Trismus","arti":"Keterbatasan pembukaan mulut akibat spasme m. masseter/pterygoideus.","penjelasan":"Jaw lock/difficulty opening mouth"},{"term":"Hot Potato Voice","arti":"Suara seperti memegang kentang panas dalam mulut, khas abses peritonsil.","penjelasan":"Muffled voice from peritonsillar abscess"}]},{"id":"slide-7-card-2","title":"Tonsilitis & Abses Peritonsil","badge":"URGENT","body":"**Tonsilitis akut**: nyeri tenggorok, demam, tonsil hiperemis + eksudat, KGB servikal tender. Penyebab: GABHS (paling sering), virus. **Tonsilitis kronis**: episode berulang >3-5x/tahun, bau mulut, detritus kripta. Terapi: tonsilektomi bila indikasi. **Abses peritonsil (Quincy)**: koleksi pus tonsil, umum usia 20-40. Gejala: nyeri faring unilateral, trismus, drooling, hot potato voice, deviasi uvula. Terapi: aspirasi jarum/insisi drainase + antibiotik (ampisilin-sulbaktam). **Tonsilektomi**: indikasi obstruksi (OSAS), infeksi rekuren >7x/1th atau >5x/2th, abses, neoplasia.","variant":"danger","items":["Indikasi tonsilektomi: obstruksi, rekuren >7x/1th atau >5x/2th, abses, neoplasia","Abses peritonsil: trismus + uvula deviasi ke sisi sehat = diagnosis klinis","Komplikasi tonsilektomi: perdarahan (hari 0-7), infeksi, nyeri, trauma sekitar"],"number":2,"content":"<p><strong>Tonsilitis akut</strong>: nyeri tenggorok, demam, tonsil hiperemis + eksudat, KGB servikal tender. Penyebab: GABHS (paling sering), virus. <strong>Tonsilitis kronis</strong>: episode berulang &gt;3-5x/tahun, bau mulut, detritus kripta. Terapi: tonsilektomi bila indikasi. <strong>Abses peritonsil (Quincy)</strong>: koleksi pus tonsil, umum usia 20-40. Gejala: nyeri faring unilateral, trismus, drooling, hot potato voice, deviasi uvula. Terapi: aspirasi jarum/insisi drainase + antibiotik (ampisilin-sulbaktam). <strong>Tonsilektomi</strong>: indikasi obstruksi (OSAS), infeksi rekuren &gt;7x/1th atau &gt;5x/2th, abses, neoplasia.</p><ul><li>Indikasi tonsilektomi: obstruksi, rekuren &gt;7x/1th atau &gt;5x/2th, abses, neoplasia</li><li>Abses peritonsil: trismus + uvula deviasi ke sisi sehat = diagnosis klinis</li><li>Komplikasi tonsilektomi: perdarahan (hari 0-7), infeksi, nyeri, trauma sekitar</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Hoarseness","arti":"Suara serak akibat gangguan getaran pita suara.","penjelasan":"Voice roughness"},{"term":"Stridor","arti":"Suara napas keras akibat obstruksi jalan napas bagian atas.","penjelasan":"Noisy breathing"},{"term":"Trismus","arti":"Keterbatasan pembukaan mulut akibat spasme m. masseter/pterygoideus.","penjelasan":"Jaw lock/difficulty opening mouth"},{"term":"Hot Potato Voice","arti":"Suara seperti memegang kentang panas dalam mulut, khas abses peritonsil.","penjelasan":"Muffled voice from peritonsillar abscess"}]},{"id":"slide-7-card-3","title":"Laringitis Akut & Subglottis","badge":"URGENT","body":"**Laringitis akut**: peradangan laring, sering pada anak (stridor, suara serak). Etiologi: viral (parainfluenza, influenza), bakteri (H. influenzae type B, S. aureus, Strep). **Laringotrakeitis/Croup**: usia 6 bulan-3 tahun, stridor inspirasi, batuk seal. Terapi: humidifikasi, steroid nebul (deksametason, budesonide), epinefrin nebul bila berat. **Epiglotitis/supraglotitis**: H. influenzae type B, onset mendadak, demam tinggi, stridor, drooling, sikap tripod. Emergency: JANGAN intubasi/blind procedure tanpa preparation. Terapi: intubasi/surgical airway + seftriakson. **Laringitis spasmodis**: batuk paroksismal malam, afebrile, usia 1-3 tahun, self-limited.","variant":"danger","items":["Croup: stridor + batuk seal + sikap tripod; rontgen: steeple sign (penyempitan subglotis)","Epiglotitis: cherry-red epiglotis, JANGAN memeriksa orofaring tanpa siap airway","Indikasi rawat inap croup: stridor istirahat, sianosis, distress pernapasan"],"number":3,"content":"<p><strong>Laringitis akut</strong>: peradangan laring, sering pada anak (stridor, suara serak). Etiologi: viral (parainfluenza, influenza), bakteri (H. influenzae type B, S. aureus, Strep). <strong>Laringotrakeitis/Croup</strong>: usia 6 bulan-3 tahun, stridor inspirasi, batuk seal. Terapi: humidifikasi, steroid nebul (deksametason, budesonide), epinefrin nebul bila berat. <strong>Epiglotitis/supraglotitis</strong>: H. influenzae type B, onset mendadak, demam tinggi, stridor, drooling, sikap tripod. Emergency: JANGAN intubasi/blind procedure tanpa preparation. Terapi: intubasi/surgical airway + seftriakson. <strong>Laringitis spasmodis</strong>: batuk paroksismal malam, afebrile, usia 1-3 tahun, self-limited.</p><ul><li>Croup: stridor + batuk seal + sikap tripod; rontgen: steeple sign (penyempitan subglotis)</li><li>Epiglotitis: cherry-red epiglotis, JANGAN memeriksa orofaring tanpa siap airway</li><li>Indikasi rawat inap croup: stridor istirahat, sianosis, distress pernapasan</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Hoarseness","arti":"Suara serak akibat gangguan getaran pita suara.","penjelasan":"Voice roughness"},{"term":"Stridor","arti":"Suara napas keras akibat obstruksi jalan napas bagian atas.","penjelasan":"Noisy breathing"},{"term":"Trismus","arti":"Keterbatasan pembukaan mulut akibat spasme m. masseter/pterygoideus.","penjelasan":"Jaw lock/difficulty opening mouth"},{"term":"Hot Potato Voice","arti":"Suara seperti memegang kentang panas dalam mulut, khas abses peritonsil.","penjelasan":"Muffled voice from peritonsillar abscess"}]},{"id":"slide-7-card-4","title":"Laringitis Kronis & Tumur Laring","badge":"HIGH-YIELD","body":"**Laringitis kronis**: hoarseness >3 minggu. Penyebab: GERD, merokok, alkohol, voice abuse, post-nasal drip. Terapi: modifikasi suara, PPI untuk LPR, stop merokok. **Red flag**: hoarseness >3 minggu + merokok/alkohol → laringoskopi untuk menyingkirkan karsinoma. **Karsinoma laring**: 90% KSS, terutama glottis (suara serak dini karena jarak simpit). **Klasifikasi**: supraglottis (35%, KGB awal, prognosis lebih buruk), glottis (60%, prognosis terbaik), subglottis (5%). Diagnosis: laringoskopi + biopsi. Terapi: radiasi (stadium awal), laringektomi (lanjut), kemoradiasi.","variant":"danger","items":["Hoarseness >3 minggu + faktor risiko (merokok/alkohol) = indikasi laringoskopi","KSS glottis: gejala dini (suara serak) karena area sempit, prognosis lebih baik","Rintis LPR (laryngopharyngeal reflux): salah satu penyebab laringitis kronis paling sering"],"number":4,"content":"<p><strong>Laringitis kronis</strong>: hoarseness &gt;3 minggu. Penyebab: GERD, merokok, alkohol, voice abuse, post-nasal drip. Terapi: modifikasi suara, PPI untuk LPR, stop merokok. <strong>Red flag</strong>: hoarseness &gt;3 minggu + merokok/alkohol → laringoskopi untuk menyingkirkan karsinoma. <strong>Karsinoma laring</strong>: 90% KSS, terutama glottis (suara serak dini karena jarak simpit). <strong>Klasifikasi</strong>: supraglottis (35%, KGB awal, prognosis lebih buruk), glottis (60%, prognosis terbaik), subglottis (5%). Diagnosis: laringoskopi + biopsi. Terapi: radiasi (stadium awal), laringektomi (lanjut), kemoradiasi.</p><ul><li>Hoarseness &gt;3 minggu + faktor risiko (merokok/alkohol) = indikasi laringoskopi</li><li>KSS glottis: gejala dini (suara serak) karena area sempit, prognosis lebih baik</li><li>Rintis LPR (laryngopharyngeal reflux): salah satu penyebab laringitis kronis paling sering</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Hoarseness","arti":"Suara serak akibat gangguan getaran pita suara.","penjelasan":"Voice roughness"},{"term":"Stridor","arti":"Suara napas keras akibat obstruksi jalan napas bagian atas.","penjelasan":"Noisy breathing"},{"term":"Trismus","arti":"Keterbatasan pembukaan mulut akibat spasme m. masseter/pterygoideus.","penjelasan":"Jaw lock/difficulty opening mouth"},{"term":"Hot Potato Voice","arti":"Suara seperti memegang kentang panas dalam mulut, khas abses peritonsil.","penjelasan":"Muffled voice from peritonsillar abscess"}]}],"tables":[{"id":"slide-7-table-1","title":"Croup vs Epiglotitis","headers":["Ciri","Croup (Laringotrakeitis)","Epiglotitis (Supraglotitis)"],"rows":[["Usia","6 bulan-3 tahun","2-7 tahun"],["Onset","Gradual (hari)","Mendadak (jam)"],["Demam","Rendah","Tinggi (>39°C)"],["Batuk","Batuk seal (barking)","Tidak"],["Stridor","Inspirasi + ekspirasi","Inspirasi"],["Postur","Tidak penting","Sikap tripod, drooling"],["Suara","Serak","Muffled/hot potato"],["Rontgen","Steeple sign","Thumb sign"],["Etiologi","Virus (parainfluenza)","H. influenzae type B"],["Terapi","Steroid nebul, humidifikasi","Intubasi + antibiotik"]]}],"quizzes":[{"id":"slide-7-quiz-1","question":"Penyebab paling sering faringitis akut adalah?","options":["Bakteri GABHS","Virus (~70%)","Jamur Candida","Mycobacterium tuberculosis"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Sekitar 70% faringitis akut disebabkan oleh virus (rhinovirus, adenovirus, influenza). GABHS menyebabkan ~15-30% faringitis akut pada anak dan <10% pada dewasa."},{"id":"slide-7-quiz-2","question":"Terapi pilihan pertama abses peritonsil adalah?","options":["Tonsilektomi emergency","Aspirasi jarum/insisi drainase + antibiotik","Antibiotik oral saja","Kompres hangat"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Abses peritonsil diterapi dengan aspirasi jarum atau insisi drainase + antibiotik IV (ampisilin-sulbaktam). Tonsilektomi interval dapat dipertimbangkan setelah abses kontrol."},{"id":"slide-7-quiz-3","question":"Emergency pada epiglotitis yang PALING penting adalah?","options":["Pemberian antibiotik oral","Jaminan jalan napas (intubasi/trakeostomi)","Pemberian analgetik","Pemeriksaan rontgen dada"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Epiglotitis adalah emergency airway. Prioritas utama adalah jaminan jalan napas dengan intubasi atau trakeostomi sebelum edema total menyebabkan obstruksi. Antibiotik diberikan setelah airway aman."},{"id":"slide-7-quiz-4","question":"Lokasi karsinoma laring dengan prognosis terbaik adalah?","options":["Supraglottis","Glottis","Subglottis","Vestibular fold"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Karsinoma glottis memiliki prognosis terbaik karena gejala dini (suara serak) muncul lebih awal akibat area sempit glottis. Supraglottis memiliki drainase limfatik kaya sehingga metastasis dini dan prognosis lebih buruk."}],"flashcards":[{"term":"Croup (Laringotrakeitis)","arti":"Inflamasi subglotis akibat virus dengan stridor dan batuk seal.","penjelasan":"Parainfluenza virus. Terapi: steroid nebul, humidifikasi, epinefrin. Rontgen: steeple sign."},{"term":"Epiglotitis","arti":"Inflamasi epiglotis akut akibat H. influenzae type B, emergency jalan napas.","penjelasan":"Onset mendadak, demam tinggi, stridor, drooling, sikap tripod. Cherry-red epiglotis. Intubasi emergency."},{"term":"Abses Peritonsil (Quincy)","arti":"Koleksi pus di ruang peritonsiler akibat infeksi tonsil.","penjelasan":"Gejala: nyeri unilateral, trismus, hot potato voice, uvula deviasi. Terapi: aspirasi/drainase + antibiotik."},{"term":"Centor Criteria","arti":"Kriteria skoring untuk menilai kemungkinan faringitis GABHS.","penjelasan":"Fever, tonsillar exudate, tender anterior cervical adenopathy, absence of cough. Skor ≥3 indikasi antibiotik."},{"term":"Laryngopharyngeal Reflux (LPR)","arti":"Refluks asam lambung ke laring yang menyebabkan laringitis kronis.","penjelasan":"Gejala: hoarseness, globus sensation, throat clearing. Terapi: PPI 2x sehari + modifikasi gaya hidup."},{"term":"Steeple Sign","arti":"Tanda radiologi penyempitan subglotis pada AP neck x-ray croup.","penjelasan":"Bentuk seperti menara gereja (steeple) pada rontgen leher AP akibat edema subglotis. Berbeda dengan thumb sign epiglotitis."}],"terms":[{"term":"Hoarseness","arti":"Suara serak akibat gangguan getaran pita suara.","penjelasan":"Voice roughness"},{"term":"Stridor","arti":"Suara napas keras akibat obstruksi jalan napas bagian atas.","penjelasan":"Noisy breathing"},{"term":"Trismus","arti":"Keterbatasan pembukaan mulut akibat spasme m. masseter/pterygoideus.","penjelasan":"Jaw lock/difficulty opening mouth"},{"term":"Hot Potato Voice","arti":"Suara seperti memegang kentang panas dalam mulut, khas abses peritonsil.","penjelasan":"Muffled voice from peritonsillar abscess"},{"term":"Drooling","arti":"Air liur berlebih yang keluar dari mulut akibat kesulitan menelan.","penjelasan":"Excess saliva from difficulty swallowing"},{"term":"Cherry-Red Epiglotis","arti":"Epiglotis yang memerah dan membengkak pada epiglotitis.","penjelasan":"Red swollen epiglottis"},{"term":"Thumb Sign","arti":"Tanda radiologi epiglotis membengkak seperti ibu jari pada lateral neck x-ray.","penjelasan":"Swollen epiglottis on x-ray"},{"term":"Tonsilektomi","arti":"Pembedahan pengangkatan tonsil palatina.","penjelasan":"Tonsil removal surgery"}],"media":[{"mediaId":"media-slide-7-1","caption":"Steeple sign pada croup vs Thumb sign epiglotitis","placement":"card-croup-epiglotitis"},{"mediaId":"media-slide-7-2","caption":"Abses peritonsil dan deviasi uvula","placement":"card-abses"},{"mediaId":"media-slide-7-3","caption":"Laringoskopi karsinoma glottis","placement":"card-karsinoma"}],"crosslinks":[{"label":"Tumor Kepala Leher","targetSlideId":"slide-6","reason":"Tumor laring dan tonsil"},{"label":"Karsinoma Nasofaring","targetSlideId":"slide-8","reason":"Tumor maligna THT-KL lain"},{"label":"Anatomi","targetSlideId":"slide-1","reason":"Review anatomi laring"}]},{"id":"slide-8","number":8,"title":"KNF, Rinitis & Radiologi THT","subtitle":"Karsinoma nasofaring, rinitis, deviasi septum, dan pemeriksaan radiologi","emoji":"🩻","stats":[{"val":"60%","lbl":"KNF dari maligna THT-KL","emoji":"📊"},{"val":"EBV","lbl":"Etiologi KNF","emoji":"🧬"},{"val":"CT/MRI","lbl":"Imaging pilihan","emoji":"🩻"}],"actions":[{"icon":"🩻","label":"Radiologi","sub":"CT/MRI THT-KL","target":"slide","targetIndex":7},{"icon":"❓","label":"Quiz","sub":"KNF + rinitis","target":"quiz","targetIndex":7}],"cards":[{"id":"slide-8-card-1","title":"Karsinoma Nasofaring (KNF)","badge":"HIGH-YIELD","body":"Tumor ganas epitel nasofaring, 60% dari seluruh keganasan THT-KL. **Epidemiologi**: Asia Tenggara (endemis), usia 30-60, M:F=3:1. **Etiologi**: EBV (gen LMP-1, EA-IgA positif), konsumsi ikan asin, merokok, genetic predisposition. **WHO klasifikasi**: tipe 1=KSS berkeratin (25%), tipe 2=KSS non-berkeratin (12%), tipe 3=undifferentiated (63%, paling sering endemis). **Gejala**: unilateral otitis media with effusion, epistaksis, KGB leher (60-85% → level II/V retrofaring), hidung tersumbat, diplopia (CN III-VI), headache. **Diagnosis**: nasofaringoskopi + biopsi, EBV serologi, CT/MRI, PET-CT untuk staging. **Staging**: AJCC TNM. **Terapi**: radioterapi (T1-T2N0), kemoradiasi cisplatin-based (T3-T4, N+), kemoterapi adjuvan.","variant":"danger","items":["KNF tipe 3 undifferentiated: paling sering di Indonesia, sangat radiosensitif","KGB leher unilateral + OME unilateral pada dewasa → curiga KNF → biopsi","Survival 5 tahun: stadium I 76.9%, II 56%, III 38.4%, IV 16.4%"],"number":1,"content":"<p>Tumor ganas epitel nasofaring, 60% dari seluruh keganasan THT-KL. <strong>Epidemiologi</strong>: Asia Tenggara (endemis), usia 30-60, M:F=3:1. <strong>Etiologi</strong>: EBV (gen LMP-1, EA-IgA positif), konsumsi ikan asin, merokok, genetic predisposition. <strong>WHO klasifikasi</strong>: tipe 1=KSS berkeratin (25%), tipe 2=KSS non-berkeratin (12%), tipe 3=undifferentiated (63%, paling sering endemis). <strong>Gejala</strong>: unilateral otitis media with effusion, epistaksis, KGB leher (60-85% → level II/V retrofaring), hidung tersumbat, diplopia (CN III-VI), headache. <strong>Diagnosis</strong>: nasofaringoskopi + biopsi, EBV serologi, CT/MRI, PET-CT untuk staging. <strong>Staging</strong>: AJCC TNM. <strong>Terapi</strong>: radioterapi (T1-T2N0), kemoradiasi cisplatin-based (T3-T4, N+), kemoterapi adjuvan.</p><ul><li>KNF tipe 3 undifferentiated: paling sering di Indonesia, sangat radiosensitif</li><li>KGB leher unilateral + OME unilateral pada dewasa → curiga KNF → biopsi</li><li>Survival 5 tahun: stadium I 76.9%, II 56%, III 38.4%, IV 16.4%</li></ul><figure class=\"codex-media-card codex-media-source-card\"><div class=\"codex-source-preview\"><strong>Media sumber internet</strong><span>URL ini adalah halaman sumber, bukan file gambar langsung.</span></div><figcaption>MRI KNF dengan ekstensi intrakranial<br><span>Radiopaedia.org · CC BY-NC-SA 3.0</span><br><a href=\"https://radiopaedia.org/cases/nasopharyngeal-carcinoma-with-intracranial-extension\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Buka sumber gambar</a></figcaption></figure>","terms":[{"term":"Nasofaringoskopi","arti":"Pemeriksaan langsung nasofaring dengan endoskop untuk biopsi KNF.","penjelasan":"Endoscopic examination of nasopharynx"},{"term":"KNF Tipe Undifferentiated","arti":"Tipe KNF paling sering di Asia Tenggara, sangat radiosensitif.","penjelasan":"Most common NPC type in SE Asia"},{"term":"OME (Otitis Media with Effusion)","arti":"Efusi telinga tengah tanpa gejala akut, sering terkait disfungsi tuba Eustachius.","penjelasan":"Glue ear/middle ear effusion"},{"term":"Septoplasty","arti":"Pembedahan koreksi deviasi septum nasi.","penjelasan":"Septal deviation surgery"}]},{"id":"slide-8-card-2","title":"Rinitis Akut & Kronis","badge":"CORE","body":"**Rinitis akut**: peradangan mukosa hidung <4 minggu. Viral (common cold): rinore jernih → mukopurulen, bersin, hidung tersumbat, malaise. Terapi: simptomatik, saline irrigation, dekongestan <5 hari. **Rinitis kronis**: >12 minggu. **Non-alergi**: vasomotor (perubahan suhu, bau, emosi), medikamentosa (rebound dekongestan >3-5 hari), idiopatik, hormon, NARES. **Alergi**: IgE-mediated, rinore jernih, bersin berulang, gatal hidung/mata, riwayat atopi. Diagnosis: skin prick test, spesifik IgE serum. Terapi: avoid trigger, kortikosteroid nasal (fluticasone, mometasone 1x/hari), antihistamin H1 (cetirizine, loratadine), leukotriene antagonist, imunoterapi.","variant":"default","items":["Rinitis medikamentosa: rebound congestion dari dekongestan vasonstriktor >3-5 hari","Rinitis vasomotor: rhinore kronis tanpa gatal/bersin, dipicu perubahan suhu/emosi","Imunoterapi SCIT/SLIT: indikasi rinitis alergi moderat-sedang yang tidak terkontrol"],"number":2,"content":"<p><strong>Rinitis akut</strong>: peradangan mukosa hidung &lt;4 minggu. Viral (common cold): rinore jernih → mukopurulen, bersin, hidung tersumbat, malaise. Terapi: simptomatik, saline irrigation, dekongestan &lt;5 hari. <strong>Rinitis kronis</strong>: &gt;12 minggu. <strong>Non-alergi</strong>: vasomotor (perubahan suhu, bau, emosi), medikamentosa (rebound dekongestan &gt;3-5 hari), idiopatik, hormon, NARES. <strong>Alergi</strong>: IgE-mediated, rinore jernih, bersin berulang, gatal hidung/mata, riwayat atopi. Diagnosis: skin prick test, spesifik IgE serum. Terapi: avoid trigger, kortikosteroid nasal (fluticasone, mometasone 1x/hari), antihistamin H1 (cetirizine, loratadine), leukotriene antagonist, imunoterapi.</p><ul><li>Rinitis medikamentosa: rebound congestion dari dekongestan vasonstriktor &gt;3-5 hari</li><li>Rinitis vasomotor: rhinore kronis tanpa gatal/bersin, dipicu perubahan suhu/emosi</li><li>Imunoterapi SCIT/SLIT: indikasi rinitis alergi moderat-sedang yang tidak terkontrol</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Nasofaringoskopi","arti":"Pemeriksaan langsung nasofaring dengan endoskop untuk biopsi KNF.","penjelasan":"Endoscopic examination of nasopharynx"},{"term":"KNF Tipe Undifferentiated","arti":"Tipe KNF paling sering di Asia Tenggara, sangat radiosensitif.","penjelasan":"Most common NPC type in SE Asia"},{"term":"OME (Otitis Media with Effusion)","arti":"Efusi telinga tengah tanpa gejala akut, sering terkait disfungsi tuba Eustachius.","penjelasan":"Glue ear/middle ear effusion"},{"term":"Septoplasty","arti":"Pembedahan koreksi deviasi septum nasi.","penjelasan":"Septal deviation surgery"}]},{"id":"slide-8-card-3","title":"Septal Deviation & Komplikasi Rinitis","badge":"CLINICAL","body":"**Septal deviation**: kelainan posisi septum nasi menyimpang dari garis tengah. Bisa kongenital (facial growth asymmetry) atau trauma. Gejala: obstruksi nasal unilateral/bilateral, epistaksis (karena drying), headache (kontak point), rinosinusitis, OSA. **Diagnosis**: anterior rhinoscopy, nasal endoscopy, CT paranasal sinus. **Terapi**: septoplasty bila gagal konservatif (intranasal steroid, dekongetan). **Komplikasi rinitis**: rinosinusitis akut (ARS, 5-7% dari URI), otitis media (disfungsi tuba Eustachius), asma eksaserbasi, sleep disturbance, dental malocclusion (mouth breathing).","variant":"default","items":["Septum deviation >50% dari diameter nasal → indikasi septoplasty","Mouth breathing syndrome pada anak: adenoid facies, dental malocclusion, intellectual delay","CT sinus: gold standard untuk evaluasi anatomi sinus dan komplikasi"],"number":3,"content":"<p><strong>Septal deviation</strong>: kelainan posisi septum nasi menyimpang dari garis tengah. Bisa kongenital (facial growth asymmetry) atau trauma. Gejala: obstruksi nasal unilateral/bilateral, epistaksis (karena drying), headache (kontak point), rinosinusitis, OSA. <strong>Diagnosis</strong>: anterior rhinoscopy, nasal endoscopy, CT paranasal sinus. <strong>Terapi</strong>: septoplasty bila gagal konservatif (intranasal steroid, dekongetan). <strong>Komplikasi rinitis</strong>: rinosinusitis akut (ARS, 5-7% dari URI), otitis media (disfungsi tuba Eustachius), asma eksaserbasi, sleep disturbance, dental malocclusion (mouth breathing).</p><ul><li>Septum deviation &gt;50% dari diameter nasal → indikasi septoplasty</li><li>Mouth breathing syndrome pada anak: adenoid facies, dental malocclusion, intellectual delay</li><li>CT sinus: gold standard untuk evaluasi anatomi sinus dan komplikasi</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Nasofaringoskopi","arti":"Pemeriksaan langsung nasofaring dengan endoskop untuk biopsi KNF.","penjelasan":"Endoscopic examination of nasopharynx"},{"term":"KNF Tipe Undifferentiated","arti":"Tipe KNF paling sering di Asia Tenggara, sangat radiosensitif.","penjelasan":"Most common NPC type in SE Asia"},{"term":"OME (Otitis Media with Effusion)","arti":"Efusi telinga tengah tanpa gejala akut, sering terkait disfungsi tuba Eustachius.","penjelasan":"Glue ear/middle ear effusion"},{"term":"Septoplasty","arti":"Pembedahan koreksi deviasi septum nasi.","penjelasan":"Septal deviation surgery"}]},{"id":"slide-8-card-4","title":"Pemeriksaan Radiologi THT-KL","badge":"HIGH-YIELD","body":"**Foto Polos**: Water's view (sinus maksilaris, ostiomeatal complex), Caldwell (sinus frontalis, etmoid), lateral (adenoid, soft tissue neck), submentovertex. **CT Scan**: gold standard sinusitis kronis, trauma, tumor, temporal bone (kolesteatoma, cholesteatoma, mastoiditis, otosklerosis: widening cochlear aqueduct, lucency fissula ante fenestram). **MRI**: lesi jaringan lunak, tumor (perineural spread, intracranial extension), schwannoma (IAC/CPA), encephalocele/meningocele. **USG**: neck mass (thyroid, KGB, abses, cystic hygroma), bed-side. **Fungsional**: VNG, caloric test, rotary chair, VEMP, otoacoustic emission, BERA/ABR.","variant":"default","items":["CT temporal bone: kolesteatoma (soft tissue density mesotimpanum + erosi ossikel/scutum)","MRI dengan kontras: evaluasi tumor, perineural spread, intracranial extension","CT sinus: Lund-Mackay scoring untuk sinusitis kronis pra/pasca operasi"],"number":4,"content":"<p><strong>Foto Polos</strong>: Water&#x27;s view (sinus maksilaris, ostiomeatal complex), Caldwell (sinus frontalis, etmoid), lateral (adenoid, soft tissue neck), submentovertex. <strong>CT Scan</strong>: gold standard sinusitis kronis, trauma, tumor, temporal bone (kolesteatoma, cholesteatoma, mastoiditis, otosklerosis: widening cochlear aqueduct, lucency fissula ante fenestram). <strong>MRI</strong>: lesi jaringan lunak, tumor (perineural spread, intracranial extension), schwannoma (IAC/CPA), encephalocele/meningocele. <strong>USG</strong>: neck mass (thyroid, KGB, abses, cystic hygroma), bed-side. <strong>Fungsional</strong>: VNG, caloric test, rotary chair, VEMP, otoacoustic emission, BERA/ABR.</p><ul><li>CT temporal bone: kolesteatoma (soft tissue density mesotimpanum + erosi ossikel/scutum)</li><li>MRI dengan kontras: evaluasi tumor, perineural spread, intracranial extension</li><li>CT sinus: Lund-Mackay scoring untuk sinusitis kronis pra/pasca operasi</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Nasofaringoskopi","arti":"Pemeriksaan langsung nasofaring dengan endoskop untuk biopsi KNF.","penjelasan":"Endoscopic examination of nasopharynx"},{"term":"KNF Tipe Undifferentiated","arti":"Tipe KNF paling sering di Asia Tenggara, sangat radiosensitif.","penjelasan":"Most common NPC type in SE Asia"},{"term":"OME (Otitis Media with Effusion)","arti":"Efusi telinga tengah tanpa gejala akut, sering terkait disfungsi tuba Eustachius.","penjelasan":"Glue ear/middle ear effusion"},{"term":"Septoplasty","arti":"Pembedahan koreksi deviasi septum nasi.","penjelasan":"Septal deviation surgery"}]}],"tables":[{"id":"slide-8-table-1","title":"Rinitis Alergi vs Vasomotor","headers":["Ciri","Rinitis Alergi","Rinitis Vasomotor"],"rows":[["Mekanisme","IgE-mediated","Neurovaskular/autonomik"],["Gatal hidung","+++","+/-"],["Bersin","Berulang, banyak","Sedikit"],["Rinore","Jernih, banyak","Jernih, variabel"],["Pemicu","Alergen (debu, serbuk sari)","Suhu, bau, emosi"],["Skin prick test","Positif","Negatif"],["Eosinofil nasal","↑↑","Normal"],["Terapi utama","Kortikosteroid nasal + AH2","Kortikosteroid nasal + ipratropium"]]},{"id":"slide-8-table-2","title":"Stadium KNF (AJCC TNM)","headers":["Stadium","T","N","M","5-tahun OS"],"rows":[["I","T1 (terbatas nasofaring)","N0","M0","~76.9%"],["II","T2 (tumor parafaring/orofaring)","N0-1","M0","~56%"],["III","T3 (os struktur/kavum sinus)","N0-2","M0","~38.4%"],["IVA","T4 (intrakranial/CN/lain)","N0-2","M0","~16.4%"],["IVB","T1-4","N3","M0",""],["IVC","T1-4","N0-3","M1",""]]}],"quizzes":[{"id":"slide-8-quiz-1","question":"Faktor risiko utama karsinoma nasofaring di populasi Asia Tenggara adalah?","options":["HPV","EBV","HBV","HIV"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Epstein-Barr Virus (EBV) adalah faktor risiko utama KNF di Asia Tenggara. EBV gen LMP-1 dan serologi EA-IgA positif digunakan sebagai biomarker. HPV lebih terkait orofaring karsinoma."},{"id":"slide-8-quiz-2","question":"Gejala tersering KNF pada presentasi awal adalah?","options":["Epistaksis massif","KGB leher unilateral + OME unilateral","Diplopia","Anosmia"],"correct":1,"explanation":"60-85% pasien KNF presentasi dengan KGB leher (level II/V retrofaring), sering disertai OME unilateral pada dewasa. Epistaksis dan diplopia lebih jarang sebagai gejala awal."},{"id":"slide-8-quiz-3","question":"Terapi utama KNF stadium I-II adalah?","options":["Kemoterapi saja","Radioterapi","Surgery","Imunoterapi"],"correct":1,"explanation":"KNF adalah tumor yang sangat radiosensitif. Stadium I-II (T1-2N0) diterapi dengan radioterapi eksternal saja. Stadium lanjut (T3-4, N+) memerlukan kemoradiasi dengan cisplatin-based."},{"id":"slide-8-quiz-4","question":"Pemeriksaan gold standard untuk kolesteatoma dengan erosi tulang adalah?","options":["Foto polos mastoid","CT scan temporal bone","MRI kontras","USG"],"correct":1,"explanation":"CT scan temporal bone adalah gold standard untuk evaluasi kolesteatoma karena dapat menunjukkan erosi tulang (ossikel, lateral semisirkular canal, scutum) dengan resolusi tinggi. MRI digunakan untuk komplikasi intrakranial."},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-26","question":"Pemuda 24 tahun, perdarahan hidung, rasa asin tenggorokan, darah ke nasofaring-orofaring, hipertensi. Tatalaksana?","options":["Tampon posterior","Tampon anterior","Kepala ditengadahkan","Darah ditelan"],"correct":0,"explanation":"Epistaksis posterior: perdarahan dari plexus Woodruff/faring (posterior nasal cavity). Tanda: darah mengalir ke posterior faring (rasa asin, batuk, hematemesis), tidak terlihat dari anterior nares. Tampon anterior tidak efektif. Perlu tampon posterior (balloon catheter/posterior nasal packing) untuk menekan vessel bleeding."},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-13","question":"Pria 21 tahun, hidung penuh 2 bulan, masa polipoid licin transluksan bilateral, IgE tinggi, histologi: stroma edematous, eosinofil. Diagnosis?","options":["Polip nasi","Karsinoma sel skuamosa nasi","Rhinitis kronik","Rhinitis alergika"],"correct":0,"explanation":"Polip nasi adalah edema submukosa sinus paranasal yang berprotrusi ke rongga hidung. Klasik: bilateral, licin, transluksan, berisi eosinofil. Terkait: rinitis alergi, asma bronkial, aspirin sensitivity (triad Samter: asma + polip + aspirin). Histologi: stroma edematous, pseudostratified respiratory epithelium, eosinophilic infiltrate."}],"flashcards":[{"term":"Karsinoma Nasofaring (KNF)","arti":"Tumor ganas epitel nasofaring, 60% keganasan THT-KL, endemis Asia Tenggara.","penjelasan":"Etiologi: EBV, ikan asin, merokok. Tipe WHO: 1=KSS berkeratin, 2=non-berkeratin, 3=undifferentiated (paling sering). Terapi: radioterapi/kemoradiasi."},{"term":"EA-IgA (Early Antigen IgA)","arti":"Serologi EBV yang positif pada KNF, digunakan sebagai biomarker skrining.","penjelasan":"EA-IgA dan VCA-IgA positif menunjukkan asosiasi EBV dengan KNF. Digunakan untuk skrining populasi berisiko tinggi."},{"term":"Rinitis Vasomotor","arti":"Rinitis non-alergi akibat dysregulasi neurovaskular mukosa hidung.","penjelasan":"Gejala: rinore, hidung tersumbat, tanpa gatal/bersin. Dipicu suhu, bau, emosi. Terapi: kortikosteroid nasal + ipratropium nasal."},{"term":"Rinitis Medikamentosa","arti":"Kongesti hidung rebound akibat penggunaan dekongestan vasonstriktor >3-5 hari.","penjelasan":"Down-regulasi reseptor alpha-adrenergik → vasodilatasi rebound. Terapi: hentikan dekongestan, kortikosteroid nasal, antihistamin."},{"term":"CT Temporal Bone","arti":"CT scan tulang temporal untuk evaluasi telinga tengah-dalam.","penjelasan":"Indikasi: kolesteatoma, mastoiditis, otosklerosis, trauma, CHL tidak jelas. Gold standard untuk erosi tulang."},{"term":"Lund-Mackay Score","arti":"Sistem skoring CT sinus untuk sinusitis kronis.","penjelasan":"Menskor opasifikasi tiap sinus (0-2) dan ostiomeatal complex (0-2). Total 0-24. Digunakan untuk evaluasi pra/pasca operasi FESS."}],"terms":[{"term":"Nasofaringoskopi","arti":"Pemeriksaan langsung nasofaring dengan endoskop untuk biopsi KNF.","penjelasan":"Endoscopic examination of nasopharynx"},{"term":"KNF Tipe Undifferentiated","arti":"Tipe KNF paling sering di Asia Tenggara, sangat radiosensitif.","penjelasan":"Most common NPC type in SE Asia"},{"term":"OME (Otitis Media with Effusion)","arti":"Efusi telinga tengah tanpa gejala akut, sering terkait disfungsi tuba Eustachius.","penjelasan":"Glue ear/middle ear effusion"},{"term":"Septoplasty","arti":"Pembedahan koreksi deviasi septum nasi.","penjelasan":"Septal deviation surgery"},{"term":"FESS","arti":"Functional Endoscopic Sinus Surgery: pembedahan endoskopi sinus fungsional.","penjelasan":"Endoscopic sinus surgery"},{"term":"Kemoradiasi","arti":"Kombinasi kemoterapi dan radioterapi secara simultan.","penjelasan":"Concurrent chemoradiation"},{"term":"Ostiomeatal Complex","arti":"Area ventilasi dan drainase sinus maksilaris, frontalis, dan anterior etmoid.","penjelasan":"Sinus drainage pathway"},{"term":"VEMP","arti":"Vestibular Evoked Myogenic Potential: tes fungsi sakulus/utrikulus.","penjelasan":"Inner ear balance test"}],"media":[{"mediaId":"media-slide-8-1","caption":"MRI KNF dengan ekstensi intrakranial","placement":"card-knf"},{"mediaId":"media-slide-8-2","caption":"CT temporal bone kolesteatoma dengan erosi ossikel","placement":"card-ct-temporal"},{"mediaId":"media-slide-8-3","caption":"CT paranasal sinus dengan Lund-Mackay scoring","placement":"card-ct-sinus"}],"crosslinks":[{"label":"Tumor THT","targetSlideId":"slide-6","reason":"Lanjutan tumor kepala leher"},{"label":"Farmakologi","targetSlideId":"slide-5","reason":"Terapi KNF dan rinitis"},{"label":"Laring","targetSlideId":"slide-7","reason":"Tumor lain THT-KL"}]},{"id":"slide-9","number":9,"title":"Kelainan Refraksi","subtitle":"Refractive Errors: Myopia, Hyperopia, Astigmatisme & Presbiopia","emoji":"👓","stats":[{"val":"4","lbl":"Tipe Kelainan Refraksi","emoji":"📐"},{"val":"~40%","lbl":"Populasi dunia mengalami myopia","emoji":"🌍"},{"val":"42-44","lbl":"Usia rata-rata onset presbiopia (tahun)","emoji":"📅"}],"actions":[{"icon":"📖","label":"Flashcard","target":"flashcard","targetIndex":8},{"icon":"❓","label":"Kuis","target":"quiz","targetIndex":8},{"icon":"🎯","label":"Simulasi Ujian","target":"stress"}],"cards":[{"id":"slide-9-card-1","title":"Definisi & Konsep Dasar","badge":"HIGH-YIELD","body":"Kelainan refraksi terjadi ketika bentuk mata mencegah cahaya fokus dengan benar pada retina, menyebabkan penglihatan kabur. Terdapat 4 tipe utama: myopia (mata minus), hipermetropia (mata plus), astigmatisme, dan presbiopia. Penanganan utama meliputi kacamata, lensa kontak, atau bedah refraktif.","variant":"primary","items":["Myopia: fokus cahaya di depan retina → visus jauh kabur","Hipermetropia: fokus cahaya di belakang retina → visus dekat kabur","Astigmatisme: kelengkungan kornea tidak merata → visus kabur pada semua jarak","Presbiopia: kehilangan kemampuan akomodasi akibat penuaan"],"number":1,"content":"<p>Kelainan refraksi terjadi ketika bentuk mata mencegah cahaya fokus dengan benar pada retina, menyebabkan penglihatan kabur. Terdapat 4 tipe utama: myopia (mata minus), hipermetropia (mata plus), astigmatisme, dan presbiopia. Penanganan utama meliputi kacamata, lensa kontak, atau bedah refraktif.</p><ul><li>Myopia: fokus cahaya di depan retina → visus jauh kabur</li><li>Hipermetropia: fokus cahaya di belakang retina → visus dekat kabur</li><li>Astigmatisme: kelengkungan kornea tidak merata → visus kabur pada semua jarak</li><li>Presbiopia: kehilangan kemampuan akomodasi akibat penuaan</li></ul><figure class=\"codex-media-card\"><img src=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Misfocusing_Due_To_Hypermetropia_and_Myopia.svg\" alt=\"Diagram yang mengilustrasikan perbedaan fokus cahaya pada mata emetropi (normal), miopi (fokus di depan retina), dan hipermetropi (fokus di belakang retina)\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" onerror=\"this.closest('figure').classList.add('image-load-failed')\"/><figcaption>Diagram perbedaan fokus cahaya pada myopia vs hyperopia<br><span>Wikimedia Commons / Blausen Medical · CC BY-SA 3.0</span></figcaption></figure>","terms":[{"term":"Emmetropia","arti":"Kondisi normal mata tanpa kelainan refraksi; cahaya fokus tepat pada retina","penjelasan":"Mata normal tanpa minus atau plus"},{"term":"Akomodasi","arti":"Kemampuan lensa mata mengubah kekuatan refraksinya untuk fokus pada objek dekat","penjelasan":"Kemampuan mata menyesuaikan fokus dari jauh ke dekat"},{"term":"Ametropia","arti":"Kondisi mata dengan kelainan refraksi apa pun (myopia, hyperopia, astigmatisme)","penjelasan":"Mata yang memiliki kelainan refraksi"},{"term":"Spherical equivalent (SE)","arti":"Nilai refraksi yang dihitung dari sphere + 1/2 cylinder","penjelasan":"Nilai refraksi total yang digunakan untuk klasifikasi"}]},{"id":"slide-9-card-2","title":"Myopia (Mata Minus)","badge":"UTBK","body":"Myopia adalah kelainan refraksi di mana kekuatan optik mata terlalu kuat dibandingkan panjang aksial, menyebabkan fokus cahaya di depan retina. Klasifikasi: non-patologis (<6 D, biasa disebut school myopia) dan patologis (>6 D atau panjang aksial >26.5 mm dengan risiko degenerasi retina progresif).","variant":"info","items":["Faktor risiko: genetik (ortu myopia ↑ risiko), near work berlebihan, urbanisasi","Gejala: visus jauh kabur, mengedipkan mata, mendekatkan bacaan","Terapi: lensa konkaf (minus), lensa kontak, atau refractive surgery pada dewasa stabil","Komplikasi patologis: retinal tear, RD, myopic macular degeneration"],"number":2,"content":"<p>Myopia adalah kelainan refraksi di mana kekuatan optik mata terlalu kuat dibandingkan panjang aksial, menyebabkan fokus cahaya di depan retina. Klasifikasi: non-patologis (&lt;6 D, biasa disebut school myopia) dan patologis (&gt;6 D atau panjang aksial &gt;26.5 mm dengan risiko degenerasi retina progresif).</p><ul><li>Faktor risiko: genetik (ortu myopia ↑ risiko), near work berlebihan, urbanisasi</li><li>Gejala: visus jauh kabur, mengedipkan mata, mendekatkan bacaan</li><li>Terapi: lensa konkaf (minus), lensa kontak, atau refractive surgery pada dewasa stabil</li><li>Komplikasi patologis: retinal tear, RD, myopic macular degeneration</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Emmetropia","arti":"Kondisi normal mata tanpa kelainan refraksi; cahaya fokus tepat pada retina","penjelasan":"Mata normal tanpa minus atau plus"},{"term":"Akomodasi","arti":"Kemampuan lensa mata mengubah kekuatan refraksinya untuk fokus pada objek dekat","penjelasan":"Kemampuan mata menyesuaikan fokus dari jauh ke dekat"},{"term":"Ametropia","arti":"Kondisi mata dengan kelainan refraksi apa pun (myopia, hyperopia, astigmatisme)","penjelasan":"Mata yang memiliki kelainan refraksi"},{"term":"Spherical equivalent (SE)","arti":"Nilai refraksi yang dihitung dari sphere + 1/2 cylinder","penjelasan":"Nilai refraksi total yang digunakan untuk klasifikasi"}]},{"id":"slide-9-card-3","title":"Hipermetropia & Astigmatisme","badge":"KLINIS","body":"Hipermetropia (farsightedness): fokus cahaya posterior ke retina saat akomodasi relaks. Klasifikasi: simple, pathologic (trauma/penyakit), functional (paralysis of accommodation). Astigmatisme: kelengkungan kornea/lensa tidak simetris (egg-shaped), menyebabkan 2 gambar berbeda tumpang tindih.","variant":"accent","items":["Hipermetropia: terapi lensa konveks (plus), terutama bila simptomatik","Astigmatisme: terapi lensa silinder; dapat dikoreksi dengan LASIK/PRK","Hipermetropia dapat menyebabkan strabismus esotropia pada anak","Gold standard diagnosis: cycloplegic refraction (retinoscopy pada anak)"],"number":3,"content":"<p>Hipermetropia (farsightedness): fokus cahaya posterior ke retina saat akomodasi relaks. Klasifikasi: simple, pathologic (trauma/penyakit), functional (paralysis of accommodation). Astigmatisme: kelengkungan kornea/lensa tidak simetris (egg-shaped), menyebabkan 2 gambar berbeda tumpang tindih.</p><ul><li>Hipermetropia: terapi lensa konveks (plus), terutama bila simptomatik</li><li>Astigmatisme: terapi lensa silinder; dapat dikoreksi dengan LASIK/PRK</li><li>Hipermetropia dapat menyebabkan strabismus esotropia pada anak</li><li>Gold standard diagnosis: cycloplegic refraction (retinoscopy pada anak)</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Emmetropia","arti":"Kondisi normal mata tanpa kelainan refraksi; cahaya fokus tepat pada retina","penjelasan":"Mata normal tanpa minus atau plus"},{"term":"Akomodasi","arti":"Kemampuan lensa mata mengubah kekuatan refraksinya untuk fokus pada objek dekat","penjelasan":"Kemampuan mata menyesuaikan fokus dari jauh ke dekat"},{"term":"Ametropia","arti":"Kondisi mata dengan kelainan refraksi apa pun (myopia, hyperopia, astigmatisme)","penjelasan":"Mata yang memiliki kelainan refraksi"},{"term":"Spherical equivalent (SE)","arti":"Nilai refraksi yang dihitung dari sphere + 1/2 cylinder","penjelasan":"Nilai refraksi total yang digunakan untuk klasifikasi"}]},{"id":"slide-9-card-4","title":"Presbiopia","badge":"WAJIB-TAHU","body":"Presbiopia adalah kehilangan kemampuan akomodasi lensa akibat penuaan, onset rata-rata 42-44 tahun, kehilangan total akomodasi umumnya 50-55 tahun. Teori Helmholtz: kontraksi otot siliar ↓→ tension zonular ↓→ lensa membulat. Teori lenticular: sklerosis nukleus, ↓elastisitas kapsul lensa.","variant":"warning","items":["Tidak ada pencegahan primer","Terapi: kacamata baca, bifokal, progressive lenses, atau lensa kontak monovision","Bedah: LASIK monovision, conductive keratoplasty, atau intraocular lenses"],"number":4,"content":"<p>Presbiopia adalah kehilangan kemampuan akomodasi lensa akibat penuaan, onset rata-rata 42-44 tahun, kehilangan total akomodasi umumnya 50-55 tahun. Teori Helmholtz: kontraksi otot siliar ↓→ tension zonular ↓→ lensa membulat. Teori lenticular: sklerosis nukleus, ↓elastisitas kapsul lensa.</p><ul><li>Tidak ada pencegahan primer</li><li>Terapi: kacamata baca, bifokal, progressive lenses, atau lensa kontak monovision</li><li>Bedah: LASIK monovision, conductive keratoplasty, atau intraocular lenses</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Emmetropia","arti":"Kondisi normal mata tanpa kelainan refraksi; cahaya fokus tepat pada retina","penjelasan":"Mata normal tanpa minus atau plus"},{"term":"Akomodasi","arti":"Kemampuan lensa mata mengubah kekuatan refraksinya untuk fokus pada objek dekat","penjelasan":"Kemampuan mata menyesuaikan fokus dari jauh ke dekat"},{"term":"Ametropia","arti":"Kondisi mata dengan kelainan refraksi apa pun (myopia, hyperopia, astigmatisme)","penjelasan":"Mata yang memiliki kelainan refraksi"},{"term":"Spherical equivalent (SE)","arti":"Nilai refraksi yang dihitung dari sphere + 1/2 cylinder","penjelasan":"Nilai refraksi total yang digunakan untuk klasifikasi"}]}],"tables":[{"id":"slide-9-table-1","title":"Perbandingan 4 Kelainan Refraksi","headers":["Parameter","Myopia","Hipermetropia","Astigmatisme","Presbiopia"],"rows":[["Fokus cahaya","Di depan retina","Di belakang retina","Tidak tunggal","Tidak bisa akomodasi"],["Visus jauh","Kabur","Normal/buruk","Kabur","Normal"],["Visus dekat","Normal","Kabur","Kabur","Kabur"],["Lensa koreksi","Konkaf (-)","Konveks (+)","Silinder","Konveks (+)"],["Onset","Anak/remaja","Kongenital/dini","Kongenital/trauma",">40 tahun"],["Faktor risiko","Genetik, near work","Genetik, microphthalmia","Kornea tidak simetris","Penuaan"]]}],"quizzes":[{"id":"slide-9-quiz-1","question":"Pasien wanita 25 tahun mengeluh visus jauh kabur sejak SMA. Pemeriksaan: spherical equivalent -4.50 D. Diagnosis yang paling tepat?","options":["Hipermetropia","Myopia non-patologis","Myopia patologis","Astigmatisme"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Myopia non-patologis (physiologic/simple myopia) didefinisikan sebagai myopia <6.00 D. Pasien 25 tahun dengan SE -4.50 D termasuk myopia non-patologis. Myopia patologis didefinisikan sebagai SE >6.00 D atau axial length >26.5 mm."},{"id":"slide-9-quiz-2","question":"Laki-laki 45 tahun mengeluh kesulitan membaca koran sejak 6 bulan terakhir. Visus jauh 6/6. Pemeriksaan refraksi dekat memerlukan tambahan +2.00 D. Diagnosis?","options":["Myopia","Hipermetropia","Presbiopia","Astigmatisme"],"correct":2,"explanation":"Presbiopia adalah kehilangan kemampuan akomodasi akibat penuaan, onset rata-rata 42-44 tahun. Ciri khas: visus jauh normal tapi kesulitan visus dekat (near vision). Terapi: kacamata baca (+2.00 D), bifokal, atau progressive lenses."},{"id":"slide-9-quiz-3","question":"Pasien 8 tahun dengan visus jauh kabur. Retinoscopy dengan cycloplegia menunjukkan +3.50 D. Anak sering mengalami sakit kepala saat membaca. Terapi awal?","options":["LASIK segera","Lensa konveks (+3.50 D) kacamata","Lensa kontak","Pilocarpine 2%"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Hipermetropia pada anak dengan gejala (asthenopia, headache) diterapi dengan kacamata lensa konveks. LASIK kontraindikasi pada anak (refractive error belum stabil). Lensa kontak biasanya tidak dianjurkan pada anak kecuali ada indikasi khusus. Pilocarpine digunakan untuk glaukoma, bukan hipermetropia."}],"flashcards":[{"term":"Myopia","arti":"Kelainan refraksi di mana fokus cahaya berada di depan retina akibat kekuatan optik terlalu kuat atau panjang aksial berlebihan","penjelasan":"Visus jauh kabur, terapi lensa konkaf. Disebut juga mata minus. Bisa non-patologis (<6D) atau patologis (>6D)."},{"term":"Hipermetropia","arti":"Kelainan refraksi di mana fokus cahaya berada di belakang retina saat akomodasi relaks","penjelasan":"Visus dekat kabur, terapi lensa konveks (+). Anak bisa mengkompensasi dengan akomodasi tetapi dapat menyebabkan asthenopia."},{"term":"Astigmatisme","arti":"Kelainan refraksi akibat kelengkungan kornea atau lensa tidak merata","penjelasan":"Visus kabur pada semua jarak karena 2 gambar berbeda terbentuk. Terapi: lensa silinder."},{"term":"Presbiopia","arti":"Kehilangan kemampuan akomodasi lensa akibat proses penuaan","penjelasan":"Onset 42-44 tahun. Disebabkan sklerosis nukleus lensa dan menurunnya elastisitas kapsul lensa. Tidak ada pencegahan primer."},{"term":"Cycloplegic refraction","arti":"Pemeriksaan refraksi dengan obat cycloplegic untuk mematihkan akomodasi","penjelasan":"Gold standard untuk diagnosis hipermetropia, terutama pada anak. Menggunakan cyclopentolate 1% atau atropine."},{"term":"Pathologic myopia","arti":"Myopia dengan SE >6.00 D atau axial length >26.5 mm yang progresif","penjelasan":"Risiko degenerasi retina, retinal tear, RD, dan myopic macular degeneration. Onset biasanya awal masa kanak-kanak."}],"terms":[{"term":"Emmetropia","arti":"Kondisi normal mata tanpa kelainan refraksi; cahaya fokus tepat pada retina","penjelasan":"Mata normal tanpa minus atau plus"},{"term":"Akomodasi","arti":"Kemampuan lensa mata mengubah kekuatan refraksinya untuk fokus pada objek dekat","penjelasan":"Kemampuan mata menyesuaikan fokus dari jauh ke dekat"},{"term":"Ametropia","arti":"Kondisi mata dengan kelainan refraksi apa pun (myopia, hyperopia, astigmatisme)","penjelasan":"Mata yang memiliki kelainan refraksi"},{"term":"Spherical equivalent (SE)","arti":"Nilai refraksi yang dihitung dari sphere + 1/2 cylinder","penjelasan":"Nilai refraksi total yang digunakan untuk klasifikasi"},{"term":"Axial length","arti":"Panjang sumbu mata dari kornea ke retina, normal 22-24 mm","penjelasan":"Panjang bola mata dari depan ke belakang"},{"term":"Refractive surgery","arti":"Bedah untuk mengoreksi kelainan refraksi (LASIK, PRK, SMILE)","penjelasan":"Operasi mata untuk menghilangkan kacamata"},{"term":"Pseudophakia","arti":"Kondisi setelah katarak ekstraksi dengan implantasi IOL","penjelasan":"Mata yang sudah dipasang lensa buatan"},{"term":"Aphakia","arti":"Kondisi tanpa lensa setelah ekstraksi katarak tanpa IOL","penjelasan":"Mata tanpa lensa alami maupun buatan"},{"term":"Anisometropia","arti":"Perbedaan refraksi signifikan antara kedua mata (>1.00 D)","penjelasan":"Kedua mata memiliki minus/plus yang berbeda jauh"},{"term":"Astenopia","arti":"Kelelahan mata akibat penggunaan akomodasi berlebihan","penjelasan":"Mata lelah karena terlalu banyak fokus"}],"media":[{"mediaId":"media-slide-9-1","caption":"Diagram perbedaan fokus cahaya pada myopia vs hyperopia","placement":"card-body"},{"mediaId":"media-slide-9-2","caption":"Ilustrasi astigmatisme dengan kelengkungan kornea tidak simetris","placement":"card-body"}],"crosslinks":[{"label":"Katarak → Refraksi dapat berubah","targetSlideId":"slide-13","reason":"Katarak dapat menyebabkan perubahan refraksi (indeks refraksi lensa berubah)"},{"label":"Retinal Detachment → Komplikasi myopia patologis","targetSlideId":"slide-14","reason":"Myopia patologis >6D berisiko retinal detachment"}]},{"id":"slide-10","number":10,"title":"Kelainan Adneksa & Permukaan Ocular","subtitle":"Palpebra, Pterigium, Hordeolum, Trikhiasis & Kelainan Lain","emoji":"👁️","stats":[{"val":"6","lbl":"Topik utama adneksa","emoji":"🔧"},{"val":"70%","lbl":"Trauma periokuler mengenai kelopak mata","emoji":"⚠️"},{"val":"S. aureus","lbl":"Kuman penyebab utama hordeolum","emoji":"🦠"}],"actions":[{"icon":"📖","label":"Flashcard","target":"flashcard","targetIndex":9},{"icon":"❓","label":"Kuis","target":"quiz","targetIndex":9},{"icon":"🩺","label":"Kasus Klinis","target":"slide","targetIndex":9}],"cards":[{"id":"slide-10-card-1","title":"Adneksa Mata: Anatomi & Fungsi","badge":"ANATOMI","body":"Adneksa mata terdiri dari struktur penunjang mata: palpebra (kelopak mata) untuk melindungi dan menjaga kelembaban, sistem lakrimal (kelenjar air mata + drainase), rongga orbita, dan otot ekstraokuler (4 rektus + 2 oblikus).","variant":"primary","items":["Palpebra: melindungi mata, melicinkan, menjaga kelembaban (berkedip)","Sistem lakrimal: kelenjar penghasil air mata + sistem drainase","Otot ekstraokuler: m. rektus superior, inferior, medialis, lateralis; m. oblikus superior & inferior","Kelainan adneksa: lacerasi, ektropion, entropion, distikhiasis, hordeolum, kalazion, trikhiasis, blefaritis, pterigium"],"number":1,"content":"<p>Adneksa mata terdiri dari struktur penunjang mata: palpebra (kelopak mata) untuk melindungi dan menjaga kelembaban, sistem lakrimal (kelenjar air mata + drainase), rongga orbita, dan otot ekstraokuler (4 rektus + 2 oblikus).</p><ul><li>Palpebra: melindungi mata, melicinkan, menjaga kelembaban (berkedip)</li><li>Sistem lakrimal: kelenjar penghasil air mata + sistem drainase</li><li>Otot ekstraokuler: m. rektus superior, inferior, medialis, lateralis; m. oblikus superior &amp; inferior</li><li>Kelainan adneksa: lacerasi, ektropion, entropion, distikhiasis, hordeolum, kalazion, trikhiasis, blefaritis, pterigium</li></ul><figure class=\"codex-media-card\"><img src=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Stye02.jpg\" alt=\"Fotografi klinis perbandingan hordeolum eksternum (infeksi kelenjar Zeis/Moll di tepi kelopak mata) dan hordeolum internum (infeksi meibomian gland)\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" onerror=\"this.closest('figure').classList.add('image-load-failed')\"/><figcaption>Gambar hordeolum eksternum dan internum<br><span>Wikimedia Commons Medical Images · CC BY-SA 3.0</span></figcaption></figure>","terms":[{"term":"Adneksa mata","arti":"Struktur penunjang mata: palpebra, sistem lakrimal, orbita, otot ekstraokuler","penjelasan":"Bagian-bagian pelengkap mata yang membantu fungsinya"},{"term":"Kelenjar Meibom","arti":"Kelenjar sebaseous pada tepi kelopak mata yang menghasilkan lipid film air mata","penjelasan":"Kelenjar minyak di kelopak mata"},{"term":"Blefaritis","arti":"Inflamasi kronis tepi kelopak mata, sering bilateral","penjelasan":"Radang tepi kelopak mata"},{"term":"Kanalikulus lakrimalis","arti":"Saluran drainase air mata dari punctum ke sakar lakrimalis","penjelasan":"Saluran pembuangan air mata"}]},{"id":"slide-10-card-2","title":"Hordeolum vs Kalazion","badge":"WAJIB-TAHU","body":"Hordeolum adalah inflamasi akut kelenjar Meibom, Zeis, atau Moll akibat infeksi (paling sering S. aureus). Kalazion adalah lesi kronis akibat sumbatan kelenjar Meibom tanpa tanda inflamasi akut. Perbedaan kritis: onset akut vs kronis, nyeri vs tidak nyeri, tanda radang vs tidak.","variant":"accent","items":["Hordeolum eksternum: infeksi kelenjar Zeis/Moll → menonjol ke kulit (luar)","Hordeolum internum: infeksi kelenjar Meibom → menonjol ke konjungtiva (dalam)","Hordeolum: terapi kompres hangat 3-4x/hari, antibiotik topikal (kloramfenikol/Polymixin B), insisi jika >48 jam tidak membaik","Kalazion: inkisi & kuretase, steroid triamcinolone injeksi untuk kalazion rekuren"],"subcards":[{"id":"slide-10-card-2a","title":"Trikhiasis & Distikhiasis","body":"Trikhiasis: bulu mata tumbuh dari posisi normal tetapi mengarah ke dalam menyentuh bola mata. Distikhiasis: bulu mata tambahan tumbuh dari orifisium kelenjar Meibom (lebih halus, pendek, putih). Epiblefaron: lipatan kulit berlebih mendorong bulu mata ke dalam (biasa pada ras Asia).","items":["Trikhiasis: epilasi (sementara, tumbuh 6-8 minggu), elektroepilasi, blefaroplasty","Komplikasi trikhiasis: erosi kornea, sikatrik kornea, infeksi"]}],"number":2,"content":"<p>Hordeolum adalah inflamasi akut kelenjar Meibom, Zeis, atau Moll akibat infeksi (paling sering S. aureus). Kalazion adalah lesi kronis akibat sumbatan kelenjar Meibom tanpa tanda inflamasi akut. Perbedaan kritis: onset akut vs kronis, nyeri vs tidak nyeri, tanda radang vs tidak.</p><ul><li>Hordeolum eksternum: infeksi kelenjar Zeis/Moll → menonjol ke kulit (luar)</li><li>Hordeolum internum: infeksi kelenjar Meibom → menonjol ke konjungtiva (dalam)</li><li>Hordeolum: terapi kompres hangat 3-4x/hari, antibiotik topikal (kloramfenikol/Polymixin B), insisi jika &gt;48 jam tidak membaik</li><li>Kalazion: inkisi &amp; kuretase, steroid triamcinolone injeksi untuk kalazion rekuren</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Adneksa mata","arti":"Struktur penunjang mata: palpebra, sistem lakrimal, orbita, otot ekstraokuler","penjelasan":"Bagian-bagian pelengkap mata yang membantu fungsinya"},{"term":"Kelenjar Meibom","arti":"Kelenjar sebaseous pada tepi kelopak mata yang menghasilkan lipid film air mata","penjelasan":"Kelenjar minyak di kelopak mata"},{"term":"Blefaritis","arti":"Inflamasi kronis tepi kelopak mata, sering bilateral","penjelasan":"Radang tepi kelopak mata"},{"term":"Kanalikulus lakrimalis","arti":"Saluran drainase air mata dari punctum ke sakar lakrimalis","penjelasan":"Saluran pembuangan air mata"}]},{"id":"slide-10-card-3","title":"Pterigium & Pinguekula","badge":"KLINIS","body":"Pterigium: jaringan fibrovaskuler segitiga yang tumbuh dari limbus ke kornea, terkait paparan UV kronik. Pinguekula: degenerasi hialin jaringan submukosa konjungtiva, bilateral, berwarna kuning-putih, tidak progresif ke kornea. Perbedaan kritis: pterigium progresif ke kornea, pinguekula tidak.","variant":"info","items":["Pterigium: gejala mata merah berulang, sensasi mengganjal, visus turun jika pupil tertutup","Stadium I: terbatas limbus; II: melewati limbus <2mm; III: melebihi II tapi belum melewati pupil; IV: melewati pupil","Tatalaksana pterigium: eksisi + konjungtival autograft/transplantasi membran amnion; edukasi kacamata UV","Pinguekula: tidak perlu pengobatan; steroid topikal jika pinguekulitis"],"number":3,"content":"<p>Pterigium: jaringan fibrovaskuler segitiga yang tumbuh dari limbus ke kornea, terkait paparan UV kronik. Pinguekula: degenerasi hialin jaringan submukosa konjungtiva, bilateral, berwarna kuning-putih, tidak progresif ke kornea. Perbedaan kritis: pterigium progresif ke kornea, pinguekula tidak.</p><ul><li>Pterigium: gejala mata merah berulang, sensasi mengganjal, visus turun jika pupil tertutup</li><li>Stadium I: terbatas limbus; II: melewati limbus &lt;2mm; III: melebihi II tapi belum melewati pupil; IV: melewati pupil</li><li>Tatalaksana pterigium: eksisi + konjungtival autograft/transplantasi membran amnion; edukasi kacamata UV</li><li>Pinguekula: tidak perlu pengobatan; steroid topikal jika pinguekulitis</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Adneksa mata","arti":"Struktur penunjang mata: palpebra, sistem lakrimal, orbita, otot ekstraokuler","penjelasan":"Bagian-bagian pelengkap mata yang membantu fungsinya"},{"term":"Kelenjar Meibom","arti":"Kelenjar sebaseous pada tepi kelopak mata yang menghasilkan lipid film air mata","penjelasan":"Kelenjar minyak di kelopak mata"},{"term":"Blefaritis","arti":"Inflamasi kronis tepi kelopak mata, sering bilateral","penjelasan":"Radang tepi kelopak mata"},{"term":"Kanalikulus lakrimalis","arti":"Saluran drainase air mata dari punctum ke sakar lakrimalis","penjelasan":"Saluran pembuangan air mata"}]},{"id":"slide-10-card-4","title":"Lacerasi Palpebra & Lagofthalmos","badge":"URGENT","body":"Lacerasi palpebra: robekan kelopak mata akibat trauma tajam/tumpul. Bisa full thickness atau partial thickness, dengan/without kanalikulus involvement. Lagofthalmos: ketidakmampuan menutup kelopak mata sempurna → kornea terpapar. Etiologi: N.VII palsy (Bell's palsy), post-trauma/bedah, Grave's oftalmopati.","variant":"danger","items":["Lacerasi: evaluasi integritas margin, tarsus, fungsi levator, kanalikulus","Pemeriksaan: anel test/irigasi kanalikulus, CT scan orbita","Tatalaksana: antitetanus, pembersihan luka, aposisi lapis demi lapis → rujuk","Lagofthalmos: artificial tear, salep mata, taping; operasi jika kornea eksposure"],"number":4,"content":"<p>Lacerasi palpebra: robekan kelopak mata akibat trauma tajam/tumpul. Bisa full thickness atau partial thickness, dengan/without kanalikulus involvement. Lagofthalmos: ketidakmampuan menutup kelopak mata sempurna → kornea terpapar. Etiologi: N.VII palsy (Bell&#x27;s palsy), post-trauma/bedah, Grave&#x27;s oftalmopati.</p><ul><li>Lacerasi: evaluasi integritas margin, tarsus, fungsi levator, kanalikulus</li><li>Pemeriksaan: anel test/irigasi kanalikulus, CT scan orbita</li><li>Tatalaksana: antitetanus, pembersihan luka, aposisi lapis demi lapis → rujuk</li><li>Lagofthalmos: artificial tear, salep mata, taping; operasi jika kornea eksposure</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Adneksa mata","arti":"Struktur penunjang mata: palpebra, sistem lakrimal, orbita, otot ekstraokuler","penjelasan":"Bagian-bagian pelengkap mata yang membantu fungsinya"},{"term":"Kelenjar Meibom","arti":"Kelenjar sebaseous pada tepi kelopak mata yang menghasilkan lipid film air mata","penjelasan":"Kelenjar minyak di kelopak mata"},{"term":"Blefaritis","arti":"Inflamasi kronis tepi kelopak mata, sering bilateral","penjelasan":"Radang tepi kelopak mata"},{"term":"Kanalikulus lakrimalis","arti":"Saluran drainase air mata dari punctum ke sakar lakrimalis","penjelasan":"Saluran pembuangan air mata"}]}],"tables":[{"id":"slide-10-table-1","title":"Perbedaan Hordeolum dan Kalazion","headers":["Parameter","Hordeolum","Kalazion"],"rows":[["Definisi","Infeksi akut kelenjar Meibom/Zeis/Moll","Sumbatan kronis kelenjar Meibom"],["Onset","Akut (hari)","Kronis (minggu-bulan)"],["Nyeri","Nyeri, kemerahan","Biasanya tanpa nyeri"],["Tanda inflamasi","Hiperemia, edema, nyeri tekan","Nodul padat tanpa inflamasi aktif"],["Mikroorganisme","S. aureus (paling sering)","Non-infeksius (sumbatan)"],["Lokasi","Anterior (ekst) atau posterior (int)","Dalam kelopak mata (kelenjar Meibom)"],["Terapi","Kompres hangat + antibiotik topikal/oral","Incisi kuretase, steroid injeksi"]]},{"id":"slide-10-table-2","title":"Pterigium vs Pinguekula vs Pseudopterigium","headers":["Parameter","Pterigium","Pinguekula","Pseudopterigium"],"rows":[["Definisi","Jaringan fibrovaskuler segitiga ke kornea","Degenerasi hialin submukosa konjungtiva","Perlekatan konjungtiva dengan kornea cacat"],["Warna","Putih kekuningan","Putih-kuning keabu-abuan","Putih kekuningan"],["Progresif","Ya (ke kornea)","Tidak","Tidak"],["Letak","Nasal/temporal limbus → kornea","Nasal/temporal dekat limbus","Daerah kornea cacat"],["Sonde","Tidak dapat diselipkan","Tidak dapat diselipkan","Dapat diselipkan"],["Histopatologi","Epitel ireguler, degenerasi hialin stroma","Degenerasi hialin submukosa","Perlengketan"]]}],"quizzes":[{"id":"slide-10-quiz-1","question":"Wanita 28 tahun datang dengan benjolan pada kelopak mata bawah, nyeri, kemerahan 2 hari. Benjolan menonjol ke arah kulit. Diagnosis?","options":["Kalazion","Hordeolum eksternum","Hordeolum internum","Trikhiasis"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Hordeolum eksternum adalah infeksi kelenjar Zeis atau Moll yang menonjol ke arah kulit (luar). Ciri: onset akut, nyeri, kemerahan, benjolan pada kelopak. Berbeda dengan kalazion yang kronis dan tidak nyeri, serta hordeolum internum yang menonjol ke konjungtiva."},{"id":"slide-10-quiz-2","question":"Pria 45 tahun pekerja lapangan memiliki jaringan segitiga pada konjungtiva nasal yang tumbuh ke arah kornea sejak 3 tahun. Visus 6/12. Diagnosis dan terapi definitif?","options":["Pinguekula, observasi","Pterigium stadium III, eksisi + konjungtival autograft","Pseudopterigium, tidak perlu terapi","Episkleritis, steroid topikal"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Gambaran klinis jaringan segitiga fibrovaskuler dari limbus ke kornea dengan visus menurun adalah pterigium. Pterigium melewati pupil (stadium IV) atau mendekati pupil (stadium III) memerlukan tindakan operatif: eksisi pterigium + konjungtival autograft untuk mencegah rekurensi."},{"id":"slide-10-quiz-3","question":"Prinsip utama tata laksana lacerasi palpebra full thickness adalah?","options":["Menjahit kulit saja dengan jahitan rapat","Mengembalikan posisi anatomi lapis demi lapis","Memberikan antibiotik dan menunggu sembuh sendiri","Mengoles salep antibiotik tanpa jahitan"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Prinsip tata laksana lacerasi palpebra adalah mengembalikan posisi dan fungsi ke keadaan anatomi dan fisiologi normal dengan rekonstruksi lapis demi lapis (kulit, otot, konjungtiva). Perlu evaluasi kanalikulus lakrimalis dan fungsi levator palpebra."},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-4","question":"Keadaan kelopak mata tertarik ke atas sehingga tidak bisa menutup sempurna dan bisa terjadi eksplorasi kornea disebut...","options":["Lagoftalmos","Retraksi palpebra","Eksoftalmus","Ektropion"],"correct":0,"explanation":"Lagoftalmos adalah ketidakmampuan menutup kelopak mata secara sempurna akibat kelumpuhan N. VII (facial nerve). Kelopak mata tertarik ke atas karena aksi unopposed m. levator palpebrae superioris (N. III). Konsekuensi: kornea terbuka → ekskoriasi, ulkus, dan infeksi kornea."}],"flashcards":[{"term":"Hordeolum","arti":"Inflamasi akut kelenjar sebaseous kelopak mata (Meibom, Zeis, Moll) akibat infeksi","penjelasan":"Biasanya S. aureus. Bisa eksternum (ke kulit) atau internum (ke konjungtiva). Terapi: kompres hangat, antibiotik, insisi jika perlu."},{"term":"Kalazion","arti":"Lesi kronis kelopak mata akibat sumbatan kelenjar Meibom tanpa infeksi","penjelasan":"Nodul padat non-nyeri pada kelopak. Terbedakan dari hordeolum yang akut dan nyeri. Terapi: incisi kuretase."},{"term":"Pterigium","arti":"Proliferasi jaringan fibrovaskuler segitiga dari limbus ke kornea","penjelasan":"Terutama terkait paparan UV kronik. Stadium I-IV berdasarkan ukuran. Terapi: observasi stadium ringan, eksisi+autograft stadium lanjut."},{"term":"Trikhiasis","arti":"Bulu mata tumbuh dari posisi normal tetapi mengarah ke dalam menyentuh bola mata","penjelasan":"Etiologi: idiopatik, infeksi kronis, trauma, luka bakar. Terapi: epilasi, elektroepilasi, blefaroplasty."},{"term":"Lagofthalmos","arti":"Ketidakmampuan menutup kelopak mata secara sempurna","penjelasan":"Kornea terpapar → dry eye, keratopati eksposure. Etiologi: N.VII palsy, Grave's, post-trauma. Terapi: lubrikan, taping, operasi."},{"term":"Ektropion","arti":"Kelopak mata terbalik ke luar sehingga konjungtiva terpapar","penjelasan":"Tipe: involutional, sikatrikial, paralitik, mekanik. Terapi: operasi tarsorafi atau koreksi sikatrik."},{"term":"Entropion","arti":"Kelopak mata terbalik ke dalam sehingga bulu mata mengenai kornea","penjelasan":"Tipe: involutional, sikatrikial, spastik, kongenital. Terapi: operasi koreksi posisi kelopak."}],"terms":[{"term":"Adneksa mata","arti":"Struktur penunjang mata: palpebra, sistem lakrimal, orbita, otot ekstraokuler","penjelasan":"Bagian-bagian pelengkap mata yang membantu fungsinya"},{"term":"Kelenjar Meibom","arti":"Kelenjar sebaseous pada tepi kelopak mata yang menghasilkan lipid film air mata","penjelasan":"Kelenjar minyak di kelopak mata"},{"term":"Blefaritis","arti":"Inflamasi kronis tepi kelopak mata, sering bilateral","penjelasan":"Radang tepi kelopak mata"},{"term":"Kanalikulus lakrimalis","arti":"Saluran drainase air mata dari punctum ke sakar lakrimalis","penjelasan":"Saluran pembuangan air mata"},{"term":"Punctum","arti":"Pembukaan saluran drainase air mata pada tepi kelopak mata","penjelasan":"Lubang pembuangan air mata di kelopak mata"},{"term":"Pinguekula","arti":"Degenerasi hialin jaringan submukosa konjungtiva, bilateral, tidak progresif ke kornea","penjelasan":"Bintik kuning pada putih mata, tidak berbahaya"},{"term":"Pseudopterigium","arti":"Perlekatan konjungtiva dengan kornea yang cacat, tidak melekat pada limbus","penjelasan":"Seperti pterigium tapi terjadi di kornea yang sudah rusak"},{"term":"Levator palpebrae superioris","arti":"Otot utama pengangkat kelopak mata atas","penjelasan":"Otot yang mengangkat kelopak mata"},{"term":"Ptosis","arti":"Penurunan posisi kelopak mata atas","penjelasan":"Kelopak mata terkulai"},{"term":"Sistem lakrimal","arti":"Sistem produksi dan drainase air mata: kelenjar lakrimalis, punctum, kanalikulus, sakar, nasolakrimal duktus","penjelasan":"Sistem pembuatan dan pembuangan air mata"}],"media":[{"mediaId":"media-slide-10-1","caption":"Gambar hordeolum eksternum dan internum","placement":"card-body"},{"mediaId":"media-slide-10-2","caption":"Diagram pterigium stadium I-IV","placement":"card-body"}],"crosslinks":[{"label":"Trauma → Lacerasi palpebra","targetSlideId":"slide-12","reason":"Trauma mekanik sering menyebabkan lacerasi palpebra"},{"label":"Mata merah visus normal → Pterigium","targetSlideId":"slide-11","reason":"Pterigium dapat menyebabkan mata merah dengan visus normal"}]},{"id":"slide-11","number":11,"title":"Konjungtivitis, Episkleritis & Skleritis","subtitle":"Mata merah: inflamasi konjungtiva, episklera, dan sklera","emoji":"🔴","stats":[{"val":"3","lbl":"Klasifikasi utama konjungtivitis","emoji":"📂"},{"val":"Adenovirus","lbl":"Penyebab konjungtivitis viral tersering","emoji":"🦠"},{"val":"2 minggu","lbl":"Durasi spontan episkleritis","emoji":"📅"}],"actions":[{"icon":"📖","label":"Flashcard","target":"flashcard","targetIndex":10},{"icon":"❓","label":"Kuis","target":"quiz","targetIndex":10},{"icon":"⚡","label":"CBT","target":"stress"}],"cards":[{"id":"slide-11-card-1","title":"Konjungtivitis: Overview","badge":"HIGH-YIELD","body":"Konjungtivitis adalah inflamasi konjungtiva yang paling sering disertai hiperemia dan sekret. Penyebab: bakteri, virus, klamidia, alergi, toksik. Tanda khas: injeksi konjungtiva, folikel (tonjolan abu-abu 1mm), cobble stone, flikten, membran/pseudomembran.","variant":"primary","items":["Konjungtivitis bakteri: sekret mukopurulen/purulen, Gram: diplokokus (gonokokus) atau batang","Konjungtivitis viral: sekret serous/mukous, folikel, sering bilateral","Konjungtivitis alergi: gatal berat, riwayat atopi, cobble stone","Diagnosis banding: keratitis, uveitis, glaukoma akut (mata merah visus turun)"],"number":1,"content":"<p>Konjungtivitis adalah inflamasi konjungtiva yang paling sering disertai hiperemia dan sekret. Penyebab: bakteri, virus, klamidia, alergi, toksik. Tanda khas: injeksi konjungtiva, folikel (tonjolan abu-abu 1mm), cobble stone, flikten, membran/pseudomembran.</p><ul><li>Konjungtivitis bakteri: sekret mukopurulen/purulen, Gram: diplokokus (gonokokus) atau batang</li><li>Konjungtivitis viral: sekret serous/mukous, folikel, sering bilateral</li><li>Konjungtivitis alergi: gatal berat, riwayat atopi, cobble stone</li><li>Diagnosis banding: keratitis, uveitis, glaukoma akut (mata merah visus turun)</li></ul><figure class=\"codex-media-card codex-media-source-card\"><div class=\"codex-source-preview\"><strong>Media sumber internet</strong><span>URL ini adalah halaman sumber, bukan file gambar langsung.</span></div><figcaption>Folikel konjungtiva pada trakoma<br><span>World Health Organization (WHO) · CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 IGO</span><br><a href=\"https://www.who.int/news-room/fact-sheets/detail/trachoma\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Buka sumber gambar</a></figcaption></figure>","terms":[{"term":"Hiperemia konjungtiva","arti":"Pelebaran pembuluh darah konjungtiva yang terlihat sebagai mata merah","penjelasan":"Mata merah akibat pembuluh darah konjungtiva melebar"},{"term":"Folikel","arti":"Tonjolan pada konjungtiva berwarna abu-abu kemerahan akibat agregasi limfosit","penjelasan":"Benjolan kecil abu-abu pada konjungtiva"},{"term":"Pseudomembran","arti":"Lapiran putih yang dapat dilepas dari konjungtiva tanpa pendarahan","penjelasan":"Selaput putih di konjungtiva yang bisa dilepas"},{"term":"Membran","arti":"Lapiran putih padat pada konjungtiva yang jika dilepas menyebabkan pendarahan","penjelasan":"Selaput putih tebal yang menempel kuat di konjungtiva"}]},{"id":"slide-11-card-2","title":"Konjungtivitis Bakteri & Purulen","badge":"WAJIB-TAHU","body":"Konjungtivitis bakteri tersering: S. aureus, pneumokokus. Konjungtivitis purulen gonokokal: Neisseria gonorrhoeae → sekret purulen masif, kemosis, edema kelopak. Ophthalmia neonatorum: N. gonorrhoeae/Chlamydia pada bayi baru lahir.","variant":"danger","items":["Konjungtivitis gonokokal: inkubasi 12-72 jam, sangat menular → isolasi","Terapi: antibiotik topikal + sistemik (sefalosporin), irigasi salin","Konjungtivitis membran: difteri (ADS 20.000 U), streptokokus, pneumokokus","Keratokonjungtivitis epidemica (adenovirus tipe 8): inkubasi 5-10 hari, pre-auricular lymphadenopathy"],"number":2,"content":"<p>Konjungtivitis bakteri tersering: S. aureus, pneumokokus. Konjungtivitis purulen gonokokal: Neisseria gonorrhoeae → sekret purulen masif, kemosis, edema kelopak. Ophthalmia neonatorum: N. gonorrhoeae/Chlamydia pada bayi baru lahir.</p><ul><li>Konjungtivitis gonokokal: inkubasi 12-72 jam, sangat menular → isolasi</li><li>Terapi: antibiotik topikal + sistemik (sefalosporin), irigasi salin</li><li>Konjungtivitis membran: difteri (ADS 20.000 U), streptokokus, pneumokokus</li><li>Keratokonjungtivitis epidemica (adenovirus tipe 8): inkubasi 5-10 hari, pre-auricular lymphadenopathy</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Hiperemia konjungtiva","arti":"Pelebaran pembuluh darah konjungtiva yang terlihat sebagai mata merah","penjelasan":"Mata merah akibat pembuluh darah konjungtiva melebar"},{"term":"Folikel","arti":"Tonjolan pada konjungtiva berwarna abu-abu kemerahan akibat agregasi limfosit","penjelasan":"Benjolan kecil abu-abu pada konjungtiva"},{"term":"Pseudomembran","arti":"Lapiran putih yang dapat dilepas dari konjungtiva tanpa pendarahan","penjelasan":"Selaput putih di konjungtiva yang bisa dilepas"},{"term":"Membran","arti":"Lapiran putih padat pada konjungtiva yang jika dilepas menyebabkan pendarahan","penjelasan":"Selaput putih tebal yang menempel kuat di konjungtiva"}]},{"id":"slide-11-card-3","title":"Episkleritis vs Skleritis","badge":"UTBK","body":"Episkleritis: inflamasi jaringan episklera (antara konjungtiva dan sklera), ringan, self-limiting 1-2 minggu, idiopatik/sepertiga terkait sistemik (gout). Skleritis: inflamasi granulomatosa kronis sklera, nyeri hebat, terkait penyakit autoimun (RA, SLE, vasculitis), bisa mengancam penglihatan.","variant":"accent","items":["Tes fenilefrin 2.5%: episkleritis → vasokonstriksi (membaik); skleritis → tidak ada perubahan","Episkleritis: tipe simple (diffuse) dan nodular; skleritis: anterior (diffuse, nodular, necrotizing) dan posterior","Skleritis: nyeri hebat, sklera tipis, risiko perforasi. Terapi: NSAID, steroid sistemik, imunosupresan","Komplikasi skleritis: keratitis, uveitis, glaukoma, ablasio retina eksudatif"],"subcards":[{"id":"slide-11-card-3a","title":"Tabel Beda Episkleritis vs Skleritis","body":"","items":["Episkleritis: gout, psoriasis, idiopatik | Skleritis: penyakit sistemik (RA)","Episkleritis: asimptomatik/nyeri ringan | Skleritis: nyeri hebat","Episkleritis: superficial | Skleritis: dalam","Episkleritis: tidak ada neovaskularisasi | Skleritis: ada neovaskularisasi","Episkleritis: tes fenilefrin (+) vasokonstriksi | Skleritis: tidak ada perubahan"]}],"number":3,"content":"<p>Episkleritis: inflamasi jaringan episklera (antara konjungtiva dan sklera), ringan, self-limiting 1-2 minggu, idiopatik/sepertiga terkait sistemik (gout). Skleritis: inflamasi granulomatosa kronis sklera, nyeri hebat, terkait penyakit autoimun (RA, SLE, vasculitis), bisa mengancam penglihatan.</p><ul><li>Tes fenilefrin 2.5%: episkleritis → vasokonstriksi (membaik); skleritis → tidak ada perubahan</li><li>Episkleritis: tipe simple (diffuse) dan nodular; skleritis: anterior (diffuse, nodular, necrotizing) dan posterior</li><li>Skleritis: nyeri hebat, sklera tipis, risiko perforasi. Terapi: NSAID, steroid sistemik, imunosupresan</li><li>Komplikasi skleritis: keratitis, uveitis, glaukoma, ablasio retina eksudatif</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Hiperemia konjungtiva","arti":"Pelebaran pembuluh darah konjungtiva yang terlihat sebagai mata merah","penjelasan":"Mata merah akibat pembuluh darah konjungtiva melebar"},{"term":"Folikel","arti":"Tonjolan pada konjungtiva berwarna abu-abu kemerahan akibat agregasi limfosit","penjelasan":"Benjolan kecil abu-abu pada konjungtiva"},{"term":"Pseudomembran","arti":"Lapiran putih yang dapat dilepas dari konjungtiva tanpa pendarahan","penjelasan":"Selaput putih di konjungtiva yang bisa dilepas"},{"term":"Membran","arti":"Lapiran putih padat pada konjungtiva yang jika dilepas menyebabkan pendarahan","penjelasan":"Selaput putih tebal yang menempel kuat di konjungtiva"}]},{"id":"slide-11-card-4","title":"Trakoma","badge":"EPIIDEMIOLOGI","body":"Trakoma adalah konjungtivitis kronis akibat Chlamydia trachomatis (serotipe A-C), penyebab kebutaan terhindari nomor 1 di dunia. WHO: trachoma belt (daerah kering, tropis, sanitasi buruk). Patognomonik: follicles pada konjungtiva superior, panus kornea, pannus.","variant":"warning","items":["Tanda khas: follicles konjungtiva superior, Herbert's pits, pannus, sikatrik (Arlt's line)","SAFE strategy: Surgery, Antibiotics, Facial cleanliness, Environmental improvement","Terapi: azithromycin oral single dose, tetracycline salep 6 minggu","Komplikasi: trikhiasis, distikhiasis, kornea opasifikasi → kebutaan"],"number":4,"content":"<p>Trakoma adalah konjungtivitis kronis akibat Chlamydia trachomatis (serotipe A-C), penyebab kebutaan terhindari nomor 1 di dunia. WHO: trachoma belt (daerah kering, tropis, sanitasi buruk). Patognomonik: follicles pada konjungtiva superior, panus kornea, pannus.</p><ul><li>Tanda khas: follicles konjungtiva superior, Herbert&#x27;s pits, pannus, sikatrik (Arlt&#x27;s line)</li><li>SAFE strategy: Surgery, Antibiotics, Facial cleanliness, Environmental improvement</li><li>Terapi: azithromycin oral single dose, tetracycline salep 6 minggu</li><li>Komplikasi: trikhiasis, distikhiasis, kornea opasifikasi → kebutaan</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Hiperemia konjungtiva","arti":"Pelebaran pembuluh darah konjungtiva yang terlihat sebagai mata merah","penjelasan":"Mata merah akibat pembuluh darah konjungtiva melebar"},{"term":"Folikel","arti":"Tonjolan pada konjungtiva berwarna abu-abu kemerahan akibat agregasi limfosit","penjelasan":"Benjolan kecil abu-abu pada konjungtiva"},{"term":"Pseudomembran","arti":"Lapiran putih yang dapat dilepas dari konjungtiva tanpa pendarahan","penjelasan":"Selaput putih di konjungtiva yang bisa dilepas"},{"term":"Membran","arti":"Lapiran putih padat pada konjungtiva yang jika dilepas menyebabkan pendarahan","penjelasan":"Selaput putih tebal yang menempel kuat di konjungtiva"}]}],"tables":[{"id":"slide-11-table-1","title":"Perbedaan Konjungtivitis Viral, Bakteri, dan Alergi","headers":["Parameter","Viral","Bakteri","Alergi"],"rows":[["Gatal","Minimal","Minimal","Berat"],["Hiperemi","Menyeluruh","Menyeluruh","Menyeluruh"],["Sekret","Minimal (serous/mukous)","Banyak (mukopurulen)","Minimal (benang)"],["Lakrimasi","++","+","+"],["Lymphadenopati","Pre-auricular (+)","Jarang","(-)"],["Folikel","Sering","Jarang","Cobble stone"],["Bilateral","Sering","Bisa unilateral","Bilateral"],["Sel dominan","Monosit","PMN","Eosinofil"]]}],"quizzes":[{"id":"slide-11-quiz-1","question":"Pasien 25 tahun dengan mata merah unilateral, nyeri ringan, lakrimasi. Tes fenilefrin 2.5%: vasokonstriksi membaik. Diagnosis?","options":["Skleritis anterior","Episkleritis","Konjungtivitis bakteri","Uveitis anterior"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Episkleritis memiliki tes fenilefrin positif (vasokonstriksi membaik) karena inflamasi superfisial. Skleritis tidak menunjukkan perubahan dengan fenilefrin. Pembedaan kritis: episkleritis ringan dan self-limiting; skleritis nyeri hebat, terkait autoimun."},{"id":"slide-11-quiz-2","question":"Wanita 60 tahun dengan nyeri mata hebat, bola mata merah, fotofobia. Riwayat rheumatoid arthritis 10 tahun. Pemeriksaan: sklera edema, neovaskularisasi. Tes fenilefrin tidak ada perubahan. Diagnosis?","options":["Episkleritis nodular","Skleritis anterior difus","Konjungtivitis kronis","Blefaritis"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Nyeri hebat + skleritis + riwayat RA + tes fenilefrin negatif = skleritis anterior difus. Skleritis 50% terkait penyakit sistemik autoimun. Perbedaan dengan episkleritis: episkleritis nyeri ringan, tes fenilefrin positif."},{"id":"slide-11-quiz-3","question":"Bayi 3 hari dengan mata merah bilateral, sekret purulen masif, edema kelopak berat. Ibu tidak pernah skrining prenatal. Agens yang paling mungkin?","options":["Adenovirus","Chlamydia trachomatis","Neisseria gonorrhoeae","Staphylococcus aureus"],"correct":2,"explanation":"Ophthalmia neonatorum gonokokal (N. gonorrhoeae) ditandai dengan sekret purulen masif, inkubasi 12-72 jam. Ini adalah emergency oftalmologi karena dapat menyebabkan perforasi kornea dalam 24 jam. Terapi: seftriakson IM + irigasi salin + antibiotik topikal."},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-20","question":"Wanita 50 tahun, mata kanan merah 3 hari, visus kabur, sakit kepala hebat, mual muntah, TIO tidak terukur, kornea edema, COA dangkal. Diagnosis?","options":["Glaukoma akut sudut tertutup","Endoftalmitis","Panoftalmitis","Uveitis anterior"],"correct":0,"explanation":"Glaukoma akut sudut tertutup (AACG) adalah emergency oftalmologi dengan trias: sakit kepala hebat, mual muntah, dan penurunan visus mendadak. Tanda: injeksi siliar, kornea edema steamy, COA dangkal, pupil middilated fixed oval. TIO sangat tinggi (>40-80 mmHg). Penyebab: pupillary block akibat contact iris-lens."}],"flashcards":[{"term":"Konjungtivitis","arti":"Inflamasi konjungtiva dengan hiperemia dan sekret","penjelasan":"Penyebab: bakteri, virus, alergi, klamidia. Diagnosis banding penting: mata merah visus normal vs visus turun."},{"term":"Episkleritis","arti":"Inflamasi ringan jaringan episklera antara konjungtiva dan sklera","penjelasan":"Self-limiting 1-2 minggu. Tes fenilefrin 2.5%: vasokonstriksi membaik. Sepertiga terkait penyakit sistemik (gout)."},{"term":"Skleritis","arti":"Inflamasi granulomatosa kronis sklera dengan destruksi kolagen","penjelasan":"Nyeri hebat, terkait autoimun (RA). Tes fenilefrin negatif. Komplikasi: keratitis, uveitis, glaukoma, ablasio retina eksudatif."},{"term":"Trakoma","arti":"Konjungtivitis kronis akibat C. trachomatis serotipe A-C","penjelasan":"Penyebab kebutaan terhindari #1 dunia. Tanda: follicles superior, Herbert's pits, pannus. SAFE strategy."},{"term":"Konjungtivitis gonokokal","arti":"Konjungtivitis purulen akut akibat N. gonorrhoeae","penjelasan":"Emergency! Sekret purulen masif, inkubasi 12-72 jam. Risiko perforasi kornea 24 jam. Isolasi + antibiotik sistemik."},{"term":"Folikel konjungtival","arti":"Tonjolan pada jaringan konjungtiva abu-abu kemerahan diameter ~1mm","penjelasan":"Tanda patognomonik trakoma dan konjungtivitis viral. Terbentuk dari agregasi limfosit."}],"terms":[{"term":"Hiperemia konjungtiva","arti":"Pelebaran pembuluh darah konjungtiva yang terlihat sebagai mata merah","penjelasan":"Mata merah akibat pembuluh darah konjungtiva melebar"},{"term":"Folikel","arti":"Tonjolan pada konjungtiva berwarna abu-abu kemerahan akibat agregasi limfosit","penjelasan":"Benjolan kecil abu-abu pada konjungtiva"},{"term":"Pseudomembran","arti":"Lapiran putih yang dapat dilepas dari konjungtiva tanpa pendarahan","penjelasan":"Selaput putih di konjungtiva yang bisa dilepas"},{"term":"Membran","arti":"Lapiran putih padat pada konjungtiva yang jika dilepas menyebabkan pendarahan","penjelasan":"Selaput putih tebal yang menempel kuat di konjungtiva"},{"term":"Pannus","arti":"Vaskularisasi superficial kornea dengan infiltrasi limfosit","penjelasan":"Tumbuhnya pembuluh darah ke kornea"},{"term":"Arlt's line","arti":"Garis sikatrik horizontal pada konjungtiva superior khas trakoma","penjelasan":"Garis putih pada konjungtiva atas tanda trakoma"},{"term":"Ophthalmia neonatorum","arti":"Konjungtivitis pada bayi <28 hari, biasanya N. gonorrhoeae atau C. trachomatis","penjelasan":"Mata merah pada bayi baru lahir"},{"term":"Cobble stone","arti":"Papil poligonal berdekatan pada konjungtiva tarsalis khas alergi","penjelasan":"Tampilan seperti batu kerikil pada konjungtiva"},{"term":"Chemosis","arti":"Edema konjungtiva bulbi yang terlihat seperti gelembung","penjelasan":"Konjungtiva bengkak berair"},{"term":"Bitot spot","arti":"Bintik putih berbusa pada konjungtiva temporal akibat defisiensi vitamin A","penjelasan":"Bintik putih di mata akibat kurang vitamin A"}],"media":[{"mediaId":"media-slide-11-1","caption":"Folikel konjungtiva pada trakoma","placement":"card-body"},{"mediaId":"media-slide-11-2","caption":"Perbedaan episkleritis dan skleritis pada pemeriksaan","placement":"card-body"}],"crosslinks":[{"label":"Trauma → Kornea & Konjungtiva","targetSlideId":"slide-12","reason":"Trauma kimia dapat menyebabkan kerusakan konjungtiva dan kornea berat"},{"label":"Adneksa → Blefaritis","targetSlideId":"slide-10","reason":"Blefaritis sering terkait konjungtivitis marginal"}]},{"id":"slide-12","number":12,"title":"Trauma Mata & Kornea","subtitle":"Trauma mekanik, kimia, kornea (ulkus & keratitis), hiphema, hipopion","emoji":"⚡","stats":[{"val":"30 menit","lbl":"Durasi irigasi wajib untuk trauma kimia","emoji":"⏱️"},{"val":"Alkali","lbl":"Lebih berbahaya dari asam (penetrasi dalam)","emoji":"⚠️"},{"val":"Grade 1-4","lbl":"Klasifikasi severity trauma kimia","emoji":"📊"}],"actions":[{"icon":"📖","label":"Flashcard","target":"flashcard","targetIndex":11},{"icon":"❓","label":"Kuis","target":"quiz","targetIndex":11},{"icon":"🚑","label":"Emergency","target":"slide","targetIndex":11}],"cards":[{"id":"slide-12-card-1","title":"Trauma Kimia: Asam vs Basa (EMERGENCY)","badge":"EMERGENCY","body":"Trauma kimia adalah emergency oftalmologi. PRIORITAS TERTINGGI: irigasi segera! Asam → koagulasi protein (sawar pelindung) → kerusakan lebih superfisial. Alkali/basa → saponifikasi lemak membran sel → penetrasi cepat ke stroma, kamera anterior, bahkan retina → destruksi lebih dalam.","variant":"danger","items":["Asam: cuka, H2SO4, HCl, HNO3 → koagulasi protein, kerusakan superfisial","Basa/Alkali: sabun, detergen, NaOH, Ca(OH)2, NH3 → penetrasi dalam, prognosis buruk","Langkah pertama: IRIGASI segera 2 Liter salin/air bersih 15-30 menit sampai pH netral (6.8-7.4)","Grading: Grade I (excellent) → Grade IV (very poor prognosis, limbal ischemia >1/2)","Double eversion kelopak mata untuk cari partikel tersisa!"],"subcards":[{"id":"slide-12-card-1a","title":"Roper-Hall Classification","body":"Berdasarkan kekeruhan kornea dan limbal ischemia. Grade I: kornea jernih, limbal ischemia 0. Grade II: kornea hazy tapi iris terlihat, ischemia <1/3. Grade III: kornea hazy iris tidak terlihat, ischemia 1/3-1/2. Grade IV: kornea opaque, ischemia >1/2.","items":[]}],"number":1,"content":"<p>Trauma kimia adalah emergency oftalmologi. PRIORITAS TERTINGGI: irigasi segera! Asam → koagulasi protein (sawar pelindung) → kerusakan lebih superfisial. Alkali/basa → saponifikasi lemak membran sel → penetrasi cepat ke stroma, kamera anterior, bahkan retina → destruksi lebih dalam.</p><ul><li>Asam: cuka, H2SO4, HCl, HNO3 → koagulasi protein, kerusakan superfisial</li><li>Basa/Alkali: sabun, detergen, NaOH, Ca(OH)2, NH3 → penetrasi dalam, prognosis buruk</li><li>Langkah pertama: IRIGASI segera 2 Liter salin/air bersih 15-30 menit sampai pH netral (6.8-7.4)</li><li>Grading: Grade I (excellent) → Grade IV (very poor prognosis, limbal ischemia &gt;1/2)</li><li>Double eversion kelopak mata untuk cari partikel tersisa!</li></ul><figure class=\"codex-media-card codex-media-source-card\"><div class=\"codex-source-preview\"><strong>Media sumber internet</strong><span>URL ini adalah halaman sumber, bukan file gambar langsung.</span></div><figcaption>Gambar grading trauma kimia mata (Roper-Hall)<br><span>American Academy of Ophthalmology (AAO) EyeWiki · AAO EyeWiki License</span><br><a href=\"https://eyewiki.aao.org/Chemical_Injuries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Buka sumber gambar</a></figcaption></figure>","terms":[{"term":"Abrasi kornea","arti":"Goresan superfisial lapisan epitel kornea","penjelasan":"Goresan pada lapisan terluar kornea"},{"term":"Lacerasi kornea","arti":"Robekan kornea yang melibatkan stroma","penjelasan":"Robekan pada kornea yang lebih dalam dari goresan"},{"term":"Perforasi kornea","arti":"Robekan penuh ketebalan kornea","penjelasan":"Kornea bolong tembus dari depan ke belakang"},{"term":"Corneal bloodstaining","arti":"Pewarnaan coklat kornea akibat hemoglobin","penjelasan":"Kornea menjadi coklat akibat darah di BMD"}]},{"id":"slide-12-card-2","title":"Keratitis & Ulkus Kornea","badge":"WAJIB-TAHU","body":"Keratitis: inflamasi kornea (superfisial, interstisial, profunda). Ulkus kornea: hilangnya jaringan kornea dengan infiltrat supuratif dan diskontinuitas jaringan. Etiologi: bakteri, virus, jamur, protozoa (Acanthamoeba), non-infeksi (kimia, radiasi, defisiensi vit A).","variant":"accent","items":["Trias keratitis: epifora, blefarospasme, fotofobia","Keratitis bakteri: infiltrat, injeksi limbus, edema stroma, hipopion, KP","Keratitis jamur: trauma tumbuhan, kortikosteroid, lensa kontak. Fenomena satelit","Acanthamoeba: lensa kontak + air, ring-shaped infiltrat, diagnosis sulit","Keratitis Herpes Simpleks: dendritik corneal ulcer, trifluridine/ganciclovir"],"number":2,"content":"<p>Keratitis: inflamasi kornea (superfisial, interstisial, profunda). Ulkus kornea: hilangnya jaringan kornea dengan infiltrat supuratif dan diskontinuitas jaringan. Etiologi: bakteri, virus, jamur, protozoa (Acanthamoeba), non-infeksi (kimia, radiasi, defisiensi vit A).</p><ul><li>Trias keratitis: epifora, blefarospasme, fotofobia</li><li>Keratitis bakteri: infiltrat, injeksi limbus, edema stroma, hipopion, KP</li><li>Keratitis jamur: trauma tumbuhan, kortikosteroid, lensa kontak. Fenomena satelit</li><li>Acanthamoeba: lensa kontak + air, ring-shaped infiltrat, diagnosis sulit</li><li>Keratitis Herpes Simpleks: dendritik corneal ulcer, trifluridine/ganciclovir</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Abrasi kornea","arti":"Goresan superfisial lapisan epitel kornea","penjelasan":"Goresan pada lapisan terluar kornea"},{"term":"Lacerasi kornea","arti":"Robekan kornea yang melibatkan stroma","penjelasan":"Robekan pada kornea yang lebih dalam dari goresan"},{"term":"Perforasi kornea","arti":"Robekan penuh ketebalan kornea","penjelasan":"Kornea bolong tembus dari depan ke belakang"},{"term":"Corneal bloodstaining","arti":"Pewarnaan coklat kornea akibat hemoglobin","penjelasan":"Kornea menjadi coklat akibat darah di BMD"}]},{"id":"slide-12-card-3","title":"Ulkus Kornea: Spesifik & Tatalaksana","badge":"KLINIS","body":"Ulkus kornea bakteri: S. pneumoniae (ulkus serpiginosa), Pseudomonas (pembawa lensa kontak, nekrosis cepat). Ulkus Mooren: idiopatik, tepi bergaung, perifer. Ulkus neuroparalitik: gangguan N.V → kornea anestetik. Tatalaksana: kultur & sensitivitas, antibiotik topikal intensif.","variant":"info","items":["Pemeriksaan: kerokan kornea (corneal scrapping), pewarnaan Gram, Giemsa, kultur","Antibiotik topikal: gentamycin/tobramycin + cephazoline tiap jam (broad spectrum)","Ulkus <3mm non-axial: rawat jalan + antibiotik topikal tiap jam","Ulkus >3mm + hipopion: rawat inap + antibiotik topikal + subkonjungtiva + parenteral","Indikasi operasi: hifema total >6 hari + TIO >25 mmHg (corneal bloodstaining)"],"number":3,"content":"<p>Ulkus kornea bakteri: S. pneumoniae (ulkus serpiginosa), Pseudomonas (pembawa lensa kontak, nekrosis cepat). Ulkus Mooren: idiopatik, tepi bergaung, perifer. Ulkus neuroparalitik: gangguan N.V → kornea anestetik. Tatalaksana: kultur &amp; sensitivitas, antibiotik topikal intensif.</p><ul><li>Pemeriksaan: kerokan kornea (corneal scrapping), pewarnaan Gram, Giemsa, kultur</li><li>Antibiotik topikal: gentamycin/tobramycin + cephazoline tiap jam (broad spectrum)</li><li>Ulkus &lt;3mm non-axial: rawat jalan + antibiotik topikal tiap jam</li><li>Ulkus &gt;3mm + hipopion: rawat inap + antibiotik topikal + subkonjungtiva + parenteral</li><li>Indikasi operasi: hifema total &gt;6 hari + TIO &gt;25 mmHg (corneal bloodstaining)</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Abrasi kornea","arti":"Goresan superfisial lapisan epitel kornea","penjelasan":"Goresan pada lapisan terluar kornea"},{"term":"Lacerasi kornea","arti":"Robekan kornea yang melibatkan stroma","penjelasan":"Robekan pada kornea yang lebih dalam dari goresan"},{"term":"Perforasi kornea","arti":"Robekan penuh ketebalan kornea","penjelasan":"Kornea bolong tembus dari depan ke belakang"},{"term":"Corneal bloodstaining","arti":"Pewarnaan coklat kornea akibat hemoglobin","penjelasan":"Kornea menjadi coklat akibat darah di BMD"}]},{"id":"slide-12-card-4","title":"Trauma Mekanik: Hiphema & Hipopion","badge":"URGENT","body":"Hiphema: perdarahan dalam bilik mata depan akibat pecahnya pembuluh darah iris/badan siliar. Grading: Grade 1 (<1/3), 2 (1/3-1/2), 3 (1/2-2/3), 4 (>2/3 = total). Hiphema dapat menyebabkan secondary hemorrhage (rebleeding) dan corneal bloodstaining.","variant":"warning","items":["Hiphema: tirah baring total 30-45°, shield pelindung, monitor TIO","Kompres dingin, analgesik non-aspirin (↓risiko rebleeding)","Sikloplegia (siklopentolat), kortikosteroid topikal (↓inflamasi & rebleeding)","Hipopion: akumulasi leukosit di BMD → 85% kasus endoftalmitis akut","Indikasi operasi hiphema: total >6 hari + TIO >25 mmHg (bloodstaining risk)"],"number":4,"content":"<p>Hiphema: perdarahan dalam bilik mata depan akibat pecahnya pembuluh darah iris/badan siliar. Grading: Grade 1 (&lt;1/3), 2 (1/3-1/2), 3 (1/2-2/3), 4 (&gt;2/3 = total). Hiphema dapat menyebabkan secondary hemorrhage (rebleeding) dan corneal bloodstaining.</p><ul><li>Hiphema: tirah baring total 30-45°, shield pelindung, monitor TIO</li><li>Kompres dingin, analgesik non-aspirin (↓risiko rebleeding)</li><li>Sikloplegia (siklopentolat), kortikosteroid topikal (↓inflamasi &amp; rebleeding)</li><li>Hipopion: akumulasi leukosit di BMD → 85% kasus endoftalmitis akut</li><li>Indikasi operasi hiphema: total &gt;6 hari + TIO &gt;25 mmHg (bloodstaining risk)</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Abrasi kornea","arti":"Goresan superfisial lapisan epitel kornea","penjelasan":"Goresan pada lapisan terluar kornea"},{"term":"Lacerasi kornea","arti":"Robekan kornea yang melibatkan stroma","penjelasan":"Robekan pada kornea yang lebih dalam dari goresan"},{"term":"Perforasi kornea","arti":"Robekan penuh ketebalan kornea","penjelasan":"Kornea bolong tembus dari depan ke belakang"},{"term":"Corneal bloodstaining","arti":"Pewarnaan coklat kornea akibat hemoglobin","penjelasan":"Kornea menjadi coklat akibat darah di BMD"}]}],"tables":[{"id":"slide-12-table-1","title":"Terapi Ulkus Kornea Berdasarkan Ukuran","headers":["Ulkus","Lokasi","Cara Pengobatan"],"rows":[["<3mm","Tidak axial","Rawat jalan, antibiotik topikal tiap jam"],["3mm","Axial","Rawat inap, antibiotik topikal tiap jam + subkonjungtiva"],["3mm + hipopion","Dimana saja","Rawat inap, topikal + subkonjungtiva + parenteral"]]},{"id":"slide-12-table-2","title":"Perbedaan Trauma Asam dan Basa","headers":["Parameter","Asam","Basa/Alkali"],"rows":[["Mekanisme","Koagulasi protein → sawar pelindung","Saponifikasi lemak membran sel"],["Kedalaman","Superfisial (kecuali hidrofluorik)","Dalam (stroma, kamera anterior, retina)"],["Keparahan","Relatif ringan","Lebih berbahaya, prognosis buruk"],["Contoh","Cuka, H2SO4, HCl, HNO3","Sabun, NaOH, Ca(OH)2, NH3"],["Irigasi","Segera 15-30 menit","Segera 15-30 menit (LEbih URGENT)"],["Prognosis","Lebih baik","Lebih buruk"]]}],"quizzes":[{"id":"slide-12-quiz-1","question":"PRIORITAS pertama pada penanganan trauma kimia mata adalah?","options":["Pemeriksaan visus","Irigasi dengan cairan fisiologis segera","Pemeriksaan pH","Pemberian antibiotik topikal"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Irigasi segera adalah prioritas tertinggi pada trauma kimia mata untuk meminimalkan durasi kontak kimia dan menormalkan pH. Speed and efficacy of irrigation = most important prognostic factor. Durasi: 15-30 menit atau sampai pH netral (6.8-7.4). Double eversion untuk cari partikel tersisa."},{"id":"slide-12-quiz-2","question":"Pria 25 tahun, pembawa lensa kontak, mata merah, nyeri, visus turun 5 hari. Slit lamp: infiltrat kornea dengan fenomena satelit. Pewarnaan Giemsa: hifa. Diagnosis?","options":["Keratitis bakteri","Keratitis fungal","Keratitis viral (HSV)","Keratitis Acanthamoeba"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Fenomena satelit (infiltrat kecil di sekitar ulkus utama) adalah tanda khas keratitis fungal. Risk factor: lensa kontak, trauma tumbuhan, kortikosteroid. Pewarnaan Giemsa menunjukkan hifa. Terapi: natamycin 5% topikal. Acanthamoeba: ring-shaped infiltrat; bakteri: infiltrat tunggal tanpa satelit."},{"id":"slide-12-quiz-3","question":"Anak 10 tahun jatuh dari sepeda, mata memar. Pemeriksaan: hiphema grade 3 (>1/2 BMD). TIO 28 mmHg. Tindakan yang paling tepat?","options":["Pulang dengan antibiotik topikal saja","Rawat inap, tirah baring 45°, sikloplegia, monitor TIO","Bedah evakuasi darah segera","Aspirin untuk nyeri"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Hiphema grade 3 dengan TIO 28 mmHg memerlukan rawat inap: tirah baring 30-45° (menggunakan gravitasi untuk menurunkan darah dari pupil), sikloplegia, kortikosteroid topikal, analgesik non-aspirin, dan monitoring TIO ketat. Aspirin kontraindikasi karena meningkatkan risiko rebleeding. Indikasi bedah: total hiphema >6 hari + TIO >25 mmHg."},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-5","question":"Yang termasuk emergency absolute pada mata adalah...","options":["Trauma benda tajam","Trauma kimia asam","Trauma kimia basa","Trauma termal"],"correct":2,"explanation":"Trauma kimia basa merupakan emergency absolute karena basa menyebabkan saponifikasi lipid membran, penetrasi mendalam ke jaringan, dan kerusakan berkelanjutan. Asam menyebabkan koagulasi protein superfisial yang justru membatasi penetrasi. IRIGASI MASIF segera adalah kunci tatalaksana."},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-29","question":"Hifema mengisi 1/2 anterior chamber. Grade berapa?","options":["Grade 1","Grade 2","Grade 3","Grade 4"],"correct":2,"explanation":"Grading hifema: G1 = <1/3 anterior chamber (AC). G2 = 1/3 - 1/2 AC. G3 = >1/2 AC (total/8-ball hifema). G4 = total AC filled with dark/clotted blood. G3-G4 berisiko komplikasi: corneal blood staining, glaucoma sekunder, optic atrophy. Penatalaksanaan: bed rest, eye shield, cycloplegic, IOP control."}],"flashcards":[{"term":"Trauma kimia mata","arti":"Emergency oftalmologi akibat paparan bahan kimia","penjelasan":"Prioritas: IRIGASI SEGERA 15-30 menit sampai pH netral. Alkali lebih berbahaya dari asam (penetrasi dalam). Grading: I-IV (Roper-Hall)."},{"term":"Keratitis","arti":"Inflamasi kornea yang dapat disebabkan bakteri, virus, jamur, atau protozoa","penjelasan":"Trias: epifora, blefarospasme, fotofobia. Bisa superfisial, interstisial, atau profunda."},{"term":"Ulkus kornea","arti":"Hilangnya jaringan kornea dengan infiltrat supuratif","penjelasan":"Etiologi: infeksi, trauma, non-infeksi. Pemeriksaan: corneal scrapping + kultur. Terapi: antibiotik topikal intensif."},{"term":"Hiphema","arti":"Perdarahan dalam bilik mata depan","penjelasan":"Grading 1-4 berdasarkan volume darah di BMD. Risiko: secondary hemorrhage, corneal bloodstaining, glaukoma."},{"term":"Hipopion","arti":"Akumulasi leukosit di bilik mata depan","penjelasan":"Tanda severe intraocular inflammation. 85% kasus endoftalmitis akut. Differential: corneal ulcer, iridocyclitis, IOFB."},{"term":"Fenomena satelit","arti":"Infiltrat kornea kecil di sekitar ulkus utama","penjelasan":"Tanda khas keratitis fungal. Berbeda dengan Acanthamoeba yang menunjukkan ring-shaped infiltrat."},{"term":"Double eversion","arti":"Teknik membalik kelopak mata ganda untuk visualisasi forniks superior","penjelasan":"Penting pada trauma kimia untuk mengidentifikasi dan membuang partikel tersisa yang bisa menahan bahan kimia."}],"terms":[{"term":"Abrasi kornea","arti":"Goresan superfisial lapisan epitel kornea","penjelasan":"Goresan pada lapisan terluar kornea"},{"term":"Lacerasi kornea","arti":"Robekan kornea yang melibatkan stroma","penjelasan":"Robekan pada kornea yang lebih dalam dari goresan"},{"term":"Perforasi kornea","arti":"Robekan penuh ketebalan kornea","penjelasan":"Kornea bolong tembus dari depan ke belakang"},{"term":"Corneal bloodstaining","arti":"Pewarnaan coklat kornea akibat hemoglobin","penjelasan":"Kornea menjadi coklat akibat darah di BMD"},{"term":"Rebleeding (secondary hemorrhage)","arti":"Perdarahan ulang pada hiphema, biasanya hari ke-2-5","penjelasan":"Darah keluar lagi dari hiphema"},{"term":"Corneal scrapping","arti":"Pengikisan jaringan kornea untuk pemeriksaan mikrobiologi","penjelasan":"Mengambil sampel kornea untuk pemeriksaan lab"},{"term":"Irigasi","arti":"Pencucian mata dengan cairan fisiologis atau air bersih","penjelasan":"Mencuci mata dengan air"},{"term":"Limbal ischemia","arti":"Iskemia area limbus akibat trauma kimia","penjelasan":"Kurang darah di area limbus kornea"},{"term":"Keratic precipitates (KP)","arti":"Deposito sel inflamasi pada endotel kornea","penjelasan":"Bintik putih di belakang kornea"},{"term":"Descemetocele","arti":"Ulkus kornea yang mencapai membran Descemet","penjelasan":"Ulkus kornea yang hampir tembus"}],"media":[{"mediaId":"media-slide-12-1","caption":"Gambar grading trauma kimia mata (Roper-Hall)","placement":"card-body"},{"mediaId":"media-slide-12-2","caption":"Fenomena satelit pada keratitis fungal","placement":"card-body"}],"crosslinks":[{"label":"Glaukoma → Hiphema","targetSlideId":"slide-14","reason":"Hipema dapat menyebabkan glaukoma sekunder akibat blockage angle"},{"label":"Adneksa → Lacerasi palpebra","targetSlideId":"slide-10","reason":"Trauma sering melibatkan kelopak mata dan kanalikulus"}]},{"id":"slide-13","number":13,"title":"Katarak","subtitle":"Cataract: etiologi, patogenesis, klasifikasi, dan tatalaksana","emoji":"🔍","stats":[{"val":"#1","lbl":"Penyebab kebutaan terhindari di dunia","emoji":"🌍"},{"val":">50 tahun","lbl":"Usia paling sering katarak senilis","emoji":"👴"},{"val":"Phaco","lbl":"Gold standard tata laksana katarak","emoji":"✂️"}],"actions":[{"icon":"📖","label":"Flashcard","target":"flashcard","targetIndex":12},{"icon":"❓","label":"Kuis","target":"quiz","targetIndex":12},{"icon":"🔬","label":"Bedah","target":"slide","targetIndex":12}],"cards":[{"id":"slide-13-card-1","title":"Definisi & Epidemiologi","badge":"HIGH-YIELD","body":"Katarak adalah kekeruhan lensa intraokular kristalin yang menyebabkan penurunan visus. Penyebab kebutaan terhindari nomor 1 di dunia. Berkembang lambat dan tanpa nyeri. Tipe tersering: age-related (senile) cataract.","variant":"primary","items":["Lensa normal: transparan, fokus cahaya ke retina","Katarak: lensa keruh → cahaya tidak fokus → visus kabur","Prevalensi meningkat dengan usia; hampir semua >80 tahun memiliki katarak","Penanganan: tergantung derajat gangguan fungsi (aktivitas sehari-hari)"],"number":1,"content":"<p>Katarak adalah kekeruhan lensa intraokular kristalin yang menyebabkan penurunan visus. Penyebab kebutaan terhindari nomor 1 di dunia. Berkembang lambat dan tanpa nyeri. Tipe tersering: age-related (senile) cataract.</p><ul><li>Lensa normal: transparan, fokus cahaya ke retina</li><li>Katarak: lensa keruh → cahaya tidak fokus → visus kabur</li><li>Prevalensi meningkat dengan usia; hampir semua &gt;80 tahun memiliki katarak</li><li>Penanganan: tergantung derajat gangguan fungsi (aktivitas sehari-hari)</li></ul><figure class=\"codex-media-card\"><img src=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Nuclear_sclerosis.jpg\" alt=\"Fotografi slit lamp katarak nukleosklerosis pada pria usia 70 tahun menunjukkan kekeruhan lensa berwarna kuning-coklat di bagian nukleus dengan sclerosis\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" onerror=\"this.closest('figure').classList.add('image-load-failed')\"/><figcaption>Gambar slit lamp: katarak nuklear (kuning-coklat)<br><span>Imrankabirhossain (Wikimedia Commons) · CC BY-SA 4.0</span></figcaption></figure>","terms":[{"term":"Nuclear sclerosis","arti":"Pengerasan dan kompaksi nucleus lensa akibat penuaan","penjelasan":"Inti lensa mengeras karena tua"},{"term":"Crystallins","arti":"Protein lensa yang mempertahankan transparansi","penjelasan":"Protein yang membuat lensa bening"},{"term":"Phacomorphic glaucoma","arti":"Glaukoma akut akibat pembengkakan lensa katarak","penjelasan":"Katarak yang membengkak menyebabkan tekanan mata naik"},{"term":"Hypermature cataract","arti":"Katarak matur yang mengalami degenerasi lanjut","penjelasan":"Katarak yang sudah sangat tua dan rusak"}]},{"id":"slide-13-card-2","title":"Patogenesis & Risk Factors","badge":"WAJIB-TAHU","body":"Patogenesis katarak senilis multifaktorial: nuclear sclerosis (kompaksi lensa), perubahan protein lensa (crystallins) → kehilangan transparansi, pigmen lensa (kuning→coklat), perubahan ionik komponen lensa. Risk factors: DM, steroid, UV, merokok, penyakit okular (uveitis, RP), trauma, genetik, radiasi.","variant":"info","items":["Diabetes: ↑glukosa → sorbitol akumulasi → osmotic stress → katarak","Steroid: posterior subcapsular cataract (PSC) - paling sering","UV exposure: katarak kortikal dan pterigium","Trauma: rosette-shaped cataract, bisa immediate atau delayed","Merokok: 2-3x risiko katarak dibanding non-perokok"],"number":2,"content":"<p>Patogenesis katarak senilis multifaktorial: nuclear sclerosis (kompaksi lensa), perubahan protein lensa (crystallins) → kehilangan transparansi, pigmen lensa (kuning→coklat), perubahan ionik komponen lensa. Risk factors: DM, steroid, UV, merokok, penyakit okular (uveitis, RP), trauma, genetik, radiasi.</p><ul><li>Diabetes: ↑glukosa → sorbitol akumulasi → osmotic stress → katarak</li><li>Steroid: posterior subcapsular cataract (PSC) - paling sering</li><li>UV exposure: katarak kortikal dan pterigium</li><li>Trauma: rosette-shaped cataract, bisa immediate atau delayed</li><li>Merokok: 2-3x risiko katarak dibanding non-perokok</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Nuclear sclerosis","arti":"Pengerasan dan kompaksi nucleus lensa akibat penuaan","penjelasan":"Inti lensa mengeras karena tua"},{"term":"Crystallins","arti":"Protein lensa yang mempertahankan transparansi","penjelasan":"Protein yang membuat lensa bening"},{"term":"Phacomorphic glaucoma","arti":"Glaukoma akut akibat pembengkakan lensa katarak","penjelasan":"Katarak yang membengkak menyebabkan tekanan mata naik"},{"term":"Hypermature cataract","arti":"Katarak matur yang mengalami degenerasi lanjut","penjelasan":"Katarak yang sudah sangat tua dan rusak"}]},{"id":"slide-13-card-3","title":"Klasifikasi & Gejala","badge":"UTBK","body":"Klasifikasi berdasarkan etiologi: age-related (senile), traumatic, metabolic (DM, galactosemia, Wilson), congenital/genetic, drug-induced (steroid), radiation. Berdasarkan lokasi: nuclear, cortical, posterior subcapsular. Gejala: visus kabur jauh/dekat, silau (glare), kesulitan malam hari, penurunan kontras, perubahan warna.","variant":"accent","items":["Nuclear cataract: visus jauh kabur, myopic shift (indeks refraksi ↑)","Cortical cataract: silau terutama malam hari, spoke-like opacities","Posterior subcapsular: visus dekat ↓, silau, progresi cepat, terkait steroid","Mature cataract: seluruh lensa keruh, bisa cause phacomorphic glaucoma","Morgagnian cataract: nucleus liquefies dan tenggelam (hypermature)"],"number":3,"content":"<p>Klasifikasi berdasarkan etiologi: age-related (senile), traumatic, metabolic (DM, galactosemia, Wilson), congenital/genetic, drug-induced (steroid), radiation. Berdasarkan lokasi: nuclear, cortical, posterior subcapsular. Gejala: visus kabur jauh/dekat, silau (glare), kesulitan malam hari, penurunan kontras, perubahan warna.</p><ul><li>Nuclear cataract: visus jauh kabur, myopic shift (indeks refraksi ↑)</li><li>Cortical cataract: silau terutama malam hari, spoke-like opacities</li><li>Posterior subcapsular: visus dekat ↓, silau, progresi cepat, terkait steroid</li><li>Mature cataract: seluruh lensa keruh, bisa cause phacomorphic glaucoma</li><li>Morgagnian cataract: nucleus liquefies dan tenggelam (hypermature)</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Nuclear sclerosis","arti":"Pengerasan dan kompaksi nucleus lensa akibat penuaan","penjelasan":"Inti lensa mengeras karena tua"},{"term":"Crystallins","arti":"Protein lensa yang mempertahankan transparansi","penjelasan":"Protein yang membuat lensa bening"},{"term":"Phacomorphic glaucoma","arti":"Glaukoma akut akibat pembengkakan lensa katarak","penjelasan":"Katarak yang membengkak menyebabkan tekanan mata naik"},{"term":"Hypermature cataract","arti":"Katarak matur yang mengalami degenerasi lanjut","penjelasan":"Katarak yang sudah sangat tua dan rusak"}]},{"id":"slide-13-card-4","title":"Tatalaksana: Bedah Katarak","badge":"BEDAH","body":"Tidak ada obat efektif untuk mengobati atau mencegah katarak. Indikasi bedah: penurunan visus yang mengganggu aktivitas sehari-hari, causa retinopati yang memerlukan visualisasi fundus. Gold standard: phacoemulsifikasi (phaco) + IOL implantation. Prosedur lain: ECCE, SICS, femtosecond laser.","variant":"success","items":["Phaco: ultrasound emulsifikasi lensa melalui insisi kecil (2.2-2.8 mm)","IOL: intraocular lens untuk menggantikan lensa yang diekstraksi","Komplikasi: PC rupture, nucleus drop, endoftalmitis, cystoid macular edema","Prognosis: sangat baik, 95% visus membaik signifikan","Pre-op: biometri (IOL power calculation), perhitungan A-constant"],"number":4,"content":"<p>Tidak ada obat efektif untuk mengobati atau mencegah katarak. Indikasi bedah: penurunan visus yang mengganggu aktivitas sehari-hari, causa retinopati yang memerlukan visualisasi fundus. Gold standard: phacoemulsifikasi (phaco) + IOL implantation. Prosedur lain: ECCE, SICS, femtosecond laser.</p><ul><li>Phaco: ultrasound emulsifikasi lensa melalui insisi kecil (2.2-2.8 mm)</li><li>IOL: intraocular lens untuk menggantikan lensa yang diekstraksi</li><li>Komplikasi: PC rupture, nucleus drop, endoftalmitis, cystoid macular edema</li><li>Prognosis: sangat baik, 95% visus membaik signifikan</li><li>Pre-op: biometri (IOL power calculation), perhitungan A-constant</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Nuclear sclerosis","arti":"Pengerasan dan kompaksi nucleus lensa akibat penuaan","penjelasan":"Inti lensa mengeras karena tua"},{"term":"Crystallins","arti":"Protein lensa yang mempertahankan transparansi","penjelasan":"Protein yang membuat lensa bening"},{"term":"Phacomorphic glaucoma","arti":"Glaukoma akut akibat pembengkakan lensa katarak","penjelasan":"Katarak yang membengkak menyebabkan tekanan mata naik"},{"term":"Hypermature cataract","arti":"Katarak matur yang mengalami degenerasi lanjut","penjelasan":"Katarak yang sudah sangat tua dan rusak"}]}],"tables":[{"id":"slide-13-table-1","title":"Perbandingan Tipe Katarak","headers":["Parameter","Nuclear","Cortical","Posterior Subcapsular"],"rows":[["Lokasi","Nucleus lensa","Korteks lensa","Posterior subkapsular"],["Penyebab utama","Penuaan","DM, UV","Steroid, DM, trauma"],["Gejala utama","Visus jauh kabur","Silau (glare)","Visus dekat turun, silau"],["Progresi","Lambat","Sedang","Cepat"],["Warna","Kuning→coklat→hitam","Putih spoke-like","Plaque like"],["Myopic shift","Sering","Jarang","Jarang"],["Second sight","Bisa (indeks naik)","Tidak","Tidak"]]}],"quizzes":[{"id":"slide-13-quiz-1","question":"Pasien 65 tahun mengeluh visus jauh kabur, silau saat mengemudi malam, perlu kacamata minus yang lebih kuat. Slit lamp: nucleus lensa kuning-coklat. Diagnosis?","options":["Katarak kortikal","Katarak nuklear","Katarak posterior subcapsular","Uveitis anterior"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Katarak nuklear: nucleus lensa kekuningan/coklat, menyebabkan visus jauh kabur, myopic shift, dan second sight phenomenon (bisa baca tanpa kacamata). Silau terutama pada kortikal, bukan nuklear."},{"id":"slide-13-quiz-2","question":"Pasien 30 tahun menggunakan kortikosteroid topikal mata untuk uveitis kronis 1 tahun. Visus menurun drastis dalam 3 bulan terakhir, terutama saat membaca. Slit lamp: plaque putih di belakang lensa. Diagnosis?","options":["Katarak nuklear senilis","Katarak posterior subcapsular","Katarak kortikal","Katarak traumatik"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Katarak posterior subcapsular (PSC) paling sering terkait penggunaan kortikosteroid (topikal, sistemik, atau inhaled). Ciri: progresi cepat, visus dekat menurun, silau hebat. Plaque putih di belakang lensa merupakan tanda khas PSC."},{"id":"slide-13-quiz-3","question":"Gold standard tata laksana katarak matur pada dewasa saat ini adalah?","options":["ECCE dengan incisi besar","Phacoemulsifikasi + IOL implantasi","Katarak ekstraksi manual tanpa IOL","Obat pencair katarak topikal"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Phacoemulsifikasi (phaco) + IOL implantation adalah gold standard bedah katarak modern. Keuntungan: incisi kecil (2.2-2.8 mm), tanpa jahitan, pemulihan cepat. ECCE digunakan untuk katarak sangat keras atau hypermature. Tidak ada obat yang terbukti efektif untuk mengobati katarak."},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-1","question":"Gejala katarak, kecuali...","options":["Glare (silau)","Floaters (bayang-bayang melayang)","Fotopsia (kilatan cahaya)","Nyeri"],"correct":3,"explanation":"Katarak adalah kekeruhan lensa intraokular yang menyebabkan penurunan penglihatan progresif. Katarak TIDAK menyebabkan nyeri karena lensa tidak memiliki inervasi sensorik. Gejala utama meliputi visi kabur, glare, floaters, fotopsia, dan diplopia monokular."}],"flashcards":[{"term":"Katarak","arti":"Kekeruhan lensa intraokular kristalin yang menyebabkan penurunan visus","penjelasan":"Penyebab kebutaan terhindari #1 dunia. Tidak ada obat efektif. Terapi: bedah (phaco + IOL)."},{"term":"Katarak nuklear","arti":"Kekeruhan pada bagian nucleus lensa, berwarna kuning-coklat","penjelasan":"Onset lambat, myopic shift, second sight phenomenon. Tersering pada lanjut usia."},{"term":"Katarak kortikal","arti":"Kekeruhan pada bagian korteks lensa, spoke-like","penjelasan":"Silau (glare) terutama saat malam. Terkait DM dan paparan UV."},{"term":"Katarak posterior subcapsular","arti":"Kekeruhan di belakang kapsul lensa bagian posterior","penjelasan":"Progresi cepat, visus dekat turun. Terkait steroid, DM, trauma. Plaque-like appearance."},{"term":"Phacoemulsifikasi","arti":"Teknik bedah katarak menggunakan ultrasound untuk emulsifikasi lensa","penjelasan":"Gold standard. Insisi kecil (2.2-2.8 mm), tanpa jahitan. IOL dimasukkan melalui insisi kecil."},{"term":"Second sight","arti":"Fenomena dapat membaca dekat tanpa kacamata akibat katarak nuklear","penjelasan":"Akibat indeks refraksi lensa meningkat (nuclear sclerosis) → myopic shift. Sementara, nanti visus memburuk."}],"terms":[{"term":"Nuclear sclerosis","arti":"Pengerasan dan kompaksi nucleus lensa akibat penuaan","penjelasan":"Inti lensa mengeras karena tua"},{"term":"Crystallins","arti":"Protein lensa yang mempertahankan transparansi","penjelasan":"Protein yang membuat lensa bening"},{"term":"Phacomorphic glaucoma","arti":"Glaukoma akut akibat pembengkakan lensa katarak","penjelasan":"Katarak yang membengkak menyebabkan tekanan mata naik"},{"term":"Hypermature cataract","arti":"Katarak matur yang mengalami degenerasi lanjut","penjelasan":"Katarak yang sudah sangat tua dan rusak"},{"term":"Morgagnian cataract","arti":"Katarak hipermatur dengan nucleus yang liquefies","penjelasan":"Katarak tua yang intinya mencair"},{"term":"IOL (Intraocular Lens)","arti":"Lensa buatan yang dipasang setelah ekstraksi katarak","penjelasan":"Lensa pengganti setelah operasi katarak"},{"term":"PCO (Posterior Capsule Opacification)","arti":"Kekeruhan kapsul posterior setelah bedah katarak","penjelasan":"Kapsul belakang berkabut setelah operasi katarak"},{"term":"Biometri","arti":"Pengukuran parameter mata untuk perhitungan kekuatan IOL","penjelasan":"Pengukuran mata untuk menentukan lensa pengganti"},{"term":"A-constant","arti":"Konstanta yang digunakan dalam rumus perhitungan IOL","penjelasan":"Angka untuk menghitung lensa pengganti"},{"term":"Anterior chamber depth","arti":"Kedalaman bilik mata depan yang mempengaruhi perhitungan IOL","penjelasan":"Kedalaman ruang antara kornea dan iris"}],"media":[{"mediaId":"media-slide-13-1","caption":"Gambar slit lamp: katarak nuklear (kuning-coklat)","placement":"card-body"},{"mediaId":"media-slide-13-2","caption":"Diagram phacoemulsifikasi + IOL","placement":"card-body"}],"crosslinks":[{"label":"Glaukoma → Phacomorphic","targetSlideId":"slide-14","reason":"Katarak matur dapat menyebabkan glaukoma akut"},{"label":"DM → Katarak lebih cepat","targetSlideId":"slide-14","reason":"Diabetes mellitus mempercepat onset katarak"}]},{"id":"slide-14","number":14,"title":"Retina: Ablatio, Retinopati DM & HT","subtitle":"Retinal detachment, diabetic retinopathy, hypertensive retinopathy","emoji":"👁️","stats":[{"val":"3","lbl":"Tipe retinal detachment","emoji":"📐"},{"val":"#1","lbl":"Retinopati diabetik: penyebat buta usia produktif","emoji":"🩺"},{"val":"Grade 0-4","lbl":"Klasifikasi retinopati hipertensi (Scheie)","emoji":"📊"}],"actions":[{"icon":"📖","label":"Flashcard","target":"flashcard","targetIndex":13},{"icon":"❓","label":"Kuis","target":"quiz","targetIndex":13},{"icon":"🩺","label":"Screening DM","target":"slide","targetIndex":13}],"cards":[{"id":"slide-14-card-1","title":"Retinal Detachment: 3 Tipe","badge":"URGENT","body":"Retinal detachment (RD) terjadi ketika cairan subretina terakumulasi antara neurosensory retina dan RPE. Tipe: Rhegmatogenous (robekan retina → vitreus masuk subretinal), Tractional (membran proliferatif menarik retina), dan Exudative (inflamasi/massa → eksudasi cairan). RD adalah URGENT - prognosis visus sangat bergantung pada waktu tindakan.","variant":"danger","items":["Rhegmatogenous: paling umum, terkait posterior vitreous detachment (PVD), trauma, myopia patologis","Tractional: proliferative diabetic retinopathy, ROP, trauma penetrasi","Exudative: Coats disease, VKH, CSC, tumor koroid, scleritis posterior","Gejala: floaters tiba-tiba, fotopsia (kilatan cahaya), curtain/veil, visus turun","Fundus: ablatio retina (kelopak retina teranggul), RPE changes"],"subcards":[{"id":"slide-14-card-1a","title":"Risk Factors RD Rhegmatogenous","body":"Lattice degeneration, peripheral retinal breaks, myopia patologis >6D, previous intraocular surgery (cataract surgery 0.5-1% risk), trauma, previous RD fellow eye (10-15%), family history.","items":[]}],"number":1,"content":"<p>Retinal detachment (RD) terjadi ketika cairan subretina terakumulasi antara neurosensory retina dan RPE. Tipe: Rhegmatogenous (robekan retina → vitreus masuk subretinal), Tractional (membran proliferatif menarik retina), dan Exudative (inflamasi/massa → eksudasi cairan). RD adalah URGENT - prognosis visus sangat bergantung pada waktu tindakan.</p><ul><li>Rhegmatogenous: paling umum, terkait posterior vitreous detachment (PVD), trauma, myopia patologis</li><li>Tractional: proliferative diabetic retinopathy, ROP, trauma penetrasi</li><li>Exudative: Coats disease, VKH, CSC, tumor koroid, scleritis posterior</li><li>Gejala: floaters tiba-tiba, fotopsia (kilatan cahaya), curtain/veil, visus turun</li><li>Fundus: ablatio retina (kelopak retina teranggul), RPE changes</li></ul><figure class=\"codex-media-card\"><img src=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Fundus_-_diabetic_retinopathy.png\" alt=\"Fotografi fundus yang menunjukkan tanda-tanda retinopati diabetik: eksudat keras (bintik kuning), mikroaneurisma (pembengkakan pembuluh darah), dan perdarahan retina (bintik merah kabur)\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" onerror=\"this.closest('figure').classList.add('image-load-failed')\"/><figcaption>Gambar fundus: retinopati diabetik proliferatif dengan NVD<br><span>Shaofeng Hao et al., PLoS One (Wikimedia Commons) · CC BY 4.0</span></figcaption></figure>","terms":[{"term":"Microaneurysm","arti":"Dilatasi saccular dinding kapiler retina, tanda awal RD","penjelasan":"Pembuluh darah retina yang membengkak kecil"},{"term":"Hard exudates","arti":"Deposito lipid putih-kuning pada retina","penjelasan":"Bintik putih kuning di retina akibat kebocoran lipid"},{"term":"Cotton wool spots","arti":"Area iskemia aksoplasmik pada lapisan serat saraf retina","penjelasan":"Bintik putih berbulus di retina akibat iskemia"},{"term":"Neovaskularisasi","arti":"Pertumbuhan pembuluh darah abnormal baru","penjelasan":"Pembuluh darah tumbuh di tempat yang tidak seharusnya"}]},{"id":"slide-14-card-2","title":"Retinopati Diabetik (RD)","badge":"WAJIB-TAHU","body":"Retinopati diabetik adalah komplikasi mikrovaskular diabetes mellitus pada retina. Penyebab kebutaan pada usia produktif. Patogenesis: hiperglikemia → non-enzymatic glycation → iskemia mikrovaskular → VEGF ↑ → neovaskularisasi. Klasifikasi: non-proliferatif (NPDR) dan proliferatif (PDR).","variant":"accent","items":["NPDR: mild (microaneurysm saja), moderate (hemorrhages, hard exudates, CWS), severe (4-2-1 rule: hemorrhages 4 kuadran, venous beading 2 kuadran, IRMA 1 kuadran)","PDR: neovaskularisasi (NVD/NVE), vitreous hemorrhage, tractional RD","DME (Diabetic Macular Edema): edema makula → visus turun","Screening: tipe 1 DM → 5 tahun setelah diagnosis; tipe 2 DM → segera setelah diagnosis","Terapi: laser PRP (PDR), anti-VEGF intravitreal (DME/PDR), vitrectomy (PDR kompleks)"],"number":2,"content":"<p>Retinopati diabetik adalah komplikasi mikrovaskular diabetes mellitus pada retina. Penyebab kebutaan pada usia produktif. Patogenesis: hiperglikemia → non-enzymatic glycation → iskemia mikrovaskular → VEGF ↑ → neovaskularisasi. Klasifikasi: non-proliferatif (NPDR) dan proliferatif (PDR).</p><ul><li>NPDR: mild (microaneurysm saja), moderate (hemorrhages, hard exudates, CWS), severe (4-2-1 rule: hemorrhages 4 kuadran, venous beading 2 kuadran, IRMA 1 kuadran)</li><li>PDR: neovaskularisasi (NVD/NVE), vitreous hemorrhage, tractional RD</li><li>DME (Diabetic Macular Edema): edema makula → visus turun</li><li>Screening: tipe 1 DM → 5 tahun setelah diagnosis; tipe 2 DM → segera setelah diagnosis</li><li>Terapi: laser PRP (PDR), anti-VEGF intravitreal (DME/PDR), vitrectomy (PDR kompleks)</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Microaneurysm","arti":"Dilatasi saccular dinding kapiler retina, tanda awal RD","penjelasan":"Pembuluh darah retina yang membengkak kecil"},{"term":"Hard exudates","arti":"Deposito lipid putih-kuning pada retina","penjelasan":"Bintik putih kuning di retina akibat kebocoran lipid"},{"term":"Cotton wool spots","arti":"Area iskemia aksoplasmik pada lapisan serat saraf retina","penjelasan":"Bintik putih berbulus di retina akibat iskemia"},{"term":"Neovaskularisasi","arti":"Pertumbuhan pembuluh darah abnormal baru","penjelasan":"Pembuluh darah tumbuh di tempat yang tidak seharusnya"}]},{"id":"slide-14-card-3","title":"Retinopati Hipertensi","badge":"KLINIS","body":"Retinopati hipertensi meliputi dua proses: efek akut (vasospasm autoregulasi) dan efek kronik (arteriosklerosis). Klasifikasi Modified Scheie: Grade 0-4. Dapat menyebabkan retinopathy, optic neuropathy, dan choroidopathy. Predisposisi ke: CRAO, CRVO, macroaneurysma, dan progresi retinopati diabetik.","variant":"info","items":["Fase vasokonstriktif: arteriol narrowing dan vasospasm","Fase sklerotik: intimal thickening, copper/silver wiring, AV nipping","Fase eksudatif: hemorrhages, hard exudates, cotton wool spots, edema","Grade 4: Grade 3 + papilledema = malignant hypertension → EMERGENCY","Terapi: kontrol tekanan darah! (kolaborasi dengan dokter interna)"],"number":3,"content":"<p>Retinopati hipertensi meliputi dua proses: efek akut (vasospasm autoregulasi) dan efek kronik (arteriosklerosis). Klasifikasi Modified Scheie: Grade 0-4. Dapat menyebabkan retinopathy, optic neuropathy, dan choroidopathy. Predisposisi ke: CRAO, CRVO, macroaneurysma, dan progresi retinopati diabetik.</p><ul><li>Fase vasokonstriktif: arteriol narrowing dan vasospasm</li><li>Fase sklerotik: intimal thickening, copper/silver wiring, AV nipping</li><li>Fase eksudatif: hemorrhages, hard exudates, cotton wool spots, edema</li><li>Grade 4: Grade 3 + papilledema = malignant hypertension → EMERGENCY</li><li>Terapi: kontrol tekanan darah! (kolaborasi dengan dokter interna)</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Microaneurysm","arti":"Dilatasi saccular dinding kapiler retina, tanda awal RD","penjelasan":"Pembuluh darah retina yang membengkak kecil"},{"term":"Hard exudates","arti":"Deposito lipid putih-kuning pada retina","penjelasan":"Bintik putih kuning di retina akibat kebocoran lipid"},{"term":"Cotton wool spots","arti":"Area iskemia aksoplasmik pada lapisan serat saraf retina","penjelasan":"Bintik putih berbulus di retina akibat iskemia"},{"term":"Neovaskularisasi","arti":"Pertumbuhan pembuluh darah abnormal baru","penjelasan":"Pembuluh darah tumbuh di tempat yang tidak seharusnya"}]},{"id":"slide-14-card-4","title":"Tatalaksana Retina","badge":"TERAPI","body":"Retinal detachment: semua retinal breaks harus diidentifikasi dan ditutup. Teknik: pneumatic retinopexy, scleral buckle, vitrectomy + gas/silicone oil. PDR: panretinal photocoagulation (PRP) untuk mengurangi VEGF. DME: anti-VEGF (ranibizumab, aflibercept, bevacizumab) intravitreal. Retinopati hipertensi: kontrol TD primer.","variant":"success","items":["Pneumatic retinopexy: gas bubble + cryotherapy/laser untuk RD superior dengan break tunggal","Scleral buckle: indentation sklera untuk mendukung area breaks","Vitrectomy: untuk PVD kompleks, tractional RD, vitreous hemorrhage","Anti-VEGF: ranibizumab, aflibercept, bevacizumab untuk DME dan neovaskularisasi","Follow-up RD: posisi facedown (gas), monitor IOP, redetachment 5-10%"],"number":4,"content":"<p>Retinal detachment: semua retinal breaks harus diidentifikasi dan ditutup. Teknik: pneumatic retinopexy, scleral buckle, vitrectomy + gas/silicone oil. PDR: panretinal photocoagulation (PRP) untuk mengurangi VEGF. DME: anti-VEGF (ranibizumab, aflibercept, bevacizumab) intravitreal. Retinopati hipertensi: kontrol TD primer.</p><ul><li>Pneumatic retinopexy: gas bubble + cryotherapy/laser untuk RD superior dengan break tunggal</li><li>Scleral buckle: indentation sklera untuk mendukung area breaks</li><li>Vitrectomy: untuk PVD kompleks, tractional RD, vitreous hemorrhage</li><li>Anti-VEGF: ranibizumab, aflibercept, bevacizumab untuk DME dan neovaskularisasi</li><li>Follow-up RD: posisi facedown (gas), monitor IOP, redetachment 5-10%</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Microaneurysm","arti":"Dilatasi saccular dinding kapiler retina, tanda awal RD","penjelasan":"Pembuluh darah retina yang membengkak kecil"},{"term":"Hard exudates","arti":"Deposito lipid putih-kuning pada retina","penjelasan":"Bintik putih kuning di retina akibat kebocoran lipid"},{"term":"Cotton wool spots","arti":"Area iskemia aksoplasmik pada lapisan serat saraf retina","penjelasan":"Bintik putih berbulus di retina akibat iskemia"},{"term":"Neovaskularisasi","arti":"Pertumbuhan pembuluh darah abnormal baru","penjelasan":"Pembuluh darah tumbuh di tempat yang tidak seharusnya"}]}],"tables":[{"id":"slide-14-table-1","title":"Modified Scheie Classification of Hypertensive Retinopathy","headers":["Grade","Kriteria"],"rows":[["Grade 0","Tidak ada perubahan"],["Grade 1","Arteriolar narrowing barely detectable"],["Grade 2","Obvious arterial narrowing + focal irregularities + AV nipping"],["Grade 3","Grade 2 + retinal hemorrhages + exudates + cotton wool spots + retinal edema"],["Grade 4","Grade 3 + PAPILLEDEMA (malignant hypertension)"]]},{"id":"slide-14-table-2","title":"Klasifikasi Retinopati Diabetik","headers":["Tipe","Kriteria"],"rows":[["Mild NPDR","Microaneurysm saja"],["Moderate NPDR","Hemorrhages, hard exudates, cotton wool spots, venous beading"],["Severe NPDR","4-2-1 rule: Hemo 4 kuadran + VB 2 kuadran + IRMA 1 kuadran"],["PDR","Neovaskularisasi (NVD/NVE) + vitreous hemorrhage/tractional RD"]]}],"quizzes":[{"id":"slide-14-quiz-1","question":"Pria 55 tahun, DM tipe 2 10 tahun, visus turun bilateral. Fundus: microaneurysm, dot-blot hemorrhages, hard exudates di makula, cotton wool spots. Diagnosis?","options":["Mild NPDR","Moderate NPDR + DME","Severe NPDR","PDR"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Moderate NPDR: microaneurysm + hemorrhages + hard exudates + cotton wool spots. Edema makula → DME (diabetic macular edema). Belum PDR karena belum ada neovaskularisasi. Belum severe NPDR karena tidak memenuhi 4-2-1 rule."},{"id":"slide-14-quiz-2","question":"Pria 60 tahun pusing, hipertensi terkontrol buruk 180/110. Visus 6/9 bilateral. Fundus: arterial narrowing, AV nipping, hemorrhages, cotton wool spots, dan papilledema bilateral. Grade retinopati hipertensi?","options":["Grade 2","Grade 3","Grade 4 (malignant)","Grade 1"],"correct":2,"explanation":"Grade 4 hypertensive retinopathy = Grade 3 + papilledema. Ini adalah malignant hypertension - EMERGENCY medis. Memerlukan penurunan TD segera dan evaluasi sistemik menyeluruh (ginjal, jantung, CNS)."},{"id":"slide-14-quiz-3","question":"Pasien 45 tahun tiba-tiba melihat kilatan cahaya di mata kanan, floaters banyak, dan seperti tirai menutupi visus. Visus 3/60. Diagnosis dan tindakan?","options":["Vitreous hemorrhage, observasi","Rhegmatogenous retinal detachment, segera bedah","Posterior vitreous detachment, rujuk 1 bulan","Retinal vein occlusion, anti-VEGF"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Trias RD rhegmatogenous: fotopsia (kilatan cahaya dari vitreous traction), floaters (vitreous hemorrhage/PVD), curtain/veil (area detachment). Ini adalah URGENT - prognosis visus sangat bergantung pada waktu tindakan bedah (<24-72 jam untuk makula-on RD)."},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-3","question":"Gejala ablasio retina, kecuali...","options":["Floater (bayang melayang)","Buram mendadak","Tirai/gorden gelap","Nyeri"],"correct":3,"explanation":"Ablasio retina adalah terlepasnya neurosensory retina dari retinal pigment epithelium (RPE). Gejalanya: floaters, penglihatan buram mendadak, bayangan gelap seperti tirai (shade), dan fotopsia (kilatan cahaya). Ablasio retina TIDAK menyebabkan nyeri karena retina tidak memiliki nociceptor."},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-27","question":"Kelainan mata akibat defisiensi vitamin A adalah...","options":["Hipopigmentasi retina","Age-related macular degeneration","Ablasio retina","Katarak senilis"],"correct":0,"explanation":"Vitamin A (retinol) esensial untuk fototransduksi (rhodopsin di rod cells). Defisiensi menyebabkan: (1) night blindness (xerophthalmia stage 1), (2) conjunctival xerosis (dryness), (3) Bitot spots (foamy patches), (4) corneal xerosis/ulceration/melting, (5) hipopigmentasi retina. AMD, ablasio retina, katarak, dan glaukoma BUKAN akibat defisiensi vitamin A."}],"flashcards":[{"term":"Retinal detachment (RD)","arti":"Pelepasan neurosensory retina dari RPE akibat akumulasi cairan subretina","penjelasan":"3 tipe: rhegmatogenous, tractional, exudative. Emergency! Tanda: floaters, fotopsia, curtain, visus turun."},{"term":"Rhegmatogenous RD","arti":"RD akibat robekan retina yang memungkinkan vitreus masuk ke subretinal space","penjelasan":"Paling umum. Terkait PVD, myopia, trauma. Terapi: pneumatic retinopexy, scleral buckle, atau vitrectomy."},{"term":"Retinopati diabetik non-proliferatif (NPDR)","arti":"Kerusakan mikrovaskular retina DM tanpa neovaskularisasi","penjelasan":"Mild: microaneurysm saja. Moderate: hemorrhages, exudates, CWS. Severe: 4-2-1 rule."},{"term":"Retinopati diabetik proliferatif (PDR)","arti":"RD dengan neovaskularisasi retina akibat iskemia","penjelasan":"NVD/NVE → vitreous hemorrhage, tractional RD. Terapi: PRP laser, anti-VEGF, vitrectomy."},{"term":"Diabetic Macular Edema (DME)","arti":"Edema makula akibat retinopati diabetik","penjelasan":"Penyebab utama visus turun pada DM. Terapi: anti-VEGF intravitreal (ranibizumab, aflibercept), laser fokal/grid."},{"term":"Malignant hypertension","arti":"Hipertensi dengan grade 4 retinopathy (papilledema)","penjelasan":"Emergency! Papilledema + retinal hemorrhages/exudates + TD sangat tinggi. Memerlukan penurunan TD segera."},{"term":"Anti-VEGF intravitreal","arti":"Obat anti-vascular endothelial growth factor yang disuntikkan ke dalam vitreus","penjelasan":"Ranibizumab, aflibercept, bevacizumab. Untuk DME, PDR, AMD eksudatif, CRVO. Mengurangi edema dan neovaskularisasi."}],"terms":[{"term":"Microaneurysm","arti":"Dilatasi saccular dinding kapiler retina, tanda awal RD","penjelasan":"Pembuluh darah retina yang membengkak kecil"},{"term":"Hard exudates","arti":"Deposito lipid putih-kuning pada retina","penjelasan":"Bintik putih kuning di retina akibat kebocoran lipid"},{"term":"Cotton wool spots","arti":"Area iskemia aksoplasmik pada lapisan serat saraf retina","penjelasan":"Bintik putih berbulus di retina akibat iskemia"},{"term":"Neovaskularisasi","arti":"Pertumbuhan pembuluh darah abnormal baru","penjelasan":"Pembuluh darah tumbuh di tempat yang tidak seharusnya"},{"term":"Vitreous hemorrhage","arti":"Perdarahan ke dalam badan kaca","penjelasan":"Darah masuk ke dalam vitreus"},{"term":"Panretinal photocoagulation (PRP)","arti":"Laser ke seluruh retina perifer untuk mengurangi iskemia","penjelasan":"Laser retina untuk mengurangi pertumbuhan pembuluh darah abnormal"},{"term":"AV nipping","arti":"Penyempitan vena di titik persilangan dengan arteri hipertrofi","penjelasan":"Pembuluh vena terjepit saat bersilangan dengan arteri"},{"term":"Copper wiring","arti":"Dinding arteri yang menebal dan memantulkan cahaya seperti tembaga","penjelasan":"Pembuluh arteri retina berwarna tembaga"},{"term":"Silver wiring","arti":"Dinding arteri yang sangat menebal dan memantulkan cahaya seperti perak","penjelasan":"Pembuluh arteri retina berwarna perak"},{"term":"Lattice degeneration","arti":"Degenerasi retina perifer dengan ikatan vitreus abnormal","penjelasan":"Area retina perifer yang tipis dan rawan robek"}],"media":[{"mediaId":"media-slide-14-1","caption":"Gambar fundus: retinopati diabetik proliferatif dengan NVD","placement":"card-body"},{"mediaId":"media-slide-14-2","caption":"Gambar fundus: hypertensive retinopathy grade 3-4","placement":"card-body"}],"crosslinks":[{"label":"Vaskular → CRVO, CRAO","targetSlideId":"slide-15","reason":"Retinopati hipertensi predisposisi ke CRVO dan CRAO"},{"label":"AMD → Anti-VEGF juga digunakan","targetSlideId":"slide-15","reason":"Anti-VEGF intravitreal digunakan untuk AMD eksudatif juga"}]},{"id":"slide-15","number":15,"title":"Vaskular Retina & Neuro-Oftalmologi","subtitle":"CRVO, CRAO, AMD, Neuritis Optik & Papiledema","emoji":"🧠","stats":[{"val":"90 menit","lbl":"Window terapi CRAO sebelum kerusakan permanen","emoji":"⏱️"},{"val":"10-15%","lbl":"AMD eksudatif dari seluruh kasus AMD","emoji":"📊"},{"val":"20%","lbl":"Neuritis optik yang merupakan presentasi awal MS","emoji":"🧩"}],"actions":[{"icon":"📖","label":"Flashcard","target":"flashcard","targetIndex":14},{"icon":"❓","label":"Kuis","target":"quiz","targetIndex":14},{"icon":"⚡","label":"Emergency","target":"slide","targetIndex":14}],"cards":[{"id":"slide-15-card-1","title":"CRVO: Central Retinal Vein Occlusion","badge":"VASKULAR","body":"CRVO adalah oklusi vena retina sentral di lamina cribrosa. Patogenesis mengikuti Virchow triad: vessel damage, stasis, hypercoagulability. Aterosklerosis arteri kompresi vena di AV crossing. Dibagi: non-ischemic (perfused, ~75%) dan ischemic (non-perfused, ~25%).","variant":"accent","items":["Non-ischemic CRVO: visus 20/200 atau lebih baik, RAPD ringan/absen, edema makula","Ischemic CRVO: visus <20/200, RAPD marked, extensive hemorrhages 4 kuadran, CWS, disc edema","Complications: macular edema, neovascular glaucoma (NVG), vitreous hemorrhage","Work-up: BP, FBS, lipid, ESR, protein electrophoresis; <50 tahun: thrombophilia screen","Terapi: anti-VEGF untuk macular edema (first-line), PRP untuk iris neovaskularisasi/NVG"],"number":1,"content":"<p>CRVO adalah oklusi vena retina sentral di lamina cribrosa. Patogenesis mengikuti Virchow triad: vessel damage, stasis, hypercoagulability. Aterosklerosis arteri kompresi vena di AV crossing. Dibagi: non-ischemic (perfused, ~75%) dan ischemic (non-perfused, ~25%).</p><ul><li>Non-ischemic CRVO: visus 20/200 atau lebih baik, RAPD ringan/absen, edema makula</li><li>Ischemic CRVO: visus &lt;20/200, RAPD marked, extensive hemorrhages 4 kuadran, CWS, disc edema</li><li>Complications: macular edema, neovascular glaucoma (NVG), vitreous hemorrhage</li><li>Work-up: BP, FBS, lipid, ESR, protein electrophoresis; &lt;50 tahun: thrombophilia screen</li><li>Terapi: anti-VEGF untuk macular edema (first-line), PRP untuk iris neovaskularisasi/NVG</li></ul><figure class=\"codex-media-card\"><img src=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/file/Cherry_red_spot_in_patient_with_central_retinal_artery_occlusion_(CRAO).jpg\" alt=\"Fotografi fundus menunjukkan central retinal artery occlusion (CRAO) dengan cherry red spot di makula dan retinal whitening (edema retina putih susu) di sekitarnya\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" onerror=\"this.closest('figure').classList.add('image-load-failed')\"/><figcaption>Fundus CRAO: cherry red spot + retinal whitening<br><span>Dr. Gopal Bisht (Wikimedia Commons) · CC BY-SA 4.0</span></figcaption></figure>","terms":[{"term":"Oklusi vena retina","arti":"Penyumbatan vena retina akibat thrombosis","penjelasan":"Vena retina tersumbat"},{"term":"Oklusi arteri retina","arti":"Penyumbatan arteri retina oleh emboli atau thrombus","penjelasan":"Arteri retina tersumbat"},{"term":"Neovaskularisasi koroidal (CNV)","arti":"Pertumbuhan pembuluh darah abnormal dari koroid ke retina","penjelasan":"Pembuluh darah baru tumbuh dari bawah retina"},{"term":"Geographic atrophy","arti":"Atrofi RPE dan fotoreseptor pada AMD non-eksudatif","penjelasan":"Area retina yang mengalami atrofi pada AMD kering"}]},{"id":"slide-15-card-2","title":"CRAO: Central Retinal Artery Occlusion (EMERGENCY)","badge":"EMERGENCY","body":"CRAO adalah EMERGENCY oftalmologi dan stroke. Okulusi arteri retina sentral → iskemia inner retina. Gejala: sudden painless vision loss dalam hitungan detik. Classic signs: retinal whitening (edema NFL) + cherry red spot (fovea tidak memiliki NFL). Window terapi: 90 menit untuk menyelamatkan retina.","variant":"danger","items":["Etiologi: emboli (carotid plaque, cardiac), thrombus, vasculitis, trauma","Fundus: retinal whitening, cherry red spot, boxcaring arteri, RAPD","Embolus sources: cholesterol (Hollenhorst plaque), platelet-fibrin, calcific","Tatalaksana EMERGENCY: digital massage, paracentesis AC, carbogen inhalasi","Rujuk stroke center: 50% memiliki stroke tersembunyi; MRI/MRA, EKG, carotid US","Branch RAO: hemifield defect; cilioretinal artery sparing: visus bisa 20/20"],"subcards":[{"id":"slide-15-card-2a","title":"Bedah CRAO vs CRVO vs Neuritis Optik","body":"","items":["CRAO: sudden painless vision loss + cherry red spot + retinal whitening","CRVO: sudden painless blurred vision + dot-blot hemorrhages 4 kuadran","Neuritis optik: painful vision loss + RAPD + normal fundus awal (retrobulbar)"]}],"number":2,"content":"<p>CRAO adalah EMERGENCY oftalmologi dan stroke. Okulusi arteri retina sentral → iskemia inner retina. Gejala: sudden painless vision loss dalam hitungan detik. Classic signs: retinal whitening (edema NFL) + cherry red spot (fovea tidak memiliki NFL). Window terapi: 90 menit untuk menyelamatkan retina.</p><ul><li>Etiologi: emboli (carotid plaque, cardiac), thrombus, vasculitis, trauma</li><li>Fundus: retinal whitening, cherry red spot, boxcaring arteri, RAPD</li><li>Embolus sources: cholesterol (Hollenhorst plaque), platelet-fibrin, calcific</li><li>Tatalaksana EMERGENCY: digital massage, paracentesis AC, carbogen inhalasi</li><li>Rujuk stroke center: 50% memiliki stroke tersembunyi; MRI/MRA, EKG, carotid US</li><li>Branch RAO: hemifield defect; cilioretinal artery sparing: visus bisa 20/20</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Oklusi vena retina","arti":"Penyumbatan vena retina akibat thrombosis","penjelasan":"Vena retina tersumbat"},{"term":"Oklusi arteri retina","arti":"Penyumbatan arteri retina oleh emboli atau thrombus","penjelasan":"Arteri retina tersumbat"},{"term":"Neovaskularisasi koroidal (CNV)","arti":"Pertumbuhan pembuluh darah abnormal dari koroid ke retina","penjelasan":"Pembuluh darah baru tumbuh dari bawah retina"},{"term":"Geographic atrophy","arti":"Atrofi RPE dan fotoreseptor pada AMD non-eksudatif","penjelasan":"Area retina yang mengalami atrofi pada AMD kering"}]},{"id":"slide-15-card-3","title":"AMD: Age-Related Macular Degeneration","badge":"GERIATRI","body":"AMD adalah penyebab kebutaan utama pada populasi >50 tahun di negara maju. 85-90% non-exudative (dry), 10-15% exudative (wet). Risk factors: usia >75 tahun, merokok, genetik (CFH, ARMS2), kardiovaskular. Dry: drusen + geographic atrophy. Wet: CNV (choroidal neovascularization) + subretinal fluid/hemorrhage.","variant":"warning","items":["Dry AMD: drusen (hard <63μm, soft >63μm), RPE changes, geographic atrophy","Wet AMD: CNV → subretinal fluid, hemorrhage, fibrosis → severe vision loss","Amsler grid: self-monitoring untuk deteksi dini konversi dry→wet","Terapi wet: anti-VEGF intravitreal (ranibizumab, aflibercept, bevacizumab)","AREDS2 suplemen (vit C, E, zinc, copper, lutein, zeaxanthin) untuk intermediate AMD","Anti-VEGF: injeksi bulanan awal, kemudian extend interval; tujuannya dry macula"],"number":3,"content":"<p>AMD adalah penyebab kebutaan utama pada populasi &gt;50 tahun di negara maju. 85-90% non-exudative (dry), 10-15% exudative (wet). Risk factors: usia &gt;75 tahun, merokok, genetik (CFH, ARMS2), kardiovaskular. Dry: drusen + geographic atrophy. Wet: CNV (choroidal neovascularization) + subretinal fluid/hemorrhage.</p><ul><li>Dry AMD: drusen (hard &lt;63μm, soft &gt;63μm), RPE changes, geographic atrophy</li><li>Wet AMD: CNV → subretinal fluid, hemorrhage, fibrosis → severe vision loss</li><li>Amsler grid: self-monitoring untuk deteksi dini konversi dry→wet</li><li>Terapi wet: anti-VEGF intravitreal (ranibizumab, aflibercept, bevacizumab)</li><li>AREDS2 suplemen (vit C, E, zinc, copper, lutein, zeaxanthin) untuk intermediate AMD</li><li>Anti-VEGF: injeksi bulanan awal, kemudian extend interval; tujuannya dry macula</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Oklusi vena retina","arti":"Penyumbatan vena retina akibat thrombosis","penjelasan":"Vena retina tersumbat"},{"term":"Oklusi arteri retina","arti":"Penyumbatan arteri retina oleh emboli atau thrombus","penjelasan":"Arteri retina tersumbat"},{"term":"Neovaskularisasi koroidal (CNV)","arti":"Pertumbuhan pembuluh darah abnormal dari koroid ke retina","penjelasan":"Pembuluh darah baru tumbuh dari bawah retina"},{"term":"Geographic atrophy","arti":"Atrofi RPE dan fotoreseptor pada AMD non-eksudatif","penjelasan":"Area retina yang mengalami atrofi pada AMD kering"}]},{"id":"slide-15-card-4","title":"Neuritis Optik & Papiledema","badge":"NEURO-OPHTHALMOLOGY","body":"Neuritis optik: inflamasi nervus optik, onset akut unilateral, painful visual loss, RAPD, warna ↓, visus ↓. Retrobulbar ON: disc normal. Terkait MS (~20% presentasi awal MS). Terapi: IV methylprednisolone 250mg q6h 3 hari (ONTT). Papiledema: edema diskus optik akibat increased ICP (bukan inflamasi).","variant":"info","items":["Neuritis optik: young adult female, pain with eye movement, RAPD, Uthoff phenomenon","Papiledema: bilateral (unless atrophic disc), headache, nausea, pulsatile tinnitus","Papiledema DD: malignant HTN, brain tumor, IIH, cerebral venous thrombosis","Work-up papilledema: MRI+MRVC, LP (opening pressure), blood pressure","Papilledema bisa asymptomatic! Visual symptoms: transient obscurations, peripheral loss","IIH (idiopathic intracranial hypertension): young obese female, normal MRI/LP pressure >25"],"number":4,"content":"<p>Neuritis optik: inflamasi nervus optik, onset akut unilateral, painful visual loss, RAPD, warna ↓, visus ↓. Retrobulbar ON: disc normal. Terkait MS (~20% presentasi awal MS). Terapi: IV methylprednisolone 250mg q6h 3 hari (ONTT). Papiledema: edema diskus optik akibat increased ICP (bukan inflamasi).</p><ul><li>Neuritis optik: young adult female, pain with eye movement, RAPD, Uthoff phenomenon</li><li>Papiledema: bilateral (unless atrophic disc), headache, nausea, pulsatile tinnitus</li><li>Papiledema DD: malignant HTN, brain tumor, IIH, cerebral venous thrombosis</li><li>Work-up papilledema: MRI+MRVC, LP (opening pressure), blood pressure</li><li>Papilledema bisa asymptomatic! Visual symptoms: transient obscurations, peripheral loss</li><li>IIH (idiopathic intracranial hypertension): young obese female, normal MRI/LP pressure &gt;25</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Oklusi vena retina","arti":"Penyumbatan vena retina akibat thrombosis","penjelasan":"Vena retina tersumbat"},{"term":"Oklusi arteri retina","arti":"Penyumbatan arteri retina oleh emboli atau thrombus","penjelasan":"Arteri retina tersumbat"},{"term":"Neovaskularisasi koroidal (CNV)","arti":"Pertumbuhan pembuluh darah abnormal dari koroid ke retina","penjelasan":"Pembuluh darah baru tumbuh dari bawah retina"},{"term":"Geographic atrophy","arti":"Atrofi RPE dan fotoreseptor pada AMD non-eksudatif","penjelasan":"Area retina yang mengalami atrofi pada AMD kering"}]}],"tables":[{"id":"slide-15-table-1","title":"Perbedaan CRAO, CRVO, dan Neuritis Optik","headers":["Parameter","CRAO","CRVO","Neuritis Optik"],"rows":[["Onset","Detik","Hari","Hari-minggu"],["Nyeri","Tidak","Tidak","Nyeri (eye movement)"],["Visus","NLP-6/60","20/200-6/12","6/6-NLP"],["Fundus","Cherry red spot, whitening","Hemorrhages 4 kuadran","Normal (retrobulbar) atau disc hyperemia"],["RAPD","+++","+ (ischemic) atau -","++"],["Emergency","YA (stroke)","Urgent","Urgent tapi tidak emergent"],["Terapi","Digital massage, AC tap","Anti-VEGF, PRP","IVMP (ONTT)"]]}],"quizzes":[{"id":"slide-15-quiz-1","question":"Pria 65 tahun, DM, hipertensi, visus tiba-tiba turun mata kiri tanpa nyeri. Fundus: dot-blot hemorrhages seluruh 4 kuadran, disc edema, tortuous veins. Diagnosis?","options":["CRAO","CRVO","Neuritis optik","AMD eksudatif"],"correct":1,"explanation":"CRVO classic: sudden painless blurred vision + dot-blot/flame hemorrhages 4 kuadran + tortuous veins + optic disc edema. Beda dengan CRAO (cherry red spot), neuritis optik (painful, RAPD, no hemorrhages), AMD (age >50, drusen, CNV)."},{"id":"slide-15-quiz-2","question":"Wanita 30 tahun visus turun mata kanan selama 3 hari, nyeri saat gerakkan mata, warna terlihat pudar. Visus 3/60, RAPD (+), disc tampak normal. Diagnosis?","options":["CRAO","CRVO","Retrobulbar optic neuritis","AMD"],"correct":2,"explanation":"Retrobulbar ON: young adult female + painful visual loss + RAPD + color vision ↓ + NORMAL fundus (inflammasi di belakang globe). 20% merupakan presentasi awal MS. Terapi: IVMP 250mg q6h 3 hari (ONTT protocol). Beda dengan CRAO/CRVO (no pain, older, abnormal fundus)."},{"id":"slide-15-quiz-3","question":"Wanita 28 tahun obesitas (BMI 35), pusing kronik 3 bulan. Pemeriksaan: papilledema bilateral, visus 6/6, normal neurologic. MRI+MRV normal. LP: opening pressure 32 cmH2O. Diagnosis?","options":["Brain tumor","IIH (idiopathic intracranial hypertension)","Malignant hypertension","Optic neuritis bilateral"],"correct":1,"explanation":"IIH (pseudotumor cerebri): young obese female + headache + papilledema bilateral + normal MRI/MRV + elevated LP opening pressure (>25 cmH2O). Terapi: weight loss, acetazolamide, topiramate. Beda dengan malignant HTN (TD sangat tinggi + retinopathy), brain tumor (MRI abnormal)."}],"flashcards":[{"term":"CRAO","arti":"Oklusi arteri retina sentral - EMERGENCY oftalmologi dan stroke","penjelasan":"Sudden painless vision loss, cherry red spot, retinal whitening. Window terapi 90 menit. Rujuk stroke center segera."},{"term":"CRVO","arti":"Oklusi vena retina sentral, penyebab tersering setelah RD","penjelasan":"Non-ischemic (75%): visus lebih baik. Ischemic (25%): visus buruk, risiko NVG. Terapi: anti-VEGF untuk ME."},{"term":"AMD eksudatif (wet)","arti":"AMD dengan CNV dan subretinal fluid/hemorrhage","penjelasan":"10-15% kasus AMD tapi 80-90% kebutaan AMD. Terapi: anti-VEGF intravitreal. AREDS2 suplemen untuk intermediate."},{"term":"Drusen","arti":"Deposito ekstraselular di bawah RPE, tanda patognomonik AMD","penjelasan":"Hard drusen (<63μm): normal aging. Soft drusen (>125μm): risk factor AMD. Intermediate AMD: extensive soft drusen."},{"term":"Neuritis optik","arti":"Inflamasi nervus optik akibat demyelinisasi","penjelasan":"Young adult female, painful vision loss, RAPD, color desaturation. Terkait MS. Terapi: IVMP (ONTT)."},{"term":"Papiledema","arti":"Edema diskus optik akibat increased ICP","penjelasan":"Bilateral (unless atrophic), normal visual acuity early. DD: tumor, IIH, venous sinus thrombosis, malignant HTN."},{"term":"Cherry red spot","arti":"Tampilan fovea merah cerah di tengah retina putih (edema)","penjelasan":"Tanda khas CRAO. Fovea terlihat merah karena tidak memiliki nerve fiber layer. Juga terlihat pada Tay-Sachs, Niemann-Pick, central retinal artery occlusion."},{"term":"IIH (idiopathic intracranial hypertension)","arti":"Peningkatan ICP tanpa penyebab yang jelas","penjelasan":"Young obese female, headache, papilledema, normal MRI, LP pressure >25 cmH2O. Terapi: weight loss, acetazolamide."}],"terms":[{"term":"Oklusi vena retina","arti":"Penyumbatan vena retina akibat thrombosis","penjelasan":"Vena retina tersumbat"},{"term":"Oklusi arteri retina","arti":"Penyumbatan arteri retina oleh emboli atau thrombus","penjelasan":"Arteri retina tersumbat"},{"term":"Neovaskularisasi koroidal (CNV)","arti":"Pertumbuhan pembuluh darah abnormal dari koroid ke retina","penjelasan":"Pembuluh darah baru tumbuh dari bawah retina"},{"term":"Geographic atrophy","arti":"Atrofi RPE dan fotoreseptor pada AMD non-eksudatif","penjelasan":"Area retina yang mengalami atrofi pada AMD kering"},{"term":"RAPD (relative afferent pupillary defect)","arti":"Defek pupil aferen relatif akibat gangguan pre-ganglion nervus optik","penjelasan":"Pupil tidak berkontraksi dengan baik saat cahaya diberikan"},{"term":"Marcus Gunn pupil","arti":"Tanda klinis RAPD yang terdeteksi dengan swinging flashlight test","penjelasan":"Tes lampu goyang untuk melihat defek pupil"},{"term":"Increased ICP","arti":"Peningkatan tekanan intrakranial di atas normal (normal 7-15 mmHg)","penjelasan":"Tekanan di dalam kepala meningkat"},{"term":"Optic disc edema","arti":"Edema diskus optik dari berbagai etiologi (bukan hanya increased ICP)","penjelasan":"Pembengkakan ujung sarur optik"},{"term":"Lamina cribrosa","arti":"Area jaringan ikat berlubang tempat serat nervus optik keluar dari globe","penjelasan":"Jaringan berpori di ujung sarur optik"},{"term":"Hollenhorst plaque","arti":"Embolus kolesterol yang terlihat di bifurkasi arteri retina","penjelasan":"Gumpalan kolesterol di pembuluh darah retina"}],"media":[{"mediaId":"media-slide-15-1","caption":"Fundus CRAO: cherry red spot + retinal whitening","placement":"card-body"},{"mediaId":"media-slide-15-2","caption":"Fundus CRVO: dot-blot hemorrhages 4 kuadran","placement":"card-body"}],"crosslinks":[{"label":"Retinopati DM → CRVO","targetSlideId":"slide-14","reason":"DM merupakan risk factor CRVO"},{"label":"Glaukoma → NVG dari CRVO","targetSlideId":"slide-16","reason":"CRVO iskemik dapat menyebabkan neovascular glaucoma"}]},{"id":"slide-16","number":16,"title":"Farmakologi, Radiologi & Patologi","subtitle":"Ocular pharmacology, radiology imaging, dan pathology mata","emoji":"💊","stats":[{"val":"ADME","lbl":"Farmakokinetik obat ocular","emoji":"⚗️"},{"val":"6","lbl":"Modalitas radiologi mata","emoji":"📡"},{"val":"Kalazion","lbl":"Lesi inflamasi palpebra tersering","emoji":"🔬"}],"actions":[{"icon":"📖","label":"Flashcard","target":"flashcard","targetIndex":15},{"icon":"❓","label":"Kuis","target":"quiz","targetIndex":15},{"icon":"🔬","label":"Patologi","target":"slide","targetIndex":15}],"cards":[{"id":"slide-16-card-1","title":"Ocular Pharmacology: ADME & Routes","badge":"FARMAKOLOGI","body":"Farmakokinetik obat mata mengikuti ADME. Rute pemberian: topikal (tetes, salep), subkonjungtival, sub-Tenon, intrakorneal, intravitreal, retrobulbar. Formulasi: gels, ointments, solid inserts, collagen shields. Topikal paling umum tapi bioavailabilitas rendah (<5%) karena nasolakrimal drainage.","variant":"primary","items":["Absorption: dipengaruhi dwell time, nasolacrimal drainage, protein binding, diffusion kornea","Distribution: aqueous humor → struktur intraokular → sirkulasi sistemik via trabecular meshwork","Metabolisme: esterases, oxidoreductases di mata; prodrugs (dipivefrin → epinephrine)","Eliminasi: ginjal (acetazolamide, mannitol) atau hati (timolol, local anesthetics)","Nasolacrimal drainage → systemic absorption (β-blocker dapat cause bradikardia!)"],"number":1,"content":"<p>Farmakokinetik obat mata mengikuti ADME. Rute pemberian: topikal (tetes, salep), subkonjungtival, sub-Tenon, intrakorneal, intravitreal, retrobulbar. Formulasi: gels, ointments, solid inserts, collagen shields. Topikal paling umum tapi bioavailabilitas rendah (&lt;5%) karena nasolakrimal drainage.</p><ul><li>Absorption: dipengaruhi dwell time, nasolacrimal drainage, protein binding, diffusion kornea</li><li>Distribution: aqueous humor → struktur intraokular → sirkulasi sistemik via trabecular meshwork</li><li>Metabolisme: esterases, oxidoreductases di mata; prodrugs (dipivefrin → epinephrine)</li><li>Eliminasi: ginjal (acetazolamide, mannitol) atau hati (timolol, local anesthetics)</li><li>Nasolacrimal drainage → systemic absorption (β-blocker dapat cause bradikardia!)</li></ul><figure class=\"codex-media-card codex-media-source-card\"><div class=\"codex-source-preview\"><strong>Media sumber internet</strong><span>URL ini adalah halaman sumber, bukan file gambar langsung.</span></div><figcaption>Tabel obat glaukoma dan mekanisme kerja<br><span>American Academy of Ophthalmology EyeWiki · AAO EyeWiki License</span><br><a href=\"https://eyewiki.aao.org/Glaucoma_Medications\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Buka sumber gambar</a></figcaption></figure>","terms":[{"term":"Nasolacrimal drainage","arti":"Sistem drainase air mata dari konjungtiva ke hidung","penjelasan":"Saluran pembuangan air mata ke hidung"},{"term":"Precorneal tear film","arti":"Lapisan air mata yang menutupi kornea","penjelasan":"Lapisan cairan pelindung di permukaan kornea"},{"term":"Prodrug","arti":"Obat tidak aktif yang dikonversi menjadi aktif di tubuh","penjelasan":"Obat yang baru aktif setelah diubah tubuh"},{"term":"Corneal penetration","arti":"Kemampuan obat menembus kornea","penjelasan":"Obat masuk ke dalam kornea"}]},{"id":"slide-16-card-2","title":"Obat-obatan Ocular Penting","badge":"WAJIB-TAHU","body":"Klasifikasi obat mata: autonomic agents (cholinergic, anticholinergic, adrenergic, β-blocker), prostaglandin analogues, carbonic anhydrase inhibitors, anti-infectives (antibacterial, antiviral, antifungal), anti-inflammatory (steroid, NSAID), anti-VEGF.","variant":"accent","items":["Cholinergic (Pilocarpine): ↑aqueous outflow, untuk pupillary block glaucoma","Anticholinergic (Atropine, Tropicamide): sikloplegia + midriasis; CONTRA pada angle-closure","β-blocker (Timolol, Betaxolol): ↓aqueous production; efek sistemik: bradikardi, bronchospasm","Prostaglandin analogues (Latanoprost, Bimatoprost): ↑uveoscleral outflow; first-line OAG","Anti-VEGF (Ranibizumab, Aflibercept): DME, wet AMD, CRVO, PDR"],"subcards":[{"id":"slide-16-card-2a","title":"Topical Antibacterial Agents","body":"Aminoglycosides (gentamycin, tobramycin): protein synthesis inhibitor. Fluoroquinolones (ciprofloxacin, moxifloxacin): DNA gyrase inhibitor. Macrolides (azithromycin, erythromycin): protein synthesis inhibitor. Sulfonamides (sulfacetamide): anti-folate.","items":[]}],"number":2,"content":"<p>Klasifikasi obat mata: autonomic agents (cholinergic, anticholinergic, adrenergic, β-blocker), prostaglandin analogues, carbonic anhydrase inhibitors, anti-infectives (antibacterial, antiviral, antifungal), anti-inflammatory (steroid, NSAID), anti-VEGF.</p><ul><li>Cholinergic (Pilocarpine): ↑aqueous outflow, untuk pupillary block glaucoma</li><li>Anticholinergic (Atropine, Tropicamide): sikloplegia + midriasis; CONTRA pada angle-closure</li><li>β-blocker (Timolol, Betaxolol): ↓aqueous production; efek sistemik: bradikardi, bronchospasm</li><li>Prostaglandin analogues (Latanoprost, Bimatoprost): ↑uveoscleral outflow; first-line OAG</li><li>Anti-VEGF (Ranibizumab, Aflibercept): DME, wet AMD, CRVO, PDR</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Nasolacrimal drainage","arti":"Sistem drainase air mata dari konjungtiva ke hidung","penjelasan":"Saluran pembuangan air mata ke hidung"},{"term":"Precorneal tear film","arti":"Lapisan air mata yang menutupi kornea","penjelasan":"Lapisan cairan pelindung di permukaan kornea"},{"term":"Prodrug","arti":"Obat tidak aktif yang dikonversi menjadi aktif di tubuh","penjelasan":"Obat yang baru aktif setelah diubah tubuh"},{"term":"Corneal penetration","arti":"Kemampuan obat menembus kornea","penjelasan":"Obat masuk ke dalam kornea"}]},{"id":"slide-16-card-3","title":"Pemeriksaan Radiologi pada Penyakit Mata","badge":"RADIOLOGI","body":"Modalitas radiologi untuk mata: foto polos (fraktur orbita, corpus alienum), USG orbita (B-scan, A-scan, CDFI), CT scan (tulang orbita, calcification, emergensi trauma), MRI (lesi intraorbital, soft tissue, optic nerve, chiasm), angiography (CTA/MRA untuk carotid-cavernous fistel), radionuclear (dacryoscintigraphy, brachytherapy uveal melanoma).","variant":"info","items":["Foto polos: fraktur rim orbita, corpus alienum radio-opaque, destruksi tulang","CT scan: bone algorithm untuk fraktur, soft tissue untuk abses/hematoma","MRI: protokol orbita (thin axial T1, coronal T2, DWI, post-contrast fat-sat T1)","USG orbita: transocular (evaluasi globe, ON, EOM) dan paraocular (beyond muscle cone)","Kontraindikasi USG: globe rupture (risiko ekstrusi isi mata)"],"number":3,"content":"<p>Modalitas radiologi untuk mata: foto polos (fraktur orbita, corpus alienum), USG orbita (B-scan, A-scan, CDFI), CT scan (tulang orbita, calcification, emergensi trauma), MRI (lesi intraorbital, soft tissue, optic nerve, chiasm), angiography (CTA/MRA untuk carotid-cavernous fistel), radionuclear (dacryoscintigraphy, brachytherapy uveal melanoma).</p><ul><li>Foto polos: fraktur rim orbita, corpus alienum radio-opaque, destruksi tulang</li><li>CT scan: bone algorithm untuk fraktur, soft tissue untuk abses/hematoma</li><li>MRI: protokol orbita (thin axial T1, coronal T2, DWI, post-contrast fat-sat T1)</li><li>USG orbita: transocular (evaluasi globe, ON, EOM) dan paraocular (beyond muscle cone)</li><li>Kontraindikasi USG: globe rupture (risiko ekstrusi isi mata)</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Nasolacrimal drainage","arti":"Sistem drainase air mata dari konjungtiva ke hidung","penjelasan":"Saluran pembuangan air mata ke hidung"},{"term":"Precorneal tear film","arti":"Lapisan air mata yang menutupi kornea","penjelasan":"Lapisan cairan pelindung di permukaan kornea"},{"term":"Prodrug","arti":"Obat tidak aktif yang dikonversi menjadi aktif di tubuh","penjelasan":"Obat yang baru aktif setelah diubah tubuh"},{"term":"Corneal penetration","arti":"Kemampuan obat menembus kornea","penjelasan":"Obat masuk ke dalam kornea"}]},{"id":"slide-16-card-4","title":"Patologi Mata","badge":"PATOLOGI","body":"Patologi mata dibagi: inflamasi, non-neoplastik, neoplastik. Kelopak mata: kalazion (lipogranuloma, foamy histiocytes, giant cell Touton), granuloma piogenikum (lobular, ulserasi, proliferasi granulasi). Kornea: pterygium (degenerasi elastik), pinguekula (degenerasi hialin). Retina: AMD (drusen, CNV), RD. Intraocular: melanoma uvea (spindle, epithelioid), retinoblastoma (rosettes Homer-Wright, Flexner-Wintersteiner).","variant":"warning","items":["Kalazion: inflamasi tersering palpebra; lipogranuloma kelenjar sebaseous","Granuloma piogenikum: lobular capillary hemangioma; trauma/post-surgery","Melanoma uvea: tumor intraokular primer tersering pada dewasa; prognosis buruk jika epithelioid","Retinoblastoma: tumor intraokular tersering pada anak; leukocoria, RB1 gene mutation","Papiloma: benign, koilocytosis (HPV related); karsinoma sel basal: palisading, retraction artifact"],"number":4,"content":"<p>Patologi mata dibagi: inflamasi, non-neoplastik, neoplastik. Kelopak mata: kalazion (lipogranuloma, foamy histiocytes, giant cell Touton), granuloma piogenikum (lobular, ulserasi, proliferasi granulasi). Kornea: pterygium (degenerasi elastik), pinguekula (degenerasi hialin). Retina: AMD (drusen, CNV), RD. Intraocular: melanoma uvea (spindle, epithelioid), retinoblastoma (rosettes Homer-Wright, Flexner-Wintersteiner).</p><ul><li>Kalazion: inflamasi tersering palpebra; lipogranuloma kelenjar sebaseous</li><li>Granuloma piogenikum: lobular capillary hemangioma; trauma/post-surgery</li><li>Melanoma uvea: tumor intraokular primer tersering pada dewasa; prognosis buruk jika epithelioid</li><li>Retinoblastoma: tumor intraokular tersering pada anak; leukocoria, RB1 gene mutation</li><li>Papiloma: benign, koilocytosis (HPV related); karsinoma sel basal: palisading, retraction artifact</li></ul>","terms":[{"term":"Nasolacrimal drainage","arti":"Sistem drainase air mata dari konjungtiva ke hidung","penjelasan":"Saluran pembuangan air mata ke hidung"},{"term":"Precorneal tear film","arti":"Lapisan air mata yang menutupi kornea","penjelasan":"Lapisan cairan pelindung di permukaan kornea"},{"term":"Prodrug","arti":"Obat tidak aktif yang dikonversi menjadi aktif di tubuh","penjelasan":"Obat yang baru aktif setelah diubah tubuh"},{"term":"Corneal penetration","arti":"Kemampuan obat menembus kornea","penjelasan":"Obat masuk ke dalam kornea"}]}],"tables":[{"id":"slide-16-table-1","title":"Autonomic Drugs for Ophthalmic Use","headers":["Kelas","Mekanisme","Agen","Indikasi","Efek Samping"],"rows":[["Cholinergic","Stimulasi muskarinik receptor → ↑outflow","Pilocarpine 0.25-2%","Pupillary block glaucoma","Miosis, brow ache, myopic shift"],["Anticholinergic","Blok muskarinik → sikloplegia","Atropine 1%, Tropicamide 1%","Sikloplegia, uveitis","Fotofobia, angle-closure risk"],["α-agonist","Stimulasi α2 → ↓aqueous production","Brimonidine 0.15%","Glaukoma terbuka","Fatigue, dry mouth, alergy"],["β-blocker","↓aqueous production","Timolol 0.5%, Betaxolol 0.5%","Glaukoma terbuka","Bradikardi, bronchospasm"],["PG analog","↑uveoscleral outflow","Latanoprost, Bimatoprost","First-line OAG","Iris pigmentation, lash growth"],["CAI","Inhibit CA → ↓aqueous","Dorzolamide, Acetazolamide","Glaukoma","Metallic taste, parestesia"]]},{"id":"slide-16-table-2","title":"Modalitas Radiologi: Indikasi dan Pilihan","headers":["Modalitas","Indikasi Utama","Keunggulan","Keterbatasan"],"rows":[["Foto Polos","Fraktur orbita, corpus alienum","Cepat, murah, wide availability","Soft tissue limited"],["CT Scan","Fraktur, calcification, emergensi","Bone detail, cepat","Radiasi, iodine contrast risk"],["MRI","Lesions intraorbital, ON, chiasma","Soft tissue superior, no radiation","Slow, contraindicated pacemaker/ferromagnetic"],["USG Orbita","Superficial lesions, children, vascular","No radiation, real-time, cheap","Operator dependent, limited depth"],["Angiography","CC fistula, vascular malformation","Gold standard vaskular","Invasive, kontras"],["Radionuclear","Dacryoscintigraphy, melanoma","Functional imaging","Low resolution, availability"]]}],"quizzes":[{"id":"slide-16-quiz-1","question":"Obat first-line untuk open-angle glaucoma dengan mekanisme ↑uveoscleral outflow adalah?","options":["Timolol","Latanoprost","Dorzolamide","Brimonidine"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Prostaglandin analogues (latanoprost, bimatoprost, travoprost) adalah first-line therapy untuk open-angle glaucoma karena mekanisme facilitate aqueous outflow through uveoscleral pathway. Diberikan once daily. Efek samping: iris pigmentation ↑, eyelash growth, macular edema (rare)."},{"id":"slide-16-quiz-2","question":"Pasien dengan glaukoma menggunakan timolol 0.5% 2x/hari. Pulmonary function test menunjukkan bronchospasm. Obat pengganti yang paling tepat?","options":["Pilocarpine","Betaxolol","Latanoprost","Atropine"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Timolol adalah non-selective β-blocker yang dapat menyebabkan bronchospasm. Betaxolol adalah β1-selective blocker yang lebih aman pada pasien dengan penyakit paru obstruktif. Alternatif: latanoprost (PG analogue) juga aman untuk paru."},{"id":"slide-16-quiz-3","question":"Anak 3 tahun dengan leukokoria (white pupil reflex) pada mata kanan. USG menunjukkan massa intraokular. Diagnosis patologi yang paling mungkin?","options":["Melanoma uvea","Retinoblastoma","Katarak kongenital","Persistent hyperplastic primary vitreous"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Retinoblastoma adalah tumor intraokular tersering pada anak (median age 18 months). Tanda: leukokoria (white pupil reflex), strabismus. Histopatologi: rosettes (Homer-Wright, Flexner-Wintersteiner). Melanoma uvea jarang pada anak. Katarak kongenital juga bisa leukokoria tapi tidak massa. PHPV: microphthalmia + stalk vitreus."}],"flashcards":[{"term":"ADME (ocular)","arti":"Absorption, Distribution, Metabolism, Elimination obat pada mata","penjelasan":"Bioavailabilitas topikal <5% karena nasolacrimal drainage. Metabolisme oleh esterases di kornea. Eliminasi via ginjal/hati."},{"term":"Prostaglandin analogues","arti":"First-line therapy OAG; ↑uveoscleral outflow","penjelasan":"Latanoprost, bimatoprost, travoprost. Once daily. Efek: iris pigmentation ↑, lash growth. Tidak ada systemic side effects."},{"term":"β-blocker topikal","arti":"Menurunkan produksi aqueous humor","penjelasan":"Timolol (non-selective), betaxolol (β1-selective). Efek sistemik: bradikardi, bronchospasm, depresi. Kontraindikasi: asthma, bradikardi."},{"term":"CT scan orbita","arti":"Modalitas pilihan untuk fraktur orbita dan calcification","penjelasan":"Bone algorithm, cepat, available emergensi. Kontraindikasi relatif: pregnancy, iodine contrast allergy."},{"term":"MRI orbita","arti":"Gold standard untuk lesi intraorbital dan optic nerve","penjelasan":"Protokol: thin axial T1, coronal T2, DWI, post-contrast fat-sat T1. Superior soft tissue. Kontra: pacemaker, ferromagnetic FB."},{"term":"Kalazion","arti":"Lipogranuloma kelenjar Meibom - inflamasi tersering palpebra","penjelasan":"Histopatologi: lipogranuloma, foamy histiocytes, giant cell Touton. Differential: hordeolum, basal cell carcinoma."},{"term":"Retinoblastoma","arti":"Tumor intraokular tersering anak, median age 18 bulan","penjelasan":"Leukokoria, strabismus. RB1 tumor suppressor gene. Rosettes: Homer-Wright, Flexner-Wintersteiner. Enucleation untuk advanced unilateral."},{"term":"Melanoma uvea","arti":"Tumor intraokular primer tersering dewasa","penjelasan":"Choroid > ciliary body > iris. Sel spindle (baik) atau epithelioid (buruk). COMS staging. Enucleation atau plaque radiotherapy."}],"terms":[{"term":"Nasolacrimal drainage","arti":"Sistem drainase air mata dari konjungtiva ke hidung","penjelasan":"Saluran pembuangan air mata ke hidung"},{"term":"Precorneal tear film","arti":"Lapisan air mata yang menutupi kornea","penjelasan":"Lapisan cairan pelindung di permukaan kornea"},{"term":"Prodrug","arti":"Obat tidak aktif yang dikonversi menjadi aktif di tubuh","penjelasan":"Obat yang baru aktif setelah diubah tubuh"},{"term":"Corneal penetration","arti":"Kemampuan obat menembus kornea","penjelasan":"Obat masuk ke dalam kornea"},{"term":"Intraocular pressure (IOP)","arti":"Tekanan di dalam mata, normal 10-21 mmHg","penjelasan":"Tekanan di dalam bola mata"},{"term":"Aqueous humor","arti":"Cairan bening yang mengisi bilik mata depan dan posterior","penjelasan":"Cairan pelumas di dalam mata"},{"term":"Trabecular meshwork","arti":"Jaringan pembuangan aqueous humor di sudut anterior","penjelasan":"Saringan pembuangan cairan mata"},{"term":"Lipogranuloma","arti":"Granuloma yang mengandung lemak, khas kalazion","penjelasan":"Benjolan radang yang berisi lemak"},{"term":"Rosette","arti":"Susunan sel tumor dalam pola melingkar","penjelasan":"Sel tumor tersusun melingkar"},{"term":"Leukokoria","arti":"Refleks pupil putih sebagai pengganti refleks merah normal","penjelasan":"Pupil terlihat putih"}],"media":[{"mediaId":"media-slide-16-1","caption":"Tabel obat glaukoma dan mekanisme kerja","placement":"card-body"},{"mediaId":"media-slide-16-2","caption":"MRI orbita: axial T1-weighted post-contrast","placement":"card-body"}],"crosslinks":[{"label":"Glaukoma → Obat-obatan","targetSlideId":"slide-14","reason":"Terapi glaukoma menggunakan obat-obatan autonomic agents"},{"label":"Retinopati DM → Anti-VEGF","targetSlideId":"slide-14","reason":"Anti-VEGF intravitreal digunakan untuk DME dan PDR"},{"label":"AMD → Anti-VEGF","targetSlideId":"slide-15","reason":"Anti-VEGF intravitreal untuk AMD eksudatif"}]}]};
  var SOAL_MASTER = {"metadata":{"appName":"Mega Atlas Blok","subject":"Mega Atlas Blok Kedokteran","audience":"Mahasiswa Kedokteran","version":"v1.0.0","releaseId":"REL-2026-05-25-001","projectId":"ATLAS-BLOK-2026-001","generatedAt":"2026-05-25T20:54:36","language":"id","author":"ARSY","soalSet":"A","totalSoal":40,"bloomDistribution":{"L1":3,"L2":17,"L3":20},"difficultyDistribution":{"easy":22,"medium":17,"hard":1},"categoryDistribution":{"knowledge":17,"clinical":23},"slideMapping":{"slide-1":1,"slide-10":1,"slide-11":1,"slide-12":4,"slide-13":1,"slide-14":2,"slide-3":4,"slide-4":2,"slide-5":4,"slide-6":14,"slide-8":2},"examOnlyCount":4,"validationStatus":"VALIDATED","checks":{"duplicates":"PASS (0 duplicates)","canonicalAnswer":"PASS (all have correctAnswerKey + jawabanBenar)","explanationCompleteness":"PASS (all have ringkas + lengkap)","optionsCount":"PASS (all have 5 options)","slideMapping":"36/40 mapped to slides"}},"soal":[{"id":"soal-A-1","questionNumber":1,"bloomLevel":2,"source":"original","category":"knowledge","difficulty":"easy","soalOriginal":{"text":"Gejala katarak, kecuali...","caseContext":""},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Glare (silau)","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"Floaters (bayang-bayang melayang)","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Fotopsia (kilatan cahaya)","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Nyeri","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"E","text":"Penglihatan ganda (diplopia monokular)","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"D","jawabanBenar":"D","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Katarak adalah kekeruhan lensa intraokular yang menyebabkan penurunan penglihatan progresif. Katarak TIDAK menyebabkan nyeri karena lensa tidak memiliki inervasi sensorik. Gejala utama meliputi visi kabur, glare, floaters, fotopsia, dan diplopia monokular.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Katarak adalah kekeruhan pada lensa crystallina mata yang menyebabkan penurunan ketajaman penglihatan secara progresif. Kondisi ini merupakan penyebab kebutaan reversible paling umum di dunia. Katarak dapat bersifat kongenital, dewasa (age-related), atau sekunder akibat trauma, medikasi (kortikosteroid), atau penyakit sistemik (diabetes mellitus).","patofisiologi":"Pada katarak senilis (paling umum), terjadi degenerasi serat lensa akibat penumpukan produk degradasi protein lensa. Proses ini melibatkan oksidasi, glikosilasi, dan cross-linking protein. Akibatnya, transparansi lensa menurun, indeks bias berubah, dan akomodasi terganggu. Kekerasan lensa meningkat seiring usia (nukleosklerosis).","presentasiKlinis":"Gejala katarak meliputi: vison kabur progresif, peningkatan silau (glare) terutama saat malam hari, perubahan warna (kuning/coklat), diplopia monokular, dan peningkatan kebutuhan cahaya untuk membaca. Pasien sering mengganti kacamata berulang kali. Stadium: incipient, immature, mature, hypermature (Morgagnian).","diagnosis":"Diagnosis klinis berdasarkan anamnesis dan pemeriksaan oftalmoskopi dengan pupil dilatasi. Lensa tampak keruh. Pemeriksaan penunjang: tes visus, biometri (penentuan IOL), keratometri, dan OCT makula. Skor LOCS (Lens Opacities Classification System) digunakan untuk grading.","tatalaksana":"Tatalaksana definitif: operasi facoemulsifikasi dengan implantasi intraocular lens (IOL). Indikasi: penurunan aktivitas fungsional akibat penglihatan. Komplikasi: PCO (posterior capsule opacification), endoftalmitis, desisment retina. Tanpa operasi, katarak tidak bisa sembuh dengan obat tetes."},"highYieldPoints":["Katarak TIDAK menyebabkan nyeri – ini pembeda dengan glaukoma akut","Diplopia monokular adalah gejala khas katarak (bukan strabismus)","Glare malam hari adalah gejala awal katarak posterior subkapsular","Katarak traumatica: bunga katarak (rosette-shaped)","Tatalaksana definitif hanya operasi, obat tetes tidak efektif"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"A","mengapaSalah":"Glare/silau merupakan gejala khas katarak terutama tipe posterior subkapsular. Kekeruhan lensa menyebabkan dispersi cahaya ke retina.","konsepMisconception":"Mahasiswa mengira glare hanya akibat gangguan refraksi atau kornea","penjelasanKonsep":"Glare pada katarak disebabkan dispersi cahaya oleh opasitas lensa. Tipe posterior subkapsular paling menyebabkan glare karena lokasinya dekat nodal point mata."},{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"Floaters dapat terjadi pada katarak karena fragmen lensa yang lepas ke vitreus (lens particle in vitreous).","konsepMisconception":"Floaters hanya dianggap berasal dari vitreus saja","penjelasanKonsep":"Floaters dapat berasal dari berbagai sumber: vitreous degeneration, PVD, retinal break, dan juga fragmen lensa pada katarak trauma."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"Fotopsia (kilatan cahaya) dapat terjadi pada katarak terutama tipe kortikal. Cahaya yang melewati wedging kortikal lensa menyebabkan efek prismatik.","konsepMisconception":"Fotopsia hanya akibat PVD atau retinal tear","penjelasanKonsep":"Walaupun fotopsia paling sering akibat vitreoretinal traction, katarak kortikal juga dapat menyebabkan kilatan cahaya akibat efek refraktif opasitas kortikal."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Diplopia monokular (penglihatan ganda dengan satu mata terbuka) merupakan gejala khas katarak. Ini berbeda dengan diplopia binokuler yang akibat neuropati N. III, IV, VI.","konsepMisconception":"Semua diplopia adalah akibat masalah otot mata/kelumpuhan saraf okulomotorius","penjelasanKonsep":"Diplopia monokular = refraktif/katarak/lens subluxation. Diplopia binokuler = neuromuskular (CN III, IV, VI, myasthenia, thyroid eye disease). Pembedaan ini krusial diagnostik."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Katarak","subtopik":["Patofisiologi katarak","Klasifikasi katarak","Gejala klinis katarak","Tatalaksana katarak"],"medicalTerms":["Katarak senilis","Nukleosklerosis","Phacomorphic glaucoma","Aphakia","Pseudophakia","IOL"],"differentialDiagnosis":["Glaukoma","Degenerasi makula","Retinopati diabetikum","Uveitis"],"clinicalPearls":["Katarak umum di usia >60 tahun","Fakoemulsifikasi adalah gold standard","PCO dapat terjadi pasca operasi"],"examHighYield":["Gejala katarak (kecuali nyeri)","Indikasi operasi","Komplikasi katarak"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Memahami gejala klinis katarak dan membedakannya dengan kondisi lain yang menyebabkan nyeri mata","assessmentIntent":"Menguji pengetahuan dasar gejala katarak, khususnya pemahaman bahwa katarak tidak menyebabkan nyeri","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Katarak menyebabkan nyeri","whyCommon":"Pasien sering datang dengan keluhan perih","correction":"Katarak tidak nyeri; nyeri menunjukkan glaukoma, uveitis, atau trauma"}],"clinicalSignificance":"Katarak adalah penyebab kebutaan reversible nomor 1 dunia. Early detection dan referral untuk fakoemulsifikasi dapat mengembalikan visus."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","expandableSections":[{"title":"Definisi & Konsep","content":"Katarak = kekeruhan lensa","order":1},{"title":"Gejala Khas","content":"Visus kabur, glare, floaters, fotopsia, diplopia monokular - SEMUA TANPA NYERI","order":2}],"highlightedContent":["Katarak TIDAK menyebabkan NYERI"],"relatedContentLinks":[]},"slideMapping":"slide-13","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"D","jawabanBenar":"D","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-2","questionNumber":2,"bloomLevel":3,"source":"original","category":"clinical","difficulty":"medium","soalOriginal":{"text":"Tn F usia 23 tahun, pendengaran berkurang telinga kanan 3 hari, nyeri, keluar cairan nanah, demam (sudah tidak demam). Pemeriksaan otoskopi: perforasi membran timpani. Tatalaksana?","caseContext":"Pasien muda dengan OMA stadium perforasi"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"NaCl 3% dan antibiotik","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"Irigasi telinga dengan NaCl 0,9% dan antibiotik","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"C","text":"Dekongestan nasal","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Analgesik saja","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Pemberian karbogliserin","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"B","jawabanBenar":"B","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"OMA (Otitis Media Akut) stadium perforasi ditatalaksani dengan irigasi telinga menggunakan NaCl 0,9% untuk membersihkan sekret/nanah dan pemberian antibiotik sistemik. NaCl 3% digunakan untuk serumen prop, bukan OMA. Dekongestan tidak mengatasi infeksi.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Otitis Media Akut (OMA) adalah infeksi telinga tengah akut dengan gejala: onset mendadak, tanda inflamasi telinga tengah, dan cairan di belakang membran timpani. Stadium: akut tanpa perforasi, akut dengan perforasi, dan kronik.","patofisiologi":"OMA dimulai dengan disfungsi tuba Eustachius yang menyebabkan akumulasi cairan di telinga tengah. Sekunder infeksi oleh bakteri (S. pneumoniae, H. influenzae, M. catarrhalis). Peningkatan tekanan menyebabkan perforasi MT spontan dengan keluaran sekret purulen.","presentasiKlinis":"Trias OMA: otalgia (nyeri telinga), otorrhea (keluar cairan), dan gangguan pendengaran. Stadium perforasi: keluar cairan nanah dari liang telinga, nyeri berkurang setelah perforasi. Otoskopi: perforasi MT, cairan purulen di telinga tengah.","diagnosis":"Diagnosis klinis: otoskopi (hiperemis MT, bulging, atau perforasi), pneumatic otoscopy (mobilitas MT berkurang). Pemeriksaan penunjang: tympanogram type B. Tidak perlu kultur rutin kecuali OMA kronik.","tatalaksana":"Tatalaksana OMA stadium perforasi: (1) Irigasi telinga dengan NaCl 0,9% atau H2O2 untuk membersihkan sekret; (2) Antibiotik sistemik: amoksisilin 500mg TDS 7-10 hari; (3) Analgesik; (4) Telinga harus tetap kering. Prognosis: perforasi umumnya sembuh spontan dalam 1-3 bulan."},"highYieldPoints":["OMA stadium perforasi: IRIGASI + ANTIBIOTIK","NaCl 3% digunakan untuk serumen prop, bukan OMA","Patogen utama OMA: S. pneumoniae, H. influenzae, M. catarrhalis","Perforasi MT spontan pada OMA = drainage alami, prognosis baik","Telinga harus dijaga kering selama masa penyembuhan"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"A","mengapaSalah":"NaCl 3% adalah hipertonik digunakan untuk serumen prop (menghancurkan cerumen dengan osmosis). Pada OMA stadium perforasi, NaCl 3% dapat menyebabkan iritasi dan tidak membersihkan sekret purulen dengan efektif.","konsepMisconception":"Semua larutan irigasi telinga sama","penjelasanKonsep":"NaCl 0,9% (isotonik) untuk OMA/bersihkan sekret. NaCl 3% (hipertonik) untuk serumenolisis. H2O3% untuk antiseptik irigasi. Pemilihan irigasi tergantung kondisi."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"Dekongestan nasal (pseudoefedrin, oksimetazolin) hanya membantu drainase telinga tengah melalui tuba Eustachius pada OMA stadium akut tanpa perforasi. Pada stadium perforasi, fokus adalah eradikasi infeksi.","konsepMisconception":"Dekongestan adalah tatalaksana utama semua OMA","penjelasanKonsep":"Dekongestan membantu ventilasi tuba Eustachius tapi tidak mengobati infeksi yang sudah terjadi. Pada perforasi, antibiotik sistemik dan irigasi lokal lebih penting."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"Analgesik hanya mengatasi nyeri symptomatik. Tanpa antibiotik, infeksi bakteri akan persisten dan dapat menyebar ke struktur sekitar (mastoiditis, meningitis, abses otak).","konsepMisconception":"OMA akan sembuh sendiri tanpa antibiotik","penjelasanKonsep":"OMA bakteri memerlukan antibiotik untuk eradikasi. Watchful waiting hanya untuk OMA ringan tanmas pada anak 6 bulan-2 tahun. Stadium perforasi menunjukkan infeksi signifikan."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Karbogliserin adalah cerumenolytic agent untuk melembutkan serumen. Tidak ada indikasi dalam OMA.","konsepMisconception":"Semua obat tetes telinga dapat digunakan untuk kondisi apapun","penjelasanKonsep":"Karbogliserin = cerumenolytic (soften wax). Antibiotik telinga (kandisin, ofloksasin) untuk OMA eksterna. Obat tetes harus dipilih sesuai diagnosis."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Otitis Media Akut","subtopik":["Patofisiologi OMA","Stadium OMA","Tatalaksana OMA","Komplikasi OMA"],"medicalTerms":["Myringitis","Tympanosclerosis","Mastoiditis","Cholesteatoma","Otorrhea"],"differentialDiagnosis":["OMA eksterna","Serumen prop","Trauma telinga","Tuberkulosis telinga"],"clinicalPearls":["OMA paling sering pada anak 6-36 bulan","Amoksisilin adalah lini pertama","Mastoiditis adalah komplikasi utama"],"examHighYield":["Tatalaksana OMA stadium perforasi","Komplikasi OMA","Patogen OMA"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Memahami tatalaksana OMA stadium perforasi dan membedakan irigasi yang tepat","assessmentIntent":"Menguji pengetahuan tatalaksana OMA perforasi dan pemilihan larutan irigasi","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"NaCl 3% digunakan untuk OMA","whyCommon":"Keduanya adalah irigasi telinga","correction":"NaCl 0,9% untuk OMA, NaCl 3% untuk serumen"}],"clinicalSignificance":"OMA yang tidak ditatalaksana dengan benar dapat menyebabkan mastoiditis, meningitis, dan abses otak."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","expandableSections":[{"title":"Stadium OMA","content":"Akut tanpa perforasi → Akut dengan perforasi → Kronik","order":1},{"title":"Tatalaksana","content":"Irigasi NaCl 0,9% + Antibiotik sistemik","order":2}],"highlightedContent":["NaCl 0,9% untuk OMA, NaCl 3% untuk serumen"],"relatedContentLinks":[]},"slideMapping":"slide-3","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"B","jawabanBenar":"B","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-3","questionNumber":3,"bloomLevel":2,"source":"original","category":"knowledge","difficulty":"easy","soalOriginal":{"text":"Gejala ablasio retina, kecuali...","caseContext":""},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Floater (bayang melayang)","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"Buram mendadak","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Tirai/gorden gelap","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Nyeri","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"E","text":"Silau (photopsia)","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"D","jawabanBenar":"D","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Ablasio retina adalah terlepasnya neurosensory retina dari retinal pigment epithelium (RPE). Gejalanya: floaters, penglihatan buram mendadak, bayangan gelap seperti tirai (shade), dan fotopsia (kilatan cahaya). Ablasio retina TIDAK menyebabkan nyeri karena retina tidak memiliki nociceptor.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Ablasio retina (retinal detachment) adalah pemisahan lapisan neurosensory retina dari retinal pigment epithelium (RPE). Terdapat 3 tipe: rhegmatogenous (dengan retinal break/traksi), eksudatif, dan traksional. Rhegmatogenous adalah tipe paling umum akibat lubang/robekan retina dengan akumulasi cairan vitreus di bawah retina.","patofisiologi":"Rhegmatogenous RD: posterior vitreous detachment (PVD) → traksi vitreus pada retina → retinal tear → cairan vitreus masuk melalui tear ke subretinal space → akumulasi cairan melepas retina. Faktor risiko: miopia tinggi, trauma, katarak surgery, degenerasi lattice.","presentasiKlinis":"Trias RD: (1) Photopsia (kilatan cahaya) akibat traksi vitreus pada fotoreseptor; (2) Floaters (peningkatan tiba-tiba) dari debris vitreus/hemorrhage; (3) Shade/curtain (bayangan gelap) sesuai area detachment. Penglihatan menurun sesuai lokasi makula (macula-on/off).","diagnosis":"Oftalmoskopi tidak langsung: retinal tear (horseshoe/bullous), subretinal fluid, loss of red reflex. Ocular ultrasound bila media tidak jelas (cataract/vitreous hemorrhage). Pengukuran ketebalan retina: OCT.","tatalaksana":"Bedah vitreoretina: pneumatic retinopexy (untuk tear superior sederhana), scleral buckling, atau pars plana vitrectomy (PPV) dengan gas tamponade (SF6, C3F8) atau silicone oil. Prinsip: tutup tear + tamponade. Prognosis lebih baik jika makula masih on."},"highYieldPoints":["Ablasio retina = NYERI TAK TERJADI","Trias: Photopsia + Floaters + Curtain/shade","Tipe paling umum: rhegmatogenous","Macula status (on/off) menentukan prognosis","Emergency: RD macula-on harus dioperasi dalam 24 jam"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"A","mengapaSalah":"Floaters merupakan gejala awal ablasio retina. Disebabkan oleh pigment cells, debris vitreus, atau darah yang mengambang di vitreus akibat retinal tear.","konsepMisconception":"Floaters selalu benign (normal aging)","penjelasanKonsep":"Floaters baru yang banyak/mendadak = RED FLAG untuk RD, retinal tear, atau vitreous hemorrhage. Perlu pemeriksaan retina segera."},{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"Penurunan penglihatan mendadak merupakan gejala ablasio retina terutama jika melibatkan makula. Makula-off → visus tajam hilang. Makula-on → visus masih relatif baik.","konsepMisconception":"Penurunan visus mendadak selalu glaukoma akut","penjelasanKonsep":"Differential visus mendadak: RD, CRVO, CRAO, vitreous hemorrhage, ON iskemia. Setiap pasien dengan visus mendadak memerlukan funduskopi segera."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"Bayangan gelap seperti tirai (curtain/shade) merupakan gejala khas ablasio retina sesuai lokasi detachment. Pasien melihat area gelap yang tidak bergerak.","konsepMisconception":"Tirai gelap hanya pada stroke okular","penjelasanKonsep":"Curtain/shade pada RD disebabkan detachment area retina yang tidak lagi merespons cahaya. Ini berbeda dengan scotoma yang lebih diffus."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Photopsia (kilatan cahaya/silau) merupakan gejala awal ablasio retina rhegmatogenous akibat traksi vitreous pada fotoreseptor. Kilatan terutama saat gerakan mata.","konsepMisconception":"Photopsia hanya pada PVD sederhana","penjelasanKonsep":"Photopsia = tanda traksi vitreoretinal. Dapat terjadi pada PVD, retinal tear, atau RD. Jika disertai floaters baru → kemungkinan besar retinal tear."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Ablasio Retina","subtopik":["Tipe ablasio retina","Penyebab ablasio retina","Tanda dan gejala","Tatalaksana ablasio retina"],"medicalTerms":["Rhegmatogenous","Exudative","Tractional","Retinal tear","Pneumatic retinopexy","Scleral buckling","PPV"],"differentialDiagnosis":["Vitreous hemorrhage","CRVO","CRAO","Posterior uveitis"],"clinicalPearls":["Macula-on = emergency","Miopia tinggi = faktor risiko","Trauma dapat menyebabkan RD"],"examHighYield":["Gejala RD (kecuali nyeri)","Tipe RD","Tatalaksana"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mengidentifikasi gejala ablasio retina dan memahami bahwa nyeri bukan gejala RD","assessmentIntent":"Menguji pengetahuan gejala klinis RD sebagai emergency oftalmologi","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Ablasio retina menyebabkan nyeri","whyCommon":"Pasien datang dengan keluhan mata","correction":"RD tidak nyeri, berbeda dengan glaukoma/uveitis"}],"clinicalSignificance":"Ablasio retina adalah emergency oftalmologi. Delay tatalaksana dapat menyebabkan kebutaan permanen."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","expandableSections":[{"title":"Trias RD","content":"Photopsia + Floaters + Curtain","order":1},{"title":"Tipe RD","content":"Rhegmatogenous, Exudative, Tractional","order":2}],"highlightedContent":["RD tidak menyebabkan NYERI - ini pembeda krusial"],"relatedContentLinks":[]},"slideMapping":"slide-14","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"D","jawabanBenar":"D","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-4","questionNumber":4,"bloomLevel":2,"source":"original","category":"knowledge","difficulty":"medium","soalOriginal":{"text":"Keadaan kelopak mata tertarik ke atas sehingga tidak bisa menutup sempurna dan bisa terjadi eksplorasi kornea disebut...","caseContext":""},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Lagoftalmos","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"Retraksi palpebra","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Eksoftalmus","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Ektropion","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Trikiasis","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Lagoftalmos adalah ketidakmampuan menutup kelopak mata secara sempurna akibat kelumpuhan N. VII (facial nerve). Kelopak mata tertarik ke atas karena aksi unopposed m. levator palpebrae superioris (N. III). Konsekuensi: kornea terbuka → ekskoriasi, ulkus, dan infeksi kornea.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Lagoftalmos (lagophthalmos) berasal dari bahasa Yunani 'lagos' (kelinci) + 'ophthalmos' (mata), mengacu pada mata yang tetap terbuka seperti mata kelinci. Kondisi ini dapat bersifat paralitik (N. VII lesion), sikatrisial (cicatricial), mekanik (tumor/proptosis), atau fungsional (bell's phenomenon abnormal).","patofisiologi":"Lagoftalmos paralitik: kelumpuhan N. VII → kelemahan/paralisis m. orbicularis oculi (penutup mata) → aksi unopposed m. levator palpebrae (N. III) → kelopak terangkat. Bell's phenomenon (elevasi bola mata saat upaya menutup) merupakan mekanisme protektif. Jika abnormal → kornea terbuka.","presentasiKlinis":"Kelopak mata tidak dapat menutup saat tidur atau blinking, mata terasa kering/keringat, epifora, fotofobia, dan visus kabur akibat exposure keratopathy. Pada pemeriksaan: area kornea inferior terbuka (inferior lagophthalmos), punctate epithelial erosions, dan potensial ulkus kornea.","diagnosis":"Diagnosis klinis: inspeksi saat upaya menutup mata (gentle closure vs forced closure). Ukuran celah palpebral saat closure. Fluorescein staining menunjukkan punctate epithelial erosions di area inferior kornea. Schirmer test untuk menilai produksi air mata.","tatalaksana":"Tujuan: proteksi kornea. (1) Lubricants: artificial tears siang, ointment malam; (2) Taping kelopak mata saat tidur; (3) Moisture chamber glasses; (4) Tarsorrhaphy (sutur sementara/permanen) untuk kasus berat; (5) Tatalaksana etiologi: N. VII decompression jika indication; (6) Gold weight implant pada kelopak atas untuk membantu gravitasi menutup."},"highYieldPoints":["Lagoftalmos = N. VII lesion (facial nerve palsy)","Kelopak terangkat karena unopposed N. III (levator)","Komplikasi utama: exposure keratopathy → ulkus kornea","Bell's phenomenon = proteksi alami (elevasi bola mata)","Tarsorrhaphy = prosedur penting untuk proteksi kornea"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"Retraksi palpebra adalah kondisi kelopak mata terangkat akibat overactivity m. levator palpebrae atau fibrosis. Dapat terjadi pada Graves' disease (Dalrymple sign), bukan akibat kelumpuhan N. VII.","konsepMisconception":"Retraksi dan lagoftalmos adalah kondisi yang sama","penjelasanKonsep":"Retraksi = kelopak terangkat TANPA kelumpuhan N. VII. Lagoftalmos = kelopak tidak bisa menutup karena kelumpuhan N. VII. Bedakan: retraction = levator overaction; lagophthalmos = orbicularis weakness."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"Eksoftalmus (exophthalmos/proptosis) adalah menonjolnya bola mata anterior dari orbita, biasanya akibat peningkatan volume retrobulbar (Graves', tumor, AV malformation). Kelopak dapat menutup normal kecuali proptosis sangat berat.","konsepMisconception":"Mata yang menonjol tidak bisa ditutup = lagoftalmos","penjelasanKonsep":"Lagoftalmos paralitik disebabkan kelumpuhan penutup (orbicularis), bukan protrusi mata. Proptosis dapat menyebabkan exposure lagophthalmos (mekanik), tapi mekanisme berbeda."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"Ektropion adalah eversi (terbaliknya) kelopak mata keluar sehingga margin palpebra tidak menyentuh bola mata. Tipe: senilis (paling umum), sikatrisial, paralitik, mekanik.","konsepMisconception":"Ektropion dan lagoftalmos sama-sama kelopak tidak menutup","penjelasanKonsep":"Ektropion = kelopak TERBALIK ke luar. Lagoftalmos = kelopak TIDAK DAPAT MENUTUP. Ektropion → epifora, konjungtivitis; Lagoftalmos → exposure keratopathy."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Trikiasis adalah kondisi bulu mata yang tumbuh ke arah posterior (menghadap ke kornea) sehingga menyebabkan iritasi kornea. Ini adalah masalah arah pertumbuhan silia, bukan kemampuan menutup kelopak.","konsepMisconception":"Semua kelainan kelopak mata menyebabkan kornea terbuka","penjelasanKonsep":"Trikiasis = bulu mata malposisi → kornea teriritasi tapi kelopak tetap menutup. Entropion = kelopak terbalik ke dalam. Ektropion = keluar. Lagoftalmos = tidak bisa menutup."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Lagoftalmos","subtopik":["N. VII palsy","Exposure keratopathy","Tarsorrhaphy"],"medicalTerms":["Lagophthalmos","Orbicularis oculi","Bell's phenomenon","Tarsorrhaphy","Exposure keratopathy"],"differentialDiagnosis":["Retraksi palpebra","Eksoftalmus","Ektropion","Entropion"],"clinicalPearls":["Lagoftalmos = N. VII","Proteksi kornea adalah prioritas","Tarsorrhaphy untuk kasus berat"],"examHighYield":["Definisi lagoftalmos","Etiologi N. VII","Komplikasi exposure keratopathy"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mengidentifikasi lagoftalmos dan memahami etiologi serta komplikasinya","assessmentIntent":"Menguji pengetahuan kelainan kelopak mata spesifik akibat N. VII palsy","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Lagoftalmos sama dengan ektropion","whyCommon":"Keduanya melibatkan kelopak mata","correction":"Lagoftalmos = tidak bisa menutup; Ektropion = kelopak terbalik keluar"}],"clinicalSignificance":"Lagoftalmos dapat menyebabkan ulkus kornea dan kebutaan jika tidak ditangani. Proteksi kornea harus segera dilakukan."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["Lagoftalmos = N. VII palsy → kelopak tidak bisa menutup"]},"slideMapping":"slide-10","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-5","questionNumber":5,"bloomLevel":2,"source":"original","category":"clinical","difficulty":"easy","soalOriginal":{"text":"Yang termasuk emergency absolute pada mata adalah...","caseContext":""},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Trauma benda tajam","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"Trauma kimia asam","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Trauma kimia basa","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"D","text":"Trauma termal","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Trauma radiasi","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"C","jawabanBenar":"C","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Trauma kimia basa merupakan emergency absolute karena basa menyebabkan saponifikasi lipid membran, penetrasi mendalam ke jaringan, dan kerusakan berkelanjutan. Asam menyebabkan koagulasi protein superfisial yang justru membatasi penetrasi. IRIGASI MASIF segera adalah kunci tatalaksana.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Ocular chemical injury adalah kerusakan mata akibat paparan zat kimia. Klasifikasi berdasarkan pH: alkali (basa, pH >7) dan acid (asam, pH <7). Emergency absolute karena kerusakan progresif dan dapat menyebabkan kebutaan total.","patofisiologi":"Alkali injury: saponifikasi lipid membran sel → disrupsi barrier kornea → penetrasi mendalam ke stroma, endotel, iris, lensa, dan bahkan retina. Proses inflamasi berkelanjutan dengan aktivasi matrix metalloproteinases (MMPs) menyebabkan melting kornea dan perforasi. Asam injury: koagulasi protein superfisial → eskar/barrier yang membatasi penetrasi dalam.","presentasiKlinis":"Nyeri hebat, fotofobia, blefarospasme, epifora, dan penurunan visus. Pemeriksaan: konjungtiva kemerahan/pucat (iskemia), kornea opasitas (haze), dan defek epitel. Grading Dua/Roper-Hall: Grade 1-2 prognosis baik; Grade 3-4 prognosis buruk.","diagnosis":"Diagnosis berdasarkan anamnesis paparan kimia dan pemeriksaan. Pengukuran pH konjungtival (harus netral 7.0). Fluorescein staining untuk melihat area epitel defect. Grading menggunakan klasifikasi Dua (iskemia limbus dan opasitas kornea).","tatalaksana":"EMERGENCY: IRIGASI segera minimal 30 menit dengan larutan irigasi (RL, NaCl 0,9%, atau BSS). Tujuannya: netralisasi pH. Jangan periksa pH dulu – LANGSUNG IRIGASI. Setelah pH netral: tetes silvadene/sikloplegik/antibiotik. Grade 3-4: vitamin C oral/topikal, citrat, dan tatalaksana inflamasi agresif. Tarsorrhaphy/AMG untuk melting kornea."},"highYieldPoints":["BASA > ASAM dalam keparahan trauma kimia mata","Saponifikasi = mekanisme penetrasi basa","IRIGASI segera adalah kunci – jangan tunggu pemeriksaan","Grading Dua: iskemia limbus + opasitas kornea","Iskemia limbus >1/2 = prognosis buruk (Grade 4)"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"A","mengapaSalah":"Trauma benda tajam adalah emergency relatif yang memerlukan penanganan segera (sutur/surgical repair), tetapi tidak se-urgent trauma kimia basa yang kerusakannya berkelanjutan.","konsepMisconception":"Semua trauma benda tajam mata adalah emergency absolute","penjelasanKonsep":"Trauma benda tajam: tergantung lokasi (cornea vs sclera), kedalaman, dan kontaminasi. Bukan absolute emergency kecuali globe rupture. Trauma kimia basa = absolute karena melting progresif."},{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"Trauma kimia asam menyebabkan coagulative necrosis superfisial. Koagulasi protein membentuk barrier yang membatasi penetrasi asam ke jaringan dalam. Prognosis umumnya lebih baik dari alkali injury.","konsepMisconception":"Asam lebih berbahaya dari basa","penjelasanKonsep":"BASA lebih berbahaya karena saponifikasi (liquefactive necrosis) → penetrasi mendalam. Asam = coagulative necrosis superfisial. Ingat: ASID = coagulation (superfisial, lebih aman); ALKALI = saponification (dalam, lebih berbahaya)."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"Trauma termal (terbakar) pada mata jarang terjadi karena reflex blink dan Bell's phenomenon protektif. Kerusakan biasanya superfisial (konjungtiva/kornea superfisial) kecuali exposure langsung panas ekstrem.","konsepMisconception":"Trauma termal = emergency absolute","penjelasanKonsep":"Mata dilindungi oleh reflex palpebral dan Bell's phenomenon. Trauma termal biasanya terbatas ke konjungtiva forniks. Emergency absolute = alkali, IOFB, globe rupture."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Trauma radiasi (UV, ionizing) menyebabkan kerusakan progresif tapi tidak akut dan berkelanjutan seperti alkali. Photokeratitis (UV) sembuh spontan 24-48 jam. Radiasi ionizing menyebabkan katarak/karsinoma tapi delayed.","konsepMisconception":"Radiasi adalah emergency absolute","penjelasanKonsep":"Acute radiation exposure pada mata jarang. UV keratitis (welder's flash) self-limiting. Radioactive exposure (iridium) dapat menyebabut necrosis but delayed. Bukan absolute emergency."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Trauma Kimia Mata","subtopik":["Alkali vs Acid injury","Grading Dua","Irigasi emergensi","Tatalaksana"],"medicalTerms":["Saponifikasi","Coagulative necrosis","Dua classification","Limbal ischemia","MMP activation"],"differentialDiagnosis":["Trauma benda tajam","Thermal injury","Radiation injury"],"clinicalPearls":["IRIGASI segera 30 menit","Basa lebih berbahaya dari asam","Vitamin C untuk grade 3-4"],"examHighYield":["Emergency absolute trauma mata","Mekanisme basa vs asam","Grading Dua"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mengidentifikasi emergency absolute trauma mata dan memahami mekanisme kerusakan kimia","assessmentIntent":"Menguji prioritas emergency oftalmologi dan pemahaman mekanisme alkali injury","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Asam lebih berbahaya dari basa","whyCommon":"Asam kuat (HCl, H2SO4) diasosiasi dengan korosif","correction":"Basa menyebabkan liquefactive necrosis penetrasi dalam, lebih berbahaya"}],"clinicalSignificance":"Trauma kimia basa tanpa irigasi segera dapat menyebabkan melting kornea dan kebutaan dalam hitungan jam."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["BASA = EMERGENCY ABSOLUTE → IRIGASI SEGERA"]},"slideMapping":"slide-12","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"C","jawabanBenar":"C","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-6","questionNumber":6,"bloomLevel":3,"source":"original","category":"clinical","difficulty":"medium","soalOriginal":{"text":"Anak 6 tahun, benjolan leher kiri depan 3 cm di tepi atas m. sternocleidomastoideus, ada lubang di ujung yang keluar cairan mukoid, sejak lahir. Berasal dari...","caseContext":"Benjolan kongenital leher"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Brachial cleft cyst","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"Kelenjar keringat","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Cervical sinus","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Kelenjar tiroid","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Brachial apparatus","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Kista brankial (brachial cleft cyst) adalah kelainan kongenital akibat kegagalan regresi sinus brankial. Lokasi khas: tepi anterior m. sternocleidomastoideus (sekitar 1/3 dari klavikula ke mandibula). Dapat berkomunikasi dengan kulit (fistel) yang mengeluarkan cairan mukoid/saliva. Penatalaksanaan definitif: eksisi lengkap.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Brachial cleft cyst adalah remnant sinus brankial (biasanya II) yang berupa kista unilateral di leher. Dapat berupa kista tanpa fistel atau kista dengan fistel ke kulit ( Branchial cleft sinus/fistula). Merupakan kelainan kongenital kedua tersering di leher setelah kista thyroglossus.","patofisiologi":"Embriologi: sinus brankial (1-4) berkembang minggu 4-8 gestasi. Sinus II biasanya regresi sempurna. Kegagalan regresi → kista brankial. Kista berisi cairan mukoid/saliva berwarna kuning kehijauan. Dapat terinfeksi → abses.","presentasiKlinis":"Benjolan lunak, bergerak lateral dengan menelan, terletak di tepi anterior SCM. Ukuran 3-6 cm. Jika fistel: lubang kecil di leher mengeluarkan cairan mukoid. Onset: dapat baru terdeteksi usia anak-anak atau dewasa muda setelah infeksi upper respiratory tract.","diagnosis":"Diagnosis klinis berdasarkan lokasi khas. Pemeriksaan penunjang: USG (kista unilocular hipoehoik), CT/MRI (menilai ekstensi dan hubungan dengan neurovaskular). Fistulography: kontras melalui opening fistel. Fine needle aspiration: cairan mukoid berisi kolesterol crystals.","tatalaksana":"Eksisi lengkap (complete surgical excision) bersama dengan tract fistel jika ada. Timing: elektif setelah infeksi dikontrol. Komplikasi: rekuren jika tidak eksisi lengkap, injury N. VII (marginal mandibular), N. XI (accessory nerve), atau vasa."},"highYieldPoints":["Lokasi khas: tepi ANTERIOR m. SCM","Kista brankial #2 tersering (setelah thyroglossus)","Cairan mukoid/kolesterol crystals","Tatalaksana definitif: EKSISI LENGKAP","Bedakan dari: thyroglossus (midline, bergerak dengan lidah)"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"Kelenjar keringat (hidradenoma, syringoma) terletak di kulit, tidak di leher dalam. Lesinya kecil-multipel, bukan kista tunggal besar. Tidak mengeluarkan cairan mukoid.","konsepMisconception":"Semua kista leher berasal dari kelenjar","penjelasanKonsep":"Kista brankial berasal dari remnant embrionik sinus brankial, bukan kelenjar. Kelenjar keringat: hidrocystoma (wajah), hidradenoma. Tidak ada di leher dalam."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"Cervical sinus adalah istilah embriologis untuk sinus brankial II yang normalnya regresi. Kista brankial adalah hasil dari kegagalan regresi cervical sinus. 'Cervical sinus' bukan diagnosis klinis.","konsepMisconception":"Kista berasal dari cervical sinus","penjelasanKonsep":"Cervical sinus adalah struktur embriologis normal. Kegagalan regresinya → brachial cleft cyst. Jawaban klinis yang tepat adalah 'brachial cleft cyst' bukan 'cervical sinus'."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"Kelenjar tiroid terletak di midline anterior leher. Tiroid tidak membentuk kista lateral leher. Kista thyroglossus (bukan tiroid) terletak midline dan bergerak dengan menelan/lidah keluar.","konsepMisconception":"Kista leher lateral = tiroid","penjelasanKonsep":"Tiroid: midline. Thyroglossus cyst: midline, bergerak dengan lidah. Brachial cleft cyst: lateral (tepi SCM), bergerak dengan menelan. Bedakan lokasi dan mobilitas."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Brachial apparatus adalah istilah umum untuk sistem brankial (arkus faringeus). Bukan diagnosis spesifik. Diagnosis yang tepat adalah brachial cleft cyst (spesifik: kista dari cleft brankial).","konsepMisconception":"Brachial apparatus = diagnosis","penjelasanKonsep":"Brachial apparatus = sistem embriologis. Diagnosis klinis: brachial cleft cyst, brachial fistula, atau branchial sinus. Pilih istilah diagnosis yang paling spesifik."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Kista Brankial","subtopik":["Embriologi sinus brankial","Klasifikasi kista leher","Diagnosis differensial kista leher"],"medicalTerms":["Branchial cleft cyst","Sinus brankial","Thyroglossal duct cyst","Cervical lymphadenopathy"],"differentialDiagnosis":["Kista thyroglossus","Lymphadenopati","Kista dermoid","Abses leher"],"clinicalPearls":["#2 tersering kista leher","Tepi anterior SCM","Eksisi lengkap"],"examHighYield":["Lokasi khas","Bedakan dari thyroglossus","Tatalaksana eksisi"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mendiagnosis kista brankial berdasarkan lokasi khas dan membedakannya dari kista leher lain","assessmentIntent":"Menguji pengetahuan kista kongenital leher dan lokasi khas brachial cleft cyst","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Semua kista leher berasal dari tiroid","whyCommon":"Tiroid terkenal sebagai kelenjar leher","correction":"Brachial cleft cyst = lateral, thyroglossus = midline"}],"clinicalSignificance":"Kista brankial dapat terinfeksi dan abses. Eksisi lengkap diperlukan untuk mencegah rekurensi."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["Kista brankial: tepi ANTERIOR SCM, sejak lahir, cairan mukoid"]},"slideMapping":"slide-6","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-7","questionNumber":7,"bloomLevel":3,"source":"original","category":"clinical","difficulty":"medium","soalOriginal":{"text":"Pasien dengan lesi dome shape, claw hand, penebalan saraf, BTA +4. Diagnosis?","caseContext":"Suspek kusta"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Kusta tuberkuloid","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"Kusta border tuberkuloid","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Kusta lepramatosa","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"D","text":"Kusta border lepramatosa","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Kusta indeterminata","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"C","jawabanBenar":"C","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Kusta lepramatosa (LL) adalah tipe multibasilari dengan BTA (Bacillus Tahan Asam) positif tinggi (+3 sampai +6). Tanda klinis: lesi infiltratif multipel (dome-shaped), penebalan saraf bilateral simetris (ulnaris, peroneus, medianus, great auricular), claw hand, facial palsy, madarosis, dan saddle nose. BTA +4 mengindikasikan multibacillary.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Kusta (leprosy/Morbus Hansen) adalah penyakit infeksi kronik oleh Mycobacterium leprae yang menyerang kulit, saraf perifer, mukosa, dan mata. Diklasifikasikan berdasarkan spektrum imun: tuberkuloid (TT, paucibasilari) → borderline tuberkuloid (BT) → mid-borderline (BB) → borderline lepramatosa (BL) → lepramatosa (LL, multibasilari).","patofisiologi":"M. leprae bersifat intraseluler (makrofag, Schwann cells) dengan doubling time 13 hari (sangat lambat). LL: respons sel-T Th1 lemah → tidak ada granuloma terorganisir → bakteri berkembang bebas (multibasilari). Kerusakan saraf akibat inflamasi perineural dan iskemia vasa nervorum.","presentasiKlinis":"LL: lesi infiltratif eritematosa/nodul (leproma) simetris, bercahaya di tengah (dome-shaped). Penebalan saraf: great auricular, ulnar (sulcus), median, peroneal, posterior tibial. Deformitas: claw hand, foot drop, facial palsy, lagophthalmos. BTA: +3 sampai +6. Lepromin test negatif.","diagnosis":"Diagnosis klinis + konfirmasi BTA dari split skin smear (SSS) atau biopsi kulit. BTA + ≥2 = multibacillary. Biopsi: dermis penuh dengan foamy macrophages (Virchow cells) mengandung M. leprae. Ridley-Jopling classification: TT, BT, BB, BL, LL.","tatalaksana":"WHO MDT (Multidrug Therapy): MB regimen = Rifampicin 600mg/bln + Dapsone 100mg/hari + Clofazimine 300mg/bln + 50mg/hari, durasi 12 bulan. PB regimen: Rifampicin + Dapsone 6 bulan. Reaksi (Type 1 reversal, Type 2 ENL): prednison/talidomide. Rehabilitasi deformitas."},"highYieldPoints":["BTA +4 = MULTIBACILLARY → LL atau BL","Tuberkuloid = BTA negatif (paucibacillary)","Claw hand = ulnar + median nerve palsy","MDT WHO: Rifampicin + Dapsone + Clofazimine (MB)","Reaksi reversal (Type 1) = prednison"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"A","mengapaSalah":"Kusta tuberkuloid (TT) adalah tipe paucibacillary dengan BTA negatif. Lesi: plak hipopigmentasi/hiperpigmentasi tunggal dengan batas tegas, hipalgesia, penebalan saraf unilateral. Tidak ada claw hand atau deformitas.","konsepMisconception":"Semua kusta dengan deformitas = lepramatosa","penjelasanKonsep":"TT: BTA negatif, lesi tunggal, tidak ada deformitas. LL: BTA positif, lesi multipel, deformitas berat. Spektrum: TT (kuat imun) → LL (lemah imun)."},{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"Borderline tuberkuloid (BT) masih tipe paucibacillary dengan BTA 0-1+. Lesi: plak multipel, penebalan saraf. Belum ada claw hand atau BTA +4.","konsepMisconception":"BT sama dengan LL","penjelasanKonsep":"Spektrum Ridley-Jopling: TT → BT → BB → BL → LL. Semakin ke LL: BTA meningkat, lesi multipel, deformitas, imun menurun. BTA +4 jelas menunjukkan LL."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"Borderline lepramatosa (BL) adalah tipe multibacillary dengan BTA 2-4+. Meskipun BTA bisa positif, tanda klinis BL tidak seberat LL. Lesi BL masih berupa plak/maculopapular, belum full infiltrative dome-shaped seperti LL.","konsepMisconception":"BL dan LL sama","penjelasanKonsep":"BL: BTA 2-4+, lesi plak/infiltratif sedang. LL: BTA 4-6+, lesi infiltratif berat, deformitas, BTA sangat tinggi. BTA +4 + claw hand + dome-shaped → LL lebih mungkin."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Kusta indeterminata adalah lesi awal yang belum bisa diklasifikasikan. Biasanya macul hypopigmented dengan batas tidak tegas, hipalgesia ringan. BTA negatif. Tidak ada penebalan saraf atau deformitas.","konsepMisconception":"Indeterminata = stadium awal semua kusta","penjelasanKonsep":"Indeterminata = unclassifiable early lesion. Stadium awal dapat berkembang ke spektrum manapun tergantung imun. BTA +4 + deformitas jelas bukan indeterminata."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Kusta (Leprosy)","subtopik":["Klasifikasi Ridley-Jopling","Tanda klinis kusta","MDT WHO","Reaksi kusta"],"medicalTerms":["Multibacillary","Paucibacillary","BTA","Lepromin test","ENL","Claw hand"],"differentialDiagnosis":["Sindrom Guillain-Barre","Neuropati diabetes","Scleroderma","Vitiligo"],"clinicalPearls":["BTA = bedakan MB vs PB","Claw hand = LL","MDT 12 bulan untuk MB"],"examHighYield":["Klasifikasi kusta","Tanda LL","Regimen MDT"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mengklasifikasikan tipe kusta berdasarkan BTA dan tanda klinis","assessmentIntent":"Menguji kemampuan membedakan LL dari tipe kusta lain berdasarkan BTA tinggi dan deformitas","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Semua kusta sama","whyCommon":"Kusta sering diajarkan sebagai satu entitas","correction":"Spektrum TT-BT-BB-BL-LL dengan perbedaan imun, BTA, dan klinis"}],"clinicalSignificance":"Klasifikasi kusta menentukan regimen MDT dan prognosis. LL memerlukan pengobatan lebih lama (12 bulan)."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["BTA +4 = MULTIBACILLARY = Kusta Lepramatosa"]},"slideMapping":"slide-6","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"C","jawabanBenar":"C","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-8","questionNumber":8,"bloomLevel":3,"source":"original","category":"clinical","difficulty":"medium","soalOriginal":{"text":"Wanita 36 tahun, bercak kemerahan 5 tahun, nyeri sendi, rambut rontok, photosensitivity, butterfly rash malar. Diagnosis?","caseContext":"Suspek penyakit autoimun sistemik"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Pemphigus vulgaris","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"Herpes genital","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Erupsi obat morbiliformis","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Lupus eritematosus sistemik","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"E","text":"Iktiosis vulgaris","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"D","jawabanBenar":"D","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Lupus eritematosus sistemik (LES/SLE) adalah penyakit autoimun multisistem dengan kriteria diagnosis ARA: malar rash (butterfly rash), photosensitivity, artritis non-erosif, oral ulcers, serositis, renal disorder, neurologic disorder, hematologic disorder, immunologic disorder, dan ANA positif. Pasien memenuhi >4 kriteria.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Systemic Lupus Erythematosus (SLE) adalah penyakit autoimun kronik yang menyerang berbagai organ (kulit, sendi, ginjal, otak, darah, jantung, paru) melalui pembentukan autoantibodi dan kompleks imun. Prevalensi: wanita usia reproduksi (F:M = 9:1). Faktor: genetik (HLA-DR2, DR3), hormon, UV, infeksi.","patofisiologi":"Dysregulasi imun: apoptosis abnormal → release nuclear antigens → autoantibodi (ANA, anti-dsDNA, anti-Sm) → pembentukan immune complex → deposisi di jaringan → inflamasi komplemen (C3, C4 turun). Kerusakan organ melalui vasculitis dan trombosis (antiphospholipid syndrome).","presentasiKlinis":"Kriteria ARA 1997 (≥4 dari 11): (1) Malar rash - butterfly rash di pipi dan hidung; (2) Discoid rash; (3) Photosensitivity; (4) Oral ulcers; (5) Arthritis non-erosif (≥2 sendi); (6) Serositis (pleuritis/perikarditis); (7) Renal disorder (proteinuria >0.5g/hari); (8) Neurologic (seizure/psychosis); (9) Hematologic; (10) Immunologic (anti-dsDNA, anti-Sm, antiphospholipid); (11) ANA positif.","diagnosis":"Diagnosis klinis berdasarkan kriteria ARA. Laboratorium: ANA (screening, sensitivitas 95%), anti-dsDNA (spesifitas 95%), anti-Sm (spesifitas 99% tapi sensitivitas 25%), C3/C4 turun, ESR/CRP naik. Pemeriksaan tambahan: urinalisis, renal biopsy, chest X-ray.","tatalaksana":"Tergantung aktivitas dan organ terlibat: (1) Hidroksiklorokuin untuk semua pasien; (2) NSAID untuk artritis ringan; (3) Kortikosteroid (prednison) untuk flare; (4) Immunosupresan: siklofosfamid (lupus nefritis), mofetil mycophenolate, azathioprine; (5) Proteksi UV; (6) Monitoring rutin."},"highYieldPoints":["Butterfly rash = tanda khas SLE (spare nasolabial fold)","Kriteria ARA: ≥4 dari 11 untuk diagnosis","Anti-dsDNA dan anti-Sm = spesifik SLE","Lupus nefritis = komplikasi serius","Hidroksiklorokuin = foundation therapy"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"A","mengapaSalah":"Pemphigus vulgaris adalah autoimun blistering disorder akibat autoantibodi anti-desmoglein 3. Tanda: flaccid bullae, erosi mukosa oral, Nikolsky sign positif. Tidak ada artritis, photosensitivity, atau butterfly rash.","konsepMisconception":"Autoimun dengan lesi kulit = pemphigus","penjelasanKonsep":"Pemphigus = blistering (Nikolsky +). SLE = photosensitivity rash + artritis + multisystem. Bedakan berdasarkan morphology lesi dan sistemik involvement."},{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"Herpes genital adalah infeksi HSV-2 yang menyebabkan vesikel gruping, ulkus, dan nyeri pada genitalia. Tidak ada kaitan dengan artritis, rambut rontok, atau butterfly rash. Tidak kronik 5 tahun.","konsepMisconception":"Lesions with erythema = herpes","penjelasanKonsep":"Herpes: vesikel gruping, recurrent, localized. SLE: maculopapular photosensitive, chronic multisystem. Sangat berbeda secara klinis."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"Erupsi obat morbiliformis adalah reaksi obat tersering (maculopapular exanthem). Muncul 7-14 hari pasca obat, simetris trunkus/proksimal ekstremitas. Tidak ada photosensitivity, artritis, atau rambut rontok. Menghilang setelah obat dihentikan.","konsepMisconception":"Rash merah = drug eruption","penjelasanKonsep":"Drug eruption: temporal relationship dengan obat, self-limiting. SLE: kronik, photosensitive, multisystem. Anamnesis obat dan timeline krusial."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Iktiosis vulgaris adalah kelainan keratinisasi autosomal dominant dengan dry fish-scale patches (hyperkeratosis) terutama pada ekstensor. Tidak ada inflamasi, artritis, atau photosensitivity. Non-systemic.","konsepMisconception":"Dry scaly skin = iktiosis","penjelasanKonsep":"Iktiosis: hereditary, non-inflammatory, scaling. SLE: inflammatory, photosensitive, multisystem. Bedakan dari riwayat keluarga dan sistemik features."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Lupus Eritematosus Sistemik","subtopik":["Kriteria ARA","Tanda klinis","Laboratorium","Tatalaksana"],"medicalTerms":["Butterfly rash","ANA","Anti-dsDNA","Anti-Sm","Lupus nefritis"],"differentialDiagnosis":["Pemphigus vulgaris","Dermatomyositis","Scleroderma","Mixed connective tissue disease"],"clinicalPearls":["Butterfly rash = khas","Anti-dsDNA spesifik","Hidroksiklorokuin untuk semua"],"examHighYield":["Kriteria ARA","Tanda khas","Laboratorium spesifik"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mendiagnosis SLE berdasarkan kriteria ARA dan tanda klinis","assessmentIntent":"Menguji kemampuan mengaplikasikan kriteria ARA pada kasus klinis","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"SLE hanya penyakit kulit","whyCommon":"Malar rash paling terlihat","correction":"SLE adalah multisystem disease dengan potensi organ-threatening"}],"clinicalSignificance":"SLE dapat mengancam jiwa melalui lupus nefritis, CNS lupus, dan serositis. Early diagnosis dan treatment krusial."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["Butterfly rash + photosensitivity + artritis = SLE"]},"slideMapping":"slide-6","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"D","jawabanBenar":"D","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-9","questionNumber":9,"bloomLevel":3,"source":"original","category":"clinical","difficulty":"medium","soalOriginal":{"text":"Pria 36 tahun, timbul lesi biru-biru setelah tetrasiklin, lokasi sama dengan 1 tahun lalu, sariawan, lecet kelamin. Diagnosis?","caseContext":"Reaksi obat berulang"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Fixed Drug Eruption (FDE)","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"Erupsi eksantematosa","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Stevens-Johnson syndrome","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Cutaneous lupus eritematosus","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Toxic epidermal necrolysis","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Fixed Drug Eruption (FDE) adalah reaksi obat yang paling khas karena lesel muncul pada lokasi yang SAMA setiap kali terpapar obat yang sama. Lesi: plak eritematosa/violaseus berbatas tegas yang dapat melibatkan mukosa (sariawan, genital). Obat pemicu umum: tetrasiklin, TMP-SMX, NSAID, barbiturat.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Fixed Drug Eruption (FDE) adalah dermatosis rekurut yang terjadi pada lokasi anatomis yang sama setiap kali pemberian obat tertentu. Merupakan tipe III reaksi hipersensitivitas (immune-complex mediated). Prevalensi: 2-5% reaksi obat cutaneous.","patofisiologi":"Mekanisme: CD8+ T-cells resident di dermis yang mensensitisasi terhadap antigen obat. Re-exposure: aktivasi CD8+ → apoptosis keratinosit → lesi lokal. CD4+ Tregs terlibat dalam regresi lesi. Depositan melanin di dermis menyebabkan hyperpigmentasi pasca-inflamasi.","presentasiKlinis":"Lesi: plak/bulla eritematosa/violaseus berbatas tegas, 1-10 cm, multipel/soliter. Lokalasi: bibir, genitalia, tangan, kaki, gluteal. Mukosa: erosi dangkal (sariawan). Waktu: 30 menit-8 jam pasca obat. Resolusi: 1-2 minggu dengan hyperpigmentasi residu. Rekurensi: lokasi IDENTIK.","diagnosis":"Diagnosis klinis berdasarkan: (1) temporal relationship obat-lesi; (2) lokasi tetap rekurensi; (3) patch test (obat dilokalisasi); (4) histopati: vacuolar interface dermatitis, melanophages di dermis, necrotic keratinocytes. Differential: SLE, erythema multiforme, herpes simplex.","tatalaksana":"(1) Hentikan obat pemicu; (2) Antihistamin dan topical kortikosteroid untuk pruritus; (3) Mukosa: topical anesthetics; (4) Edukasi pasien untuk menghindari obat seumur hidup (medical alert); (5) Cross-reactivity: perlu diperhatikan dengan obat sekelas."},"highYieldPoints":["FDE = lesi pada lokasi SAMA setiap kali obat sama","Obat pemicu: tetrasiklin, TMP-SMX, NSAID, metronidazol","Lesinya: plak violaseus berbatas tegas + mukosa","Hyperpigmentasi residu = tanda khas","Tatalaksana: HENTIKAN obat, avoid for life"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"Erupsi eksantematosa (morbiliform) adalah reaksi obat tersering (90%) tapi lesi muncul simetris difus di trunkus dan ekstremitas, TIDAK pada lokasi tetap. Tidak melibatkan mukosa secara khusus.","konsepMisconception":"Semua reaksi obat cutaneous sama","penjelasanKonsep":"Morbiliform: widespread, simetris, tidak fixed location. FDE: localized, fixed location, mukosa involved. Bedakan dari lokasi dan pattern distribusi."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"Stevens-Johnson syndrome (SJS) adalah severe cutaneous adverse reaction (SCAR) dengan target lesions, erosi mukosa multipel (>2 sites), dan epidermal necrosis. Bukan rekurut di lokasi sama. Lebih akut dan berat.","konsepMisconception":"FDE dengan mukosa = SJS","penjelasanKonsep":"SJS: target lesions, epidermal detachment <10%, multipel mucosal sites, akut life-threatening. FDE: localized plaques, mukosa 1-2 sites, recurrent same location, self-limiting."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"Cutaneous lupus (discoid LE) menyebabkan plak eritematosa dengan skala, folikel plug, atrofi, dan skar. Tidak ada temporal relationship dengan obat. Lesi kronik, photosensitivity, DIF: lupus band (+).","konsepMisconception":"Plak violaseus + mukosa = cutaneous lupus","penjelasanKonsep":"Discoid LE: folikel plug, atrophi, photosensitive. FDE: drug-related, recurrent same site, hyperpigmentation after resolution. Bedakan dari riwayat obat dan clinical course."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"TEN adalah SCAR yang parah dengan epidermal detachment >30%, positive Nikolsky. Seperti SJS tapi lebih luas. Life-threatening. Bukan rekurut di lokasi sama dan tidak terkait obat spesifik yang sama.","konsepMisconception":"FDE multipel = TEN","penjelasanKonsep":"TEN: widespread epidermal detachment, positive Nikolsky, mortality tinggi. FDE: localized, negative Nikolsky, self-limiting. Sangat berbeda dalam severity dan extent."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Fixed Drug Eruption","subtopik":["Reaksi obat kulit","Mekanisme FDE","Obat pemicu FDE"],"medicalTerms":["FDE","CD8+ T cells","Interface dermatitis","Hyperpigmentation"],"differentialDiagnosis":["SJS","TEN","Discoid LE","Erythema multiforme"],"clinicalPearls":["Lokasi sama = pathognomonic","Avoid obat seumur hidup","Hyperpigmentasi residu"],"examHighYield":["Definisi FDE","Bedakan dari SJS/TEN","Tatalaksana"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mengidentifikasi FDE berdasarkan lokasi tetap rekurensi","assessmentIntent":"Menguji kemampuan membedakan FDE dari reaksi obat kulit lain","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"FDE sama dengan drug rash biasa","whyCommon":"Keduanya reaksi obat","correction":"FDE: fixed location, recurrent. Drug rash: widespread, tidak fixed"}],"clinicalSignificance":"FDE memerlukan identifikasi obat pemicu dan edukasi lifelong avoidance. Cross-reactivity perlu diperhatikan."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["FDE = lesi di lokasi YANG SAMA setiap kali obat sama"]},"slideMapping":"slide-5","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-10","questionNumber":10,"bloomLevel":2,"source":"original","category":"knowledge","difficulty":"easy","soalOriginal":{"text":"Jenis erupsi obat yang paling sering terjadi adalah...","caseContext":""},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Stevens-Johnson syndrome","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"Erupsi obat tipe bulosa","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Erupsi obat morbiliformis","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"D","text":"Toxic epidermal necrolysis","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Lupus drug induced","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"C","jawabanBenar":"C","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Erupsi obat morbiliformis (exanthematous/morbiliform drug eruption) adalah reaksi obat kulit tersering, menyebabkan ~90% semua reaksi obat cutaneous. Berupa makulopapul eritematosa yang simetris di trunkus dan proksimal ekstremitas, muncul 7-14 hari pasca obat. Self-limiting setelah obat dihentikan.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Morbiliform/exanthematous drug eruption adalah reaksi obat tersering berupa erupsi makulopapular eritematosa yang simetris. Disebut 'morbiliform' karena menyerupai rash campak (measles-like). Prevalensi: 1-3% pasien yang terpapar obat.","patofisiologi":"Mekanisme: T-cell mediated delayed hypersensitivity (type IV). Obat sebagai hapten mengikat protein jaringan → antigenik → aktivasi Th1/Th17 → inflamasi kulit. Reaksi akut: 7-14 hari pertama exposure. Reaksi cepat: 1-3 hari pada re-exposure.","presentasiKlinis":"Makul dan papul eritematosa 1-5 mm, simetris, mulai trunkus → ekstremitas proksimal → wajah. Pruritus umum. Tidak melibatkan mukosa (beda SJS). Tidak ada deskuamasi. Waktu onset: 7-14 hari obat baru. Resolusi: 1-2 minggu setelah henti obat.","diagnosis":"Diagnosis eksklusi: riwayat obat baru, onset 7-14 hari, morfologi makulopapular, tidak ada mukosa involvement. Differential: viral exanthem, SJS awal, scarlet fever. Tidak perlu biopsy rutin. Khusus: peripheral eosinophilia dapat membantu.","tatalaksana":"(1) Hentikan obat yang dicurigai; (2) Antihistamin oral untuk pruritus; (3) Kortikosteroid topical ringan; (4) Kortikosteroid sistemik untuk kasus berat; (5) Rechallenge: kontraindikasi (risiko SJS/TEN). Cross-reactivity perlu dievaluasi."},"highYieldPoints":["Morbiliform = 90% reaksi obat kulit","Onset: 7-14 hari pasca obat baru","Simetris trunkus + proksimal ekstremitas","TIDAK melibatkan mukosa (beda SJS)","Self-limiting setelah obat dihentikan"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"A","mengapaSalah":"SJS adalah SCAR jarang (1-2/million) dengan target lesions, erosi mukosa multipel, dan epidermal detachment <10%. Bukan reaksi obat tersering tapi paling dikenal karena berbahaya.","konsepMisconception":"SJS sering terjadi","penjelasanKonsep":"SJS/TEN: 1-2/million/year. Morbiliform: 90% drug eruptions. Jangan bingung: yang berbahaya = jarang; yang sering = biasanya ringan."},{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"Erupsi obat tipe bulosa (bullous drug eruption) jarang. Contoh: linear IgA bullous dermatosis, pseudoporphyria. Bukan tipe tersering.","konsepMisconception":"Bullous = sering","penjelasanKonsep":"Bullous drug eruptions termasuk reaksi obat yang jarang. Morbiliform, urticaria, dan FDE jauh lebih sering."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"TEN adalah SCAR paling parah dengan epidermal detachment >30%. Sangat jarang (0.4-1.2/million/year). Mortality 30-50%. Bukan reaksi obat tersering.","konsepMisconception":"TEN sering","penjelasanKonsep":"TEN jarang tapi fatal. Jangan bingukan frekuensi dengan severity. Morbiliform sering tapi ringan. TEN jarang tapi life-threatening."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Drug-induced lupus adalah kondisi autoimun akibat obat tertentu (procainamide, hydralazine, INH). Jauh lebih jarang dari morbiliform. Onset bulan-bulan, tidak akut 7-14 hari.","konsepMisconception":"DIL = reaksi obat kulit","penjelasanKonsep":"DIL: sistemik (artritis, serositis, ANA+), bukan rash kulit sederhana. Jarang dan onset lambat. Morbiliform: cutaneous, sering, onset cepat."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Reaksi Obat Kulit","subtopik":["Klasifikasi reaksi obat","Morbiliform drug eruption","SCAR"],"medicalTerms":["Exanthematous","Morbiliform","SCAR","SJS","TEN"],"differentialDiagnosis":["Viral exanthem","Scarlet fever","SJS awal"],"clinicalPearls":["Morbiliform = paling sering","7-14 hari onset","Tidak mukosa"],"examHighYield":["Jenis reaksi obat tersering","Bedakan dari SCAR","Onset temporal"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mengidentifikasi erupsi obat morbiliformis sebagai reaksi obat tersering","assessmentIntent":"Menguji pengetahuan epidemiologi reaksi obat kulit","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"SJS/TEN sering","whyCommon":"Diajarkan sebagai emergency","correction":"Morbiliform 90%; SJS/TEN <1%"}],"clinicalSignificance":"Membedakan morbiliform ringan dari SCAR berbahaya krusial untuk manajemen pasien."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["Morbiliform = 90% reaksi obat kulit - PALING SERING"]},"slideMapping":"slide-5","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"C","jawabanBenar":"C","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-11","questionNumber":11,"bloomLevel":3,"source":"original","category":"clinical","difficulty":"easy","soalOriginal":{"text":"Pria 54 tahun, papul multipel diskret coklat, batas tegas, pedunkulated, riwayat keluarga serupa. Diagnosis?","caseContext":"Lesi kulit kronis wajah"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Kista epidermal","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"Hemangioma","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Keratosis seboroik","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"D","text":"Melanoma","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Karsinoma sel basal","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"C","jawabanBenar":"C","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Keratosis seboroik (seborrheic keratosis) adalah tumor epidermal benign yang sangat umum, terutama usia >50 tahun. Tanda khas: lesi papul/nodul berwarna coklat kehitaman, batas tegas, permukaan berminyak/verukosa seperti 'menempel' pada kulit (stuck-on appearance). Pedunkulated = berpucuk (daging tumbuh). Riwayat keluarga: common.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Keratosis seboroik (SK) adalah tumor benign proliferation keratinosit epidermal. Prevalensi meningkat dengan usia (>90% populasi >60 tahun). Etiologi: mutasi gen FGFR3, PIK3CA, dan HRAS. Faktor: UV kronis, HPV, dan faktor genetik.","patofisiologi":"Hiperplasia epidermal non-invasif dengan akantosis, papillomatosis, dan hiperkeratosis. Melanosit aktif → pigmen coklat. Tidak ada atipia. Lesi 'stuck-on' karena tidak melibatkan dermis.","presentasiKlinis":"Papul/plak multipel, 2-3 mm sampai beberapa cm, warna coklat sampai hitam, batas tegas, permukaan verukosa/berminyak, stuck-on appearance. Lokalasi: wajah, dada, punggang. Tipe: hiperkeratotik, pedunkulated, dermatosis papulosa nigra (kulit gelap). Tanda Leser-Trelat: muncul tiba-tiba banyak = paraneoplastic (GI/lymphoma).","diagnosis":"Diagnosis klinis berdasarkan tampilan stuck-on. Dermoskopi: milia-like cysts, comedo-like openings, fissures, dan hairpin vessels. Biopsi jika atipikal: hiperkeratosis, papillomatosis, akantosis, horn pseudocysts.","tatalaksana":"Tidak perlu tatalaksana jika diagnosis jelas. Kosmetik: cryotherapy, curettage, electrodessication, atau laser. Hindari biopsy shave karena dapat menimbulkan scar hipertrofik. Tanda Leser-Trelat: screening malignancy internal."},"highYieldPoints":["Stuck-on appearance = pathognomonic","Benign, tidak perlu tatalaksana","Leser-Trelat sign = paraneoplastic","Bedakan dari melanoma: SK tidak melibatkan dermis","Dermoskopi: milia-like cysts"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"A","mengapaSalah":"Kista epidermal (epidermoid cyst) adalah kista subkutan berisi keratin, biasanya pada wajah/leher. Tampilan: nodul subkutan dengan punctum sentral. Tidak pigmented coklat multipel.","konsepMisconception":"Nodul kulit = kista","penjelasanKonsep":"Kista epidermal: subkutan, punctum, keratin. SK: superficial, pigmented, stuck-on. Bedakan dari depth dan morphology."},{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"Hemangioma adalah vaskular tumor yang tampil sebagai nodul/plak merah/ungu. Tumbuh pada infant, involusi spontan. Tidak berwarna coklat multipel dengan surface verukosa.","konsepMisconception":"Lesions coklat = vaskular","penjelasanKonsep":"Hemangioma: red/blue, compressible, infantile. SK: brown/black, non-compressible, adult onset. Bedakan warna dan usia onset."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"Melanoma adalah keganasan melanosit dengan ABCDE criteria: Asymmetry, Border irregular, Color variation, Diameter >6mm, Evolving. SK: simetris, batas tegas, warna uniform, tidak evolving.","konsepMisconception":"Lesions gelap multipel = melanoma","penjelasanKonsep":"ABCDE untuk melanoma. SK: stuck-on, uniform, tidak evolving. Jika ragu: dermoskopi atau excisional biopsy."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Karsinoma sel basal (BCC) tampil sebagai papul/nodul pearly dengan telangiektasis dan rolled border, atau ulkus rodent. Biasanya soliter, bukan multipel diskret coklat.","konsepMisconception":"Nodul wajah = BCC","penjelasanKonsep":"BCC: pearly, telangiectasia, soliter. SK: pigmented, verrucous, multipel. Dermoskopi membantu membedakan."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Keratosis Seboroik","subtopik":["Tumor benign epidermal","Stuck-on appearance","Leser-Trelat sign"],"medicalTerms":["Seborrheic keratosis","Stuck-on","Dermoscopy","Papillomatosis"],"differentialDiagnosis":["Melanoma","BCC","Epidermoid cyst","Solar lentigo"],"clinicalPearls":["Stuck-on = pathognomonic","Tidak perlu treatment","Leser-Trelat = paraneoplastic"],"examHighYield":["Tanda khas","Bedakan dari melanoma","Leser-Trelat"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mengidentifikasi keratosis seboroik dan membedakannya dari lesi pigmented lain","assessmentIntent":"Menguji kemampuan diagnosis klinis lesi benign kulit umum","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Les gelap = melanoma","whyCommon":"Meningkat awareness melanoma","correction":"SK jauh lebih sering, tanda khas stuck-on"}],"clinicalSignificance":"Mampu membedakan SK benign dari melanoma malignant mencegah overtreatment dan anxiety pasien."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["Stuck-on appearance = Keratosis Seboroik"]},"slideMapping":"slide-6","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"C","jawabanBenar":"C","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-12","questionNumber":12,"bloomLevel":3,"source":"original","category":"clinical","difficulty":"medium","soalOriginal":{"text":"Pria 72 tahun, ulserasi pinna, sel tumor polygonal, sitoplasma eosinofilik, intercellular bridge, keratin pearl. Diagnosis?","caseContext":"Lesi telinga dengan histologi khas"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Melanoma","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"Karsinoma sel skuamosa","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"C","text":"Dermatofibrosarcoma protuberans","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Cutaneous T-cell lymphoma","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Karsinoma sel basal","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"B","jawabanBenar":"B","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Karsinoma sel skuamosa (SCC/SCC cutaneous) adalah keganasan keratinosit kedua tersering setelah BCC. Tanda histologi: sel polygonal eosinofilik, intercellular bridges (desmosomes), dan keratin pearls. Lokasi: daerah terpapar UV (pinna, wajah, tangan). Faktor risiko: UV kronis, imunosupresi, HPV, dan arsenik.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Squamous cell carcinoma (SCC) cutaneous adalah malignansi keratinosit dengan potensi metastasis. Incidence: kedua tersering setelah BCC. Subtypes: SCC in situ (Bowen's disease), invasive SCC, keratoacanthoma, dan verrucous carcinoma.","patofisiologi":"Kumulatif UV damage → mutasi DNA (p53, PTCH, RAS) → dysplasia (aktinik keratosis) → invasive SCC. HPV 16, 18 (anogenital/oral). Immunosuppression (transplant): risk 65-250x. Perineural invasion: prognostic factor buruk.","presentasiKlinis":"Papul/nodul eritematosa dengan scale/crust, ulkus, atau exophytic growth di daerah terpapar UV. Pinna: ulserasi persisten non-healing. Subungual: mimics verruca atau onychomycosis. High-risk: diameter >2cm, depth >4mm, perineural invasion, lokasi ear/lip.","diagnosis":"Biopsi (punch/excisional): invasive SCC menunjukkan atypical keratinocytes dari epidermis ke dermis dengan intercellular bridges, keratin pearls, dan mitosis. Perineural invasion harus dilaporkan. Staging menggunakan AJCC 8th edition.","tatalaksana":"Low-risk: eksisi bedah dengan margin 4-6mm, curettage & electrodessication, atau cryotherapy. High-risk: Mohs micrographic surgery atau eksisi dengan margin 6-10mm + adjuvant radiation jika perineural invasion. Metastatic: cemiplimab (PD-1 inhibitor) atau chemotherapy."},"highYieldPoints":["Intercellular bridge + keratin pearl = HISTOLOGI KHAS SCC","#2 keganasan kulit tersering (setelah BCC)","Lokasi: daerah terpapar UV (pinna, wajah, dorsum tangan)","High risk: >2cm, depth >4mm, perineural invasion","Mohs surgery untuk high-risk facial SCC"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"A","mengapaSalah":"Melanoma berasal dari melanosit, bukan keratinosit. Histologi: sel atipikal dengan pigmen melanin, prominent nucleoli, dan mitosis. Tidak ada intercellular bridge atau keratin pearl. Immunohistokimia: S100+, HMB-45+, Melan-A+.","konsepMisconception":"Tumor kulit = melanoma","penjelasanKonsep":"Melanoma: melanocytic origin, S100+, pigmented. SCC: keratinocytic origin, keratin pearls, intercellular bridges. Bedakan dari histology dan IHC."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"DFSP adalah tumor dermis berproliferasi lambat dari fibroblast dengan storiform pattern histologi. Tampilan: plak/keloid-like nodul. Tidak ada keratin pearls atau intercellular bridges. CD34+.","konsepMisconception":"Nodul kulit = DFSP","penjelasanKonsep":"DFSP: dermal, storiform, CD34+. SCC: epidermal origin, keratin pearls. Sangat berbeda histologis."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"CTCL (Mycosis fungoides) adalah lymphoma T-sel kulit. Histologi: atypical lymphoid infiltrate di epidermis (Pautrier microabscesses). Tidak ada keratin pearls. Immunohistokimia: CD3+, CD4+, CD7-.","konsepMisconception":"Infiltrasi sel atipikal = lymphoma","penjelasanKonsep":"CTCL: lymphoid cells, Pautrier abscesses, CD30+/CD4+. SCC: epithelial cells, keratin pearls. Bedakan dari cell type dan architecture."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"BCC berasal dari basaloid cells dengan palisading nuclei di periphery dan retraction artifact. Tidak ada keratin pearls atau intercellular bridges. Histology: nests of basaloid cells with peripheral palisading.","konsepMisconception":"Nodul wajah tua = BCC","penjelasanKonsep":"BCC: basaloid cells, peripheral palisading, retraction artifact. SCC: polygonal cells, intercellular bridges, keratin pearls. Bedaan histologis fundamental."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Karsinoma Sel Skuamosa","subtopik":["Histologi SCC","Faktor risiko","Staging dan tatalaksana"],"medicalTerms":["Keratin pearl","Intercellular bridge","Perineural invasion","Mohs surgery"],"differentialDiagnosis":["BCC","Keratoacanthoma","Melanoma","DFSP"],"clinicalPearls":["Keratin pearl = khas","UV = etiologi utama","Mohs untuk high-risk"],"examHighYield":["Tanda histologi khas","Bedakan dari BCC","Faktor risiko"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mengidentifikasi SCC berdasarkan histologi khas dan membedakannya dari keganasan kulit lain","assessmentIntent":"Menguji kemampuan diagnosis histopatologi SCC","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"SCC dan BCC histologi sama","whyCommon":"Keduanya keganasan kulit","correction":"SCC: keratin pearls + intercellular bridges; BCC: basaloid cells + palisading"}],"clinicalSignificance":"SCC berpotensi metastasis terutama jika high-risk features. Early detection dan appropriate excision krusial."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["Keratin pearl + Intercellular bridge = SCC"]},"slideMapping":"slide-3","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"B","jawabanBenar":"B","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-13","questionNumber":13,"bloomLevel":3,"source":"original","category":"clinical","difficulty":"medium","soalOriginal":{"text":"Pria 21 tahun, hidung penuh 2 bulan, masa polipoid licin transluksan bilateral, IgE tinggi, histologi: stroma edematous, eosinofil. Diagnosis?","caseContext":"Obstruksi hidung kronis bilateral"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Polip nasi","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"Karsinoma sel skuamosa nasi","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Rhinitis kronik","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Rhinitis alergika","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Papilloma inverting","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Polip nasi adalah edema submukosa sinus paranasal yang berprotrusi ke rongga hidung. Klasik: bilateral, licin, transluksan, berisi eosinofil. Terkait: rinitis alergi, asma bronkial, aspirin sensitivity (triad Samter: asma + polip + aspirin). Histologi: stroma edematous, pseudostratified respiratory epithelium, eosinophilic infiltrate.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Polip nasi (nasal polyp) adalah pseudotumor yang berasal dari edema submukosa ethmoid/maxillary sinus. Prevalensi: 1-4% populasi umum, 10-40% pada pasien asma. Etiologi: inflamasi kronik, rinitis alergi, infeksi, CF, dan aspirin sensitivity.","patofisiologi":"Proses inflamasi kronik → upregulasi growth factors (VEGF, TGF-β) → edema submukosa → polip. Eosinophilic inflammation dominant (IL-5, eotaxin). Aspirin sensitivity: arachidonic acid metabolism disorder → leukotriene overproduction.","presentasiKlinis":"Obstruksi hidung bilateral progresif, hiposmia/anosmia, rinore klear, postnasal drip, facial pain/pressure. Endoskopi: massa licin transluksan bilateral dari ostiomeatal complex. Complications: sleep apnea, sinusitis kronik, asma exacerbation.","diagnosis":"Diagnosis klinis + endoskopi. CT scan paranasal sinus: opasifikasi sinus dengan remodeling osseus tanpa destruksi (berbeda dari malignancy). Histologi: pseudostratified ciliated columnar epithelium, stroma edematous, eosinophilic/lymphocytic infiltrate, thick basement membrane. Skin prick test untuk alergi.","tatalaksana":"Medikal: intranasal corticosteroids (flutikason, mometason) = first-line. Oral corticosteroids (prednison) untuk polip besar. Antileukotriene (montelukast) untuk aspirin sensitivity. Antibiotik jika sinusitis superimposed. Surgical: functional endoscopic sinus surgery (FESS) untuk refractory/massive polyps. Aspirin desensitization untuk triad Samter."},"highYieldPoints":["Polip nasi: BILATERAL, licin, transluksan","Eosinofil + edema stroma = histologi khas","Triad Samter: asma + polip + aspirin sensitivity","Bedakan dari malignancy: bilateral, no bone destruction","FESS untuk refractory"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"SCC nasi jarang bilateral, biasanya unilateral dengan ulserasi, epistaksis, dan bone destruction pada CT. Histologi: atypical squamous cells, keratin pearls. Polip nasi tidak ada atipia.","konsepMisconception":"Massa hidung = malignancy","penjelasanKonsep":"Polip: bilateral, smooth, translucent, no bone destruction. SCC: unilateral, ulcerated, bone destruction. CT scan krusial untuk membedakan."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"Rhinitis kronik adalah inflamasi mukosa hidung tanpa polip. Gejala: obstruksi, rinore, bersin-bersin tapi tidak ada massa polipoid yang terlihat pada endoskopi.","konsepMisconception":"Obstruksi hidung = rhinitis","penjelasanKonsep":"Rhinitis: mucosal inflammation only. Polyp: distinct mass protruding into nasal cavity. Endoskopi membedakan."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"Rhinitis alergika dapat mendahului/menyertai polip, tetapi diagnosis yang tepat untuk MASSA yang terlihat adalah polip nasi. Rhinitis alergika alone tidak menyebabkan polip pada semua pasien.","konsepMisconception":"IgE tinggi = rhinitis alergika","penjelasanKonsep":"IgE tinggi menunjukkan atopy yang mendasari. Tapi massa polipoid yang dilapisi edematous stroma dengan eosinofil = nasal polyp. Polip adalah komplikasi dari rhinitis alergika, bukan diagnosis utama."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Inverted papilloma adalah tumor epithelial benign yang unilateral, berwarna merah-abu, surface bergerigi (cauliflower-like), dan dapat menyebabkan bone destruction. Tidak transluksan, tidak bilateral.","konsepMisconception":"Massa hidung = papilloma","penjelasanKonsep":"Inverted papilloma: unilateral, reddish, friable, bone remodeling. Polyp: bilateral, translucent, smooth. CT scan dan histologi membedakan."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Polip Nasi","subtopik":["Patofisiologi polip","Triad Samter","FESS"],"medicalTerms":["Nasal polyp","Eosinophilic inflammation","Ostiomeatal complex","FESS"],"differentialDiagnosis":["SCC nasi","Inverted papilloma","Rhinitis alergika","Antrochoanal polyp"],"clinicalPearls":["Bilateral = polip","Eosinofil dominan","FESS untuk refractory"],"examHighYield":["Diagnosis polip","Bedakan dari SCC","Triad Samter"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mendiagnosis polip nasi berdasarkan tanda klinis dan histologi","assessmentIntent":"Menguji kemampuan membedakan polip nasi dari massa hidung lain","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Massa hidung = malignancy","whyCommon":"Keganasan hidung menakutkan","correction":"Polip jauh lebih sering, bilateral, smooth"}],"clinicalSignificance":"Polip nasi dapat menyebabkan anosmia dan exacerbation asma. FESS efektif untuk refractory cases."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["Polip nasi: BILATERAL + transluksan + eosinofil"]},"slideMapping":"slide-8","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-14","questionNumber":14,"bloomLevel":3,"source":"original","category":"clinical","difficulty":"easy","soalOriginal":{"text":"Wanita 25 tahun, keputihan kehijauan 7 hari, gatal, perih, strawberry cervix. Pengobatan?","caseContext":"Vaginitis akut"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Metronidazol p.o 2 gram dosis tunggal","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"Sefiksim p.o 800 mg dosis tunggal","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Doksisiklin p.o 2x100 mg 7 hari","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Itrakonazol p.o 2x100 mg 2 hari","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Asiklovir p.o 5x400 mg 5 hari","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Trichomoniasis adalah IMS paling sering di dunia, disebabkan oleh protozoa flagellate Trichomonas vaginalis. Tanda khas: keputihan kuning-kehijauan berbusa, pruritus, dyspareunia, dan STRAWBERRY CERVIX (punctate hemorrhages pada serviks). Terapi: metronidazol atau tinidazol PO. Pasien dan pasangan HARUS diobati bersama.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Trichomoniasis adalah infeksi protozoa oleh Trichomonas vaginalis yang menyerang vagina, serviks, uretra, dan gland Bartholin. Prevalensi: 3-5% populasi wanita reproduksi. Transmisi seksual. Komplikasi: preterm delivery, low birth weight, dan increased HIV transmission.","patofisiologi":"T. vaginalis adalah protozoa anaerob flagellate yang berkolonisasi pada epitel vagina dan serviks. Menghasilkan enzymes (proteinases, phospholipases) yang merusak epitel. Inflamasi akut → increased vaginal pH (>4.5) → keputihan kehijauan. Strawberry cervix = capillary dilation dan microhemorrhages.","presentasiKlinis":"Wanita: keputihan kuning-kehijauan berbusa (70%), pruritus vulvae, dysuria, dyspareunia, vulvar erythema. Strawberry cervix (2-5% visual inspection, 45% colposcopy). Pria: asimptomatik (70%) atau uretritis ringan.","diagnosis":"Wet mount microscopy: motile flagellated protozoa (sensitivitas 50-70%). OSOM Trichomonas Rapid Test (sensitivitas >83%). Nucleic acid amplification test (NAAT): gold standard (sensitivitas >95%). Culture: Diamond medium (gold standard tapi jarang). pH vaginal >4.5.","tatalaksana":"First-line: metronidazole 2g PO single dose ATAU 500mg BID x 7 hari. Alternatif: tinidazole 2g PO single dose. Pasangan SEKSUAL HARUS diobati bersama. Abstain selama treatment + 7 hari setelah. Test of cure tidak diperlukan jika asimptomatik. Resistensi: high-dose metronidazole 500mg TID x 7 hari."},"highYieldPoints":["Strawberry cervix = tanda khas (tapi jarang terlihat)","Keputihan kehijauan berbusa = klinis khas","Metronidazol 2g single dose = terapi pilihan","NAAT = gold standard diagnosis","PASANGAN HARUS DIQBATI BERSAMA"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"Sefiksim (sefalosporin generasi III) adalah terapi untuk gonore (Neisseria gonorrhoeae), bukan trichomoniasis. Gonore: duh mukopurulen kuning, Gram negatif diplococcus intraseluler.","konsepMisconception":"Semua IMS keputihan = gonore","penjelasanKonsep":"Gonore: mukopurulent yellow discharge, Gram negative diplococci. Trichomoniasis: green-foamy discharge, motile protozoa. Bedakan dari morphology discharge dan microscopy."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"Doksisiklin adalah terapi untuk Chlamydia trachomatis (non-gonococcal urethritis/cervicitis). Chlamydia: duh mukopurulen/mucoid, silent infection, tidak ada strawberry cervix.","konsepMisconception":"Semua vaginitis = Chlamydia","penjelasanKonsep":"Chlamydia: often asymptomatic, mucoid discharge, NAAT diagnosis. Trichomoniasis: symptomatic, frothy green discharge, strawberry cervix. Bedakan dari clinical features."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"Itrakonazol adalah antifungal azol untuk candidiasis vulvovaginitis. Candida: duh putih keju cottage cheese, pH normal (<4.5), pseudohifa pada KOH. Tidak ada strawberry cervix.","konsepMisconception":"Semua vaginitis gatal = kandidiasis","penjelasanKonsep":"Candida: white curdy discharge, itching dominant, normal pH. Trichomoniasis: green discharge, strawberry cervix, elevated pH. Bedakan dari discharge characteristics dan pH."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Asiklovir adalah antivirus untuk HSV (herpes genital). Herpes: vesikel gruping painful, ulceration, recurrent. Tidak ada keputihan kehijauan atau strawberry cervix.","konsepMisconception":"Vaginitis dengan gatal = herpes","penjelasanKonsep":"HSV: vesicles, ulcers, pain. Trichomoniasis: discharge, strawberry cervix. Sangat berbeda secara klinis."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Trichomoniasis Vaginalis","subtopik":["IMS protozoa","Strawberry cervix","Terapi metronidazol"],"medicalTerms":["Trichomonas vaginalis","Strawberry cervix","Metronidazole","NAAT"],"differentialDiagnosis":["Bacterial vaginosis","Candidiasis vulvovaginitis","Gonococcal cervicitis","Chlamydia cervicitis"],"clinicalPearls":["Strawberry cervix = khas","Metronidazol 2g SD","Treat partner"],"examHighYield":["Diagnosis","Terapi pilihan","Bedakan dari BV dan candidiasis"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mendiagnosis trichomoniasis dan membedakannya dari vaginitis lain","assessmentIntent":"Menguji kemampuan diagnosis vaginitis berdasarkan tanda khas","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Vaginitis gatal = kandidiasis","whyCommon":"Kandidiasis paling dikenal","correction":"Trichomoniasis: green discharge + strawberry cervix + elevated pH"}],"clinicalSignificance":"Trichomoniasis meningkatkan transmisi HIV dan komplikasi kehamilan. Treat partner penting untuk mencegah reinfeksi."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["Strawberry cervix + keputihan kehijauan = Trichomoniasis"]},"slideMapping":"slide-5","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-15","questionNumber":15,"bloomLevel":3,"source":"original","category":"clinical","difficulty":"easy","soalOriginal":{"text":"Anak balita, gatal seminggu, papul vesikel erosi krusta sela jari punggung perut, keluarga serupa, gatal malam. Organisme?","caseContext":"Infestasi parasit kulit"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Sarcoptes scabiei","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"Pediculus humanus corporis","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Phthirus pubis","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Demodex folliculorum","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Cimex lectularius","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Skabies (sarcoptiasis) adalah infestasi Sarcoptes scabiei var. hominis yang menyebabkan gatal hebat terutama malam hari. Lokasi: sela jari, pergelangan tangan, aksila, perut, gluteal. Gejala: papul, vesikel, linier burrows, erosi dari garukan, dan krusta. Epidemiologi: keluarga/kontak dekat. Tanda kardinal: burrow, vesikel di penis/gland, dan sela jari.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Skabies adalah infestasi kulit oleh tungau Sarcoptes scabiei var. hominis. Prevalensi: ~200 juta kasus global per tahun. Endemis di daerah tropis dan overcrowded. Zoonotic potential dari S. scabiei var. canis (temporary infestation).","patofisiologi":"Tungau betina (0.3-0.5mm) menggali terowongan di stratum corneum (burrow), bertelur 2-3/hari, hidup 1-2 bulan. Sensitisasi delayed-type (2-6 minggu pertama/reinfestasi 1-4 hari) terhadap tungau, telur, dan feses. Gatal parah akibat respons inflamasi Th2/IL-4/IL-13.","presentasiKlinis":"Gatal parah NOCTURNAL (pathognomonic). Lesi: papul eritematosa, vesikel, linier burrows, ekskoriasi, krusta. Lokasi khas: sela jari (interdigital webspaces), pergelangan tangan (flexor), siku, aksila, puting payudara, umbilicus, gluteal, penis/vulva. Crusted scabies (Norwegian): immunocompromised, thick crusts, millions of mites.","diagnosis":"Diagnosis klinis: nocturnal pruritus + distribution khas + household contact. Konfirmasi: mikroskop scrapings dari burrow dengan KOH 10% → lihat tungau, telur, atau feses (scybala). Dermatoscopy: delta wing sign (tungau di ujung burrow). Ink test (tinta biru): burrow visualization.","tatalaksana":"First-line: permethrin 5% cream (aplikasi neck-down semalaman, ulang 7 hari). Alternatif: ivermectin 200mcg/kg PO dosis tunggal (ulang 7-14 hari). Lindane 1% (terakhir karena neurotoxicity). Itching dapat persist 2-4 minggu pasca treatment (post-scabietic itch). Semua kontak dekat dan keluarga HARUS diobati bersama. Baju dan sprei dicuci panas atau diisolasi 72 jam."},"highYieldPoints":["Gatal MALAM HARI = pathognomonic","Sela jari + pergelangan tangan = lokasi khas","Burrow = tanda diagnosis","Permethrin 5% = first-line topical","TREAT ALL HOUSEHOLD CONTACTS"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"Pediculus humanus corporis (body louse) menyebabkan pediculosis corporis. Lesi: papul pruriginous di bahu, trunkus, gluteal. Tidak ada burrow, vesikel di sela jari, atau nocturnal predominance. Ditemukan louse/lice eggs (nits) di pakaian.","konsepMisconception":"Semua infestasi gatal = kutu","penjelasanKonsep":"Body lice: clothing-borne, trunkus/buttocks, nits on clothing. Scabies: skin-burrowing, interdigital/wrist, burrows. Bedakan dari vector dan distribution."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"Pubic louse (crab louse) infestasi area genital/pubic hair. Ditemukan lice menempel pada batang rambut. Tidak menggali burrow atau menyebabkan vesikel di sela jari. Transmisi seksual.","konsepMisconception":"Pubic lice = scabies","penjelasanKonsep":"Pubic lice: pubic hair, visible lice attached to hair shafts. Scabies: burrows in skin, interdigital spaces. Different morphology and distribution."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"Demodex folliculorum adalah tungau normal flora folikel rambut dan kelenjar sebasea. Bersifat komensal. Pada rosacea dapat berperan patogenik tapi tidak menyebabkan gatal hebat atau burrows.","konceptMisconception":"Demodex = penyebab gatal","penjelasanKonsep":"Demodex: normal flora, asymptomatic. Scabies: pathogenic, intense pruritus, burrows. Demodex diagnosis: microscopic examination of skin scraping from follicle."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Cimex lectularius (bed bug) menyebabkan bites linear/grouped (breakfast, lunch, dinner pattern) di area exposed skin. Ditemukan di tempat tidur/furniture. Tidak ada burrow atau vesikel khas skabies.","konsepMisconception":"Bed bug bites = scabies","penjelasanKonsep":"Bed bugs: exposed skin, linear pattern, found in bedding. Scabies: interdigital, burrows, nocturnal, household spread. Different exposure history and lesion pattern."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Skabies","subtopik":["Sarcoptes scabiei","Burrow","Permethrin","Post-scabietic itch"],"medicalTerms":["Scabies","Burrow","Permethrin 5%","Ivermectin","Crusted scabies"],"differentialDiagnosis":["Atopic dermatitis","Pediculosis","Dermatitis herpetiformis","Insect bites"],"clinicalPearls":["Gatal malam = khas","Permethrin 5% first-line","Treat all contacts"],"examHighYield":["Tanda khas","Terapi","Bedakan dari pediculosis"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mendiagnosis skabies berdasarkan gatal malam dan burrow","assessmentIntent":"Menguji kemampuan membedakan skabies dari infestasi lain","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Semua gatal infestasi = kutu","whyCommon":"Kutu paling umum dikenal","correction":"Skabies: burrow + nocturnal + interdigital; Lice: visible on hair/clothing"}],"clinicalSignificance":"Skabies epidemik di daerah padat dan kurang sanitasi. Treat all contacts mencegah reinfeksi siklik."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["Gatal MALAM + sela jari + burrow = SKABIES"]},"slideMapping":"slide-6","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-16","questionNumber":16,"bloomLevel":2,"source":"original","category":"knowledge","difficulty":"easy","soalOriginal":{"text":"Yang bukan merupakan kompleks osteomeatal (KOM) adalah...","caseContext":"Anatomi sinus paranasal"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Infundibulum ethmoidale","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"Hiatus semilunaris","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Bula ethmoidalis","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Processus uncinatus","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Sinus ethmoid posterior","isCorrect":true}],"correctAnswerKey":"E","jawabanBenar":"E","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Kompleks osteomeatal (KOM) adalah unit fungsional di meatus nasi medius yang mencakup: hiatus semilunaris, infundibulum ethmoidale, bula ethmoidalis, dan processus uncinatus. Sinus ethmoid posterior BUKAN bagian KOM; sinus ini bermuara ke meatus nasi superior (bukan medius).","lengkap":{"definisi":"Ostiomeatal complex (OMC) adalah unit fungsional ventilasi dan drainase sinus paranasal anterior di lateral nasal wall. KOM terdiri dari: hiatus semilunaris (celah antara uncinate process dan ethmoidal bulla), infundibulum ethmoidale (saluran antara uncinate dan bulla), ethmoidal bulla (sel ethmoid anterior terbesar), dan uncinate process (lamina tipis dari ethmoid inferior).","patofisiologi":"Obstruksi KOM menyebabkan stasis sekret sinus → inflamasi → rinosinusitis akut/kronik. Obstruksi dapat disebabkan: deviasi septum, konka bullosa, Haller cell, paradoxical middle turbinate, atau mucosal edema dari alergi/infeksi.","presentasiKlinis":"Obstruksi KOM: obstruksi hidung unilateral/bilateral, rinore purulen, anosmia/hyposmia, facial pain/pressure, headache. Endoskopi: edema mukosa, purulen discharge dari middle meatus.","diagnosis":"CT scan paranasal sinus (coronal view) adalah gold standard untuk evaluasi KOM. Tanda: opasifikasi sinus maxillaris, ethmoid anterior, dan frontal; mucosal thickening; air-fluid level; anatomical variants (concha bullosa, Haller cell, paradoxical turbinate).","tatalaksana":"Medikal: intranasal corticosteroids, saline irrigation, decongestan jangka pendek. Antibiotik jika bakterial sinusitis. Surgical: functional endoscopic sinus surgery (FESS) dengan uncinectomy dan antrostomy untuk refractory cases."},"highYieldPoints":["KOM = Hiatus semilunaris + Infundibulum + Bulla ethmoidalis + Uncinate process","Semua sinus anterior bermuara ke meatus medius melalui KOM","Sinus ethmoid posterior → meatus nasi SUPERIOR","Obstruksi KOM = rinosinusitis","CT coronal = gold standard evaluasi"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"A","mengapaSalah":"Infundibulum ethmoidale ADALAH bagian KOM. Ini adalah saluran sempit antara uncinate process anteriorly dan ethmoidal bulla posteriorly. Sinus maxillaris dan anterior ethmoid drain melalui infundibulum.","konsepMisconception":"Infundibulum bukan bagian KOM","penjelasanKonsep":"Infundibulum = komponen utama KOM. Drainase sinus maxillaris, anterior ethmoid, dan frontal melalui infundibulum. Obstruksi infundibulum → sinusitis maxillaris."},{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"Hiatus semilunaris ADALAH bagian KOM. Ini adalah celah/ostium antara uncinate process dan ethmoidal bulla yang terbuka ke meatus nasi medius.","konsepMisconception":"Hiatus bukan KOM","penjelasanKonsep":"Hiatus semilunaris = opening dari infundibulum ke meatus medius. Saluran utama drainase sinus anterior. Komponen vital KOM."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"Bula ethmoidalis ADALAH bagian KOM. Ini adalah sel ethmoid anterior terbesar yang membentuk posterior boundary dari infundibulum.","konceptMisconception":"Bulla bukan KOM","penjelasanKonsep":"Ethmoidal bulla = largest anterior ethmoid air cell. Berbatasan dengan infundibulum posteriorly. Obstruksi bulla → ethmoid sinusitis."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"Processus uncinatus ADALAH bagian KOM. Ini adalah lamina tipis tulang ethmoid yang membentuk anterior dan inferior boundary dari infundibulum. Uncinectomy adalah langkah pertama FESS.","konsepMisconception":"Uncinate bukan KOM","penjelasanKonsep":"Uncinate process = thin ethmoidal bone forming anterior boundary of infundibulum. Uncinectomy = first step FESS. Vital component of OMC."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Kompleks Osteomeatal","subtopik":["Anatomi sinus paranasal","Drainase sinus","FESS"],"medicalTerms":["OMC","Hiatus semilunaris","Infundibulum","Uncinate process","Ethmoidal bulla"],"differentialDiagnosis":[],"clinicalPearls":["KOM = drainase sinus anterior","Obstruksi = sinusitis","CT coronal evaluasi"],"examHighYield":["Komponen KOM","Drainase sinus","Bedakan posterior ethmoid"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Memahami anatomi KOM dan komponen-komponennya","assessmentIntent":"Menguji pengetahuan anatomi drainase sinus paranasal","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Semua sinus bermuara ke meatus medius","whyCommon":"KOM terletak di meatus medius","correction":"Anterior sinus → meatus medius; Posterior ethmoid + sphenoid → meatus superior"}],"clinicalSignificance":"KOM adalah area kunci untuk FESS. Pemahaman anatomi mencegah komplikasi surgery."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["KOM: Hiatus + Infundibulum + Bulla + Uncinate. BUKAN ethmoid posterior"]},"slideMapping":"slide-1","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"E","jawabanBenar":"E","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-17","questionNumber":17,"bloomLevel":1,"source":"original","category":"knowledge","difficulty":"easy","soalOriginal":{"text":"Kelenjar yang menghasilkan serumen adalah...","caseContext":"Anatomi telinga"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Kelenjar sebacea","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"Kelenjar seruminosa (apokrin)","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"C","text":"Kelenjar minyak","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Kelenjar ekrin/merokrin","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Kelenjar lacrimalis","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"B","jawabanBenar":"B","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Serumen (earwax) dihasilkan oleh kelenjar seruminosa (apokrin glands) dan kelenjar sebacea yang terdapat di daerah kartilago meatus akustikus eksternus (outer 1/3). Kelenjar seruminosa adalah modifikasi kelenjar apokrin yang terletak di submukosa. Serumen bersifat protektif: antimikroba, pelumas, dan barrier.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Serumen adalah substansi kuning-coklat yang dihasilkan oleh kelenjar seruminosa (apokrin) dan sebacea di meatus akustikus eksternus. Komposisi: shed skin cells (60%), hair, secretions (seruminous + sebaceous).","patofisiologi":"Kelenjar seruminosa: modifikasi apokrin glands di submukosa outer 1/3 meatus kartilago. Produksi: 2 kg sel kulit + sekret/tahun. Fungsi protektif: pH asam (5.2-7.0), antimikroba (lysozyme, immunoglobulin), pelumas, dan barrier debu/benda asing.","presentasiKlinis":"Impaksi serumen: penyumbatan telinga, pendengaran berkurang (konduktif), tinnitus, vertigo, batuk refleks (Arnold nerve). Predisposisi: cotton bud use, hearing aids, anak-anak, lanjut usia.","diagnosis":"Otoskopi: massa coklat/kekuningan yang menyumbat meatus. Audiogram: hearing loss konduktif jika impaksi total.","tatalaksana":"Serumenolisis: NaCl 3%, karbogliserin, H2O2. Irigasi: NaCl 0,9% atau warm water. Suction. Manual removal oleh dokter. Kontraindikasi irigasi: perforasi MT, tympanostomy tube, otitis eksterna, perih."},"highYieldPoints":["Kelenjar seruminosa = apokrin glands di outer 1/3 meatus","Serumen = protektif (antimikroba + pelumas)","Impaksi: penyebab HL konduktif reversible paling umum","NaCl 3% = serumenolisis","JANGAN pakai cotton bud (mendorong serumen ke dalam)"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"A","mengapaSalah":"Kelenjar sebacea menghasilkan sebum (lipid) tapi bukan komponen utama serumen. Sebaceous glands berkontribusi sekitar 30% komposisi serumen tapi yang spesifik disebut 'serumen' berasal dari seruminous glands.","konsepMisconception":"Sebacea = serumen","penjelasanKonsep":"Serumen = 60% keratin + sebum + seruminous secretion. Kelenjar seruminosa (apokrin) spesifik untuk meatus. Sebaceous glands universal."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"'Kelenjar minyak' adalah sebutan umum untuk kelenjar sebacea. Tidak menghasilkan komponen utama serumen.","konsepMisconception":"Minyak = serumen","penjelasanKonsep":"Kelenjar minyak = sebaceous glands. Serumen membutuhkan kelenjar seruminosa (apokrin) + sebaceous."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"Kelenjar ekrin/merokrin menghasilkan keringat (air + garam) untuk termoregulasi. Terdapat di seluruh kulit. Tidak terlibat dalam produksi serumen.","konsepMisconception":"Semua kelenjar kulit menghasilkan serumen","penjelasanKonsep":"Ekrin: thermoregulation sweat. Apokrin (seruminous): meatus, axilla, groin. Sebaceous: sebum. Bedakan fungsi dan lokasi."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Kelenjar lacrimalis menghasilkan air mata di orbita superolateral. Tidak ada hubungan dengan telinga atau serumen.","konsepMisconception":"Semua kelenjar sekret di kepala = serumen","penjelasanKonsep":"Lacrimal gland: superolateral orbit → tears. Seruminous glands: outer 1/3 ear canal → cerumen. Completely different anatomy."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Serumen dan Anatomi Telinga","subtopik":["Anatomi meatus","Produksi serumen","Impaksi serumen"],"medicalTerms":["Cerumen","Apocrine gland","Seruminous gland","Impaksi"],"differentialDiagnosis":[],"clinicalPearls":["Seruminosa = apokrin","NaCl 3% untuk serumen","No cotton bud"],"examHighYield":["Kelenjar seruminosa","Fungsi serumen","Tatalaksana impaksi"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mengetahui kelenjar penghasil serumen","assessmentIntent":"Menguji pengetahuan anatomi dasar telinga","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Serumen dari kelenjar sebacea","whyCommon":"Sebacea juga menghasilkan lipid","correction":"Seruminosa (apokrin) = kelenjar utama serumen"}],"clinicalSignificance":"Pemahaman anatomi mencegah trauma saat pembersihan serumen."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["Kelenjar seruminosa (apokrin) = penghasil serumen"]},"slideMapping":"slide-1","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"B","jawabanBenar":"B","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-18","questionNumber":18,"bloomLevel":1,"source":"original","category":"knowledge","difficulty":"easy","soalOriginal":{"text":"Sel melanosit berada pada lapisan epidermis...","caseContext":"Histologi kulit"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Stratum korneum","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"Diantara stratum basal dan stratum spinosum","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"C","text":"Stratum granulosum","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Stratum spinosum","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Stratum lusidum","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"B","jawabanBenar":"B","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Melanosit terletak di stratum basal epidermis (basal layer), bersisian dengan keratinosit. Setiap melanosit melayani sekitar 36 keratinosit (epidermal melanin unit). Melanosit memiliki dendrit yang memanjang ke stratum spinosum untuk transfer melanin (pigment) ke keratinosit.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Melanosit adalah sel neural crest-derived yang menghasilkan melanin melalui melanogenesis. Terletak di stratum basale epidermis, folikel rambut, iris, dan leptomeninges. Populasi: 1 melanosit per 10 keratinosit di basal layer.","patofisiologi":"Melanogenesis: tyrosinase mengkonversi tyrosine → DOPA → melanin (eumelanin hitam/pheomelanin merah). Melanin disimpan dalam melanosom yang ditransfer ke keratinosit via dendrit. Fungsi: proteksi UV (absorpsi 99.9% UVB), antioxidant, dan determinant skin color.","presentasiKlinis":"Kelainan melanosit: vitiligo (autoimun destruction → depigmentasi), melasma (hiperpigmentasi hormonal), melanoma (malignant transformation), dan nevomelanocytic nevus (benign proliferation).","diagnosis":"Identifikasi melanosit: imunohistokimia S100+, HMB-45+, Melan-A+. Pada histologi H&E: sel clear dengan nukleus gelap di basal layer. Dendrit tidak terlihat pada H&E rutin.","tatalaksana":"Vitiligo: kortikosteroid topikal, kalsineurin inhibitor, fototerapi. Melanoma: eksisi dengan margin, sentinel node biopsy, adjuvant therapy."},"highYieldPoints":["Melanosit di STRATUM BASAL","1 melanosit : 36 keratinosit (epidermal melanin unit)","Melanin transfer via dendrit ke keratinosit","Tyrosinase = enzyme kunci melanogenesis","S100+, HMB-45+ = marker melanosit"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"A","mengapaSalah":"Stratum korneum adalah lapisan terluar epidermis berisi keratinosit mati (anucleate) yang mengandung keratin. Melanosit tidak ada di lapisan ini.","konsepMisconception":"Pigmen kulit di lapisan terluar","penjelasanKonsep":"Melanin ada di keratinosit stratum basale sampai korneum (melanin descent). Tapi melanocyte CELL-nya hanya di basal layer."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"Stratum granulosum mengandung keratinosit dengan granula keratohyalin dan lamellar bodies. Melanosit tidak berada di lapisan ini.","konsepMisconception":"Granula = melanin","penjelasanKonsep":"Keratohyalin granules ≠ melanin. Melanin di basal; keratohyalin di granulosum. Different cell products."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"Stratum spinosum mengandung keratinosit multipolar dengan desmosom (spiny appearance). Keratinosit di sini MENERIMA melanin dari melanosit tapi melanosit CELL-nya tidak berada di sini.","konsepMisconception":"Melanin di spinosum = melanosit di spinosum","penjelasanKonsep":"Melanin transferred TO spinosum keratinocytes. Melanocyte CELL stays in basale. Dendrites reach spinosum."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Stratum lusidum hanya ada di thick skin (telapak tangan/kaki). Lapisan transparan elektron-dense. Tidak mengandung melanosit.","konceptMisconception":"Lusidum ada di semua kulit","penjelasanKonsep":"Stratum lusidum: thick skin only (palms/soles). Not present in thin skin. Melanocytes not found here."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Melanosit dan Pigmentasi Kulit","subtopik":["Histologi epidermis","Melanogenesis","Epidermal melanin unit"],"medicalTerms":["Melanocyte","Stratum basale","Melanin","Tyrosinase","Melanosome"],"differentialDiagnosis":[],"clinicalPearls":["Basal layer","1:36 ratio","S100+ marker"],"examHighYield":["Lokasi melanosit","Melanogenesis","Bedakan dari melanin distribution"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mengetahui lokasi melanosit di epidermis","assessmentIntent":"Menguji pengetahuan histologi kulit dasar","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Melanin di stratum korneum = melanosit di sana","whyCommon":"Melihat warna kulit terluar","correction":"Melanocyt CELL only in basale; melanin distributed to upper layers"}],"clinicalSignificance":"Pemahaman lokasi melanosit penting untuk diagnosis melanoma dan vitiligo."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["Melanosit di STRATUM BASAL epidermis"]},"slideMapping":"slide-6","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"B","jawabanBenar":"B","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-19","questionNumber":19,"bloomLevel":3,"source":"original","category":"clinical","difficulty":"medium","soalOriginal":{"text":"Petani 68 tahun, tahi lalat pipi kanan membesar, nodul soliter, ulkus rodent, telangiektasis. Diagnosis?","caseContext":"Lesion wajah progresif pada petani"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Karsinoma sel basal","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"Melanoma","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Keratosis seboroik","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Kista epidermal","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Karsinoma sel skuamosa","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Karsinoma sel basal (BCC) adalah keganasan kulit tersering. Tanda khas: nodul pearly transluksan dengan telangiektasis dan rolled border, atau ulkus rodent dengan tepi menggulung. Faktor risiko: UV kronis (petani/nelayan), kulit terang, umur >60. Histologi: sel basaloid berjejer palisading. Jarang metastasis tapi locally invasive.","lengkap":{"definisi":"BCC adalah malignansi basaloid cells dari epidermis atau folikel rambut. Incidence: keganasan kulit tersering (75-80%). Subtypes: nodular (60%), superficial, morpheaform, dan pigmented.","patofisiologi":"Mutasi gen Hedgehog pathway: inactivating PTCH1 atau activating SMO. UV-induced DNA damage → mutasi tumor suppressor genes. BCC tumbuh lambat, locally invasive, metastasis <0.1%.","presentasiKlinis":"Nodular BCC: papul/nodul pearly transluksan, telangiektasis, rolled border, sentral ulceration (rodent ulcer). Lokasi: wajah (nose 25-30%), leher, dorsal hands. Superficial: plak eritematosa skala. Morpheaform: plak putih sklerotik (aggressive).","diagnosis":"Diagnosis klinis + biopsi (punch/shave/excisional). Histologi: nests basaloid cells, hyperchromatic nuclei, scant cytoplasm, peripheral palisading, retraction artifact. Immunohistokimia: BerEP4+, BCL2+, CD10-.","tatalaksana":"Curettage & electrodessication untuk low-risk. Eksisi bedah untuk standard. Mohs micrographic surgery untuk high-risk (wajah, recurrent, morpheaform). Radiation untuk inoperable. Vismodegib (Hedgehog inhibitor) untuk advanced."},"highYieldPoints":["Pearly nodule + telangiectasia + rolled border = BCC","Rodent ulcer = BCC ulcerated","Palisading nuclei = histology hallmark","Mohs surgery for facial/high-risk","Rarely metastasizes"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"Melanoma: ABCDE criteria, pigmented lesion with color variation, irregular border. BCC: pearly, non-pigmented (usually), rolled border. Histology: melanoma = S100+, HMB-45+; BCC = BerEP4+.","konsepMisconception":"Dark lesion = melanoma; Pearly lesion = melanoma amelanotic","penjelasanKonsep":"Amelanotic melanoma can mimic BCC. Key difference: melanoma grows rapidly, BCC slowly. Biopsy confirms diagnosis."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"Keratosis seboroik: stuck-on appearance, waxy, multiple, brown/black. BCC: pearly, transluksan, telangiectasia, usually solitary. SK tidak ada telangiectasia atau rolled border.","konsepMisconception":"Pigmented BCC = SK","penjelasanKonsep":"Pigmented BCC: pearly + pigment. SK: stuck-on + waxy. Dermoscopy: BCC = arborizing vessels; SK = milia-like cysts."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"Epidermoid cyst: subcutaneous nodule with central punctum, contains keratin. BCC: superficial/epidermal, no punctum, pearly appearance. Completely different morphology.","konsepMisconception":"Nodul kulit = kista","penjelasanKonsep":"Cyst: subcutaneous, punctum, keratin. BCC: epidermal origin, pearly, telangiectasia. Location and surface differ."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"SCC: keratin pearls, intercellular bridges, scaly/crusted lesion. BCC: pearly, no scale, palisading. SCC more aggressive, higher metastatic potential. Histology clearly distinguishes them.","konsepMisconception":"Ulkus kulit tua = SCC","penjelasanKonsep":"SCC: scaly, crusted, rapid growth. BCC: pearly, slow-growing, rolled border. Both occur in sun-exposed skin but morphology differs."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Karsinoma Sel Basal","subtopik":["Tipe BCC","Tanda khas","Mohs surgery"],"medicalTerms":["BCC","Rodent ulcer","Pearly papule","Palisading","Mohs surgery"],"differentialDiagnosis":["Melanoma","SCC","SK","Epidermoid cyst"],"clinicalPearls":["Pearly + telangiectasia = BCC","Jarang metastasis","Mohs untuk facial"],"examHighYield":["Tanda klinis","Histologi palisading","Tatalaksana"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mengidentifikasi BCC berdasarkan tanda khas dan membedakannya dari lesi lain","assessmentIntent":"Menguji diagnosis klinis keganasan kulit tersering","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Ulkus tua = SCC selalu","whyCommon":"SCC lebih agresif","correction":"Rodent ulcer = BCC; BCC lebih sering di wajah tua"}],"clinicalSignificance":"BCC adalah keganasan kulit paling sering. Early recognition mencegah destruksi jaringan local."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["Pearly + rolled border + telangiectasia = BCC"]},"slideMapping":"slide-3","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-20","questionNumber":20,"bloomLevel":3,"source":"original","category":"clinical","difficulty":"hard","soalOriginal":{"text":"Wanita 50 tahun, mata kanan merah 3 hari, visus kabur, sakit kepala hebat, mual muntah, TIO tidak terukur, kornea edema, COA dangkal. Diagnosis?","caseContext":"Emergency oftalmologi akut"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Glaukoma akut sudut tertutup","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"Endoftalmitis","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Panoftalmitis","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Uveitis anterior","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Ulkus kornea bakteri","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Glaukoma akut sudut tertutup (AACG) adalah emergency oftalmologi dengan trias: sakit kepala hebat, mual muntah, dan penurunan visus mendadak. Tanda: injeksi siliar, kornea edema steamy, COA dangkal, pupil middilated fixed oval. TIO sangat tinggi (>40-80 mmHg). Penyebab: pupillary block akibat contact iris-lens.","lengkap":{"definisi":"AACG adalah peningkatan TIO mendadak akibat closure sudut iridokorneal. Mekanisme: pupillary block (contact iris-lens) → aqueous humor tidak bisa mengalir dari posterior chamber ke anterior chamber → bowing iris anterior → angle closure → TIO naik drastis.","patofisiologi":"Predisposisi: hyperopia (shallow anterior chamber), small corneal diameter, thick lens, plateau iris. Triger: pupil dilatation (dark room, stress, antikolinergik/simpatomimetik). Akut IOP rise → iskemia optic nerve → permanent vision loss dalam 24-48 jam.","presentasiKlinis":"Trias: (1) periorbital pain/sakit kepala hebat (V1 distribution), (2) mual muntah (vagal response), (3) visus mendadak turun. Tanda: injeksi siliar, kornea edema steamy, shallow AC, middilated fixed pupil, optic disc hyperemia/edema.","diagnosis":"Tonometri: IOP sangat tinggi (40-80 mmHg). Gonioskopi: angle closure. Slit lamp: shallow AC, corneal edema. USG biomicroscopy (UBM) untuk plateau iris. A-scan: reduced anterior chamber depth.","tatalaksana":"EMERGENCY: (1) Manitol IV 20% untuk osmotic diuresis; (2) Asetazolamid 500mg IV/PO (CA inhibitor); (3) Timolol 0.5% topikal (beta blocker); (4) Pilokarpin 2-4% (miotik) SETELAH IOP turun; (5) Steroid topikal untuk inflamasi. Definitif: laser peripheral iridotomy (LPI) pada kedua mata."},"highYieldPoints":["Trias: sakit kepala + mual muntah + visus turun = AACG","TIO >40 mmHg = emergency","Cornea steamy edema + shallow AC","Pupil middilated fixed oval","LPI = tatalaksana definitif"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"Endoftalmitis: infeksi intraokular (vitreous chamber) pasca surgery/trauma. Hypopyon AC, vitritis, visus turun. Tidak ada TIO tinggi, kornea edema steamy, atau pupil middilated.","konsepMisconception":"Mata merah akut dengan visus turun = infeksi","penjelasanKonsep":"Endoftalmitis: post-op/trauma, hypopyon, vitritis. AACG: acute IOP rise, steamy cornea, shallow AC. Different contexts and signs."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"Panoftalmitis: infeksi seluruh struktur bola mata (kornea sampai sklera). Lebih jarang, severe pain, proptosis, limited eye movement. Tidak ada TIO sangat tinggi khas AACG.","konsepMisconception":"Inflamasi mata total = glaukoma","penjelasanKonsep":"Panoftalmitis: severe infection, proptosis, EOM restriction. AACG: IOP rise, corneal edema, shallow AC. Completely different entities."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"Uveitis anterior: keratic precipitates (KP), AC cells/flare, ciliary injection, photophobia. IOP normal atau sedikit rendah. Tidak ada TIO sangat tinggi atau cornea steamy edema.","konsepMisconception":"Injeksi siliar + nyeri mata = uveitis","penjelasanKonsep":"Uveitis: KP, AC cells, normal/low IOP. AACG: steamy cornea, very high IOP, shallow AC. Gonioscopy distinguishes."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Ulkus kornea bakteri: infiltrat purulen, epithelial defect, AC reaction/hypopyon. IOP normal. Tidak ada sakit kepala, mual muntah, atau TIO tinggi.","konsepMisconception":"Mata merah akut = ulkus kornea","penjelasanKonsep":"Corneal ulcer: epithelial defect, infiltrate, normal IOP. AACG: intact epithelium, clear infiltrate, very high IOP. Slit lamp differentiates."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Glaukoma Akut Sudut Tertutup","subtopik":["Pupillary block","Emergency glaukoma","LPI"],"medicalTerms":["AACG","IOP","Shallow AC","Steamy cornea","Peripheral iridotomy"],"differentialDiagnosis":["Endoftalmitis","Uveitis","Corneal ulcer","Acute iritis"],"clinicalPearls":["Emergency 24-48 jam","LPI definitif","Manitol + asetazolamid"],"examHighYield":["Trias klinis","Tanda slit lamp","Tatalaksana emergency"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mendiagnosis AACG sebagai emergency oftalmologi","assessmentIntent":"Menguji recognition emergency glaucoma dan differential diagnosis","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Mata merah + sakit kepala = sinusitis/migraine","whyCommon":"Nyeri referred ke kepala","correction":"AACG: trias + TIO tinggi + shallow AC. Jangan miss!"}],"clinicalSignificance":"AACG dapat menyebabkan kebutaan permanen dalam 24-48 jam. Immediate IOP lowering dan LPI krusial."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["Sakit kepala + mual + visus turun = AACG EMERGENCY"]},"slideMapping":"slide-11","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-21","questionNumber":21,"bloomLevel":2,"source":"original","category":"knowledge","difficulty":"easy","soalOriginal":{"text":"Side effect beta blocker yang berhubungan dengan asma adalah...","caseContext":"Farmakologi kardiovaskular"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Bronkospasme","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"Takikardia","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Hipertensi","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Hipoglikemia","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Diare","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Beta blocker non-selektif (propranolol) menghambat reseptor beta-2 di bronkus → bronkospasme. Kontraindikasi pada asma. Beta blocker kardioselektif (metoprolol, bisoprolol) lebih aman tapi tetap hati-hati. Beta-2 agonist (salbutamol) merupakan terapi utama asma.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Beta blocker adalah antagonis reseptor adrenergik beta. Beta-1: jantung (inotrop, kronotrop). Beta-2: bronkus (dilatasi), vaskular (dilatasi), uterus, hati (glikogenolisis).","patofisiologi":"Beta-2 stimulation → adenilat siklase → cAMP → bronkodilatasi. Beta blocker non-selektif → blokade beta-2 → bronkokonstriksi → bronkospasme. Pada asma: hiperreactivity bronkus → bronkospasme parah dapat terjadi.","presentasiKlinis":"Sesak napas, wheezing, penurunan PEF setelah beta blocker. Riwayat asma + beta blocker non-selektif. Bisa fatal jika tidak ditangani.","diagnosis":"Anamnesis obat + riwayat asma + auskultasi wheezing + penurunan PEF. Spirometri: penurunan FEV1 reversible setelah beta-2 agonist.","tatalaksana":"Hentikan beta blocker. Bronkodilator beta-2 agonist (salbutamol nebulizer). Kortikosteroid sistemik. Oksigen. Jika gagal: ventilasi mekanik."},"highYieldPoints":["Non-selektif beta blocker = bronkospasme","Kontraindikasi pada asma","Selektif beta-1 lebih aman","Beta-2 agonist = antidot"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"Beta blocker MENYEBABKAN bradikardia (bukan takikardia) melalui blokade beta-1 di SA/AV node. Decrease heart rate adalah efek terapeutik, bukan side effect.","konsepMisconception":"Semua obat jantung = takikardia","penjelasanKonsep":"Beta blocker: negative chronotropic → bradycardia. Takikardia = withdrawal or overdose paradox."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"Beta blocker menurunkan tekanan darah (antihipertensi). Blokade beta-1 → decrease CO; blokade beta-2 → decrease renin release.","konsepMisconception":"Beta blocker = hipertensi","penjelasanKonsep":"Beta blocker adalah ANTIhipertensi. Kontraindikasi jika hipotensi/bradikardia."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"Beta blocker dapat menyembunyikan gejala hipoglikemia (takikardia, tremor) tapi tidak menyebabkan hipoglikemia langsung. Actually dapat cause hyperglycemia via blockade glycogenolysis.","konsepMisconception":"Beta blocker = hipoglikemia","penjelasanKonsep":"Beta blocker masks hypoglycemia symptoms. Glycogenolysis blocked → can worsen hyperglycemia in diabetics."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Beta blocker tidak menyebabkan diare. Efek GI: nausea, constipation (bukan diare).","konsepMisconception":"Semua obat = GI side effects","penjelasanKonsep":"Beta blocker GI effects minimal. Constipation > diarrhea. Not a characteristic side effect."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Efek Samping Beta Blocker","subtopik":["Beta-1 vs Beta-2","Kontraindikasi","Bronkospasme"],"medicalTerms":["Beta blocker","Bronchospasm","Selectivity","Beta-2 agonist"],"differentialDiagnosis":[],"clinicalPearls":["Non-selective = asthma contraindication","Beta-1 selective safer"],"examHighYield":["Side effect bronkospasme","Kontraindikasi asma"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Memahami efek samping beta blocker pada sistem pernapasan","assessmentIntent":"Menguji pengetahuan kontraindikasi beta blocker","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Semua beta blocker kontraindikasi asma","whyCommon":"Non-selective berbahaya","correction":"Beta-1 selective (metoprolol) lebih aman tapi tetap hati-hati"}],"clinicalSignificance":"Pemilihan beta blocker pada pasien dengan penyakit paru krusial untuk mencegah eksaserbasi."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["Beta blocker non-selektif = KONTRAINDIKASI ASMA"]},"slideMapping":"slide-5","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-22","questionNumber":22,"bloomLevel":2,"source":"original","category":"knowledge","difficulty":"easy","soalOriginal":{"text":"Bayi 5 bulan, gerakan kepala terbatas, sulit berpaling, kepala datar satu sisi, bahu mengangkat. Diagnosis?","caseContext":"Deformitas leher infant"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Tortikolis kongenital","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"Kista brankial","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Kista tiroglossus","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Abses leher","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Skoliosis servikal","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Tortikolis kongenital adalah kependekan m. sternocleidomastoideus (fibrosis) yang menyebabkan kepala miring ke sisi lesio (ipsilateral) dan dagu ke sisi kontralateral. Penyebab: trauma kelahiran (breech), intrauterine malposition, atau fibrosis idiopatik. Plagiocephaly (kepala datar satu sisi) akibat posisi terus-menerus.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Torticollis = twisted neck. Kongenital muscular torticollis (CMT) adalah tersering: fibrosis SCM unilateral. Incidence: 0.3-2% kelahiran hidup.","patofisiologi":" compartment syndrome SCM akibat positioning intrauterine atau birth trauma → iskemia → fibrosis → muscle contracture. Result: head tilt ipsilateral, chin rotation contralateral, limited ROM.","presentasiKlinis":"Neonatal/infant: head tilt + chin rotation. Palpable SCM mass (fibrotic band/sternomastoid tumor). Plagiocephaly (positional flattening). Facial asymmetry jika tidak ditangani. No pain.","diagnosis":"Clinical: head tilt, chin rotation, SCM tightness. USG: hyperechoic fibrotic mass in SCM. X-ray: rule out cervical spine anomalies (Klippel-Feil).","tatalaksana":"Fisioterapi: stretching exercises (90% respond). Positioning modifications. Helm orthosis untuk plagiocephaly. Surgery (bipolar release SCM) untuk refractory >1 tahun."},"highYieldPoints":["Head tilt ipsilateral + chin contralateral = CMT","Fibrosis m. SCM","Plagiocephaly association","PT stretching first-line","Surgery if refractory >1 year"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"Kista brankial: benjolan leher lateral (tepi SCM), berisi cairan mukoid, tidak menyebabkan torticollis atau plagiocephaly.","konsepMisconception":"Massa leher = tortikolis","penjelasanKonsep":"Brachial cyst: cystic mass, no head position change. CMT: SCM fibrosis with head tilt. Different etiology."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"Kista tiroglossus: midline neck cyst, moves with tongue protrusion/swallowing. No head tilt or plagiocephaly.","konsepMisconception":"Midline neck mass = tortikolis","penjelasanKonsep":"Thyroglossal cyst: midline, tongue movement. CMT: lateral SCM involvement, head tilt. Location differentiates."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"Abses leher: akut, painful, erythematous, fluctuant mass with fever. Torticollis dari abses = protective (muscle spasm) tapi tidak kongenital.","konsepMisconception":"Torticollis = infection","penjelasanKonsep":"Acquired torticollis from infection = painful, acute. CMT: painless, congenital, fibrotic band. Context differentiates."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Skoliosis servikal: lateral curvature cervical spine (congenital vertebral anomalies). Can cause head tilt but no SCM mass/fibrosis. X-ray shows vertebral defects.","konsepMisconception":"Head tilt = scoliosis","penjelasanKonsep":"Cervical scoliosis: vertebral anomaly. CMT: muscular fibrosis. Physical exam: SCM tightness in CMT, absent in scoliosis."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Tortikolis Kongenital","subtopik":["Fibrosis SCM","Plagiocephaly","Fisioterapi"],"medicalTerms":["Torticollis","SCM","Plagiocephaly","Sternomastoid tumor"],"differentialDiagnosis":["Brachial cyst","Thyroglossal cyst","Cervical scoliosis"],"clinicalPearls":["Head tilt + chin rotation = CMT","PT stretching 90% success"],"examHighYield":["Tanda khas","Plagiocephaly association","Tatalaksana"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mengidentifikasi tortikolis kongenital","assessmentIntent":"Menguji diagnosis deformitas leher infant","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Torticollis selalu butuh operasi","whyCommon":"Deformitas menakutkan","correction":"90% respond to PT stretching"}],"clinicalSignificance":"Early PT mencegah plagiocephaly permanent dan facial asymmetry."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["Head tilt + chin rotation + plagiocephaly = Tortikolis"]},"slideMapping":"slide-6","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-23","questionNumber":23,"bloomLevel":2,"source":"original","category":"knowledge","difficulty":"easy","soalOriginal":{"text":"Luka bakar kemerahan tanpa bula, nyeri. Derajat? / Luka bakar tidak ada nyeri tekan. Derajat?","caseContext":"Klasifikasi luka bakar"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Derajat 1 / Derajat 3","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"Derajat 2a / Derajat 2b","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Derajat 2b / Derajat 1","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Derajat 3 / Derajat 1","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Derajat 4 / Derajat 2a","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Luka bakar derajat 1: epidermis saja, kemerahan, nyeri, tanpa bulae (contoh: sunburn). Derajat 2: melibatkan dermis, ada bulae. Derajat 2a superficial = bulae + nyeri. Derajat 2b deep = bulae + nyeri BERKURANG. Derajat 3: full thickness (epidermis+dermis+subkutis), pucat/putih/karat, tidak nyeri karena destruksi nervus (tetapi nyeri di perifer). Derajat 4: melibatkan otot/tulang.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Klasifikasi luka bakar berdasarkan kedalaman: superficial (1), partial thickness (2), full thickness (3), dan deep full thickness (4).","patofisiologi":"Derajat 1: keratinosit mati, vaskular dilation → erythema. Derajat 2: keratinosit necrosis, dermal damage → blister/bulla. Derajat 3: coagulative necrosis semua lapisan kulit → eskar. Derajat 4: thermal destruction sampai deep tissue.","presentasiKlinis":"G1: erythema, pain, dry, blanching. G2a: bullae, weeping, severe pain. G2b: bullae, mottled, decreased pain sensation. G3: white/charred, leathery, insensate. G4: exposed bone/muscle.","diagnosis":"Clinical: appearance + pain + blanching + capillary refill. Tidak perlu biopsy. Laser Doppler imaging untuk assessment kedalaman akurat.","tatalaksana":"G1: supportive (moisturizer, analgesik). G2a: topical silver sulfadiazine, dressing. G2b: early excision + grafting. G3: excision + split thickness skin graft. G4: amputation jika perlu. Fluid resuscitation (Parkland formula) untuk >15% BSA."},"highYieldPoints":["G1: erythema, pain, NO blisters","G2: blisters present","G3: NO pain (nerve destruction)","G4: muscle/bone involved","Parkland formula: 4mL x kg x %BSA"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"G2a: blisters PRESENT. G2b: decreased pain but NOT painless. Soalan tanpa bula + nyeri = G1 (bukan 2a). Tanpa nyeri = G3 (bukan 2b).","konsepMisconception":"Nyeri berkurang = G2b","penjelasanKonsep":"G2b: decreased pain but still sensitive. G3: completely insensate. Key difference."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"G2b memerlukan blisters. Tanpa bula = G1. Tanpa nyeri = G3 (bukan G2b atau G1).","konceptMisconception":"Semua partial thickness = blisters","penjelasanKonsep":"Partial thickness (G2) ALWAYS has blisters. No blisters = superficial (G1)."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"G3: painless, white/charred. But tanpa bula + nyeri = G1 (bukan G3). Painless = G3 (bukan G1).","konceptMisconception":"G3 always white","penjelasanKonsep":"Correct pairing: erythema+no blister+pain = G1. No pain = G3. Reversed option."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"G4: involves deep structures. G2a: blisters present. Doesn't match either scenario.","konceptMisconception":"Electrical burn = G4 always","penjelasanKonsep":"G4 determined by depth, not mechanism. Can occur with flame/electrical/chemical."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Klasifikasi Luka Bakar","subtopik":["Kedalaman luka bakar","Parkland formula","Tatalaksana"],"medicalTerms":["Superficial","Partial thickness","Full thickness","Bulla","Eskar"],"differentialDiagnosis":[],"clinicalPearls":["G1: sunburn","G2: blisters","G3: no pain","G4: bone/muscle"],"examHighYield":["Klasifikasi derajat","Tanda khas per derajat","Parkland formula"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mengklasifikasikan luka bakar berdasarkan kedalaman","assessmentIntent":"Menguji pengetahuan klasifikasi luka bakar","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Luka bakar besar = derajat tinggi","whyCommon":"Mengira luas = kedalaman","correction":"Derajat = kedalaman, BSA = luas. Keduanya independent."}],"clinicalSignificance":"Klasifikasi kedalaman menentukan tatalaksana: G1 conservative, G2-3 grafting, G4 reconstruction."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["G1: no blister + pain | G2: blister | G3: NO PAIN | G4: bone"]},"slideMapping":"slide-6","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-24","questionNumber":24,"bloomLevel":3,"source":"original","category":"clinical","difficulty":"medium","soalOriginal":{"text":"Laki-laki 62 tahun, vesikel multiple aurikularis sinistra, nyeri, pendengaran berkurang, pusing. Saraf terlibat?","caseContext":"Vesikel telinga dengan gejala neurologis"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"N. VII dan N. VIII","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"N. I dan N. II","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"N. III dan N. IV","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"N. V dan N. VI","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"N. IX dan N. X","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Ramsay Hunt Syndrome (herpes zoster oticus) adalah reaktivasi VZV di ganglion geniculate (N. VII facial). Trias: (1) vesikel aurikular/external ear, (2) facial paralysis (Bell palsy-like), (3) auditory/vestibular symptoms (tinnitus, HL, vertigo) akibat N. VIII involvement. Tatalaksana: asiklovir + prednison dalam 72 jam.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Ramsay Hunt syndrome type I = herpes zoster oticus. Reactivasi VZV dari latensi di sensory ganglion (geniculate ganglion of CN VII). Also involves CN VIII due to anatomical proximity.","patofisiologi":"VZV reactivation in geniculate ganglion → inflammation and edema → facial nerve compression in fallopian canal → facial paralysis. Spread to CN VIII → cochlear/vestibular dysfunction. Viral spread via nervus intermedius.","presentasiKlinis":"Trias: (1) severe ear pain → vesicles on auricle/external auditory canal/tympanic membrane; (2) ipsilateral facial paralysis (lower motor neuron type); (3) hearing loss (sensorineural), tinnitus, vertigo, nystagmus. Additional: dysgeusia (chorda tympani), decreased lacrimation.","diagnosis":"Clinical: trias. PCR VZV from vesicle fluid (gold standard). Serology: anti-VZV IgM. Audiometry: sensorineural hearing loss. ENG: vestibular hypofunction. MRI: facial nerve enhancement.","tatalaksana":"Antiviral: asiklovir 800mg 5x/hari x 7-10 hari ATAU valasiklovir 1g TDS x 7 hari. Kortikosteroid: prednison 1mg/kg x 5-7 hari kemudian taper. Start within 72 hours for best outcome. Eye protection if lagophthalmos. Prognosis worse than Bell palsy: complete recovery 70%."},"highYieldPoints":["Vesikel aurikular + facial palsy + HL/vertigo = Ramsay Hunt","VZV reactivation in geniculate ganglion","CN VII + CN VIII involved","Asiklovir + prednison <72 jam","Prognosis worse than idiopathic Bell palsy"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"CN I (olfactory) = bau. CN II (optic) = visus. Tidak terlibat dalam Ramsay Hunt. Herpes zoster ophthalmicus melibatkan CN V1 (bukan CN I/II).","konsepMisconception":"Vesikel di kepala = CN I/II","penjelasanKonsep":"Ramsay Hunt: CN VII/VIII. HZO: CN V1. Different cranial nerves, different distributions."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"CN III (oculomotor): eye movement, pupil, levator. CN IV (trochlear): superior oblique. Tidak terlibat dalam Ramsay Hunt. Herpes zoster ophthalmicus dapat melibatkan CN III/IV/VI via orbital involvement tapi ini berbeda.","konceptMisconception":"Cranial nerve palsy = CN III/IV","penjelasanKonsep":"CN III/IV involvement = ophthalmoplegia, ptosis, pupil changes. Not Ramsay Hunt."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"CN V (trigeminal): wajah sensasi, pengunyahan. CN VI (abducens): lateral rectus. Herpes zoster ophthalmicus = CN V1 dengan vesikel di V1 distribution (forehead). Bukan telinga.","konsepMisconception":"Zoster wajah = CN V selalu","penjelasanKonsep":"HZO: CN V1, forehead/eye distribution. Ramsay Hunt: CN VII, ear distribution with CN VIII symptoms. Different dermatomes."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"CN IX (glossopharyngeal): faring/sensasi posterior tongue. CN X (vagus): laring/faring/viscera. Tidak terlibat dalam Ramsay Hunt.","konceptMisconception":"Telinga + pusing = CN IX/X","penjelasanKonsep":"CN IX/X involvement: dysphagia, hoarseness, gag reflex. Not ear vesicles or hearing loss."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Ramsay Hunt Syndrome","subtopik":["VZV reactivation","Ganglion geniculate","Facial paralysis"],"medicalTerms":["Ramsay Hunt","Ganglion geniculate","N. facialis","N. vestibulocochlearis","Asiklovir"],"differentialDiagnosis":["Bell palsy","Herpes zoster ophthalmicus","AOM","Mastoiditis"],"clinicalPearls":["Trias khas","<72 jam treatment","Prognosis 70% recovery"],"examHighYield":["Trias","Saraf terlibat","Terapi"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mendiagnosis Ramsay Hunt Syndrome dan membedakannya dari Bell palsy","assessmentIntent":"Menguji recognition syndrome dan cranial nerve anatomy","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Facial palsy + vesikel = Bell palsy","whyCommon":"Bell palsy lebih umum","correction":"Vesikel aurikular = Ramsay Hunt, bukan Bell palsy"}],"clinicalSignificance":"Ramsay Hunt memerlukan antiviral lebih agresif dan prognosis lebih buruk dari Bell palsy."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["Vesikel aurikular + facial palsy + HL = Ramsay Hunt (N.VII+VIII)"]},"slideMapping":"slide-4","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-25","questionNumber":25,"bloomLevel":3,"source":"original","category":"clinical","difficulty":"medium","soalOriginal":{"text":"Buruh 36 tahun, penurunan pendengaran bilateral, terbiasa suara mesin. Hasil audiometri?","caseContext":"Sensorineural hearing loss occupational"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Noise notch 4000 Hz bilateral","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"Penurunan air conduction saja","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Penurunan bone conduction saja","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Cookie-bite pattern","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Rising curve","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Noise-induced hearing loss (NIHL) adalah sensorineural hearing loss akibat paparan noise kronis (>85 dB). Tanda audiometri khas: bilateral symmetrical sensorineural hearing loss dengan noise notch di 3000-6000 Hz (peak 4000 Hz). Mekanisme: stereocilia damage di basal turn cochlea (high frequency region).","lengkap":{"definisi":"NIHL adalah sensorineural hearing loss permanent akibat acoustic trauma kronis (>85 dB, 8 jam/hari) atau akut (explosion/gunshot). Occupational NIHL: #1 penyebat occupational illness di dunia.","patofisiologi":"Noise >85 dB → oxidative stress di outer hair cells (OHC) → lipid peroxidation → hair cell death (apoptosis/necrosis). Basal turn cochlea (high frequency) lebih rentan karena lebih exposed to sound energy. Hair cell loss → decreased frequency tuning → hearing loss.","presentasiKlinis":"Tinnitus + bilateral progressive hearing loss. Kesulitan mendengar di tempat bising (cocktail party effect). Early: high frequency loss. Advanced: mid and low frequency involvement. Tullio phenomenon: vertigo with loud noise (if fistula).","diagnosis":"Audiometri tonal: bilateral symmetrical sensorineural hearing loss with NOISE NOTCH at 3000-6000 Hz (deepest at 4000 Hz). Tympanometry: type A. OAE: absent/distorted. History: occupational noise exposure >85 dB x years.","tatalaksana":"Prevention: ear protection (earmuffs, earplugs) untuk noise >85 dB. Hearing conservation program: annual audiometry. Treatment: hearing aids untuk permanent loss. Cochlear implant untuk severe. No medication reverses NIHL."},"highYieldPoints":["Noise notch 3000-6000 Hz (peak 4000 Hz) = NIHL","Bilateral symmetrical","Sensorineural (not conductive)","Prevention with hearing protection","Occupational history crucial"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"NIHL adalah SENSORINEURAL hearing loss: BOTH air conduction AND bone conduction decrease equally (air-bone gap <10 dB). Penurunan air conduction saja = conductive hearing loss.","konceptMisconception":"HL = conductive","penjelasanKonsep":"NIHL: AC and BC both decreased (sensorineural). Conductive: AC decreased, BC normal (air-bone gap >10 dB)."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"NIHL: bone conduction TURUN bersama air conduction. Penurunan bone conduction saja tidak mungkin karena BC measures inner ear directly.","konceptMisconception":"Bone conduction = inner ear always normal","penjelasanKonsep":"If BC decreased = sensorineural or mixed loss. Pure bone conduction loss doesn't exist clinically."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"Cookie-bite pattern (U-shaped): mid-frequency loss (500-2000 Hz) sparing lows and highs. Tipe khas hereditary hearing loss (e.g., DFNA9). Bukan NIHL.","konceptMisconception":"All notches = NIHL","penjelasanKonsep":"Cookie-bite: mid-frequency U-shape (genetic). Noise notch: 3-6 kHz (occupational). Different patterns."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Rising curve: low frequency loss worse than high frequency. Tipe: Meniere disease, otosclerosis early, genetic. NIHL = high frequency loss (descending curve).","konceptMisconception":"Rising curve = NIHL","penjelasanKonsep":"Rising curve: low freq worse. NIHL: high freq worse (descending). Opposite patterns."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Noise Induced Hearing Loss","subtopik":["Noise notch","Audiometri","Hearing protection"],"medicalTerms":["NIHL","Noise notch","Sensorineural","Outer hair cells","Cochlea"],"differentialDiagnosis":["Presbycusis","Meniere","Ototoxicity","Genetic HL"],"clinicalPearls":["Noise notch 4kHz","Bilateral symmetrical","Prevention key"],"examHighYield":["Audiometri pattern","Noise notch","Prevention"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mengidentifikasi NIHL berdasarkan noise notch audiometri","assessmentIntent":"Menguji pattern recognition audiometri","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Semua HL occupational = conductive","whyCommon":"Noise = mechanical","correction":"NIHL = sensorineural (hair cell damage)"}],"clinicalSignificance":"NIHL preventable dengan hearing protection. Early detection dengan screening audiometri."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["Noise notch 4000 Hz = NIHL khas"]},"slideMapping":"slide-4","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-26","questionNumber":26,"bloomLevel":3,"source":"original","category":"clinical","difficulty":"medium","soalOriginal":{"text":"Pemuda 24 tahun, perdarahan hidung, rasa asin tenggorokan, darah ke nasofaring-orofaring, hipertensi. Tatalaksana?","caseContext":"Epistaksis posterior"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Tampon posterior","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"Tampon anterior","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Kepala ditengadahkan","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Darah ditelan","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Kompresi digital hidung","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Epistaksis posterior: perdarahan dari plexus Woodruff/faring (posterior nasal cavity). Tanda: darah mengalir ke posterior faring (rasa asin, batuk, hematemesis), tidak terlihat dari anterior nares. Tampon anterior tidak efektif. Perlu tampon posterior (balloon catheter/posterior nasal packing) untuk menekan vessel bleeding.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Epistaksis posterior: bleeding dari arterial plexus (Woodruff's plexus/sphenopalatine branches) di posterior nasal cavity/lateral nasal wall. 5-10% epistaksis tapi lebih serius dari anterior.","patofisiologi":"Kiesselbach's plexus (anterior) = 90% epistaksis. Woodruff's plexus (posterior) = 5-10%. Posterior bleeding: older patients, hypertension, anticoagulants, atherosclerosis. Can cause significant blood loss and aspiration.","presentasiKlinis":"Blood flowing down throat (hemoptysis, hematemesis), minimal external bleeding, cannot identify anterior source. Blood in nasopharynx/oropharynx. May present with syncope/anemia.","diagnosis":"Anterior rhinoscopy: no identifiable bleeding point. Endoscopy (rigid/flexible): identify posterior source. Check BP, coagulation profile, CBC. Distinguish from anterior: blood pooling in posterior pharynx.","tatalaksana":"Tampon posterior: Foley catheter insertion, balloon inflated, secured anteriorly. Alternative: commercial balloon devices (Rapid Rhino posterior). Hospital admission, airway monitoring. Refractory: angiographic embolization or ligation (sphenopalatine artery)."},"highYieldPoints":["Posterior epistaxis = blood down throat","Tampon anterior ineffective","Tampon posterior = Foley/balloon","Hospital admission required","Angiographic embolization for refractory"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"Tampon anterior (gauze/Merocel) untuk anterior epistaxis (Kiesselbach's plexus). Posterior bleeding source di belakang tampon anterior → tidak terkontrol.","konsepMisconception":"All epistaxis = anterior packing","penjelasanKonsep":"Anterior: visible bleeding, responds to anterior packing. Posterior: blood down throat, needs posterior packing. Location determines management."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"Menengadahkan kepala membuat darah mengalir ke posterior pharynx → aspiration risk, nausea, vomiting. POSISI BENAR: lean forward, pinch soft nose.","konceptMisconception":"Head back stops nosebleed","penjelasanKonsep":"Head back: blood flows posteriorly → swallow/aspirate. Correct: head forward + nasal compression."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"Menelan darah menyebabkan nausea, vomiting, melena, dan aspiration. DARAH HARUS DIKELUARKAN (spit out).","konceptMisconception":"Swallowing blood =止血","penjelasanKonsep":"Swallowed blood: gastric irritation → vomiting. Can cause aspiration pneumonia. Spit out blood, lean forward."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Kompresi digital (pinching nose) untuk anterior epistaxis ringan. Posterior bleeding tidak terpengaruh karena source terlalu dalam.","konceptMisconception":"Nasal compression works for all epistaxis","penjelasanKonsep":"Digital compression: effective for anterior soft nose. Posterior: too deep, requires packing or balloon."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Epistaksis Posterior","subtopik":["Plexus Woodruff","Tampon posterior","Embolisasi"],"medicalTerms":["Epistaxis","Woodruff's plexus","Posterior packing","Sphenopalatine artery"],"differentialDiagnosis":["Anterior epistaxis","Coagulopathy","Nasal tumor"],"clinicalPearls":["Blood down throat = posterior","Foley catheter = emergency","Admission required"],"examHighYield":["Diagnosis","Tatalaksana","Bedakan anterior"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mendiagnosis dan menatalaksana epistaksis posterior","assessmentIntent":"Menguji recognition posterior epistaxis dan manajemen","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Semua mimisan = kompresi hidung","whyCommon":"Anterior lebih umum","correction":"Posterior: blood down throat, needs posterior packing"}],"clinicalSignificance":"Posterior epistaxis dapat mengancam jiwa. Manajemen benar mencegah aspiration dan hemorrhagic shock."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["Darah ke tenggorokan = Epistaksis POSTERIOR → tampon posterior"]},"slideMapping":"slide-8","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-27","questionNumber":27,"bloomLevel":2,"source":"original","category":"knowledge","difficulty":"easy","soalOriginal":{"text":"Kelainan mata akibat defisiensi vitamin A adalah...","caseContext":"Nutrisi dan mata"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Hipopigmentasi retina","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"Age-related macular degeneration","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Ablasio retina","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Katarak senilis","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Glaukoma primer","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Vitamin A (retinol) esensial untuk fototransduksi (rhodopsin di rod cells). Defisiensi menyebabkan: (1) night blindness (xerophthalmia stage 1), (2) conjunctival xerosis (dryness), (3) Bitot spots (foamy patches), (4) corneal xerosis/ulceration/melting, (5) hipopigmentasi retina. AMD, ablasio retina, katarak, dan glaukoma BUKAN akibat defisiensi vitamin A.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Vitamin A defisiensi (VAD) adalah kekurangan retinol yang menyebabkan xerophthalmia dan immune dysfunction. Endemic di developing countries (anak-anak <5 tahun).","patofisiologi":"Retinol → 11-cis-retinal → rhodopsin (visual pigment rod cells). VAD: rhodopsin tidak bisa diregenerasi → night blindness. Also: epithelial cell differentiation impaired → conjunctival/corneal xerosis, metaplasia (Bitot spots).","presentasiKlinis":"WHO classification: XN (night blindness), X1A (conjunctival xerosis), X1B (Bitot spots), X2 (corneal xerosis), X3A (<1/3 corneal ulceration), X3B (>1/3), XS (corneal scar). Plus: folikel hipopigmentasi retina.","diagnosis":"Serum retinol <20 mcg/dL. Conjunctival impression cytology: loss goblet cells, epithelial metaplasia. Dark adaptation test. Fundus: white spots (folikel).","tatalaksana":"High-dose vitamin A: <6 bulan: 50,000 IU PO; 6-12 bulan: 100,000 IU; >12 bulan: 200,000 IU. Ulang 1-2 hari kemudian. Dietary supplementation. Topikal retinoic acid for ocular surface."},"highYieldPoints":["VAD: night blindness → xerosis → Bitot spots → corneal ulcer","Rhodopsin regeneration requires vitamin A","Hipopigmentasi retina = fundus finding","High-dose oral vitamin A = treatment","Preventable blindness"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"AMD: degenerasi makula terkait usia (>50 tahun), drusen, RPE atrophy/ CNV. Etiologi: genetik, smoking, hypertension. BUKAN defisiensi vitamin A. Antioxidants (AREDS) untuk prevention.","konceptMisconception":"Retina changes = VAD","penjelasanKonsep":"AMD: age-related, macula, drusen. VAD: any age, night blindness, xerosis. Different etiology and presentation."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"Ablasio retina: neurosensory retina detachment. Etiologi: myopia, trauma, PVD, surgery. BUKAN defisiensi vitamin A.","konceptMisconception":"Retinal problem = malnutrition","penjelasanKonsep":"RD: mechanical (tear/traction/exudative). VAD: functional (rhodopsin/night blindness). Different pathophysiology."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"Katarak senilis: lens opacification with age. Risk factors: UV, diabetes, smoking, steroids. BUKAN vitamin A deficiency.","konceptMisconception":"All eye problems in elderly = nutrition","penjelasanKonsep":"Cataract: lens protein aggregation. VAD: rhodopsin/visual function. Different structures affected."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Glaukoma primer: optic neuropathy dengan visual field loss, elevated/normal IOP. Etiologi: aqueous outflow dysfunction. BUKAN vitamin A.","konceptMisconception":"Eye disease = vitamin deficiency","penjelasanKonsep":"Glaucoma: IOP/optic nerve. VAD: retinal photoreceptors/conjunctiva. Completely different pathophysiology."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Defisiensi Vitamin A","subtopik":["Xerophthalmia","Rhodopsin","Bitot spots","Night blindness"],"medicalTerms":["Vitamin A","Retinol","Rhodopsin","Xerophthalmia","Bitot spots"],"differentialDiagnosis":["Retinitis pigmentosa","Zinc deficiency"],"clinicalPearls":["Night blindness = early sign","Bitot spots = pathognomonic","High-dose oral treatment"],"examHighYield":["Stadia xerophthalmia","Tanda khas","Tatalaksana"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mengidentifikasi manifestasi mata defisiensi vitamin A","assessmentIntent":"Menguji pengetahuan xerophthalmia","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Semua masalah mata = vitamin A","whyCommon":"VAD terkenal","correction":"VAD: xerophthalmia/night blindness; Bukan AMD/glaucoma/katarak"}],"clinicalSignificance":"VAD adalah penyebab kebutaan preventable nomor 1 dunia pada anak."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["VAD: Night blindness → Xerosis → Bitot spots → Corneal ulcer"]},"slideMapping":"slide-14","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-28","questionNumber":28,"bloomLevel":2,"source":"original","category":"knowledge","difficulty":"easy","soalOriginal":{"text":"Pembengkakan dari post auricular sampai m. sternocleidomastoideus setelah otitis media akut. Diagnosis?","caseContext":"Komplikasi OMA"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Abses Bezold","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"Mastoiditis akut","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Abses subperiosteal","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Lateral sinus thrombosis","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Meningitis","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Abses Bezold adalah komplikasi otitis media akut/mastoiditis dimana infeksi menyebar melalui mastoid tip (processus mastoideus) yang pneumatized, masuk ke ruang di bawah m. sternocleidomastoideus. Tanda: pembengkakan post-auricular yang meluas ke leher (sulcus retro-mastoideus → SCM).","lengkap":{"definisi":"Bezold abscess: mastoiditis with abscess formation that breaks through mastoid tip into digastric/trapezial space deep to SCM. Named after Friedrich Bezold (German otologist).","patofisiologi":"OMA → mastoiditis → pus accumulation in mastoid air cells → erosion of mastoid tip → extension through digastric groove → deep neck space (peri-sternocleidomastoid).","presentasiKlinis":"OMA symptoms + post-auricular swelling that extends inferiorly along SCM. Torticollis (kepala miring ke sisi lesio). Fever, ear pain, protruding ear. Palpable mass/fluctuance along SCM.","diagnosis":"CT temporal bone: mastoiditis (opacification, coalescence, bone erosion) with abscess extension to neck. MRI untuk soft tissue extent. Culture: S. pneumoniae, H. influenzae, S. aureus.","tatalaksana":"Surgical: mastoidectomy (canal wall up/down) + abscess drainage. IV antibiotics: ceftriaxone + metronidazole (or vancomycin if MRSA). Airway monitoring jika abscess besar."},"highYieldPoints":["Bezold = mastoiditis + neck abscess","Extension through mastoid tip","Swelling along SCM","Mastoidectomy + drainage","Different from simple mastoiditis"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"Mastoiditis akut: inflamasi mastoid air cells tanpa abses leher. Tanda: post-auricular tenderness, swelling, protruding ear. TANPA extension ke leher.","konceptMisconception":"All mastoiditis = Bezold","penjelasanKonsep":"Mastoiditis: mastoid only. Bezold: mastoid + neck abscess. Bezold is a COMPLICATION of mastoiditis."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"Abses subperiosteal: abses antara periosteum mastoid dan korteks mastoid. Post-auricular swelling TANPA extension ke leher. Tampilan: post-auricular bulging (Macewen's triangle).","konceptMisconception":"Post-auricular abscess = Bezold","penjelasanKonsep":"Subperiosteal: localized post-auricular. Bezold: extends to neck along SCM. Location distinguishes."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"Lateral (sigmoid) sinus thrombosis: komplikasi intrakranial mastoiditis. Tanda: headache, papilledema, sixth nerve palsy, fever (otogenic sepsis). BUKAN abses leher.","konceptMisconception":"Mastoiditis complication = Bezold always","penjelasanKonsep":"Mastoiditis complications: extratemporal (Bezold, subperiosteal) vs intracranial (sinus thrombosis, meningitis, brain abscess). Different categories."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Meningitis: komplikasi intrakranial. Tanda: meningismus, fotofobia, altered mental status, fever. Tidak ada pembengkakan leher.","konceptMisconception":"Severe ear infection + fever = meningitis","penjelasanKonsep":"Meningitis: nuchal rigidity, photophobia, CNS symptoms. Bezold: neck swelling along SCM, ear symptoms. Physical exam differentiates."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Abses Bezold","subtopik":["Komplikasi OMA","Mastoiditis","Deep neck abscess"],"medicalTerms":["Bezold abscess","Mastoid tip","SCM","Mastoidectomy"],"differentialDiagnosis":["Mastoiditis","Subperiosteal abscess","Lateral sinus thrombosis"],"clinicalPearls":["Mastoiditis + neck abscess","Extension via mastoid tip","Mastoidectomy definitive"],"examHighYield":["Diagnosis","Bedakan dari mastoiditis","Tatalaksana"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mengidentifikasi abses Bezold sebagai komplikasi OMA","assessmentIntent":"Menguji recognition komplikasi ekstratemporal mastoiditis","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Semua mastoiditis = Bezold","whyCommon":"Bezold terkenal","correction":"Bezold = mastoiditis + neck abscess extension"}],"clinicalSignificance":"Bezold abscess memerlukan surgical drainage dan mastoidectomy. Delay dapat menyebabkan sepsis."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["Mastoiditis + leher abses = BEZOLD"]},"slideMapping":"slide-3","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-29","questionNumber":29,"bloomLevel":2,"source":"original","category":"knowledge","difficulty":"easy","soalOriginal":{"text":"Hifema mengisi 1/2 anterior chamber. Grade berapa?","caseContext":"Trauma mata"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Grade 1","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"Grade 2","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Grade 3","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"D","text":"Grade 4","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Grade 5","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"C","jawabanBenar":"C","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Grading hifema: G1 = <1/3 anterior chamber (AC). G2 = 1/3 - 1/2 AC. G3 = >1/2 AC (total/8-ball hifema). G4 = total AC filled with dark/clotted blood. G3-G4 berisiko komplikasi: corneal blood staining, glaucoma sekunder, optic atrophy. Penatalaksanaan: bed rest, eye shield, cycloplegic, IOP control.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Hifema (hyphema) adalah penumpukan darah di anterior chamber akibat trauma atau spontan (sickle cell, bleeding disorders, anticoagulants). Source: iris root vessel, ciliary body, or angle vessel rupture.","patofisiologi":"Trauma → vessel rupture in iris/ciliary body → blood in AC. Rebleed risk: 5-30% (peak day 2-5). Complications: elevated IOP (blood blockage trabecular meshwork), corneal blood staining (hemoglobin + iron deposition), synechia, optic nerve damage.","presentasiKlinis":"Blurred vision, eye pain, photophobia after trauma. Visible blood layer in AC on slit lamp. Check: IOP, corneal clarity, posterior segment (when possible).","diagnosis":"Slit lamp examination: grade blood level, check for microhyphema (RBC in AC without layered blood). Gonioscopy after resolution (when safe). Rule out: globe rupture, orbital fracture, lens dislocation.","tatalaksana":"Conservative: bed rest with head elevated 30-45 degrees, rigid eye shield, avoid aspirin/NSAIDs. Cycloplegic (atropine 1% or homatropine 5%). IOP control: timolol, dorzolamide, alpha-agonist (avoid pilocarpine/miotic). Anterior chamber washout if: IOP >50 for 5 days, >35 for 7 days, total hyphema with corneal blood staining risk, sickle cell with IOP >24."},"highYieldPoints":["G1: <1/3 AC","G2: 1/3 - 1/2 AC","G3: >1/2 AC","G4: total AC (8-ball)","Rebleed risk day 2-5","Elevated IOP = main complication"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"A","mengapaSalah":"G1 = <1/3 AC (microhyphema to mild). 1/2 AC is significantly more than G1.","konceptMisconception":"Half = small amount","penjelasanKonsep":"G1: minimal blood. G2: moderate. G3: severe. 1/2 AC = G3, not G1."},{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"G2 = 1/3 to 1/2 AC. 1/2 AC is at the upper limit of G2 but typically classified as G3 if >1/2.","konceptMisconception":"Exactly 1/2 = G2","penjelasanKonsep":"G2: 1/3-1/2. G3: >1/2. At exactly 1/2: borderline, but filling half AC = G2 upper limit/G3 lower limit. Most classify >1/2 as G3."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"G4 = total AC filled (100%), black ball/clot. 1/2 AC is 50%, not total.","konceptMisconception":"Severe = always G4","penjelasanKonsep":"G4: complete AC filling (8-ball). G3: >1/2 but not total. 1/2 AC = G3, not G4."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"G5 tidak ada dalam standar grading hifema. Standard: G1-G4. G4 is the most severe (total hyphema).","konceptMisconception":"More grades = more severe","penjelasanKonsep":"Standard hyphema grading: 1-4. No G5 exists. Total = G4."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Hifema","subtopik":["Grading hifema","Trauma mata","Komplikasi"],"medicalTerms":["Hyphema","Anterior chamber","Rebleed","Corneal blood staining"],"differentialDiagnosis":["Microhyphema","Vitreous hemorrhage"],"clinicalPearls":["G3: >1/2 AC","Rebleed day 2-5","IOP monitoring crucial"],"examHighYield":["Grading","Komplikasi","Tatalaksana"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mengklasifikasikan hifema berdasarkan grading","assessmentIntent":"Menguji pengetahuan grading hifema","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Semua hifema sama","whyCommon":"Tampaknya serupa","correction":"Grading determines prognosis and management"}],"clinicalSignificance":"Grading hifema menentukan prognosis dan kebutuhan surgical intervention."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":[">1/2 AC = Grade 3 Hifema"]},"slideMapping":"slide-12","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"C","jawabanBenar":"C","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-30","questionNumber":30,"bloomLevel":2,"source":"original","category":"knowledge","difficulty":"medium","soalOriginal":{"text":"Faktor yang mempengaruhi absorbsi obat tetes mata adalah...","caseContext":"Farmakologi mata"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Lamanya obat di prekornea","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"pH asam saja","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Irigasi ke saccus lacrimalis","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Ikatan obat pada protein darah","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Difusi ke palpebra saja","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Absorbsi obat tetes mata terjadi melalui kornea (transcorneal) dan konjungtiva. Faktor utama: waktu kontak prekorneal (prekorneal residence time). Hanya 1-5% obat yang masuk ke anterior chamber. Faktor lain: pH, lipophilicity, molecular weight, viscosity, dan nasolacrimal drainage. Nasolacrimal occlusion (menutup punctum) meningkatkan absorbsi dengan memperpanjang waktu kontak.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Ocular drug delivery via eye drops: absorption through cornea (primary) and conjunctiva. Cornea: lipophilic epithelium + hydrophilic stroma + lipophilic endothelium. Barrier utama: epithelium.","patofisiologi":"Prekorneal factors: tear film (7 mcL), reflex tearing, nasolacrimal drainage (punctum → canaliculus → sac → duct → nose). Residence time: 2-10 minutes. Corneal penetration: depends on drug lipophilicity, pH, molecular size, and formulation.","presentasiKlinis":"Therapeutic efficacy depends on bioavailability. Poor absorption: need frequent dosing (timolol 2x/day). Systemic side effects: nasolacrimal drainage → nasal mucosa absorption → systemic circulation (timolol → asthma/bradycardia).","diagnosis":"N/A (pharmacology concept).","tatalaksana":"Improve absorption: (1) increase viscosity (methylcellulose), (2) increase lipophilicity (prodrug), (3) decrease drop volume (20-30 mcL optimal), (4) nasolacrimal occlusion (5 min), (5) gelling systems, (6) ointments for prolonged contact."},"highYieldPoints":["Prekorneal residence time = key factor","Only 1-5% enters eye","Nasolacrimal drainage = major loss","Nasolacrimal occlusion improves absorption","Viscosity and lipophilicity matter"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"pH mempengaruhi ionisasi dan penetrasi, tapi 'asam saja' salah. Optimal pH 7.0-7.4 (neutral). pH terlalu asam atau basa menyebabkan irritation dan reflex tearing → DECREASED absorption.","konceptMisconception":"Asam = better absorption","penjelasanKonsep":"Neutral pH optimal. Acidic/basic pH causes irritation and increased clearance. Not just 'asam saja'."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"Irigasi ke saccus lacrimalis = nasolacrimal drainage. Ini MENGURANGI absorbsi karena obat dibuang dari mata sebelum sempat diserap. Yang diinginkan: MENCEGAH irigasi/drainase.","konceptMisconception":"Drainage = absorption","penjelasanKonsep":"Nasolacrimal drainage REMOVES drug from eye → decreased absorption. Nasolacrimal occlusion PREVENTS drainage → increased absorption."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"Ikatan protein darah (plasma protein binding) mempengaruhi DISTRIBUSI sistemik, bukan absorbsi okular lokal. Setelah masuk sistemik baru protein binding relevan.","konceptMisconception":"Protein binding affects local absorption","penjelasanKonsep":"Protein binding: systemic pharmacokinetics (distribution). Ocular absorption: local factors (pre-corneal residence, corneal penetration). Different phases."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Palpebra (kelopak mata) bukan route absorpsi utama. Obat tetes mata absorbsi melalui KORNEA dan KONJUNGTIVA, bukan palpebra. 'Saja' juga terlalu terbatas.","konceptMisconception":"Eyelid = absorption route","penjelasanKonsep":"Cornea + conjunctiva = main absorption routes. Palpebra is not a primary absorption surface. Drug passes OVER palpebra to reach cornea."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Farmakologi Ocular","subtopik":["Drug delivery mata","Prekorneal residence","Nasolacrimal drainage"],"medicalTerms":["Prekorneal residence","Transcorneal absorption","Nasolacrimal occlusion","Bioavailability"],"differentialDiagnosis":[],"clinicalPearls":["1-5% bioavailability","Nasolacrimal occlusion key","Residence time crucial"],"examHighYield":["Faktor absorbsi","Nasolacrimal occlusion","Bioavailability okular"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Memahami faktor-faktor yang mempengaruhi absorbsi obat tetes mata","assessmentIntent":"Menguji farmakokinetik okular","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Semua tetes mata sama efektif","whyCommon":"Tidak memperhatikan formulasi","correction":"Formulasi, viscosity, dan technique mempengaruhi bioavailability"}],"clinicalSignificance":"Teknik pemasangan tetes mata yang benar (nasolacrimal occlusion) meningkatkan efikasi dan mengurangi efek sistemik."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["Prekorneal residence time = faktor utama absorbsi"]},"slideMapping":"slide-5","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-31","questionNumber":31,"bloomLevel":3,"source":"original","category":"clinical","difficulty":"medium","soalOriginal":{"text":"Trauma kimia mata: kornea stroma haze, detail iris terlihat, iskemik limbus <1/3. Grade?","caseContext":"Chemical eye injury"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Grade 1","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"Grade 2","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"C","text":"Grade 3","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Grade 4","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Grade 5","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"B","jawabanBenar":"B","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Grading trauma kimia mata menurut Dua (modifikasi Roper-Hall): G1 = epitelial damage saja, no limbal ischemia, prognosis baik. G2 = hazy cornea tapi iris details visible, limbal ischemia <1/3, prognosis baik. G3 = total epithelial loss, stromal haze (iris details obscured), limbal ischemia 1/3-1/2, prognosis ragu. G4 = opaque cornea (no iris view), limbal ischemia >1/2, prognosis buruk.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Ocular chemical injury grading (Dua classification): based on corneal clarity and limbal ischemia. Predicts prognosis and guides treatment.","patofisiologi":"Alkali: saponification → deep penetration. Acid: coagulation → superficial. Severity depends on: pH, concentration, contact duration, and volume. Limbal stem cell damage → corneal opacity, vascularization, symblepharon.","presentasiKlinis":"Pain, photophobia, blepharospasm, decreased vision. Slit lamp: conjunctival injection/chemosis, corneal epithelial defect, stromal haze, limbal ischemia (whitening).","diagnosis":"Slit lamp with fluorescein. Measure pH (should be 7.0). Grading: G1 (clear cornea, no ischemia), G2 (hazy, <1/3 ischemia), G3 (very hazy, 1/3-1/2 ischemia), G4 (opaque, >1/2 ischemia).","tatalaksana":"Emergency: copious irrigation (30 min minimum). Grade 1-2: topical antibiotic, cycloplegic, steroid (after epithelial healing), vitamin C oral/topical. Grade 3-4: topical citrate, ascorbate, tetracycline (collagenase inhibition), amniotic membrane transplant, limbal stem cell transplant."},"highYieldPoints":["G2: cornea hazy + iris visible + <1/3 limbal ischemia","G3: iris obscured + 1/3-1/2 ischemia","G4: opaque + >1/2 ischemia = poor prognosis","Irrigation first, grading second","Vitamin C for grade 3-4"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"A","mengapaSalah":"G1: cornea clear, no limbal ischemia, minimal epithelial damage. Stroma haze = more than G1.","konceptMisconception":"Minimal damage = G1","penjelasanKonsep":"G1: clear cornea only. G2: hazy cornea. Stromal haze elevates to G2 minimum."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"G3: stromal haze obscures iris details, limbal ischemia 1/3-1/2. Soalan states 'detail iris terlihat' + '<1/3 ischemia' = G2, not G3.","konceptMisconception":"Stroma haze = G3 always","penjelasanKonsep":"G3: iris NOT visible. If iris visible = G2. Limbal ischemia <1/3 = G2. Combined: G2."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"G4: opaque cornea, no iris view, >1/2 limbal ischemia. Prognosis buruk. Soalan: iris visible + <1/3 ischemia = not G4.","konceptMisconception":"Any alkali injury = G4","penjelasanKonsep":"G4: complete opacity + extensive ischemia. Less severe findings = lower grade."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Grade 5 tidak ada dalam klasifikasi Dua. Maximum grade = 4.","konceptMisconception":"More severe = higher grade number","penjelasanKonsep":"Dua classification: grades 1-4. No grade 5 exists."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Grading Trauma Kimia Mata","subtopik":["Klasifikasi Dua","Limbal ischemia","Prognosis"],"medicalTerms":["Dua classification","Limbal ischemia","Stromal haze","Symblepharon"],"differentialDiagnosis":[],"clinicalPearls":["Iris visible = better prognosis","Limbal ischemia = key prognostic factor","Grade 3-4 need aggressive treatment"],"examHighYield":["Grading criteria","Prognosis per grade","Tatalaksana"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mengklasifikasikan trauma kimia mata","assessmentIntent":"Menguji grading system Dua","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Semua alkali injury = prognosis buruk","whyCommon":"Alkali lebih berbahaya dari asam","correction":"Prognosis depends on grade, not just pH"}],"clinicalSignificance":"Grading menentukan prognosis dan intensitas treatment. Grade 3-4 perlu referral ke specialist cornea."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["Iris visible + <1/3 ischemia = Grade 2"]},"slideMapping":"slide-12","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"B","jawabanBenar":"B","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-32","questionNumber":32,"bloomLevel":3,"source":"original","category":"clinical","difficulty":"medium","soalOriginal":{"text":"Bayi 5 bulan, ruam merah pipi setelah susu formula, riwayat atopi keluarga. Terapi topikal?","caseContext":"Dermatitis infant"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Kortikosteroid topikal rangkaian I-II","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"Kortikosteroid topikal rangkaian IV","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Antibiotik topikal","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Kalsipotriol","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Retinoid topikal","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Dermatitis atopik (eksim) adalah dermatitis kronik relapsing dengan pruritus, riwayat atopi personal/keluarga, dan distribusi sesuia usia. Infant: ekstensor, wajah (pipi). Terapi: emolien + kortikosteroid topikal LOW potency (rangkaian I-II) untuk wajah dan infant. Rangkaian IV terlalu kuat untuk wajah/bayi.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Atopic dermatitis (AD) adalah dermatitis inflamasi kronik dengan pruritus, distribusi karakteristik sesuia usia, dan riwayat atopi. Kriteria Hanifin-Rajka: pruritus + 3 minor criteria (onset <2 tahun, cheilitis, xerosis, Dennie-Morgan folds, etc.).","patofisiologi":"Skin barrier dysfunction (filaggrin mutation) + immune dysregulation (Th2 dominant: IL-4, IL-5, IL-13) → pruritus, inflamasi, infection susceptibility.","presentasiKlinis":"Infant (<2 tahun): erythematous papules/plaques with exudate/crust, extensor surfaces, cheeks. Childhood: flexural (popliteal, antecubital). Adult: flexural, hand, face/neck lichenified plaques.","diagnosis":"Clinical: pruritus + morphology + distribution + personal/family history. Rule out: seborrheic dermatitis, contact dermatitis, psoriasis, scabies.","tatalaksana":"Basic: emollients (vaseline, ceramide creams), avoid triggers, short lukewarm baths. Acute flare: topical corticosteroids (face/infant: class VI-VII hydrocortisone 1-2.5%; body: class III-IV). Calcineurin inhibitors (tacrolimus 0.03%, pimecrolimus 1%) for face and maintenance. Antihistamines for sleep. Antibiotics for secondary infection."},"highYieldPoints":["Infant: extensor + cheeks","Low potency steroid for face/infant","Emollients = foundation","Calcineurin inhibitors for maintenance","Avoid triggers (allergens, irritants)"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"Rangkaian IV (clobetasol, betamethasone dipropionate) = superpotent. Kontraindikasi untuk wajah dan infant karena risk atrophy, striae, HPA axis suppression.","konceptMisconception":"Stronger = better","penjelasanKonsep":"Face and infants: low potency only (I-II). Body: medium potency (III-IV). Potent: palms/soles only, short term."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"Antibiotik topikal hanya jika ada sekunder infeksi (impetiginasi: honey-colored crust, pustules). Tanpa tanda infeksi = tidak perlu antibiotik.","konceptMisconception":"Dermatitis needs antibiotics","penjelasanKonsep":"AD is inflammatory, not infectious. Antibiotics only for secondary bacterial infection signs. Overuse drives resistance."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"Kalsipotriol (vitamin D analog) untuk psoriasis. Meksanisme: inhibits keratinocyte proliferation. Tidak untuk dermatitis atopi.","konceptMisconception":"All skin conditions = same treatment","penjelasanKonsep":"Calcipotriene: psoriasis (antiproliferative). AD: anti-inflammatory (steroids, calcineurin inhibitors). Different diseases."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Retinoid topikal (tretinoin, adapalene) untuk acne, photoaging. Terlalu irritating untuk AD skin. Can worsen barrier dysfunction.","konceptMisconception":"Retinoids for all dermatoses","penjelasanKonsep":"Retinoids: acne, anti-aging. AD: barrier dysfunction, needs moisture + anti-inflammatory. Retinoids too irritating."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Dermatitis Atopik","subtopik":["Kriteria Hanifin-Rajka","Terapi topikal","Potency steroid"],"medicalTerms":["Atopic dermatitis","Pruritus","Emollients","Calcineurin inhibitor"],"differentialDiagnosis":["Seborrheic dermatitis","Contact dermatitis","Psoriasis"],"clinicalPearls":["Infant: cheeks + extensors","Low potency for face","Emollients first"],"examHighYield":["Distribusi per usia","Terapi topikal","Potency selection"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Menatalaksana dermatitis atopik infant","assessmentIntent":"Menguji pengetahuan terapi topikal AD","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Semua steroid sama","whyCommon":"Tidak memahami potency","correction":"Face/infant = low potency (I-II)"}],"clinicalSignificance":"Pemilihan potency steroid yang benar mencegah side effects cutaneous dan systemic."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["AD infant: Low potency steroid (I-II) + emolien"]},"slideMapping":"slide-6","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-33","questionNumber":33,"bloomLevel":2,"source":"original","category":"clinical","difficulty":"easy","soalOriginal":{"text":"Ny S 25 tahun, benjolan kemerahan pipi, pustul eritema, komedo. Diagnosis?","caseContext":"Lesi wajah wanita muda"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Acne vulgaris","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"Rosacea","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Folikulitis","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Perioral dermatitis","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Seborrheic dermatitis","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Acne vulgaris adalah penyakit pilosebasea kronik dengan 4 patogenesis: hiperkeratinisasi folikel, seborrhea (sekret sebasea berlebih), kolonisasi C. acnes (dulu P. acnes), dan inflamasi. Lesi: komedo (buka/tutup), papul, pustul, nodul, kista. Distribusi: wajah, dada, punggung atas. Terapi: topikal (benzoyl peroxide, retinoid, antibiotik topikal) + sistemik (antibiotik, isotretinoin, hormonal) sesuai severity.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Acne vulgaris: multifactorial disease of pilosebaceous unit. Peak incidence: adolescence (85%). Persistent adult acne: 12% wanita >25 tahun.","patofisiologi":"(1) Follicular hyperkeratinization → microcomedone; (2) Sebum overproduction (androgen-driven); (3) C. acnes colonization → lipase → free fatty acids; (4) Inflammation (IL-1, TNF-alpha).","presentasiKlinis":"Comedones (blackheads/whiteheads), papules, pustules, nodules, cysts. Grading: mild (comedones + few papules), moderate (many papules/pustules), severe (nodules/cysts). Scarring potential: severe > moderate.","diagnosis":"Clinical: lesion types + distribution. Rule out: steroid acne, drug-induced acne, endocrine disorders (PCOS: irregular menses, hirsutism).","tatalaksana":"Mild: topical retinoid (adapalene 0.1%) ± benzoyl peroxide 2.5%. Moderate: add topical clindamycin or oral doxycycline 100mg BID. Severe: oral isotretinoin 0.5-1mg/kg x 15-20 weeks (teratogenic, monitor lipids/LFT). Female: hormonal (COC, spironolactone)."},"highYieldPoints":["4 pathogenesis: keratinization + sebum + C. acnes + inflammation","Comedones = hallmark","Retinoid first-line for maintenance","Isotretinoin for severe","Teratogenic: pregnancy test mandatory"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"Rosacea: centrofacial erythema, telangiectasia, papulopustules TANPA comedones. Trigger: heat, alcohol, spicy food. Age >30. No comedones distinguishes from acne.","konceptMisconception":"Papulopustules face = acne","penjelasanKonsep":"Rosacea: no comedones, erythema/telangiectasia dominant, older age. Acne: comedones present, younger age. Comedones = key differentiator."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"Folikulitis: inflamasi hair follicle, usually bacterial (S. aureus) or fungal (Malassezia). Pustules centered on hair follicle. Can occur anywhere with hair. No comedones.","konceptMisconception":"Pustules = folliculitis","penjelasanKonsep":"Folliculitis: hair-centered pustules, any hairy area. Acne: face/chest/back, comedones, sebaceous glands involved. Different distribution and primary lesions."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"Perioral dermatitis: small papulopustules around mouth, nose, eyes. Spares vermillion border. Trigger: topical steroids. No comedones. Distribution periorificial distinguishes from acne.","konceptMisconception":"Face rash = acne","penjelasanKonsep":"Perioral dermatitis: periorificial only, spares lips, steroid-related. Acne: broader face distribution, comedones. Location differentiates."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Seborrheic dermatitis: erythema with greasy yellow scale in seborrheic areas (scalp, nasolabial folds, eyebrows, chest). No pustules or comedones. Associated with Malassezia.","konceptMisconception":"Facial erythema + scale = SD","penjelasanKonsep":"SD: scale dominant, no pustules/comedones. Acne: papulopustules + comedones. Different primary lesions."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Acne Vulgaris","subtopik":["Patogenesis","Grading","Terapi"],"medicalTerms":["Comedone","Pustule","Retinoid","Isotretinoin","C. acnes"],"differentialDiagnosis":["Rosacea","Folliculitis","Perioral dermatitis"],"clinicalPearls":["Comedones = hallmark","Retinoid maintenance","Isotretinoin for severe"],"examHighYield":["Patogenesis 4 faktor","Grading","Terapi sesuai severity"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mendiagnosis dan menatalaksana acne vulgaris","assessmentIntent":"Menguji diagnosis lesi wajah wanita muda","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Acne hanya remaja","whyCommon":"Peak di adolescence","correction":"Adult female acne common (12% age >25)"}],"clinicalSignificance":"Acne dapat menyebabkan scarring dan psychological impact. Appropriate treatment prevents permanent sequelae."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["Komedo + papul/pustul = Acne vulgaris"]},"slideMapping":"slide-6","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-34","questionNumber":34,"bloomLevel":1,"source":"original","category":"knowledge","difficulty":"easy","soalOriginal":{"text":"Faktor risiko paling tinggi untuk melanoma kulit adalah...","caseContext":"Epidemiologi melanoma"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Fitzpatrick Skin Phototype I","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"Fitzpatrick Skin Phototype II","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Fitzpatrick Skin Phototype III","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Fitzpatrick Skin Phototype IV","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Fitzpatrick Skin Phototype V","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Fitzpatrick Skin Type I (very fair, always burns, never tans) memiliki risiko melanoma tertinggi. Type II juga berisiko tinggi. Risk ratio: Type I-II 2-3x higher than Type III-IV. Melanoma: #5 cancer terbanyak, #1 cause of skin cancer death. UV exposure = primary risk factor.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Fitzpatrick classification: I (always burn, never tan), II (usually burn, tan minimally), III (sometimes burn, tan gradually), IV (rarely burn, tan well), V (very rarely burn, dark brown skin), VI (never burn, deeply pigmented).","patofisiologi":"UVB (290-320nm): DNA damage directly, sunburn. UVA (320-400nm): deeper penetration, oxidative stress, DNA damage via ROS. Skin type I-II: less melanin, poor UV protection, more DNA damage per UV dose.","presentasiKlinis":"Melanoma: ABCDE criteria. Risk factors: fair skin, multiple nevi (>50), atypical nevi, family history, blistering sunburns, tanning bed use, immunosuppression.","diagnosis":"Excisional biopsy with 1-2mm margin. Breslow thickness = most important prognostic factor. SLNB for thickness >0.8mm.","tatalaksana":"Surgical excision with margin based on Breslow thickness. Adjuvant therapy (pembrolizumab, nivolumab) for stage III-IV. Prevention: sun protection, screening for high-risk individuals."},"highYieldPoints":["Type I = highest melanoma risk","UV exposure = primary cause","ABCDE for diagnosis","Breslow thickness = prognosis","Prevention: sun protection"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"Type II juga berisiko tinggi tapi tidak setinggi Type I. Type I: always burn, never tan = minimal natural protection.","konceptMisconception":"Type I and II same risk","penjelasanKonsep":"Both high risk but Type I > Type II. Type I: absolutely no tan, always burns. Maximum risk category."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"Type III: sometimes burn, tan gradually. Moderate risk. Melanin protection better than I-II.","konceptMisconception":"All fair skin same risk","penjelasanKonsep":"Risk gradient: I > II > III > IV > V > VI. Each step decreases risk."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"Type IV: rarely burn, tan well. Lower risk. Olive skin. More melanin protection.","konceptMisconception":"Any white skin = high risk","penjelasanKonsep":"Type IV: substantial melanin, tanning ability. Risk lower than I-III. Acral lentiginous melanoma more common in darker skin."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Type V: very rarely burn, dark brown skin. Lowest melanoma risk among options. Acral lentiginous melanoma (palms/soles/nails) more common than sun-exposed melanoma.","konceptMisconception":"Dark skin = no melanoma risk","penjelasanKonsep":"Type V: lower risk overall but acral/subungual melanoma more common relative to sun-exposed melanoma. Bob Marley died from acral melanoma."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Melanoma: Faktor Risiko","subtopik":["Fitzpatrick classification","UV exposure","ABCDE criteria"],"medicalTerms":["Fitzpatrick","Melanoma","UVB","Breslow thickness","SLNB"],"differentialDiagnosis":[],"clinicalPearls":["Type I = highest risk","Sun protection key","ABCDE screening"],"examHighYield":["Fitzpatrick types","Melanoma risk factors","ABCDE criteria"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mengetahui faktor risiko melanoma","assessmentIntent":"Menguji epidemiologi melanoma","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Semua kulit terang sama","whyCommon":"White skin = high risk","correction":"Type I > II > III > IV in risk gradient"}],"clinicalSignificance":"Identifikasi high-risk individuals enables targeted screening and prevention counseling."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["Fitzpatrick Type I = HIGHEST melanoma risk"]},"slideMapping":"slide-6","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-35","questionNumber":35,"bloomLevel":2,"source":"original","category":"knowledge","difficulty":"medium","soalOriginal":{"text":"Faktor prognostik yang dinilai pada SCORTEN, KECUALI...","caseContext":"Prognostik TEN/SJS"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Usia >40 tahun","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"Denyut jantung >120x/menit","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Serum bikarbonat <20 mEq/L","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Kolesterol total","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"E","text":"Glukosa serum >252 mg/dL","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"D","jawabanBenar":"D","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"SCORTEN (Severity-of-Illness Score for TEN) adalah scoring system untuk memprediksi mortality SJS/TEN. 7 faktor: (1) age ≥40, (2) heart rate ≥120, (3) cancer/hematologic malignancy, (4) BSA detached >10%, (5) serum bicarbonate <20, (6) glucose >252, (7) BUN >28. Kolesterol BUKAN komponen SCORTEN. Score 0-1 = mortality 3.2%; 2 = 12.1%; 3 = 35.3%; 4 = 58.3%; ≥5 = >90%.","lengkap":{"definisi":"SCORTEN: validated prognostic scoring for SJS/TEN mortality, developed 2000. Applied within 24 hours of admission.","patofisiologi":"SJS/TEN: severe mucocutaneous reactions, keratinocyte apoptosis (Fas-FasL, cytotoxic T-cells, granulysin). Mortality from: dehydration, electrolyte imbalance, sepsis, multiorgan failure.","presentasiKlinis":"SJS: epidermal detachment <10% BSA. SJS-TEN overlap: 10-30%. TEN: >30%. Mucosal involvement >2 sites. Nikolsky positive.","diagnosis":"Clinical: drug history, rapid-onset mucocutaneous eruption, epidermal detachment. Histology: full-thickness epidermal necrosis, subepidermal split. Differential: staphylococcal scalded skin syndrome (SSSS: superficial, children, S. aureus exfoliative toxin).","tatalaksana":"Stop offending drug. Supportive care: fluid resuscitation (Parkland-modified), electrolytes, nutritional support, infection prevention, wound care. Specialized unit/burn ICU. IVIG, cyclosporine, etanercept debated. Score SCORTEN within 24h."},"highYieldPoints":["SCORTEN: 7 factors, score day 1","Bicarbonate <20 = acidosis prognostic","BSA detached >10% = significant","Kolesterol BUKAN SCORTEN","Score ≥5 = mortality >90%"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"A","mengapaSalah":"Age ≥40 tahun ADALAH komponen SCORTEN. Older age = decreased regenerative capacity, more comorbidities.","konceptMisconception":"Age not important","penjelasanKonsep":"Age ≥40: 1 point in SCORTEN. Significant prognostic factor."},{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"HR ≥120 ADALAH komponen SCORTEN. Tachycardia indicates: dehydration, sepsis, pain, cytokine storm.","konceptMisconception":"HR just reflects pain","penjelasanKonsep":"Tachycardia in SJS/TEN: volume depletion, infection, inflammatory response. Prognostic marker."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"Bicarbonate <20 mEq/L ADALAH komponen SCORTEN. Metabolic acidosis: tissue hypoperfusion, lactic acidosis from shock.","konceptMisconception":"Bicarbonate not relevant","penjelasanKonsep":"Low bicarbonate = metabolic acidosis = tissue hypoperfusion/shock. Strong mortality predictor."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Glucose >252 mg/dL ADALAH komponen SCORTEN. Hyperglycemia: stress response, cortisol/catecholamine surge, insulin resistance.","konceptMisconception":"Glucose not prognostic","penjelasanKonsep":"Hyperglycemia: stress response marker, associated with worse outcomes in critical illness."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"SCORTEN Prognostik","subtopik":["SJS/TEN","Mortality prediction","Supportive care"],"medicalTerms":["SCORTEN","SJS","TEN","Nikolsky sign","Epidermal detachment"],"differentialDiagnosis":["SSSS","AGEP","EM major"],"clinicalPearls":["Score within 24h","Bicarbonate crucial","Burn ICU for severe"],"examHighYield":["SCORTEN components","Prognosis by score","Supportive management"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mengetahui komponen SCORTEN","assessmentIntent":"Menguji memorisasi SCORTEN criteria","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"SCORTEN includes all lab values","whyCommon":"Many labs checked","correction":"Specific 7 factors only; cholesterol not included"}],"clinicalSignificance":"SCORTEN guides triage: high score needs burn ICU referral."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["Kolesterol BUKAN komponen SCORTEN"]},"slideMapping":"slide-6","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"D","jawabanBenar":"D","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-36","questionNumber":36,"bloomLevel":2,"source":"original","category":"knowledge","difficulty":"easy","soalOriginal":{"text":"Luka robekan menembus 2 sisi karena pisau disebut...","caseContext":"Klasifikasi luka traumatik"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Vulnus perforatum","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"Vulnus laceratum","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Vulnus punctum","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Vulnus scissum","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Vulnus contusum","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Vulnus perforatum (perforating wound): luka tembus yang masuk dan keluar (through-and-through), menembus 2 sisi struktur. Vulnus laceratum: luka robek (tearing). Vulnus punctum: luka tusuk. Vulnus scissum: luka sayat (incised/cut). Vulnus contusum: luka tumpul (contused/abraded).","lengkap":{"definisi":"Klasifikasi luka traumatik berdasarkan mekanisme: (1) Vulnus scissum/incisum: sharp cutting (knife, glass) → clean edges; (2) Vulnus laceratum: tearing/blunt force → irregular edges; (3) Vulnus punctum: stab/puncture → small entry, deep; (4) Vulnus perforatum: through-and-through; (5) Vulnus contusum: blunt trauma → bruising; (6) Vulnus sclopetarium: gunshot.","patofisiologi":"","presentasiKlinis":"Perforatum: entry and exit wound. Assess depth, structures involved, bleeding, contamination. Document: size, shape, depth, foreign bodies, neurovascular status.","diagnosis":"Clinical examination. Imaging: X-ray for fractures/foreign bodies, CT for deep structure assessment, angiography for vascular injury.","tatalaksana":"Irrigation, debridement, hemostasis, primary closure (within 6-8 hours) or delayed closure. Antibiotics for contaminated wounds. Tetanus prophylaxis. Surgical exploration for deep/uncertain injuries."},"highYieldPoints":["Perforatum: through-and-through","Laceratum: tear/irregular","Punctum: stab/deep","Scissum: cut/clean","Contusum: blunt/bruise"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"Laceratum: luka robek akibat blunt force/tearing. Irregular edges, tissue bridging. Tidak menembus 2 sisi secara sengaja.","konceptMisconception":"Robekan = perforatum","penjelasanKonsep":"Laceratum: tearing mechanism. Perforatum: through-and-through. Different mechanisms and appearances."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"Punctum: luka tusuk, entry point kecil, deep penetration. Biasanya tidak melihat exit wound (unless through-and-through, but classification based on mechanism).","konceptMisconception":"Stab wound = perforatum","penjelasanKonsep":"Punctum: stab wound (single entry). Perforatum: through-and-through (entry + exit). If stab goes through = perforatum."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"Scissum (incisum): luka sayat tajam dengan tepi rapi. Superficial atau dalam tapi tidak spesifik through-and-through.","konceptMisconception":"Sharp cut = perforatum","penjelasanKonsep":"Scissum: incised wound. Can be deep but not defined by through-and-through. Perforatum specifically = enters and exits."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Contusum: luka tumpul dengan kontusi (bruising), abrasions, hematoma. Tidak menembus kulit.","konceptMisconception":"Blunt injury with break = contusum","penjelasanKonsep":"Contusum: closed/blunt injury. Open wound with through-and-through = perforatum. Different categories."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Klasifikasi Luka Traumatik","subtopik":["Tipe luka","Mekanisme trauma"],"medicalTerms":["Vulnus perforatum","Vulnus laceratum","Vulnus punctum","Vulnus scissum"],"differentialDiagnosis":[],"clinicalPearls":["Perforatum = through-and-through","Document entry and exit"],"examHighYield":["Klasifikasi luka","Bedakan tipe"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mengklasifikasikan luka traumatik","assessmentIntent":"Menguji terminologi luka","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Semua luka tembus = perforatum","whyCommon":"Perforatum = tembus","correction":"Perforatum specifically = through-and-through (2 sides)"}],"clinicalSignificance":"Klasifikasi luka menentukan approach debridement dan closure."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["Perforatum = through-and-through (masuk dan keluar)"]},"slideMapping":"slide-6","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-37","questionNumber":37,"bloomLevel":3,"source":"original","category":"clinical","difficulty":"easy","soalOriginal":{"text":"Laki-laki IMS, gram negatif diplococcus intraseluler. Pengobatan?","caseContext":"Uretritis gonokokal"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Seftriakson 250-500 mg IM dosis tunggal","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"Azitromisin 1 gram PO dosis tunggal","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Doksiklin 100 mg PO BID 7 hari","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Metronidazol 2 gram PO dosis tunggal","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Asiklovir 400 mg PO 5x/hari 7 hari","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Gonore uretritis: Neisseria gonorrhoeae (gram negative diplococcus intraseluler di PMN). Terapi: ceftriaxone 250-500mg IM single dose (first-line per CDC 2021). Koinfeksi Chlamydia: add doxycycline 100mg BID x 7 hari. Resistance to fluoroquinolones widespread.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Gonorrhea: infection by Neisseria gonorrhoeae, gram-negative diplococcus. Second most common bacterial STI worldwide. Site: urethra, cervix, rectum, pharynx, conjunctiva.","patofisiologi":"N. gonorrhoeae: pili (attachment), Opa proteins (intracellular invasion), LOS (endotoxin). Incubation: 2-7 days. Complications: PID, disseminated gonococcal infection (DGI), infertility, ectopic pregnancy.","presentasiKlinis":"Male: purulent urethral discharge, dysuria, frequency. Female: often asymptomatic (50-80%), vaginal discharge, dysuria, abdominal pain. Complications: epididymitis, PID, perihepatitis (Fitz-Hugh-Curtis).","diagnosis":"NAAT (nucleic acid amplification test): urine or swab. Culture: Thayer-Martin media (for resistance testing). Gram stain: sensitivity 90-95% for urethral male, 50-70% endocervical, <50% pharyngeal/rectal.","tatalaksana":"Uncomplicated: ceftriaxone 500mg IM (1g if ≥150kg). Alternative: gentamicin 240mg IM + azithromycin 2g PO. Always treat Chlamydia co-infection: doxycycline 100mg BID x 7 days (or azithromycin 1g if pregnant). Test of cure: NAAT at 7-14 days if pharyngeal infection or alternative regimen used."},"highYieldPoints":["Gram negative diplococcus intracellular = N. gonorrhoeae","Ceftriaxone IM = first-line","Always co-treat Chlamydia","NAAT = diagnosis gold standard","Rising resistance to quinolones"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"Azitromycin 1g = Chlamydia treatment, not gonorrhea monotherapy (resistance). CDC 2021: azithromycin not recommended for gonorrhea due to resistance.","konceptMisconception":"Azithromycin for all STI","penjelasanKonsep":"Azithromycin: Chlamydia (1g), NOT gonorrhea monotherapy. Gonorrhea: ceftriaxone. Can use azithromycin 2g as alternative partner with gentamicin."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"Doksiklin = Chlamydia treatment. For gonorrhea: insufficient, rapid resistance. Only as adjunct for Chlamydia co-treatment.","konceptMisconception":"Doxycycline for gonorrhea","penjelasanKonsep":"Doxycycline: Chlamydia, NOT gonorrhea. Gonorrhea: ceftriaxone. Add doxycycline for Chlamydia coverage."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"Metronidazole: anaerobes, trichomoniasis, bacterial vaginosis, giardiasis. NO activity against N. gonorrhoeae (aerobic gram-negative diplococcus).","konceptMisconception":"Metronidazole for all genital infection","penjelasanKonsep":"Metronidazole: anaerobes/protozoa. Gonorrhea: aerobic gram-negative cocci. Completely different spectrum."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Asiklovir: herpes simplex virus (HSV). Antiviral. No activity against bacteria including N. gonorrhoeae.","konceptMisconception":"All penis/vaginal infection = antiviral","penjelasanKonsep":"Acyclovir: HSV only. Gonorrhea: bacterial, needs antibiotic (ceftriaxone). Different pathogens."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Gonore Uretritis","subtopik":["N. gonorrhoeae","Gram stain","Ceftriaxone"],"medicalTerms":["Gonorrhea","Diplococcus","NAAT","Ceftriaxone","Chlamydia coinfection"],"differentialDiagnosis":["Chlamydia urethritis","NSU","Trichomoniasis"],"clinicalPearls":["Gram stain: intracellular diplococci","Ceftriaxone IM","Treat Chlamydia too"],"examHighYield":["Diagnosis","Terapi","Coinfection management"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mendiagnosis dan menatalaksana gonore uretritis","assessmentIntent":"Menguji IMS bakteri dan antibiotik pilihan","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Doxycycline untuk semua uretritis","whyCommon":"Doxycycline untuk Chlamydia","correction":"Gonore = ceftriaxone; Chlamydia = doxycycline"}],"clinicalSignificance":"Gonore resistance rising globally. Ceftriaxone remains first-line but monitoring crucial."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["Gram negative diplococcus + Ceftriakson = GONORE"]},"slideMapping":"slide-5","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-38","questionNumber":38,"bloomLevel":2,"source":"original","category":"clinical","difficulty":"easy","soalOriginal":{"text":"Spaghetti and meatballs pada mikroskop. Diagnosis?","caseContext":"Bercak kulit dengan KOH"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Pitiriasis versikolor","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"Dermatofitosis","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Kandidiasis kutis","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Eritrasma","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Pitiriasis rosea","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Pitiriasis versikolor (tinea versicolor) adalah infeksi superficial oleh Malassezia furfur (lipophilic yeast, normal flora). KOH: 'spaghetti and meatballs' = hifa pendek (spaghetti) + yeast cells spherical (meatballs). Lesi: hipopigmentasi/hiperpigmentasi dengan skuama halus. Terapi: selenium sulfide 2.5% lotion, ketoconazole shampoo, topical azoles.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Tinea/pityriasis versicolor: superficial infection by Malassezia furfur (Pityrosporum ovale/orbiculare). Not a dermatophyte (despite 'tinea' name). Prevalence: 2-8% worldwide, higher in tropics.","patofisiologi":"Malassezia: lipophilic yeast (normal skin flora). Overgrowth triggers: humidity, sweating, oily skin, immunosuppression, steroids. Hyphal form = pathogenic. Produces azelaic acid → hypopigmentation (tyrosinase inhibition).","presentasiKlinis":"Hypopigmented or hyperpigmented macules with fine scale. Distribution: trunk, neck, proximal arms. Asymptomatic or mild pruritus. Worse with sun exposure (lesions don't tan).","diagnosis":"KOH preparation: hyphae + yeast = 'spaghetti and meatballs' (pathognomonic). Wood's lamp: yellow-green fluorescence. Culture: not done (requires lipid supplementation).","tatalaksana":"Topical: selenium sulfide 2.5% (apply 10 min, daily x 7 days), ketoconazole 2% shampoo, zinc pyrithione. Extensive: oral itraconazole 200mg daily x 5-7 days or fluconazole 300mg weekly x 2 weeks. Recurrence common. Prophylaxis: monthly ketoconazole shampoo."},"highYieldPoints":["Spaghetti and meatballs = Pityriasis versicolor","Malassezia furfur (not dermatophyte)","Hypo/hyperpigmented macules with scale","KOH = diagnosis","Selenium sulfide or ketoconazole"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"Dermatofitosis (ringworm): KOH shows branching septate hyphae only (no yeast). Different morphology: long branching hyphae without spherical yeast forms.","konceptMisconception":"All hyphae on KOH = dermatophyte","penjelasanKonsep":"Dermatophyte: hyphae only. Malassezia: hyphae + yeast (spaghetti and meatballs). Different KOH findings."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"Candidiasis: KOH shows budding yeast + pseudohyphae (elongated chains of yeast cells). No true hyphae. Different from spaghetti and meatballs.","konceptMisconception":"Yeast + hyphae = candida","penjelasanKonsep":"Candida: pseudohyphae + budding yeast. Malassezia: short hyphae + spherical yeast. Different morphology."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"Erythrasma: bacterial infection (Corynebacterium minutissimum). Coral-red fluorescence on Wood's lamp. KOH: negative (bacterial, not fungal).","konceptMisconception":"Scale + color change = fungal","penjelasanKonsep":"Erythrasma: bacterial, coral-red Wood's lamp, KOH negative. PV: fungal, yellow-green Wood's, KOH positive."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Pityriasis rosea: viral (HHV-6/7) exanthem. Herald patch → Christmas tree distribution. No scale on KOH (not fungal). Self-limiting 6-8 weeks.","konceptMisconception":"Pityriasis name = same condition","penjelasanKonsep":"Pityriasis rosea: viral, herald patch, no KOH findings. Pityriasis versicolor: fungal, spaghetti and meatballs on KOH. Different etiologies."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Pitiriasis Versikolor","subtopik":["Malassezia furfur","KOH spaghetti and meatballs","Terapi"],"medicalTerms":["Pityriasis versicolor","Malassezia","Spaghetti and meatballs","Selenium sulfide"],"differentialDiagnosis":["Tinea corporis","Vitiligo","Erythrasma","Pityriasis rosea"],"clinicalPearls":["Spaghetti and meatballs = pathognomonic","Not a true dermatophyte","Recurrence common"],"examHighYield":["KOH finding","Terapi","Bedakan dari dermatofitosis"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mengidentifikasi pityriasis versikolor berdasarkan KOH","assessmentIntent":"Menguji pattern recognition mikroskopik","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Semua 'tinea' = dermatofit","whyCommon":"Nama tinea versicolor","correction":"Tinea versicolor = Malassezia (yeast), bukan dermatofit"}],"clinicalSignificance":"PV sering misdiagnosa sebagai vitiligo atau dermatofitosis. KOH spesifik mencegah kesalahan treatment."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["Spaghetti and meatballs = Pitiriasis versikolor (Malassezia)"]},"slideMapping":"slide-5","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-39","questionNumber":39,"bloomLevel":3,"source":"original","category":"clinical","difficulty":"easy","soalOriginal":{"text":"Wanita 44 tahun, gatal vagina, duh encer, mikroskopi: blastospora. Diagnosis?","caseContext":"Vaginitis"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Kandidiasis vulvovaginitis","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"Bacterial vaginosis","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Trichomoniasis","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Atrophic vaginitis","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Gonore","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Kandidiasis vulvovaginitis: infeksi Candida albicans (90%) atau C. glabrata. Tanda: pruritus vulvae intens, discharge putih kental seperti cottage cheese, vulvar erythema/edema. pH normal (<4.5). KOH/pap smear: pseudohyphae, blastospores, budding yeast. Terapi: azol topikal (klotrimazole, mikonazole) 1-7 hari atau fluconazole 150mg PO single dose.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Vulvovaginal candidiasis (VVC): fungal infection, 2nd most common vaginitis after BV. 75% women experience at least one episode. Recurrent VVC: ≥4 episodes/year.","patofisiologi":"C. albicans: normal GI flora, overgrowth triggered by antibiotics, pregnancy, diabetes, immunosuppression, OCP. Adherence to vaginal epithelium → hyphae formation → tissue invasion → inflammation.","presentasiKlinis":"Pruritus (dominant), burning, dysuria (external), dyspareunia. Discharge: white, thick, curdy/cottage cheese, odorless. Vulva: erythema, edema, fissures, satellite lesions.","diagnosis":"pH <4.5 (normal, distinguishes from BV/trichomonas). KOH 10%: pseudohyphae, budding yeast, blastospores (sensitivity 40-60%). Saline wet mount: budding yeast. Culture: Sabouraud dextrose agar (for recurrent/atypical).","tatalaksana":"Uncomplicated: azole topikal (clotrimazole 1% or miconazole 2%) 1-7 days OR fluconazole 150mg PO single dose. Complicated (severe/recurrent/immunocompromised): fluconazole 150mg every 72 hours x 3 doses, then maintenance weekly x 6 months. Partner treatment: not routine (not STI)."},"highYieldPoints":["Pruritus dominant","Cottage cheese discharge","pH <4.5 (normal)","Blastospores/pseudohyphae on KOH","Azoles = treatment"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"BV: thin gray-white discharge, fishy odor (amine), pH >4.5, clue cells on saline wet mount. NO pruritus dominant, NO yeast forms.","konceptMisconception":"Vaginal discharge = BV","penjelasanKonsep":"BV: pH >4.5, clue cells, fishy odor. VVC: pH <4.5, pseudohyphae, pruritus, cottage cheese. Different findings."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"Trichomoniasis: yellow-green frothy discharge, pH >4.5, strawberry cervix, motile trichomonads on saline. NO blastospores.","konceptMisconception":"Vaginitis with itching = trichomonas","penjelasanKonsep":"Trichomonas: pH >4.5, motile protozoa, green discharge. VVC: pH <4.5, yeast, white curdy discharge. Different."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"Atrophic vaginitis: postmenopausal, estrogen deficiency. Thin clear discharge, vaginal dryness, dyspareunia, pH elevated (>5.0). NO yeast, NO intense pruritus.","konceptMisconception":"Age 44 = atrophic","penjelasanKonsep":"Atrophic: postmenopausal, estrogen low. VVC: reproductive age, intense pruritus, yeast. Age 44 premenopausal likely."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Gonorrhea: cervicitis/urethritis, mucopurulent discharge, Gram negative diplococcus intracellular. NO pruritus dominant, NO blastospores.","konceptMisconception":"All vaginal infections = STI","penjelasanKonsep":"Gonorrhea: cervical infection, discharge, dysuria. VVC: fungal, pruritus, yeast. Different etiologies and presentations."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Kandidiasis Vulvovaginitis","subtopik":["Candida albicans","pH normal","Azoles"],"medicalTerms":["VVC","Pseudohyphae","Blastospore","Cottage cheese discharge"],"differentialDiagnosis":["BV","Trichomoniasis","Atrophic vaginitis"],"clinicalPearls":["Pruritus dominant","pH <4.5","Fluconazole 150mg SD"],"examHighYield":["Diagnosis","Bedakan dari BV","Terapi"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mendiagnosis kandidiasis vulvovaginitis","assessmentIntent":"Menguji vaginitis differential diagnosis","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Semua vaginitis gatal = kandidiasis","whyCommon":"VVC paling dikenal","correction":"BV, trichomonas juga gatal; pH dan microscopy differentiate"}],"clinicalSignificance":"Accurate diagnosis prevents inappropriate treatment and recurrent infection."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["Blastospora + pruritus + cottage cheese = Kandidiasis"]},"slideMapping":"slide-6","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","isCorrectMatch":true}},{"id":"soal-A-40","questionNumber":40,"bloomLevel":3,"source":"original","category":"clinical","difficulty":"medium","soalOriginal":{"text":"Robekan iris mengenai sfingter → pendarahan anterior chamber. Diagnosis?","caseContext":"Trauma mata tumpul"},"pilihan":[{"letter":"A","text":"Hifema","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"Hipopion","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"Hemofthalm","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"Vitreous hemorrhage","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"E","text":"Subkonjungtival hemorrhage","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","penjelasan":{"ringkas":"Hifema adalah penumpukan darah di anterior chamber (AC) akibat trauma tumpul yang merobekkan vessel di iris root atau ciliary body. Sfingter iris injury → bleeding into AC. Grading berdasarkan volume: G1(<1/3), G2(1/3-1/2), G3(>1/2), G4(total/8-ball). Komplikasi: rebleed (day 2-5), corneal blood staining, secondary glaucoma.","lengkap":{"definisi":"Hyphema: blood in anterior chamber. Traumatic: most common (children/young adults). Spontaneous: sickle cell, anticoagulants, bleeding disorders, vascular anomalies.","patofisiologi":"Blunt trauma → sudden compression → iris root/ciliary body vessel rupture → blood fills AC. Circumferential ciliary body tearing = angle recession (risk late glaucoma).","presentasiKlinis":"Trauma history + blurred vision + eye pain. Visible blood layer in AC on penlight/slit lamp. Check: IOP, corneal clarity, posterior segment (when media clear), angle recession signs.","diagnosis":"Slit lamp: grade hyphema, assess for microhyphema, rule out open globe injury. Gonioscopy after resolution. US B-scan if posterior segment not visible.","tatalaksana":"Outpatient if small, no sickle cell. Activity restriction, head elevation 30-45°, eye shield. Cycloplegic (atropine/homatropine). Avoid aspirin/NSAIDs. IOP control. Hospitalize if: G3-4, sickle cell, non-compliant, suspected child abuse. Surgery (AC washout) if: total hyphema >5 days, corneal blood staining risk, IOP uncontrolled."},"highYieldPoints":["Blood in AC = hyphema","Trauma = most common cause","Grade determines management","Rebleed risk day 2-5","Sickle cell = worse prognosis"],"opsiSalah":[{"letter":"B","mengapaSalah":"Hipopion: pus (white blood cells) in AC, not blood. Layered white cells. Indicates severe infection (endophthalmitis, corneal ulcer).","konceptMisconception":"Layered fluid in AC = hipopion","penjelasanKonsep":"Hyphema = blood (red). Hypopyon = pus (white). Different contents, different etiologies."},{"letter":"C","mengapaSalah":"Hemophthalm/hemophthalmos: blood in vitreous cavity (posterior segment), not anterior chamber. Requires B-scan if cornea not clear.","konceptMisconception":"Blood in eye = hemophthalm","penjelasanKonsep":"Hemophthalm: vitreous hemorrhage. Hyphema: AC hemorrhage. Location distinguishes."},{"letter":"D","mengapaSalah":"Vitreous hemorrhage: blood in vitreous gel. Causes: PVD, retinal tear, diabetes, trauma. NOT anterior chamber location.","konceptMisconception":"Any intraocular blood = VH","penjelasanKonsep":"VH: posterior segment. Hyphema: anterior segment. Slit lamp localizes."},{"letter":"E","mengapaSalah":"Subconjunctival hemorrhage: blood under conjunctiva (red patch on white sclera). Common, benign, self-limiting. NOT in anterior chamber.","konceptMisconception":"Red eye with trauma = SCH","penjelasanKonsep":"SCH: subconjunctival blood. Hyphema: AC blood layer. Different locations and significance."}]},"materi":{"topikUtama":"Hifema Traumatik","subtopik":["Trauma blunt","Anterior chamber bleeding","Grading"],"medicalTerms":["Hyphema","Anterior chamber","Iris sphincter","Angle recession"],"differentialDiagnosis":["Hipopion","Vitreous hemorrhage","Subconjunctival hemorrhage"],"clinicalPearls":["Blood in AC = hyphema","Grade determines prognosis","Sickle cell = complications"],"examHighYield":["Definition","Grading","Management"]},"pedagogical":{"learningObjective":"Mengidentifikasi hifema sebagai akibat trauma iris","assessmentIntent":"Menguji anatomy dan terminology ocular hemorrhage","commonMisconceptions":[{"misconception":"Semua darah di mata sama","whyCommon":"Visual similarity","correction":"Hyphema (AC), hypopyon (pus), VH (vitreous), SCH (subconjunctival) = different locations"}],"clinicalSignificance":"Hifema memerlukan grading dan monitoring IOP untuk mencegah complications."},"htmlMetadata":{"displayMode":"expanded","highlightedContent":["Blood in anterior chamber = HIFEMA"]},"slideMapping":"slide-12","canonicalAnswerContract":{"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","isCorrectMatch":true}}]};
  var QUIZ_RECALL_MASTER = {"metadata":{"appName":"Mega Atlas Blok","type":"quiz_recall_bank","description":"Per-slide recall quizzes mapped from canonical question bank","totalQuizzes":18,"slideCoverage":[{"slideId":"slide-1","quizCount":1,"sourceSoalIds":["soal-A-17"]},{"slideId":"slide-10","quizCount":1,"sourceSoalIds":["soal-A-4"]},{"slideId":"slide-11","quizCount":1,"sourceSoalIds":["soal-A-20"]},{"slideId":"slide-12","quizCount":2,"sourceSoalIds":["soal-A-5","soal-A-29"]},{"slideId":"slide-13","quizCount":1,"sourceSoalIds":["soal-A-1"]},{"slideId":"slide-14","quizCount":2,"sourceSoalIds":["soal-A-3","soal-A-27"]},{"slideId":"slide-3","quizCount":2,"sourceSoalIds":["soal-A-28","soal-A-2"]},{"slideId":"slide-4","quizCount":2,"sourceSoalIds":["soal-A-24","soal-A-25"]},{"slideId":"slide-5","quizCount":2,"sourceSoalIds":["soal-A-10","soal-A-21"]},{"slideId":"slide-6","quizCount":2,"sourceSoalIds":["soal-A-18","soal-A-34"]},{"slideId":"slide-8","quizCount":2,"sourceSoalIds":["soal-A-26","soal-A-13"]}],"generatedAt":"2026-05-25T20:54:36","validationStatus":"VALIDATED"},"quizzes":[{"id":"quiz-soal-A-17","slideId":"slide-1","questionNumber":17,"bloomLevel":1,"difficulty":"easy","question":"Kelenjar yang menghasilkan serumen adalah...","caseContext":"Anatomi telinga","options":[{"key":"A","text":"Kelenjar sebacea","isCorrect":false},{"key":"B","text":"Kelenjar seruminosa (apokrin)","isCorrect":true},{"key":"C","text":"Kelenjar minyak","isCorrect":false},{"key":"D","text":"Kelenjar ekrin/merokrin","isCorrect":false},{"key":"E","text":"Kelenjar lacrimalis","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"B","explanation":"Serumen (earwax) dihasilkan oleh kelenjar seruminosa (apokrin glands) dan kelenjar sebacea yang terdapat di daerah kartilago meatus akustikus eksternus (outer 1/3). Kelenjar seruminosa adalah modifikasi kelenjar apokrin yang terletak di submukosa. Serumen bersifat protektif: antimikroba, pelumas, dan barrier.","highYieldPoints":["Kelenjar seruminosa = apokrin glands di outer 1/3 meatus","Serumen = protektif (antimikroba + pelumas)","Impaksi: penyebab HL konduktif reversible paling umum","NaCl 3% = serumenolisis","JANGAN pakai cotton bud (mendorong serumen ke dalam)"],"sourceSoalId":"soal-A-17"},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-4","slideId":"slide-10","questionNumber":4,"bloomLevel":2,"difficulty":"medium","question":"Keadaan kelopak mata tertarik ke atas sehingga tidak bisa menutup sempurna dan bisa terjadi eksplorasi kornea disebut...","caseContext":"","options":[{"key":"A","text":"Lagoftalmos","isCorrect":true},{"key":"B","text":"Retraksi palpebra","isCorrect":false},{"key":"C","text":"Eksoftalmus","isCorrect":false},{"key":"D","text":"Ektropion","isCorrect":false},{"key":"E","text":"Trikiasis","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","explanation":"Lagoftalmos adalah ketidakmampuan menutup kelopak mata secara sempurna akibat kelumpuhan N. VII (facial nerve). Kelopak mata tertarik ke atas karena aksi unopposed m. levator palpebrae superioris (N. III). Konsekuensi: kornea terbuka → ekskoriasi, ulkus, dan infeksi kornea.","highYieldPoints":["Lagoftalmos = N. VII lesion (facial nerve palsy)","Kelopak terangkat karena unopposed N. III (levator)","Komplikasi utama: exposure keratopathy → ulkus kornea","Bell's phenomenon = proteksi alami (elevasi bola mata)","Tarsorrhaphy = prosedur penting untuk proteksi kornea"],"sourceSoalId":"soal-A-4"},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-20","slideId":"slide-11","questionNumber":20,"bloomLevel":3,"difficulty":"hard","question":"Wanita 50 tahun, mata kanan merah 3 hari, visus kabur, sakit kepala hebat, mual muntah, TIO tidak terukur, kornea edema, COA dangkal. Diagnosis?","caseContext":"Emergency oftalmologi akut","options":[{"key":"A","text":"Glaukoma akut sudut tertutup","isCorrect":true},{"key":"B","text":"Endoftalmitis","isCorrect":false},{"key":"C","text":"Panoftalmitis","isCorrect":false},{"key":"D","text":"Uveitis anterior","isCorrect":false},{"key":"E","text":"Ulkus kornea bakteri","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","explanation":"Glaukoma akut sudut tertutup (AACG) adalah emergency oftalmologi dengan trias: sakit kepala hebat, mual muntah, dan penurunan visus mendadak. Tanda: injeksi siliar, kornea edema steamy, COA dangkal, pupil middilated fixed oval. TIO sangat tinggi (>40-80 mmHg). Penyebab: pupillary block akibat contact iris-lens.","highYieldPoints":["Trias: sakit kepala + mual muntah + visus turun = AACG","TIO >40 mmHg = emergency","Cornea steamy edema + shallow AC","Pupil middilated fixed oval","LPI = tatalaksana definitif"],"sourceSoalId":"soal-A-20"},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-5","slideId":"slide-12","questionNumber":5,"bloomLevel":2,"difficulty":"easy","question":"Yang termasuk emergency absolute pada mata adalah...","caseContext":"","options":[{"key":"A","text":"Trauma benda tajam","isCorrect":false},{"key":"B","text":"Trauma kimia asam","isCorrect":false},{"key":"C","text":"Trauma kimia basa","isCorrect":true},{"key":"D","text":"Trauma termal","isCorrect":false},{"key":"E","text":"Trauma radiasi","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"C","explanation":"Trauma kimia basa merupakan emergency absolute karena basa menyebabkan saponifikasi lipid membran, penetrasi mendalam ke jaringan, dan kerusakan berkelanjutan. Asam menyebabkan koagulasi protein superfisial yang justru membatasi penetrasi. IRIGASI MASIF segera adalah kunci tatalaksana.","highYieldPoints":["BASA > ASAM dalam keparahan trauma kimia mata","Saponifikasi = mekanisme penetrasi basa","IRIGASI segera adalah kunci – jangan tunggu pemeriksaan","Grading Dua: iskemia limbus + opasitas kornea","Iskemia limbus >1/2 = prognosis buruk (Grade 4)"],"sourceSoalId":"soal-A-5"},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-29","slideId":"slide-12","questionNumber":29,"bloomLevel":2,"difficulty":"easy","question":"Hifema mengisi 1/2 anterior chamber. Grade berapa?","caseContext":"Trauma mata","options":[{"key":"A","text":"Grade 1","isCorrect":false},{"key":"B","text":"Grade 2","isCorrect":false},{"key":"C","text":"Grade 3","isCorrect":true},{"key":"D","text":"Grade 4","isCorrect":false},{"key":"E","text":"Grade 5","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"C","explanation":"Grading hifema: G1 = <1/3 anterior chamber (AC). G2 = 1/3 - 1/2 AC. G3 = >1/2 AC (total/8-ball hifema). G4 = total AC filled with dark/clotted blood. G3-G4 berisiko komplikasi: corneal blood staining, glaucoma sekunder, optic atrophy. Penatalaksanaan: bed rest, eye shield, cycloplegic, IOP control.","highYieldPoints":["G1: <1/3 AC","G2: 1/3 - 1/2 AC","G3: >1/2 AC","G4: total AC (8-ball)","Rebleed risk day 2-5","Elevated IOP = main complication"],"sourceSoalId":"soal-A-29"},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-1","slideId":"slide-13","questionNumber":1,"bloomLevel":2,"difficulty":"easy","question":"Gejala katarak, kecuali...","caseContext":"","options":[{"key":"A","text":"Glare (silau)","isCorrect":false},{"key":"B","text":"Floaters (bayang-bayang melayang)","isCorrect":false},{"key":"C","text":"Fotopsia (kilatan cahaya)","isCorrect":false},{"key":"D","text":"Nyeri","isCorrect":true},{"key":"E","text":"Penglihatan ganda (diplopia monokular)","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"D","explanation":"Katarak adalah kekeruhan lensa intraokular yang menyebabkan penurunan penglihatan progresif. Katarak TIDAK menyebabkan nyeri karena lensa tidak memiliki inervasi sensorik. Gejala utama meliputi visi kabur, glare, floaters, fotopsia, dan diplopia monokular.","highYieldPoints":["Katarak TIDAK menyebabkan nyeri – ini pembeda dengan glaukoma akut","Diplopia monokular adalah gejala khas katarak (bukan strabismus)","Glare malam hari adalah gejala awal katarak posterior subkapsular","Katarak traumatica: bunga katarak (rosette-shaped)","Tatalaksana definitif hanya operasi, obat tetes tidak efektif"],"sourceSoalId":"soal-A-1"},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-3","slideId":"slide-14","questionNumber":3,"bloomLevel":2,"difficulty":"easy","question":"Gejala ablasio retina, kecuali...","caseContext":"","options":[{"key":"A","text":"Floater (bayang melayang)","isCorrect":false},{"key":"B","text":"Buram mendadak","isCorrect":false},{"key":"C","text":"Tirai/gorden gelap","isCorrect":false},{"key":"D","text":"Nyeri","isCorrect":true},{"key":"E","text":"Silau (photopsia)","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"D","explanation":"Ablasio retina adalah terlepasnya neurosensory retina dari retinal pigment epithelium (RPE). Gejalanya: floaters, penglihatan buram mendadak, bayangan gelap seperti tirai (shade), dan fotopsia (kilatan cahaya). Ablasio retina TIDAK menyebabkan nyeri karena retina tidak memiliki nociceptor.","highYieldPoints":["Ablasio retina = NYERI TAK TERJADI","Trias: Photopsia + Floaters + Curtain/shade","Tipe paling umum: rhegmatogenous","Macula status (on/off) menentukan prognosis","Emergency: RD macula-on harus dioperasi dalam 24 jam"],"sourceSoalId":"soal-A-3"},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-27","slideId":"slide-14","questionNumber":27,"bloomLevel":2,"difficulty":"easy","question":"Kelainan mata akibat defisiensi vitamin A adalah...","caseContext":"Nutrisi dan mata","options":[{"key":"A","text":"Hipopigmentasi retina","isCorrect":true},{"key":"B","text":"Age-related macular degeneration","isCorrect":false},{"key":"C","text":"Ablasio retina","isCorrect":false},{"key":"D","text":"Katarak senilis","isCorrect":false},{"key":"E","text":"Glaukoma primer","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","explanation":"Vitamin A (retinol) esensial untuk fototransduksi (rhodopsin di rod cells). Defisiensi menyebabkan: (1) night blindness (xerophthalmia stage 1), (2) conjunctival xerosis (dryness), (3) Bitot spots (foamy patches), (4) corneal xerosis/ulceration/melting, (5) hipopigmentasi retina. AMD, ablasio retina, katarak, dan glaukoma BUKAN akibat defisiensi vitamin A.","highYieldPoints":["VAD: night blindness → xerosis → Bitot spots → corneal ulcer","Rhodopsin regeneration requires vitamin A","Hipopigmentasi retina = fundus finding","High-dose oral vitamin A = treatment","Preventable blindness"],"sourceSoalId":"soal-A-27"},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-28","slideId":"slide-3","questionNumber":28,"bloomLevel":2,"difficulty":"easy","question":"Pembengkakan dari post auricular sampai m. sternocleidomastoideus setelah otitis media akut. Diagnosis?","caseContext":"Komplikasi OMA","options":[{"key":"A","text":"Abses Bezold","isCorrect":true},{"key":"B","text":"Mastoiditis akut","isCorrect":false},{"key":"C","text":"Abses subperiosteal","isCorrect":false},{"key":"D","text":"Lateral sinus thrombosis","isCorrect":false},{"key":"E","text":"Meningitis","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","explanation":"Abses Bezold adalah komplikasi otitis media akut/mastoiditis dimana infeksi menyebar melalui mastoid tip (processus mastoideus) yang pneumatized, masuk ke ruang di bawah m. sternocleidomastoideus. Tanda: pembengkakan post-auricular yang meluas ke leher (sulcus retro-mastoideus → SCM).","highYieldPoints":["Bezold = mastoiditis + neck abscess","Extension through mastoid tip","Swelling along SCM","Mastoidectomy + drainage","Different from simple mastoiditis"],"sourceSoalId":"soal-A-28"},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-2","slideId":"slide-3","questionNumber":2,"bloomLevel":3,"difficulty":"medium","question":"Tn F usia 23 tahun, pendengaran berkurang telinga kanan 3 hari, nyeri, keluar cairan nanah, demam (sudah tidak demam). Pemeriksaan otoskopi: perforasi membran timpani. Tatalaksana?","caseContext":"Pasien muda dengan OMA stadium perforasi","options":[{"key":"A","text":"NaCl 3% dan antibiotik","isCorrect":false},{"key":"B","text":"Irigasi telinga dengan NaCl 0,9% dan antibiotik","isCorrect":true},{"key":"C","text":"Dekongestan nasal","isCorrect":false},{"key":"D","text":"Analgesik saja","isCorrect":false},{"key":"E","text":"Pemberian karbogliserin","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"B","explanation":"OMA (Otitis Media Akut) stadium perforasi ditatalaksani dengan irigasi telinga menggunakan NaCl 0,9% untuk membersihkan sekret/nanah dan pemberian antibiotik sistemik. NaCl 3% digunakan untuk serumen prop, bukan OMA. Dekongestan tidak mengatasi infeksi.","highYieldPoints":["OMA stadium perforasi: IRIGASI + ANTIBIOTIK","NaCl 3% digunakan untuk serumen prop, bukan OMA","Patogen utama OMA: S. pneumoniae, H. influenzae, M. catarrhalis","Perforasi MT spontan pada OMA = drainage alami, prognosis baik","Telinga harus dijaga kering selama masa penyembuhan"],"sourceSoalId":"soal-A-2"},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-24","slideId":"slide-4","questionNumber":24,"bloomLevel":3,"difficulty":"medium","question":"Laki-laki 62 tahun, vesikel multiple aurikularis sinistra, nyeri, pendengaran berkurang, pusing. Saraf terlibat?","caseContext":"Vesikel telinga dengan gejala neurologis","options":[{"key":"A","text":"N. VII dan N. VIII","isCorrect":true},{"key":"B","text":"N. I dan N. II","isCorrect":false},{"key":"C","text":"N. III dan N. IV","isCorrect":false},{"key":"D","text":"N. V dan N. VI","isCorrect":false},{"key":"E","text":"N. IX dan N. X","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","explanation":"Ramsay Hunt Syndrome (herpes zoster oticus) adalah reaktivasi VZV di ganglion geniculate (N. VII facial). Trias: (1) vesikel aurikular/external ear, (2) facial paralysis (Bell palsy-like), (3) auditory/vestibular symptoms (tinnitus, HL, vertigo) akibat N. VIII involvement. Tatalaksana: asiklovir + prednison dalam 72 jam.","highYieldPoints":["Vesikel aurikular + facial palsy + HL/vertigo = Ramsay Hunt","VZV reactivation in geniculate ganglion","CN VII + CN VIII involved","Asiklovir + prednison <72 jam","Prognosis worse than idiopathic Bell palsy"],"sourceSoalId":"soal-A-24"},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-25","slideId":"slide-4","questionNumber":25,"bloomLevel":3,"difficulty":"medium","question":"Buruh 36 tahun, penurunan pendengaran bilateral, terbiasa suara mesin. Hasil audiometri?","caseContext":"Sensorineural hearing loss occupational","options":[{"key":"A","text":"Noise notch 4000 Hz bilateral","isCorrect":true},{"key":"B","text":"Penurunan air conduction saja","isCorrect":false},{"key":"C","text":"Penurunan bone conduction saja","isCorrect":false},{"key":"D","text":"Cookie-bite pattern","isCorrect":false},{"key":"E","text":"Rising curve","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","explanation":"Noise-induced hearing loss (NIHL) adalah sensorineural hearing loss akibat paparan noise kronis (>85 dB). Tanda audiometri khas: bilateral symmetrical sensorineural hearing loss dengan noise notch di 3000-6000 Hz (peak 4000 Hz). Mekanisme: stereocilia damage di basal turn cochlea (high frequency region).","highYieldPoints":["Noise notch 3000-6000 Hz (peak 4000 Hz) = NIHL","Bilateral symmetrical","Sensorineural (not conductive)","Prevention with hearing protection","Occupational history crucial"],"sourceSoalId":"soal-A-25"},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-10","slideId":"slide-5","questionNumber":10,"bloomLevel":2,"difficulty":"easy","question":"Jenis erupsi obat yang paling sering terjadi adalah...","caseContext":"","options":[{"key":"A","text":"Stevens-Johnson syndrome","isCorrect":false},{"key":"B","text":"Erupsi obat tipe bulosa","isCorrect":false},{"key":"C","text":"Erupsi obat morbiliformis","isCorrect":true},{"key":"D","text":"Toxic epidermal necrolysis","isCorrect":false},{"key":"E","text":"Lupus drug induced","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"C","explanation":"Erupsi obat morbiliformis (exanthematous/morbiliform drug eruption) adalah reaksi obat kulit tersering, menyebabkan ~90% semua reaksi obat cutaneous. Berupa makulopapul eritematosa yang simetris di trunkus dan proksimal ekstremitas, muncul 7-14 hari pasca obat. Self-limiting setelah obat dihentikan.","highYieldPoints":["Morbiliform = 90% reaksi obat kulit","Onset: 7-14 hari pasca obat baru","Simetris trunkus + proksimal ekstremitas","TIDAK melibatkan mukosa (beda SJS)","Self-limiting setelah obat dihentikan"],"sourceSoalId":"soal-A-10"},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-21","slideId":"slide-5","questionNumber":21,"bloomLevel":2,"difficulty":"easy","question":"Side effect beta blocker yang berhubungan dengan asma adalah...","caseContext":"Farmakologi kardiovaskular","options":[{"key":"A","text":"Bronkospasme","isCorrect":true},{"key":"B","text":"Takikardia","isCorrect":false},{"key":"C","text":"Hipertensi","isCorrect":false},{"key":"D","text":"Hipoglikemia","isCorrect":false},{"key":"E","text":"Diare","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","explanation":"Beta blocker non-selektif (propranolol) menghambat reseptor beta-2 di bronkus → bronkospasme. Kontraindikasi pada asma. Beta blocker kardioselektif (metoprolol, bisoprolol) lebih aman tapi tetap hati-hati. Beta-2 agonist (salbutamol) merupakan terapi utama asma.","highYieldPoints":["Non-selektif beta blocker = bronkospasme","Kontraindikasi pada asma","Selektif beta-1 lebih aman","Beta-2 agonist = antidot"],"sourceSoalId":"soal-A-21"},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-18","slideId":"slide-6","questionNumber":18,"bloomLevel":1,"difficulty":"easy","question":"Sel melanosit berada pada lapisan epidermis...","caseContext":"Histologi kulit","options":[{"key":"A","text":"Stratum korneum","isCorrect":false},{"key":"B","text":"Diantara stratum basal dan stratum spinosum","isCorrect":true},{"key":"C","text":"Stratum granulosum","isCorrect":false},{"key":"D","text":"Stratum spinosum","isCorrect":false},{"key":"E","text":"Stratum lusidum","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"B","explanation":"Melanosit terletak di stratum basal epidermis (basal layer), bersisian dengan keratinosit. Setiap melanosit melayani sekitar 36 keratinosit (epidermal melanin unit). Melanosit memiliki dendrit yang memanjang ke stratum spinosum untuk transfer melanin (pigment) ke keratinosit.","highYieldPoints":["Melanosit di STRATUM BASAL","1 melanosit : 36 keratinosit (epidermal melanin unit)","Melanin transfer via dendrit ke keratinosit","Tyrosinase = enzyme kunci melanogenesis","S100+, HMB-45+ = marker melanosit"],"sourceSoalId":"soal-A-18"},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-34","slideId":"slide-6","questionNumber":34,"bloomLevel":1,"difficulty":"easy","question":"Faktor risiko paling tinggi untuk melanoma kulit adalah...","caseContext":"Epidemiologi melanoma","options":[{"key":"A","text":"Fitzpatrick Skin Phototype I","isCorrect":true},{"key":"B","text":"Fitzpatrick Skin Phototype II","isCorrect":false},{"key":"C","text":"Fitzpatrick Skin Phototype III","isCorrect":false},{"key":"D","text":"Fitzpatrick Skin Phototype IV","isCorrect":false},{"key":"E","text":"Fitzpatrick Skin Phototype V","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","explanation":"Fitzpatrick Skin Type I (very fair, always burns, never tans) memiliki risiko melanoma tertinggi. Type II juga berisiko tinggi. Risk ratio: Type I-II 2-3x higher than Type III-IV. Melanoma: #5 cancer terbanyak, #1 cause of skin cancer death. UV exposure = primary risk factor.","highYieldPoints":["Type I = highest melanoma risk","UV exposure = primary cause","ABCDE for diagnosis","Breslow thickness = prognosis","Prevention: sun protection"],"sourceSoalId":"soal-A-34"},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-26","slideId":"slide-8","questionNumber":26,"bloomLevel":3,"difficulty":"medium","question":"Pemuda 24 tahun, perdarahan hidung, rasa asin tenggorokan, darah ke nasofaring-orofaring, hipertensi. Tatalaksana?","caseContext":"Epistaksis posterior","options":[{"key":"A","text":"Tampon posterior","isCorrect":true},{"key":"B","text":"Tampon anterior","isCorrect":false},{"key":"C","text":"Kepala ditengadahkan","isCorrect":false},{"key":"D","text":"Darah ditelan","isCorrect":false},{"key":"E","text":"Kompresi digital hidung","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","explanation":"Epistaksis posterior: perdarahan dari plexus Woodruff/faring (posterior nasal cavity). Tanda: darah mengalir ke posterior faring (rasa asin, batuk, hematemesis), tidak terlihat dari anterior nares. Tampon anterior tidak efektif. Perlu tampon posterior (balloon catheter/posterior nasal packing) untuk menekan vessel bleeding.","highYieldPoints":["Posterior epistaxis = blood down throat","Tampon anterior ineffective","Tampon posterior = Foley/balloon","Hospital admission required","Angiographic embolization for refractory"],"sourceSoalId":"soal-A-26"},{"id":"quiz-soal-A-13","slideId":"slide-8","questionNumber":13,"bloomLevel":3,"difficulty":"medium","question":"Pria 21 tahun, hidung penuh 2 bulan, masa polipoid licin transluksan bilateral, IgE tinggi, histologi: stroma edematous, eosinofil. Diagnosis?","caseContext":"Obstruksi hidung kronis bilateral","options":[{"key":"A","text":"Polip nasi","isCorrect":true},{"key":"B","text":"Karsinoma sel skuamosa nasi","isCorrect":false},{"key":"C","text":"Rhinitis kronik","isCorrect":false},{"key":"D","text":"Rhinitis alergika","isCorrect":false},{"key":"E","text":"Papilloma inverting","isCorrect":false}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","explanation":"Polip nasi adalah edema submukosa sinus paranasal yang berprotrusi ke rongga hidung. Klasik: bilateral, licin, transluksan, berisi eosinofil. Terkait: rinitis alergi, asma bronkial, aspirin sensitivity (triad Samter: asma + polip + aspirin). Histologi: stroma edematous, pseudostratified respiratory epithelium, eosinophilic infiltrate.","highYieldPoints":["Polip nasi: BILATERAL, licin, transluksan","Eosinofil + edema stroma = histologi khas","Triad Samter: asma + polip + aspirin sensitivity","Bedakan dari malignancy: bilateral, no bone destruction","FESS untuk refractory"],"sourceSoalId":"soal-A-13"}]};
