"A","text":"Floater (bayang melayang)"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"Buram mendadak"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Tirai/gorden gelap"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Nyeri"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Silau (photopsia)"}],"correctAnswerKey":"D","jawabanBenar":"D","explanation":"Ablasio retina adalah terlepasnya neurosensory retina dari retinal pigment epithelium (RPE). Gejalanya: floaters, penglihatan buram mendadak, bayangan gelap seperti tirai (shade), dan fotopsia (kilatan cahaya). Ablasio retina TIDAK menyebabkan nyeri karena retina tidak memiliki nociceptor.","highYieldPoints":["Ablasio retina = NYERI TAK TERJADI","Trias: Photopsia + Floaters + Curtain/shade","Tipe paling umum: rhegmatogenous","Macula status (on/off) menentukan prognosis","Emergency: RD macula-on harus dioperasi dalam 24 jam"],"slideMapping":"slide-14","materi":{"topikUtama":"Ablasio Retina","subtopik":["Tipe ablasio retina","Penyebab ablasio retina","Tanda dan gejala","Tatalaksana ablasio retina"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-4","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-4","questionNumber":4,"bloomLevel":2,"category":"knowledge","difficulty":"medium","text":"Keadaan kelopak mata tertarik ke atas sehingga tidak bisa menutup sempurna dan bisa terjadi eksplorasi kornea disebut...","caseContext":"","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"Lagoftalmos"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"Retraksi palpebra"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Eksoftalmus"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Ektropion"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Trikiasis"}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","explanation":"Lagoftalmos adalah ketidakmampuan menutup kelopak mata secara sempurna akibat kelumpuhan N. VII (facial nerve). Kelopak mata tertarik ke atas karena aksi unopposed m. levator palpebrae superioris (N. III). Konsekuensi: kornea terbuka → ekskoriasi, ulkus, dan infeksi kornea.","highYieldPoints":["Lagoftalmos = N. VII lesion (facial nerve palsy)","Kelopak terangkat karena unopposed N. III (levator)","Komplikasi utama: exposure keratopathy → ulkus kornea","Bell's phenomenon = proteksi alami (elevasi bola mata)","Tarsorrhaphy = prosedur penting untuk proteksi kornea"],"slideMapping":"slide-10","materi":{"topikUtama":"Lagoftalmos","subtopik":["N. VII palsy","Exposure keratopathy","Tarsorrhaphy"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-5","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-5","questionNumber":5,"bloomLevel":2,"category":"clinical","difficulty":"easy","text":"Yang termasuk emergency absolute pada mata adalah...","caseContext":"","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"Trauma benda tajam"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"Trauma kimia asam"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Trauma kimia basa"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Trauma termal"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Trauma radiasi"}],"correctAnswerKey":"C","jawabanBenar":"C","explanation":"Trauma kimia basa merupakan emergency absolute karena basa menyebabkan saponifikasi lipid membran, penetrasi mendalam ke jaringan, dan kerusakan berkelanjutan. Asam menyebabkan koagulasi protein superfisial yang justru membatasi penetrasi. IRIGASI MASIF segera adalah kunci tatalaksana.","highYieldPoints":["BASA > ASAM dalam keparahan trauma kimia mata","Saponifikasi = mekanisme penetrasi basa","IRIGASI segera adalah kunci – jangan tunggu pemeriksaan","Grading Dua: iskemia limbus + opasitas kornea","Iskemia limbus >1/2 = prognosis buruk (Grade 4)"],"slideMapping":"slide-12","materi":{"topikUtama":"Trauma Kimia Mata","subtopik":["Alkali vs Acid injury","Grading Dua","Irigasi emergensi","Tatalaksana"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-6","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-6","questionNumber":6,"bloomLevel":3,"category":"clinical","difficulty":"medium","text":"Anak 6 tahun, benjolan leher kiri depan 3 cm di tepi atas m. sternocleidomastoideus, ada lubang di ujung yang keluar cairan mukoid, sejak lahir. Berasal dari...","caseContext":"Benjolan kongenital leher","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"Brachial cleft cyst"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"Kelenjar keringat"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Cervical sinus"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Kelenjar tiroid"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Brachial apparatus"}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","explanation":"Kista brankial (brachial cleft cyst) adalah kelainan kongenital akibat kegagalan regresi sinus brankial. Lokasi khas: tepi anterior m. sternocleidomastoideus (sekitar 1/3 dari klavikula ke mandibula). Dapat berkomunikasi dengan kulit (fistel) yang mengeluarkan cairan mukoid/saliva. Penatalaksanaan definitif: eksisi lengkap.","highYieldPoints":["Lokasi khas: tepi ANTERIOR m. SCM","Kista brankial #2 tersering (setelah thyroglossus)","Cairan mukoid/kolesterol crystals","Tatalaksana definitif: EKSISI LENGKAP","Bedakan dari: thyroglossus (midline, bergerak dengan lidah)"],"slideMapping":"slide-6","materi":{"topikUtama":"Kista Brankial","subtopik":["Embriologi sinus brankial","Klasifikasi kista leher","Diagnosis differensial kista leher"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-7","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-7","questionNumber":7,"bloomLevel":3,"category":"clinical","difficulty":"medium","text":"Pasien dengan lesi dome shape, claw hand, penebalan saraf, BTA +4. Diagnosis?","caseContext":"Suspek kusta","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"Kusta tuberkuloid"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"Kusta border tuberkuloid"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Kusta lepramatosa"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Kusta border lepramatosa"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Kusta indeterminata"}],"correctAnswerKey":"C","jawabanBenar":"C","explanation":"Kusta lepramatosa (LL) adalah tipe multibasilari dengan BTA (Bacillus Tahan Asam) positif tinggi (+3 sampai +6). Tanda klinis: lesi infiltratif multipel (dome-shaped), penebalan saraf bilateral simetris (ulnaris, peroneus, medianus, great auricular), claw hand, facial palsy, madarosis, dan saddle nose. BTA +4 mengindikasikan multibacillary.","highYieldPoints":["BTA +4 = MULTIBACILLARY → LL atau BL","Tuberkuloid = BTA negatif (paucibacillary)","Claw hand = ulnar + median nerve palsy","MD