r":"B","text":"Erupsi eksantematosa"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Stevens-Johnson syndrome"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Cutaneous lupus eritematosus"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Toxic epidermal necrolysis"}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","explanation":"Fixed Drug Eruption (FDE) adalah reaksi obat yang paling khas karena lesel muncul pada lokasi yang SAMA setiap kali terpapar obat yang sama. Lesi: plak eritematosa/violaseus berbatas tegas yang dapat melibatkan mukosa (sariawan, genital). Obat pemicu umum: tetrasiklin, TMP-SMX, NSAID, barbiturat.","highYieldPoints":["FDE = lesi pada lokasi SAMA setiap kali obat sama","Obat pemicu: tetrasiklin, TMP-SMX, NSAID, metronidazol","Lesinya: plak violaseus berbatas tegas + mukosa","Hyperpigmentasi residu = tanda khas","Tatalaksana: HENTIKAN obat, avoid for life"],"slideMapping":"slide-5","materi":{"topikUtama":"Fixed Drug Eruption","subtopik":["Reaksi obat kulit","Mekanisme FDE","Obat pemicu FDE"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-10","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-10","questionNumber":10,"bloomLevel":2,"category":"knowledge","difficulty":"easy","text":"Jenis erupsi obat yang paling sering terjadi adalah...","caseContext":"","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"Stevens-Johnson syndrome"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"Erupsi obat tipe bulosa"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Erupsi obat morbiliformis"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Toxic epidermal necrolysis"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Lupus drug induced"}],"correctAnswerKey":"C","jawabanBenar":"C","explanation":"Erupsi obat morbiliformis (exanthematous/morbiliform drug eruption) adalah reaksi obat kulit tersering, menyebabkan ~90% semua reaksi obat cutaneous. Berupa makulopapul eritematosa yang simetris di trunkus dan proksimal ekstremitas, muncul 7-14 hari pasca obat. Self-limiting setelah obat dihentikan.","highYieldPoints":["Morbiliform = 90% reaksi obat kulit","Onset: 7-14 hari pasca obat baru","Simetris trunkus + proksimal ekstremitas","TIDAK melibatkan mukosa (beda SJS)","Self-limiting setelah obat dihentikan"],"slideMapping":"slide-5","materi":{"topikUtama":"Reaksi Obat Kulit","subtopik":["Klasifikasi reaksi obat","Morbiliform drug eruption","SCAR"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-11","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-11","questionNumber":11,"bloomLevel":3,"category":"clinical","difficulty":"easy","text":"Pria 54 tahun, papul multipel diskret coklat, batas tegas, pedunkulated, riwayat keluarga serupa. Diagnosis?","caseContext":"Lesi kulit kronis wajah","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"Kista epidermal"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"Hemangioma"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Keratosis seboroik"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Melanoma"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Karsinoma sel basal"}],"correctAnswerKey":"C","jawabanBenar":"C","explanation":"Keratosis seboroik (seborrheic keratosis) adalah tumor epidermal benign yang sangat umum, terutama usia >50 tahun. Tanda khas: lesi papul/nodul berwarna coklat kehitaman, batas tegas, permukaan berminyak/verukosa seperti 'menempel' pada kulit (stuck-on appearance). Pedunkulated = berpucuk (daging tumbuh). Riwayat keluarga: common.","highYieldPoints":["Stuck-on appearance = pathognomonic","Benign, tidak perlu tatalaksana","Leser-Trelat sign = paraneoplastic","Bedakan dari melanoma: SK tidak melibatkan dermis","Dermoskopi: milia-like cysts"],"slideMapping":"slide-6","materi":{"topikUtama":"Keratosis Seboroik","subtopik":["Tumor benign epidermal","Stuck-on appearance","Leser-Trelat sign"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-12","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-12","questionNumber":12,"bloomLevel":3,"category":"clinical","difficulty":"medium","text":"Pria 72 tahun, ulserasi pinna, sel tumor polygonal, sitoplasma eosinofilik, intercellular bridge, keratin pearl. Diagnosis?","caseContext":"Lesi telinga dengan histologi khas","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"Melanoma"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"Karsinoma sel skuamosa"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Dermatofibrosarcoma protuberans"},{"key":