tus nasi SUPERIOR","Obstruksi KOM = rinosinusitis","CT coronal = gold standard evaluasi"],"slideMapping":"slide-1","materi":{"topikUtama":"Kompleks Osteomeatal","subtopik":["Anatomi sinus paranasal","Drainase sinus","FESS"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-17","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-17","questionNumber":17,"bloomLevel":1,"category":"knowledge","difficulty":"easy","text":"Kelenjar yang menghasilkan serumen adalah...","caseContext":"Anatomi telinga","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"Kelenjar sebacea"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"Kelenjar seruminosa (apokrin)"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Kelenjar minyak"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Kelenjar ekrin/merokrin"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Kelenjar lacrimalis"}],"correctAnswerKey":"B","jawabanBenar":"B","explanation":"Serumen (earwax) dihasilkan oleh kelenjar seruminosa (apokrin glands) dan kelenjar sebacea yang terdapat di daerah kartilago meatus akustikus eksternus (outer 1/3). Kelenjar seruminosa adalah modifikasi kelenjar apokrin yang terletak di submukosa. Serumen bersifat protektif: antimikroba, pelumas, dan barrier.","highYieldPoints":["Kelenjar seruminosa = apokrin glands di outer 1/3 meatus","Serumen = protektif (antimikroba + pelumas)","Impaksi: penyebab HL konduktif reversible paling umum","NaCl 3% = serumenolisis","JANGAN pakai cotton bud (mendorong serumen ke dalam)"],"slideMapping":"slide-1","materi":{"topikUtama":"Serumen dan Anatomi Telinga","subtopik":["Anatomi meatus","Produksi serumen","Impaksi serumen"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-18","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-18","questionNumber":18,"bloomLevel":1,"category":"knowledge","difficulty":"easy","text":"Sel melanosit berada pada lapisan epidermis...","caseContext":"Histologi kulit","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"Stratum korneum"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"Diantara stratum basal dan stratum spinosum"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Stratum granulosum"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Stratum spinosum"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Stratum lusidum"}],"correctAnswerKey":"B","jawabanBenar":"B","explanation":"Melanosit terletak di stratum basal epidermis (basal layer), bersisian dengan keratinosit. Setiap melanosit melayani sekitar 36 keratinosit (epidermal melanin unit). Melanosit memiliki dendrit yang memanjang ke stratum spinosum untuk transfer melanin (pigment) ke keratinosit.","highYieldPoints":["Melanosit di STRATUM BASAL","1 melanosit : 36 keratinosit (epidermal melanin unit)","Melanin transfer via dendrit ke keratinosit","Tyrosinase = enzyme kunci melanogenesis","S100+, HMB-45+ = marker melanosit"],"slideMapping":"slide-6","materi":{"topikUtama":"Melanosit dan Pigmentasi Kulit","subtopik":["Histologi epidermis","Melanogenesis","Epidermal melanin unit"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-19","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-19","questionNumber":19,"bloomLevel":3,"category":"clinical","difficulty":"medium","text":"Petani 68 tahun, tahi lalat pipi kanan membesar, nodul soliter, ulkus rodent, telangiektasis. Diagnosis?","caseContext":"Lesion wajah progresif pada petani","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"Karsinoma sel basal"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"Melanoma"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Keratosis seboroik"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Kista epidermal"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Karsinoma sel skuamosa"}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","explanation":"Karsinoma sel basal (BCC) adalah keganasan kulit tersering. Tanda khas: nodul pearly transluksan dengan telangiektasis dan rolled border, atau ulkus rodent dengan tepi menggulung. Faktor risiko: UV kronis (petani/nelayan), kulit terang, umur >60. Histologi: sel basaloid berjejer palisading. Jarang metastasis tapi locally invasive.","highYieldPoints":["Pearly nodule + telangiectasia + rolled border = BCC","Rodent ulcer = BCC ulcerated","Palisading nuclei = histology hallmark","Mohs surgery for facial/high-risk","Rarely metastasizes"],"slideMapping":"slide-3","materi":{"topikUtama":"Karsinoma Sel Basal","subtopik":["Tipe BCC","Tanda khas","Mohs surgery"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-20","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-20","questionNumber":20,"bloomLevel":3,"category":"clinical","difficulty":"hard","text":"Wanita 50 tahun, mata kanan merah 3 hari, visus kabur, sakit kepala hebat, mual muntah, TIO tidak terukur, kornea edema, COA dangkal. Diagnosis?","caseContext":"Emergency oftalmologi akut","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"Glaukoma akut sudut tertutup"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"Endoftalmitis"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Panoftalmitis"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Uveitis anterior"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Ulkus kornea bakteri"}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","explanation":"Glaukoma akut sudut tertutup (AACG) adalah emergency oftalmologi dengan trias: sakit kepala hebat, mual muntah, dan penurunan visus mendadak. Tanda: injeksi siliar, kornea edema steamy, COA dangkal, pupil middilated fixed oval. TIO sangat tinggi (>40-80 mmHg). Penyebab: pupillary block akibat contact iris-lens.","highYieldPoints":["Trias: sakit kepala + mual muntah + visus turun = AACG","TIO >40 mmHg = emergency","Cornea steamy edema + shallow AC","Pupil middilated fixed oval","LPI = tatalaksana definitif"],"slideMapping":"slide-11","materi":{"topikUtama":"Glaukoma Akut Sudut Tertutup","subtopik":["Pupillary block","Emergency glaukoma","LPI"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-21","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-21","questionNumber":21,"bloomLevel":2,"category":"knowledge","difficulty":"easy","text":"Side effect beta blocker yang berhubungan dengan asma adalah...","caseContext":"Farmakologi kardiovaskular","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"Bronkospasme"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"Takikardia"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Hipertensi"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Hipoglikemia"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Diare"}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","explanation":"Beta blocker non-selektif (propranolol) menghambat reseptor beta-2 di bronkus → bronkospasme. Kontraindikasi pada asma. Beta blocker kardioselektif (metoprolol, bisoprolol) lebih aman tapi tetap hati-hati. Beta-2 agonist (salbutamol) merupakan terapi utama asma.","highYieldPoints":["Non-selektif beta blocker = bronkospasme","Kontraindikasi pada asma","Selektif beta-1 lebih aman","Beta-2 agonist = antidot"],"slideMapping":"slide-5","materi":{"topikUtama":"Efek Samping Beta Blocker","subtopik":["Beta-1 vs Beta-2","Kontraindikasi","Bronkospasme"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-22","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-22","questionNumber":22,"bloomLevel":2,"category":"knowledge","difficulty":"easy","text":"Bayi 5 bulan, gerakan kepala terbatas, sulit berpaling, kepala datar satu sisi, bahu mengangkat. Diagnosis?","caseContext":"Deformitas leher infant","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"Tortikolis kongenital"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"Kista brankial"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Kista tiroglossus"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Abses leher"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Skoliosis servikal"}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","explanation":"Tortikolis kongenital adalah kependekan m. sternocleidomastoideus (fibrosis) yang menyebabkan kepala miring ke sisi lesio (ipsilateral) dan dagu ke sisi kontralateral. Penyebab: trauma kelahiran (breech), intrauterine malposition, atau fibrosis idiopatik. Plagiocephaly (kepala datar satu sisi) akibat posisi terus-menerus.","highYieldPoints":["Head tilt ipsilateral + chin contralateral = CMT","Fibrosis m. SCM","Plagiocephaly association","PT stretching first-line","Surgery if refractory >1 year"],"slideMapping":"slide-6","materi":{"topikUtama":"Tortikolis Kongenital","subtopik":["Fibrosis SCM","Plagiocephaly","Fisioterapi"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-23","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-23","questionNumber":23,"bloomLevel":2,"category":"knowledge","difficulty":"easy","text":"Luka bakar kemerahan tanpa bula, nyeri. Derajat? / Luka bakar tidak ada nyeri tekan. Derajat?","caseContext":"Klasifikasi luka bakar","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"Derajat 1 / Derajat 3"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"Derajat 2a / Derajat 2b"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Derajat 2b / Derajat 1"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Derajat 3 / Derajat 1"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Derajat 4 / Derajat 2a"}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","explanation":"Luka bakar derajat 1: epidermis saja, kemerahan, nyeri, tanpa bulae (contoh: sunburn). Derajat 2: melibatkan dermis, ada bulae. Derajat 2a superficial = bulae + nyeri. Derajat 2b deep = bulae + nyeri BERKURANG. Derajat 3: full thickness (epidermis+dermis+subkutis), pucat/putih/karat, tidak nyeri karena destruksi nervus (tetapi nyeri di perifer). Derajat 4: melibatkan otot/tulang.","highYieldPoints":["G1: erythema, pain, NO blisters","G2: blisters present","G3: NO pain (nerve destruction)","G4: muscle/bone involved","Parkland formula: 4mL x kg x %BSA"],"slideMapping":"slide-6","materi":{"topikUtama":"Klasifikasi Luka Bakar","subtopik":["Kedalaman luka bakar","Parkland formula","Tatalaksana"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-24","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-24","questionNumber":24,"bloomLevel":3,"category":"clinical","difficulty":"medium","text":"Laki-laki 62 tahun, vesikel multiple aurikularis sinistra, nyeri, pendengaran berkurang, pusing. Saraf terlibat?","caseContext":"Vesikel telinga dengan gejala neurologis","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"N. VII dan N. VIII"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"N. I dan N. II"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"N. III dan N. IV"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"N. V dan N. VI"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"N. IX dan N. X"}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","explanation":"Ramsay Hunt Syndrome (herpes zoster oticus) adalah reaktivasi VZV di ganglion geniculate (N. VII facial). Trias: (1) vesikel aurikular/external ear, (2) facial paralysis (Bell palsy-like), (3) auditory/vestibular symptoms (tinnitus, HL, vertigo) akibat N. VIII involvement. Tatalaksana: asiklovir + prednison dalam 72 jam.","highYieldPoints":["Vesikel aurikular + facial palsy + HL/vertigo = Ramsay Hunt","VZV reactivation in geniculate ganglion","CN VII + CN VIII involved","Asiklovir + prednison <72 jam","Prognosis worse than idiopathic Bell palsy"],"slideMapping":"slide-4","materi":{"topikUtama":"Ramsay Hunt Syndrome","subtopik":["VZV reactivation","Ganglion geniculate","Facial paralysis"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-25","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-25","questionNumber":25,"bloomLevel":3,"category":"clinical","difficulty":"medium","text":"Buruh 36 tahun, penurunan pendengaran bilateral, terbiasa suara mesin. Hasil audiometri?","caseContext":"Sensorineural hearing loss occupational","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"Noise notch 4000 Hz bilateral"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"Penurunan air conduction saja"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Penurunan bone conduction saja"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Cookie-bite pattern"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Rising curve"}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","explanation":"Noise-induced hearing loss (NIHL) adalah sensorineural hearing loss akibat paparan noise kronis (>85 dB). Tanda audiometri khas: bilateral symmetrical sensorineural hearing loss dengan noise notch di 3000-6000 Hz (peak 4000 Hz). Mekanisme: stereocilia damage di basal turn cochlea (high frequency region).","highYieldPoints":["Noise notch 3000-6000 Hz (peak 4000 Hz) = NIHL","Bilateral symmetrical","Sensorineural (not conductive)","Prevention with hearing protection","Occupational history crucial"],"slideMapping":"slide-4","materi":{"topikUtama":"Noise Induced Hearing Loss","subtopik":["Noise notch","Audiometri","Hearing protection"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-26","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-26","questionNumber":26,"bloomLevel":3,"category":"clinical","difficulty":"medium","text":"Pemuda 24 tahun, perdarahan hidung, rasa asin tenggorokan, darah ke nasofaring-orofaring, hipertensi. Tatalaksana?","caseContext":"Epistaksis posterior","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"Tampon posterior"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"Tampon anterior"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Kepala ditengadahkan"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Darah ditelan"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Kompresi digital hidung"}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","explanation":"Epistaksis posterior: perdarahan dari plexus Woodruff/faring (posterior nasal cavity). Tanda: darah mengalir ke posterior faring (rasa asin, batuk, hematemesis), tidak terlihat dari anterior nares. Tampon anterior tidak efektif. Perlu tampon posterior (balloon catheter/posterior nasal packing) untuk menekan vessel bleeding.","highYieldPoints":["Posterior epistaxis = blood down throat","Tampon anterior ineffective","Tampon posterior = Foley/balloon","Hospital admission required","Angiographic embolization for refractory"],"slideMapping":"slide-8","materi":{"topikUtama":"Epistaksis Posterior","subtopik":["Plexus Woodruff","Tampon posterior","Embolisasi"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-27","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-27","questionNumber":27,"bloomLevel":2,"category":"knowledge","difficulty":"easy","text":"Kelainan mata akibat defisiensi vitamin A adalah...","caseContext":"Nutrisi dan mata","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"Hipopigmentasi retina"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"Age-related macular degeneration"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Ablasio retina"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Katarak senilis"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Glaukoma primer"}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","explanation":"Vitamin A (retinol) esensial untuk fototransduksi (rhodopsin di rod cells). Defisiensi menyebabkan: (1) night blindness (xerophthalmia stage 1), (2) conjunctival xerosis (dryness), (3) Bitot spots (foamy patches), (4) corneal xerosis/ulceration/melting, (5) hipopigmentasi retina. AMD, ablasio retina, katarak, dan glaukoma BUKAN akibat defisiensi vitamin A.","highYieldPoints":["VAD: night blindness → xerosis → Bitot spots → corneal ulcer","Rhodopsin regeneration requires vitamin A","Hipopigmentasi retina = fundus finding","High-dose oral vitamin A = treatment","Preventable blindness"],"slideMapping":"slide-14","materi":{"topikUtama":"Defisiensi Vitamin A","subtopik":["Xerophthalmia","Rhodopsin","Bitot spots","Night blindness"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-28","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-28","questionNumber":28,"bloomLevel":2,"category":"knowledge","difficulty":"easy","text":"Pembengkakan dari post auricular sampai m. sternocleidomastoideus setelah otitis media akut. Diagnosis?","caseContext":"Komplikasi OMA","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"Abses Bezold"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"Mastoiditis akut"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Abses subperiosteal"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Lateral sinus thrombosis"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Meningitis"}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","explanation":"Abses Bezold adalah komplikasi otitis media akut/mastoiditis dimana infeksi menyebar melalui mastoid tip (processus mastoideus) yang pneumatized, masuk ke ruang di bawah m. sternocleidomastoideus. Tanda: pembengkakan post-auricular yang meluas ke leher (sulcus retro-mastoideus → SCM).","highYieldPoints":["Bezold = mastoiditis + neck abscess","Extension through mastoid tip","Swelling along SCM","Mastoidectomy + drainage","Different from simple mastoiditis"],"slideMapping":"slide-3","materi":{"topikUtama":"Abses Bezold","subtopik":["Komplikasi OMA","Mastoiditis","Deep neck abscess"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-29","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-29","questionNumber":29,"bloomLevel":2,"category":"knowledge","difficulty":"easy","text":"Hifema mengisi 1/2 anterior chamber. Grade berapa?","caseContext":"Trauma mata","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"Grade 1"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"Grade 2"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Grade 3"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Grade 4"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Grade 5"}],"correctAnswerKey":"C","jawabanBenar":"C","explanation":"Grading hifema: G1 = <1/3 anterior chamber (AC). G2 = 1/3 - 1/2 AC. G3 = >1/2 AC (total/8-ball hifema). G4 = total AC filled with dark/clotted blood. G3-G4 berisiko komplikasi: corneal blood staining, glaucoma sekunder, optic atrophy. Penatalaksanaan: bed rest, eye shield, cycloplegic, IOP control.","highYieldPoints":["G1: <1/3 AC","G2: 1/3 - 1/2 AC","G3: >1/2 AC","G4: total AC (8-ball)","Rebleed risk day 2-5","Elevated IOP = main complication"],"slideMapping":"slide-12","materi":{"topikUtama":"Hifema","subtopik":["Grading hifema","Trauma mata","Komplikasi"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-30","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-30","questionNumber":30,"bloomLevel":2,"category":"knowledge","difficulty":"medium","text":"Faktor yang mempengaruhi absorbsi obat tetes mata adalah...","caseContext":"Farmakologi mata","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"Lamanya obat di prekornea"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"pH asam saja"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Irigasi ke saccus lacrimalis"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Ikatan obat pada protein darah"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Difusi ke palpebra saja"}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","explanation":"Absorbsi obat tetes mata terjadi melalui kornea (transcorneal) dan konjungtiva. Faktor utama: waktu kontak prekorneal (prekorneal residence time). Hanya 1-5% obat yang masuk ke anterior chamber. Faktor lain: pH, lipophilicity, molecular weight, viscosity, dan nasolacrimal drainage. Nasolacrimal occlusion (menutup punctum) meningkatkan absorbsi dengan memperpanjang waktu kontak.","highYieldPoints":["Prekorneal residence time = key factor","Only 1-5% enters eye","Nasolacrimal drainage = major loss","Nasolacrimal occlusion improves absorption","Viscosity and lipophilicity matter"],"slideMapping":"slide-5","materi":{"topikUtama":"Farmakologi Ocular","subtopik":["Drug delivery mata","Prekorneal residence","Nasolacrimal drainage"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-31","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-31","questionNumber":31,"bloomLevel":3,"category":"clinical","difficulty":"medium","text":"Trauma kimia mata: kornea stroma haze, detail iris terlihat, iskemik limbus <1/3. Grade?","caseContext":"Chemical eye injury","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"Grade 1"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"Grade 2"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Grade 3"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Grade 4"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Grade 5"}],"correctAnswerKey":"B","jawabanBenar":"B","explanation":"Grading trauma kimia mata menurut Dua (modifikasi Roper-Hall): G1 = epitelial damage saja, no limbal ischemia, prognosis baik. G2 = hazy cornea tapi iris details visible, limbal ischemia <1/3, prognosis baik. G3 = total epithelial loss, stromal haze (iris details obscured), limbal ischemia 1/3-1/2, prognosis ragu. G4 = opaque cornea (no iris view), limbal ischemia >1/2, prognosis buruk.","highYieldPoints":["G2: cornea hazy + iris visible + <1/3 limbal ischemia","G3: iris obscured + 1/3-1/2 ischemia","G4: opaque + >1/2 ischemia = poor prognosis","Irrigation first, grading second","Vitamin C for grade 3-4"],"slideMapping":"slide-12","materi":{"topikUtama":"Grading Trauma Kimia Mata","subtopik":["Klasifikasi Dua","Limbal ischemia","Prognosis"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-32","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-32","questionNumber":32,"bloomLevel":3,"category":"clinical","difficulty":"medium","text":"Bayi 5 bulan, ruam merah pipi setelah susu formula, riwayat atopi keluarga. Terapi topikal?","caseContext":"Dermatitis infant","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"Kortikosteroid topikal rangkaian I-II"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"Kortikosteroid topikal rangkaian IV"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Antibiotik topikal"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Kalsipotriol"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Retinoid topikal"}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","explanation":"Dermatitis atopik (eksim) adalah dermatitis kronik relapsing dengan pruritus, riwayat atopi personal/keluarga, dan distribusi sesuia usia. Infant: ekstensor, wajah (pipi). Terapi: emolien + kortikosteroid topikal LOW potency (rangkaian I-II) untuk wajah dan infant. Rangkaian IV terlalu kuat untuk wajah/bayi.","highYieldPoints":["Infant: extensor + cheeks","Low potency steroid for face/infant","Emollients = foundation","Calcineurin inhibitors for maintenance","Avoid triggers (allergens, irritants)"],"slideMapping":"slide-6","materi":{"topikUtama":"Dermatitis Atopik","subtopik":["Kriteria Hanifin-Rajka","Terapi topikal","Potency steroid"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-33","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-33","questionNumber":33,"bloomLevel":2,"category":"clinical","difficulty":"easy","text":"Ny S 25 tahun, benjolan kemerahan pipi, pustul eritema, komedo. Diagnosis?","caseContext":"Lesi wajah wanita muda","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"Acne vulgaris"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"Rosacea"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Folikulitis"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Perioral dermatitis"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Seborrheic dermatitis"}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","explanation":"Acne vulgaris adalah penyakit pilosebasea kronik dengan 4 patogenesis: hiperkeratinisasi folikel, seborrhea (sekret sebasea berlebih), kolonisasi C. acnes (dulu P. acnes), dan inflamasi. Lesi: komedo (buka/tutup), papul, pustul, nodul, kista. Distribusi: wajah, dada, punggung atas. Terapi: topikal (benzoyl peroxide, retinoid, antibiotik topikal) + sistemik (antibiotik, isotretinoin, hormonal) sesuai severity.","highYieldPoints":["4 pathogenesis: keratinization + sebum + C. acnes + inflammation","Comedones = hallmark","Retinoid first-line for maintenance","Isotretinoin for severe","Teratogenic: pregnancy test mandatory"],"slideMapping":"slide-6","materi":{"topikUtama":"Acne Vulgaris","subtopik":["Patogenesis","Grading","Terapi"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-34","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-34","questionNumber":34,"bloomLevel":1,"category":"knowledge","difficulty":"easy","text":"Faktor risiko paling tinggi untuk melanoma kulit adalah...","caseContext":"Epidemiologi melanoma","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"Fitzpatrick Skin Phototype I"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"Fitzpatrick Skin Phototype II"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Fitzpatrick Skin Phototype III"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Fitzpatrick Skin Phototype IV"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Fitzpatrick Skin Phototype V"}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","explanation":"Fitzpatrick Skin Type I (very fair, always burns, never tans) memiliki risiko melanoma tertinggi. Type II juga berisiko tinggi. Risk ratio: Type I-II 2-3x higher than Type III-IV. Melanoma: #5 cancer terbanyak, #1 cause of skin cancer death. UV exposure = primary risk factor.","highYieldPoints":["Type I = highest melanoma risk","UV exposure = primary cause","ABCDE for diagnosis","Breslow thickness = prognosis","Prevention: sun protection"],"slideMapping":"slide-6","materi":{"topikUtama":"Melanoma: Faktor Risiko","subtopik":["Fitzpatrick classification","UV exposure","ABCDE criteria"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-35","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-35","questionNumber":35,"bloomLevel":2,"category":"knowledge","difficulty":"medium","text":"Faktor prognostik yang dinilai pada SCORTEN, KECUALI...","caseContext":"Prognostik TEN/SJS","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"Usia >40 tahun"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"Denyut jantung >120x/menit"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Serum bikarbonat <20 mEq/L"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Kolesterol total"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Glukosa serum >252 mg/dL"}],"correctAnswerKey":"D","jawabanBenar":"D","explanation":"SCORTEN (Severity-of-Illness Score for TEN) adalah scoring system untuk memprediksi mortality SJS/TEN. 7 faktor: (1) age ≥40, (2) heart rate ≥120, (3) cancer/hematologic malignancy, (4) BSA detached >10%, (5) serum bicarbonate <20, (6) glucose >252, (7) BUN >28. Kolesterol BUKAN komponen SCORTEN. Score 0-1 = mortality 3.2%; 2 = 12.1%; 3 = 35.3%; 4 = 58.3%; ≥5 = >90%.","highYieldPoints":["SCORTEN: 7 factors, score day 1","Bicarbonate <20 = acidosis prognostic","BSA detached >10% = significant","Kolesterol BUKAN SCORTEN","Score ≥5 = mortality >90%"],"slideMapping":"slide-6","materi":{"topikUtama":"SCORTEN Prognostik","subtopik":["SJS/TEN","Mortality prediction","Supportive care"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-36","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-36","questionNumber":36,"bloomLevel":2,"category":"knowledge","difficulty":"easy","text":"Luka robekan menembus 2 sisi karena pisau disebut...","caseContext":"Klasifikasi luka traumatik","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"Vulnus perforatum"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"Vulnus laceratum"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Vulnus punctum"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Vulnus scissum"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Vulnus contusum"}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","explanation":"Vulnus perforatum (perforating wound): luka tembus yang masuk dan keluar (through-and-through), menembus 2 sisi struktur. Vulnus laceratum: luka robek (tearing). Vulnus punctum: luka tusuk. Vulnus scissum: luka sayat (incised/cut). Vulnus contusum: luka tumpul (contused/abraded).","highYieldPoints":["Perforatum: through-and-through","Laceratum: tear/irregular","Punctum: stab/deep","Scissum: cut/clean","Contusum: blunt/bruise"],"slideMapping":"slide-6","materi":{"topikUtama":"Klasifikasi Luka Traumatik","subtopik":["Tipe luka","Mekanisme trauma"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-37","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-37","questionNumber":37,"bloomLevel":3,"category":"clinical","difficulty":"easy","text":"Laki-laki IMS, gram negatif diplococcus intraseluler. Pengobatan?","caseContext":"Uretritis gonokokal","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"Seftriakson 250-500 mg IM dosis tunggal"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"Azitromisin 1 gram PO dosis tunggal"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Doksiklin 100 mg PO BID 7 hari"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Metronidazol 2 gram PO dosis tunggal"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Asiklovir 400 mg PO 5x/hari 7 hari"}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","explanation":"Gonore uretritis: Neisseria gonorrhoeae (gram negative diplococcus intraseluler di PMN). Terapi: ceftriaxone 250-500mg IM single dose (first-line per CDC 2021). Koinfeksi Chlamydia: add doxycycline 100mg BID x 7 hari. Resistance to fluoroquinolones widespread.","highYieldPoints":["Gram negative diplococcus intracellular = N. gonorrhoeae","Ceftriaxone IM = first-line","Always co-treat Chlamydia","NAAT = diagnosis gold standard","Rising resistance to quinolones"],"slideMapping":"slide-5","materi":{"topikUtama":"Gonore Uretritis","subtopik":["N. gonorrhoeae","Gram stain","Ceftriaxone"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-38","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-38","questionNumber":38,"bloomLevel":2,"category":"clinical","difficulty":"easy","text":"Spaghetti and meatballs pada mikroskop. Diagnosis?","caseContext":"Bercak kulit dengan KOH","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"Pitiriasis versikolor"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"Dermatofitosis"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Kandidiasis kutis"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Eritrasma"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Pitiriasis rosea"}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","explanation":"Pitiriasis versikolor (tinea versicolor) adalah infeksi superficial oleh Malassezia furfur (lipophilic yeast, normal flora). KOH: 'spaghetti and meatballs' = hifa pendek (spaghetti) + yeast cells spherical (meatballs). Lesi: hipopigmentasi/hiperpigmentasi dengan skuama halus. Terapi: selenium sulfide 2.5% lotion, ketoconazole shampoo, topical azoles.","highYieldPoints":["Spaghetti and meatballs = Pityriasis versicolor","Malassezia furfur (not dermatophyte)","Hypo/hyperpigmented macules with scale","KOH = diagnosis","Selenium sulfide or ketoconazole"],"slideMapping":"slide-5","materi":{"topikUtama":"Pitiriasis Versikolor","subtopik":["Malassezia furfur","KOH spaghetti and meatballs","Terapi"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-39","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-39","questionNumber":39,"bloomLevel":3,"category":"clinical","difficulty":"easy","text":"Wanita 44 tahun, gatal vagina, duh encer, mikroskopi: blastospora. Diagnosis?","caseContext":"Vaginitis","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"Kandidiasis vulvovaginitis"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"Bacterial vaginosis"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Trichomoniasis"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Atrophic vaginitis"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Gonore"}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","explanation":"Kandidiasis vulvovaginitis: infeksi Candida albicans (90%) atau C. glabrata. Tanda: pruritus vulvae intens, discharge putih kental seperti cottage cheese, vulvar erythema/edema. pH normal (<4.5). KOH/pap smear: pseudohyphae, blastospores, budding yeast. Terapi: azol topikal (klotrimazole, mikonazole) 1-7 hari atau fluconazole 150mg PO single dose.","highYieldPoints":["Pruritus dominant","Cottage cheese discharge","pH <4.5 (normal)","Blastospores/pseudohyphae on KOH","Azoles = treatment"],"slideMapping":"slide-6","materi":{"topikUtama":"Kandidiasis Vulvovaginitis","subtopik":["Candida albicans","pH normal","Azoles"]}},{"id":"exam-soal-A-40","sourceSoalId":"soal-A-40","questionNumber":40,"bloomLevel":3,"category":"clinical","difficulty":"medium","text":"Robekan iris mengenai sfingter → pendarahan anterior chamber. Diagnosis?","caseContext":"Trauma mata tumpul","options":[{"key":"A","letter":"A","text":"Hifema"},{"key":"B","letter":"B","text":"Hipopion"},{"key":"C","letter":"C","text":"Hemofthalm"},{"key":"D","letter":"D","text":"Vitreous hemorrhage"},{"key":"E","letter":"E","text":"Subkonjungtival hemorrhage"}],"correctAnswerKey":"A","jawabanBenar":"A","explanation":"Hifema adalah penumpukan darah di anterior chamber (AC) akibat trauma tumpul yang merobekkan vessel di iris root atau ciliary body. Sfingter iris injury → bleeding into AC. Grading berdasarkan volume: G1(<1/3), G2(1/3-1/2), G3(>1/2), G4(total/8-ball). Komplikasi: rebleed (day 2-5), corneal blood staining, secondary glaucoma.","highYieldPoints":["Blood in AC = hyphema","Trauma = most common cause","Grade determines management","Rebleed risk day 2-5","Sickle cell = worse prognosis"],"slideMapping":"slide-12","materi":{"topikUtama":"Hifema Traumatik","subtopik":["Trauma blunt","Anterior chamber bleeding","Grading"]}}]};
